  ('zcrm_1579374000114043033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096076002', 'Darcie Johnston', NULL, '02.16.2023 Darcie is scheduled to have her annual mamm in march, and wanted to confirm how to present herself.
I shared to make sure the facility and all the providers involved with the mamm are in the PHCS network. She wasn''t sure how to go about doing that. I emailed her the MultiPlan PHCS link to find provider. She will also call and confirm with them that they are indeed in the network, like she found while on the phone with me. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-16 12:22:07', '2023-02-16 12:35:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114043025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', NULL, '02.16.2023 KYle called needing the Welcome Call Scheduler link for Robert to register.
Robert is in a lot of pain with his jaw. Wants to use Cirrus MD but Robert''s email is not registered. Kyle went ahead and completed the change/add email form from the Updates and Member Portal page. Because of the pain Robert is in, Kyle wanted to know how long till his email is uploaded so they can start using CirrusMD/Telehealth. I messaged our Patti via teams, when she responds to me, I will call Kyle back. Unless she calls back confirming he received my CirrusMd invitation link I sent today. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-16 12:13:50', '2023-02-16 12:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113990018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083233002', 'Heidi Holliday', NULL, '2-16-2023:  Heidi &amp; I could not hear each other.  After 2 attempts, I called &amp; Jennifer is going to try in case it''s my GoTo.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-16 12:12:21', '2023-02-16 12:12:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114040002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084517001', 'Kyle King', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Leonardo Moraes', 'Visit ID : 2858 Question : How do I get my husband able to use the Telehealth option. He is on our account, but he doesn''t have a way to register and login.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-02-16 11:48:40', '2023-02-16 11:48:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114043017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109568001', 'Donald Whitfield', NULL, '02.16.2023 ACL injury at work - workers comp not paying - Opened a medical need on 01.30.2023, BUT NEVER received a confirmation it was received or approved or reviewed. Wants to get reimbursed. I advised him to upload his receipts. Donald claims he''s not technologically savvy and does not know how to do that, given that they are hard copies.
I coached him to either take pictures or use an app like Genius Scan or Docu Sign to scan his hard copies, email to upload from a desktop OR simply access the link from the initial medical need email to upload from his phone.
He couldn''t find his Zion ID#, to complete the form, so I offered that we call Zion again after him and I are done, but to promise me that he would write it down somewhere accessible this time. He eventually found the number from earlier, and organized his information and papers. Donald repeated the process to get reimbursed and was confident on what he needed to do. 
Donald CALLED BACK to share that he uploaded his receipts as we spoke, but he STILL DID NOT receive a form of confirmation that it was sent, nor via email. With verbal coaching on what to say to Zion, I transferred him to them to discuss the disconnect.
I am consulting with Cari via teams to make sure I did not miss a step. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-16 11:31:36', '2023-02-16 12:55:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114043003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110308002', 'Robert Golden', NULL, '02.16.2023 Robert has contacted cirrusMD x2 - Sinus infection - still present - Needs to see a doctor physically now, per CirrusMD''s chat with him the 2nd time. Wants to know how to present himself at the doctor''s office, TODAY @1.
I thought it would be with Planstin, but it''s also not preventative. I consulted with Cari via teams, for clarification. Cari accepted to be brought into the call to clarify what I said and offer the process in clear.
Cari clarified this would NOT be preventative, and  DO NOT present the Planstin card. She asked if he''s had a chance to set up an HSA, and he has not he said. He said he has not been feeling well and could not take on any more projects, but he will try now. Cari offered some advice on the process of applying for the HSA. She explained visits like this, expecially since CirrusMD has been exhausted kind of falls under medical cost sharing, but not until he''s met the $2500 IUA.  He knows there is a 6mos deadline for sub the ''med need'' & will contact us in the next 2-4 mos if this is ongoing.. Therefore to save receipts and present as cash-pay in preparation it should escalate. - NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-16 10:39:02', '2023-02-16 11:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113999008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598008', 'Jennifer Dintelmann', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-16 10:04:16', '2023-02-16 10:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114031003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055125026', 'Matthew Bennett', NULL, 'Elena called because she was wondering if dermatology was considered preventative care. I confirmed that it was not preventative care, discussed the self-pay process and advised that if this down go above her IUA to give us a call and we will assist her in opening a Need. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-16 09:42:06', '2023-02-16 09:42:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000114010008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772009', 'Jennifer DeNoyer', NULL, '02.16.23:  Jenni called.  Needs a 1095 for her taxes. Told her to call Concierge and get transferred to Patti to help her.  Jenni said she got her PCP to join the PHCS network. Jenni had her physical and needs to submit her need because this practice doesn''t accept insurance - payment up front. She also asked about having a preventive cologuard test instead of a colonoscopy. Told her one or the other but not both would be shared.  I suggested she call Planstin directly to resolve her preventive care service reimbursement, since she already paid of it. Asked her to let me know if she has any issue with it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-16 09:13:10', '2023-02-16 09:13:10'),
