  ('zcrm_1579374000113964008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, '2-15-23 Per Patti in Teams, "Michael Sharpe has been taken care of I refunded him $24.22 for the months of Dec, Jan &amp; Feb. &nbsp;He had enrolled in the DPC option and Sedera did not let us know. &nbsp; I also let him know his new price of $353.78 he''s fine."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-15 16:23:42', '2023-02-15 16:23:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113964003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, '2-15-23 "Our 985-652-8228 number has been disconnected since our home flooded in 2021 and we relocated. I am available by mobile at 504-319-9099.  It has a functional voice mailbox."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-15 16:21:03', '2023-02-15 16:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113931018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082151010', 'Peter Benjamin', NULL, '02.15.2023 Peter called to learn what to plug in for "insurance" in the website for therapy application.
I was not sure how to guide him, so I consulted with Cari via teams. 
Cari shared that he cannot use anyone except someone in the M&S network.  I told him he would need to call their # tomorrow to get help w/who is covered. 
I shared that with Peter, and he asked "what is that?", which then prompted me to ask him if he has had  his WELCOME call, but he responded no. I sent him the welcome call invite link to sing up for a slot.
I guided Peter to the MAP program link from our site, and offered the code MAP to access the M&S resources.
Peter was glad to contact M&S asst #, and peruse their website. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-15 15:57:28', '2023-02-15 16:49:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113931013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108946002', 'Charles Warner', NULL, '02.15.2023 Charles called to change payment information from banking to ACH.
I guided him to our Member Portal and Updates page and to the forms section. He was concerned about the timing of effect, so I confirmed for him that it would go through this month, since it is well before the 20th of the month. He went ahead to fill out the form independently. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-15 15:30:48', '2023-02-15 15:30:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113931008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497108', 'Kathleen Walsh', NULL, '02.15.2023 Kathleen called wanting to know how to attain her year-end tax forms. I direct transferred her to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-15 14:45:11', '2023-02-15 14:45:11'),
