  ('zcrm_1579374000113939008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '2-15-2023:  Karen Torsoe called.  John''s frustrated by the counseling.  I went over how much we''ve done w/him trying to help facilitate his Mazz & Sull relationship.  That, his wanting to see someone in person, seems to be an issue.  He also seemed to think he could just use his counselor & have them reimb, which I explained over the last yr: you can nominate your counselor, but you''d do that thru Mazz & Sull, then it would be up to your couns to accept or decline.  In talking w/Karen, she thought they could use this like a portion of the pymt & then pay the bal.  I let her know I do not know what the Mazz & Sull contract looks like, so I don''t sugg advertising that as it may go against their rules.  Let her know Mazz & Sull is really the only ones who can help John.  NOTE: don''t forget he''s in CA & only gets 6 visits per yr.  She is going to LM for Jennifer Thorin (the new concierge lead) to see if she has other sugg.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-15 14:32:00', '2023-02-15 14:32:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113958003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100830002', 'Michael Agugliaro', NULL, 'Mike called because his daughter had to go to urgent care. We discussed what happens if the bills go above his IUA. We also discussed that his wife, Jennifer, is going to be having some thyroid blood tests done. We went over how to present as self-pay. Mike will call with any other questions. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-15 14:10:20', '2023-02-15 14:10:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113940008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113954001', 'Dave Mell', NULL, 'Dave called in on the sales line after doing a search online. He recently signed with Zion, but he wants to have the HSA compatibility. Took him on my page, walked him through the Secure Plan. Member is 57, daughter is 22. Non smokers, no pre-ex. Has a DPC. He had to take another call, he has my direct number and will contact me back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-15 13:39:40', '2023-02-15 13:39:40'),
