  ('zcrm_1579374000113940003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081135010', 'Quentyn Luna', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Quentyn. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-15 11:15:54', '2023-02-15 11:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371027', 'Karen Faydenko', NULL, '2-15-2023:  Karen called, she wants to sched her mamm.  I took her to the post Welcome Call e-mail, showed her how to use the PHCS search tool, healthcare.gov, and made sure she knows the reader of the images also needs to be in ntwk.
     Let her know we will at some point be transitioning to no req''d ntwk, so when she receives that new pdf Planstin card, she''ll know why.
     She found a provider while we were on the phone &amp; was going to call to set-up the appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-15 10:55:48', '2023-02-15 10:55:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113926018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to remove spouse and dependents  eff 3/1/23 from plan I will process and let member know new pricing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-15 10:36:18', '2023-02-15 10:36:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113931003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107380001', 'Edward Barlow', NULL, '02.15.2023 Katie called regarding her daughter''s, Harper, nail again. It turns out, according to the dermatologists who were recommended, that it is nail tumor.
Katie wanted guidance on how to proceed from here, whether to get the MRI or not. They confirmed that they will perform surgery on Harper''s nail to remove the tumor, no matter what the results are from the MRI. Katie was leaning towards not pursuing the MRI due to that confirmation.
Katie and I proceeded to open a medical need, which I guided her through step by step. At the end, she needed to download all the receipts to upload into the medical need. She also needed to give Zion a call to retrieve her member ID number with them, OR search for it via her husband, Edward''s email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-15 10:32:29', '2023-02-15 10:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113926013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113967002', 'Lynette Phillips', NULL, 'I received this as a quote request this morning. I called and the lady  was driving, told me she spoke to someone already. Upon further investigation, I discovered she''d spoken to Leo. He never entered her into the CRM', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-15 10:32:13', '2023-02-15 10:32:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113926008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'Member called in asking about a vision plan option.  Since she is a house account I sent her out the Denail brochure.  Explained that Vision would be an add on to the Dental.  She will look over.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-15 10:27:38', '2023-02-15 10:27:38'),
