  ('zcrm_1579374000113859013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061006173', 'Brian Delaney', NULL, 'Brian called in this AM for instructions on how to present himself at his preventative care appointment. When speaking with Brian, we needed to verify that his provider, Laura Erben, was in-network and unfortunately she isn''t. He wanted to verify this info with Planstin and I also sent him a new list of PCP''s in his area that are in-network. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-15 09:21:49', '2023-02-15 09:21:49'),
