  ('zcrm_1579374000113803031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055720124', 'Robert Prieto', NULL, '2-14-23 I talked with Stephen and let him know Robert didn''t choose to include the MEC upon enrollment. He said Robert is ok and has found he can get a colonoscopy done at Rose Medical for $1000. Stephen knows you can get them cash pay for $1200-$1400 locally. I am inquiring if Robert can add the MEC. Sent a note to Patti asking. If not, Robert is self-employed and might be able to join SECURE  instead at $325/$1000. He''s paying $299 with $2500 IUA, now or close to it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-14 17:37:39', '2023-02-14 17:37:39'),
