  ('zcrm_1579374000113803021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, '2-14-23 From Patti, "Can you call me re: Michael Sharpe?  He has been on a chat with Kelly about his Sedera billing.  You attached an email string in the CRM from 2/2 addressing the differences in the Sedera amount & the actual amount.  Now he is saying that he signed up for a DPC in the Oct., Nov timeframe and is now expecting a discount for that.  This is the 1st we are hearing about this.  How do you want me to move forward with this?" 
