  ('zcrm_1579374000113798054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111978002', 'Robin Athey', NULL, '2-14-2023:  Robin called  back.  
     - We went over the doc''s recommended places for the mamm (which is curr showing as in PHCS ntwk) & making sure comp that reads image also in ntwk.  
     - For her colonoscopy, Dr Tusek is having an image done first for $300.  If it sees anything, then she may need a colonoscopy, so we went over the 2 scenarios:  IF they see something on this scan, they will want a reg colonoscopy done.  If billed as diagnostic, the $300 can go twds 1k IUA.  If billed as prev, the hosp itself is showing as in ntwk (we''ll need to conf if we get to that point), then it''s poss it would be part of her Planstin ''prev care'' & no exp on this portion.
     - She kind of likes the HSA option & has no waiting period for the mamm & colonoscopy, so at least right now, she knows she''s on the Secure plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-14 15:39:17', '2023-02-14 15:39:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113795042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, '02.14.2023 Felicia Balderston and Debbie called together regarding the Form 1095C, receive health coverage. Since they moved and changed their address, they were inquiring to see if the forms could be emailed to them as well, in order to receive them faster just vs snail mail. I forwarded them to Patti, our Benefits Administrator. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-14 15:37:42', '2023-02-14 15:41:24'),
