  ('zcrm_1579374000113795032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112215002', 'Brenda Harms', NULL, '02.14.2023 Brenda called to attain a Gastroenterologist that is in the network. I searched the PHCS website and I generated a list for her in the zip code: 80601 and emailed it to her via outlook. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-14 15:03:58', '2023-02-14 15:03:58'),
