  ('zcrm_1579374000113795027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106535002', 'Richard Lancaster', NULL, '02.14.2023 Richard called inquiring about pricing a prescription. I emailed him, via CRM, the link to the form for RX Requests. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-14 14:31:28', '2023-02-14 14:31:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113798043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, '2-14-2023:  Natalie called.  She wanted to understand how to handle the mental health component.  Took her to MAP &amp; showed her what is avail &amp; how it works.  She''ll call them tomorrow.  DId mention, during their reg bus hours things go best for our memb.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-14 14:22:16', '2023-02-14 14:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113803003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114234002', 'Kenneth Storm', NULL, '2-14-23 Ken was referred by JP and Julie Boylan and some other friends who have similar memberships. He watched the video and filled out the questionnaire. They are a good fit. They are healthy, no tobacco. They just had 2 kids in the last 2 years. His wife was put onto levothyroxine for pregnancy wellness which she will go off of once she''s done breast feeding. Her thyroid is good. He''s not entirely sure what it''s for but it''s only temporary. They use Boulder Medical Center for most of the dr. visits. He was asking about the possible network. I let him know there shouldn''t be a network as of March 1st, if all goes well with removal of the network.  Ken''s wife is resigning in 2 weeks, hence why they''re looking for options now. JP is self-employed and will show proof.  They want a March 1st start date. Wife goes to chiro for preventative purposes and has for most of life. They live next to a chiro and she really sees the value in chiro. Ken''s more interested in acupuncture and finds that''s beneficial on occasion. I let him know there must be a new diagnosis, pay your IUA and must get pre-approval for alternative. He understands.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-14 14:07:36', '2023-02-14 16:57:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113775008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, 'I spoke with Corey, he just needs to take his wife and children off the plan, due to divorce. I gave him the pricing for just him. Patti will send him the link for plan change', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-14 13:50:04', '2023-02-14 13:50:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113798032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055720124', 'Robert Prieto', NULL, '2-14-2023:  Robert called thinking he has coverage for his colonoscopy.  Our cheatsheet for this old plan is unclear.  Neither Jennifer or I can see any ''prev care'' on that cheatsheet, here in the CRM, or in the Admin123.  We decided to connect w/Wendy Scipione since she knows the older plans.
     -Per Wendy:  She doesn''t think he has ''prev care'', but she''s going to have to look into it further.  We need to let Rbt know what we find out.     - CA

Wendy got back to me via Teams chat.  She believes my understanding is correct & it''s his advisor Stephen Cox that is confusing the issue, so she''s getting with him.  Stephen & Robert have already talked & Wendy will make sure he calls Robert back to let him know he was mistaken, the ''prev care'' was not selected w/this plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-14 13:24:12', '2023-02-14 17:16:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113795016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107491002', 'Douglas Hollowell', NULL, '02.14.2023 Doug called to change Banking information. I guided him to the member portal page to complete the form and learn more about that page.
After completing the form, while I was on line with him, he wanted to access his portal and learn more, I gave him his log in information.
He then asked if waiting 2 months after signing up with MPB, in order to make Preventative Annual Checkup was what he needed to do and that he was told so.
I consulted with Jen via teams, and she confirmed, "if he has not had any preventative care done yet, there is no wait."
Doug then wanted to confirm if his plan is considered a high deductible plan for the opportunity to be approved for an HSA. I confirmed that The Secure Plan that we have at MPB, offers the opportunity to apply for an HSA. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-14 13:22:42', '2023-02-14 13:42:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113798021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109797002', 'Kim Vailati', NULL, '2-14-2023:  This file came up from 312-388-5035 on the caller ID.  This gal is very aggitated saying she''s being miss billed.  Her description makes no sense, but this is also a plan there have been some issues with, so I transferred her directly to Patti''s line hoping she will understand the issue.  She''ll LM if she doesn''t catch her [the gal says, "yeah she better get back to me" if she''s not available because ...].  I just responded that Patti''s very good at getting back to people should she be unavailable.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-14 13:14:30', '2023-02-14 13:16:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113743033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101118002', 'David Cavazos', NULL, 'No response. 6th attempt. Left a detailed vm and sent a new scheduler. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-14 13:02:45', '2023-02-14 13:02:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113798013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '2-14-2023:  Julia called & it was a difficult conv.  She''s quite frustrated and got very snippy at one point.  We however got to a good point and ended okay.
     - She''s having a colonoscopy, so I conf she found someone in ntwk & reminded her to remind them the facility & anesthesiologist must also be in ntwk.  She has already given them the info off her curr Planstin card.
     - Tried to discuss what happens if colonoscopy becomes diagnostic (pull a polyp), it''s no longer ''prev care'' & must now go thru her healthshare component.  Call us shortly afterwards & we will help her sub a ''med need''.  Plus, when it moves to healthsharing, she''ll now be resp for her $2500 IUA.
     - Then she got upset because we are "supposed to negotiate her pricing".  We discussed ''cash-pay'' & her asking for a ''cash-pay'' discount to which she said aren''t you supposed to do that for me?   That maybe she''s thinking of the component that will work on negotiating pricing with surgery > 5k.
     Thank goodness we ended in a good spot.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-14 12:59:53', '2023-02-14 13:03:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113798008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', 'Rec''d: Permission to Discuss the MPB.Health Membership Plan - OK to tt husb Steve Karich', '2-14-2023:  See Cognito forms for rec''d document.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-14 12:53:34', '2023-02-14 12:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113798003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, '2-14-2023:  Ashley called to see if chiropractic care is included.  She''s very nice to work with.  We went over quite a bit:
     - If part of a larger ''med need'' can req pre-approval thru the healthshare comp w/a Treatment plan [w/proven success rates, less invasive, etc. - they do consider these treatments]
