     - Then she asked about the mental health we provide & since they are in CA = only 6 visits annually.  Took her to MAP, gave her instructions, & she''ll work on.  Will call if further questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-14 11:56:34', '2023-02-14 17:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113795008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', NULL, '02.14.2023 Steven called to better understand how to attain a letter of proof of benefits from Planstin for his job, given now that he''s completed the form from Patti. 
