  ('zcrm_1579374000113743023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064054002', 'Mark Dunkley', NULL, 'Mark called to inquire about what card to present at a screening colonoscopy. We went over how to present the Planstin card and I will be sending him a list of in-network providers in his area for colonoscopies. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-14 09:23:58', '2023-02-14 09:23:58'),
