  ('zcrm_1579374000113628024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Thelma has spent all day trying to find a ''prev care'' doc & is totally frustrated.  She called PHCS rather than us to get a list of in ntwk docs.  When she sent me the list it''s not Spec Srvcs, so I walked her thru how to use the PHCS Search, HCBB, & the guidelines.  Orig she was looking in a town not necessarily near her.  Called the office she''s interested in (has a yellow yeild sign in the PHCS list).  The office only accepts patients from certain employers, so they won''t work.  We zoned in on docs closer to her new home & she''s going to try some we found together to see if they will work.  She''ll call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 16:55:36', '2023-02-21 23:47:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113628019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087125001', 'Robert West', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Robert called thinking we told him his ins would cover his low testosterone treatments.  Told him he would need to start a ''med need'' with Zion to see if this is a qualified need.  Sent him the temp &amp; walked him thru what to do &amp; what to expect.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 16:24:55', '2023-02-21 23:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113628014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088337002', 'Teresa Mullaney', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Teresa called.  She''s looking for a doctor, so I showed her how utilize HCBB (from the link in her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail.  Also helped her understand diff between ''Planstin Prev Care'' PHCS Search Tool and when she needs to worry about that. Healthcare.gov to see what is/is not part of the MEC.  How to present for both prev &amp; other visits.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 16:09:18', '2023-02-14 15:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113628003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095950001', 'Jennifer Kries', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Jennifer called for her tax form.  She was trying to create an acct, so we did some education on our healthcare ''solution'', the diff comp, etc.  I let her know her ''prev care'' portion, Planstin is planning to e-mail copies of the tax form at the beg of March (as req''d by the gvmt).  If she hasn''t seen the e-mail by 3/8/23, she''ll call since Patti will have copies by then.  [She lives in CA, so they do req the form info.]    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 15:43:00', '2023-02-13 15:43:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113577112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111978002', 'Robin Athey', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Robin called.  She''s wanting to have a mammogram, Christine Corsini  sold her the SECURE plan for people who own their own bus, however, Robin''s doc is Dr Tusek here in Lgmt, but he is a DPC &amp; she won''t be able to use the ''prev care'' w/his office (although mamm, colonoscopies, immunizations, will still be ok).  She has a client meeting &amp; needed to go, but will have to understand this better since her doc is a true DPC.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 15:34:44', '2023-02-13 15:46:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113577104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976010', 'George Elkins', NULL, '2-13-2023:  George called.  He wanted to know how to sched his ''Welcome Call''.  Sent him the invite &amp; he sched for the 16th w/Vanessa.  He wanted to make sure Vanessa can bring his wife into the call, so I sent a Teams chat to Vanessa, I''m sure she''s aware of how to do that, if not, let me know &amp; I can share how to do that on GoTo.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 14:46:50', '2023-02-13 14:52:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113577099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291579', 'Darius Vasquez', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-13 13:56:05', '2023-02-13 13:56:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113577094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Cameron called - her doctor''s off is asking her to take the NPI # to make sure they are covered.  I explained that they are thinking there''s a ntwk.  Went over how to present:  cash-pay (she''ll be resp for the first 1k no matter what - so ask if they have a cash-pay disc).  Then let them know she needs a treatment plan to sub for other MCS memb to help pay her maternity expenses.  So, whether it''s her or the other members, we are paying ''cash'' for her bills.  I told her to have the doc''s off call us if still confused.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 13:48:50', '2023-02-13 13:48:50'),
