  ('zcrm_1579374000113577079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114145002', 'Mary Soborowicz', NULL, 'Mary Beth messaged me in response to my Greeting I sent her when she came online SalesIQ at 1:54pm this afternoon. This is Mary''s exact message: "Hello. I am interested in a family plan that is HSA eligible. Can someone speak to me about this?". I replied back saying of course she could and that I just need her full name and the best # to reach her at. I let her know I wrote it all down and gave her info over to Leonardo who is one of our In-House Healthcare Advisors here. I gave Leo everything she gave me to call her, and Leo called Mary Beth right away. Leo got back to me and said Mary Beth is very interested and qualifies for the exact plan that she wanted with Secure that is HSA Compatible, she requested that as a type of plan for her to be able to have an HSA account. Leo said he will enroll soon. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-13 13:13:46', '2023-02-13 13:13:46'),
