  ('zcrm_1579374000113572008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111878002', 'Ian Jenkins', NULL, 'Spoke to Ian, he has been on the plan for 13 days and is cancelling. He said he had a foot injury, and he came out of pocket. He also let slip that he has a pre-existing ear problem. He said he got a plan through United. He''s not a fit for this plan, I sent him CXL link.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-13 10:48:11', '2023-02-13 10:48:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113577016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Asiye called.  She''s looking for a counselor for her 12-1/2 yr old''s anger issues.  We went together to MAP &amp; I went over details.  Showed her the asst ph # &amp; the articles that could be helpful.  Let her know sm ntwk so may need to go to wider area &amp; do virtual.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 10:46:18', '2023-02-13 10:46:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113577008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109357039', 'Linda Mitchell', NULL, '2-13-2023:  Linda called.  Resent her the Welcome Call invite.  She also hurt her back yesterday &amp; is going to want to set-up an appt w/a PCP.  She said she called telehealth &amp; they sugg seeing her PCP if the pain cont, but it''s doing better.  We decided since she''s going to make her Welcome Call appt, we''ll walk thru HCBB once she has her post Welcome Call e-mail (she''s just not in a hurry today), BUT if she has any issue, she''ll call back &amp; we''ll do it sooner!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-13 10:41:22', '2023-02-13 10:43:03'),
