  ('zcrm_1579374000113494043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109674015', 'Katherine Morgan', NULL, 'Katherine called in because her 1-month old child is having eye/neurological issues. We went over the self-pay process and I advised Katherine that if this is something that would be considered a medical necessity to get a new need open with Zion ASAP. Katherine will call back with any other questions or for more guidance. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-13 07:44:05', '2023-02-13 07:44:05'),
