  ('zcrm_1579374000113454067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '2-12-2023:  Brandee e-mailed asking about the annual tax form.  Responded &amp; let her know it''s sched to go out beginning of March (which as I understand it is when the gvmt requires the for be out).  That most states want the info, but don''t req the form be attached (it''s just for your records).  I told her Planstin should be sending a pdf version via e-mail for her records.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-12 11:40:42', '2023-02-12 11:40:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113494033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '2-10-23 Abe was sent an email from C4 stating he must file jointly to get a tax credit. So, he''ll talk with his wife to see if it makes sense now that he''s out of the corporate world and working on a self-employment biz together.  If they file separately, he will pay the full cost of a plan. Cigna''s $0 Ded will be $728.32 or he can look at the Friday Bronze Copay plans to get his monthly cost down and still have co-pays for many services.  He''ll call me on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-10 16:05:57', '2023-02-10 16:05:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113497026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '02.10.2023 Helen called concerned that her conversion process with Sedera does not seem to have been finalized, because she is receiving notes from Sedera to re-enlist. 
She shared she spoke with Wendy prior to this, and was reassured that she is all set.
I recommended that she speak with Wendy again, because might have a way to solve the misunderstanding or missed step. 
I transferred her to Wendy. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-10 16:00:24', '2023-02-10 16:00:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113497018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061021001', 'Nathan Schultz', NULL, '02.10.2023 Maya called regarding Annabelle''s ear infection that started at the beginning of October or November  - Maya will call ped to be specific.
Since then she has had other little colds and more. Ped says she might have fluid in her ears.
They had a hearing test administered, but she did not pass it with flying colors. Ped recommended that they repeat the test since they may not have know what they were doing.
Maya believes that Annabelle might be experiencing hearing issues, and wants to take her in to see an ENT. She called us to get more clarification.
I consulted with Jen, and she recommended that Maya use her CirrusMD service. At first Maya was hesitant to do so, as she had a negative experience with CirrusMD in the past, but she said she will give them another try. - NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-10 15:17:07', '2023-02-10 15:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113454062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496027', 'Stephen Osteen', NULL, 'Carolyne''s e-mail:  carolynemcain91@gmail.com

2-10-2023:  Carolyne called.  She''s wondering how we handle RX Quotes.  I showed her the concierge form online (she was trying to sign-in online - but who know what since she''s on her phone).  Turns out she''s sitting at the pharmacy & needs the coupon right now.  We priced it and Publix is 10x less expencive, so here''s what I sent (she''s going to request a pharmacy-to-pharmacy transfer):
     - Sertraline HCL (= Gen Zoloft) 100mg., #90 tabs = $7.50 at Publix on RXGo
From the conv it sounds like this is the only RX they get, but maybe she just meant "today" it''s the only RX.
     - ''Welcome Call'': sent inv & went over instuctions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-10 14:48:45', '2023-02-20 19:21:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113427115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514334', 'Jordan Lubin', 'Aging into Medicare eff 4/23', 'Member will be aging into Medicare eff 4/1.  1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor 2/10  2nd notice sent &amp; cancelled - 3/9', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-10 14:39:20', '2023-03-09 10:51:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113494023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '2-10-23 Abe is concerned about a pre-x now after his dr. visit. His levels are off from some labs and needs monitoring. It''s the only health issue but it will be excluded so he was thinking of just going with Cobra. But, I looked up his C4 options and he can get a significant subsidy at his best guess of $50K income with self-employment. He and son are the only ones on his tax returns. So, he can get $464 APTC with that income and the Cigna $0 Ded plan is $264.32. He''s thrilled with that at that price. His Aetna plan with Cobra has a $4500 Ded and $8550 MOP/ $17K Family MOP.  So, C4 looks to be best option. He completed the cancellation for MPB now as well. Membership never began, so he will be refunded his money.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-10 14:25:30', '2023-02-10 14:25:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113496013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108725010', 'Scott Burns', NULL, 'Spoke to Scott with Leo present. I explained that turning 50 increases the monthly premium. His main complaint is, he feels he should have been told this up front, and the email he received regarding the $200. 00 increase was very impersonal. I agreed, and explained it is system generated. I also thanked him for expressing that. I went over the option for him to keep his plan but increase the IUA from $1,000 to $2,500. That would increase his monthly by $50.00 instead of $200. He will stay where he is for now and think about if he will change IUA amount. Otherwise, he is happy with our service and personal contact.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-10 14:18:45', '2023-02-10 14:18:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113454054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107137002', 'Anita Arneson', NULL, '2-10-2023:  A counselor/psychiatrist? called asking how Anita Arneson''s mental healthcare works.  I let her know ''our members'' must use an in network counselor.  Let her know she could potentially become in network &amp; gave her Mizz &amp; Sull''s ph #.  Went over slightly how it''s diff, so they could give her all the info.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-10 14:13:20', '2023-02-10 14:16:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113427104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598001', 'Nathan Bertsch', 'New Plan eff 1/1/23', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-10 13:45:44', '2023-02-10 13:45:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113427099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742009', 'Bridgett Mansfield', 'New Plan eff 1/1/23', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-10 13:37:05', '2023-02-10 13:37:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113454043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111982009', 'Dean Mello', NULL, '2-10-2023:  Kelly called re: lots of questions:
     - Welcome Call
     - RX''s:  showed her form & gave her instructions for when she''s ready to make requests.
      - Diabetic supplies, insulin, etc. = Dean''s.  Let her know we are very challenged here.
     - They pd >35k on their healthcare last year due to diabetic items & the insurance prem.
     - WHLC:  Wanted to know about the dental discounts.  Helped her get the WHLC & also mentioned we have true dental policies (& some you can add vision to), yet we''d have to get her an advisor for an actual dental/vision policy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-10 13:14:12', '2023-03-02 11:46:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113427094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105905002', 'Stephanie Mundy', NULL, 'Spoke to member who told me that she did not have the money to pay us right now due to some bank issue that she was having.  She said that she needed to cancel and would re-enroll at a later date when she got straightened out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-10 13:01:24', '2023-02-10 13:01:24'),
