I also recommended that they call the facilities and individual providers to make sure they are not on the list. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-09 11:44:42', '2023-02-09 11:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113412003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081769002', 'Robert Henchel', NULL, '2-9-2023:  Robert is having stomach pain, so his doc wants to do a catscan of his stomach &amp; bladder (I think that''s what he said).   I told him how to present w/his healthsharing comp = ''cash-pay'', ask for disc,  1k IUA resp, call us if this looks like it''ll be ongoing so we can get the ''med need'' process started.  Once approved pymt easier.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-09 11:11:29', '2023-02-09 11:11:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113411003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', NULL, '02.09.2023 Muffy called to price an ointment that was offered to her at the Pharmacy for $400.
Desoximetasone, .05%, 100g.
I was not able to find a price lower than $119, and our International Shopper cannot source this.
I generated the following email via outlook and attached a coupon for $119.80:

"I searched our discount sites for your RX Quote: DESOXIMETASONE (Generic for TOPICORT) - QTY 100 • 0.05 % • Ointment (g) • Near 44022
In addition, I consulted with our international shopper. Unfortunately, the least expensive price I was able to find on our sites is over $100. Our international shopper does not source this drug.
The average price for DESOXIMETASONE (Generic for TOPICORT) - 100g • 0.05 % • Ointment in your area is: $534.58
Desoximetasone, 100g, .05%, Ointment, 1 tube: Rite Aid $119.80
Attached is a coupon for the above price. I know you shared that you would not pursue the drug, should it be over $50. However, here it is, just in case you change your mind." NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-09 10:56:51', '2023-02-09 14:51:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113405026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529553', 'Shelly Jamieson', NULL, 'Sent out new QR cards to both Shelly and her husband upon Vanessa''s request. Sent in the mail to be picked up around 3pm. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-09 10:53:31', '2023-02-09 10:53:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113408026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-09 10:41:16', '2023-02-09 10:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113408021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529553', 'Shelly Jamieson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-09 10:17:26', '2023-02-09 10:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113408016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101118002', 'David Cavazos', NULL, 'No response. 4th attempt. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-09 09:09:17', '2023-02-09 09:09:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113408008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111776002', 'Mauryce Kennedy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Carma. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-09 08:59:54', '2023-02-09 09:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113403008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084647016', 'Jonathon Vanderwall', NULL, 'Member''s parent called in and wanted to cancel this membership for his son.  I received cancellation back from him.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-09 08:39:40', '2023-02-09 08:39:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113408003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109501001', 'Sophia Guzman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-09 08:37:18', '2023-02-09 08:37:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113405006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114236001', 'Carlos Salazar', NULL, 'Carlos emailed me asking questions about lab work', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2023-02-09 08:17:24', '2023-02-09 08:17:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109380001', 'Louis Nappi', NULL, 'Dawn called in for instructions on how to submit bills to Zion for her husbands recent ER visit. She did present as self-pay and has a few receipts that she is going to upload. I also sent her a welcome call scheduler since they have not had their call yet. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-09 07:43:02', '2023-02-09 07:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113403003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084657012', 'Carly Vanderwall', 'Cancellation', 'Member''s father called in and requested cancellation of this membership.  I sent link and will process eff 3/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-09 07:41:17', '2023-02-09 07:41:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113400003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113318002', 'Thomas Parker', NULL, 'I had also spoken with Thomas in Leo''s absence. He finally enrolled under my link. I changed this over to Leonardo.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-09 07:19:03', '2023-02-09 07:19:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785099', 'Dina Rabo', NULL, 'See ticket from 2/9/23 JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-09 07:13:11', '2023-02-09 07:13:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086852002', 'Brandon Ciullo', NULL, '02.08.2023 Brandon was able to fill in an RX request for Acyclovir, 400mg, 90 tablets. I sent him a coupon via outlook with the following information:
Below is the price as of today, 02.08.2023.
The average price for Acyclovir in your area is $42.68
Acyclovir, QTY 90 • 400 MG: City Market $15.12    - NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-08 17:46:40', '2023-02-08 17:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111982009', 'Dean Mello', NULL, '02.08.2023 Dean called wanting to know how to get his prescription requests covered, and I explained that we do not cover rx requests, but we do search 7 discount sites for the best prices and an international shopper as a last resort.
I emailed him via CRM the link to the rx request form to have for future reference. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-08 17:20:14', '2023-02-08 17:20:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109000002', 'Ronald Ware', NULL, '2-8-2023:  Ronald called trying to sub his Urg Care virus visit info into "his portal" on Zion, so we''d have record (so if he calls CirrusMD, they''d know what Zion has, etc).  We went over how diff companies are diff components & they cannot see each other''s records.  Let him know CirrusMD has a place you can input your medical records if desired, but Zion won''t see that.  He was online starting a ''med need'' & I was trying to help him until I understood what he was doing.  Let him know, he does not need to turn anything in, upload anything, for us or Zion.  His virus was a few hundred dollars & he''s completely healed, so he will never be anywhere near his $2500 IUA.  He was good w/the info & sb set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-08 17:19:19', '2023-02-08 17:19:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113395026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '2-8-23 Dr. Lee Nelson is not in the network and nobody in the network seems to be recommended by anyone. She might live with the neck pain, numbness in her arm and hands if she can''t find someone she trusts.  She''s looking for a group to be a part of or get a job with an employer that offers coverage. She''s not really sure what to do at this point without a SEP or other options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-08 16:42:09', '2023-02-08 16:42:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', 'SENT: Permission to Discuss the MPB.Health Membership Plan', '02.08.2023 Steven called to attain what he called a Statement of Benefits. Given that he''s not on Katherine''s plan, and I''m unable to access such document. I forwarded him to Patti, who he is familiar with as well, and he left her a voicemail. 
I then forwarded Katherine the Permission to Discuss MPB Plan link, in order to be able to discuss anything element on Katherine''s plan with Steven. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-08 16:27:42', '2023-02-08 17:14:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113395021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '2-8-23 Bobbi wanted to know if she could switch to a carrier that has out of network benefits. None of them do and she''s outside of open enrollment. So, not an option. She has a friend whose surgeon or knows a surgeon in FL that she wanted to see. But, I suggested she sees Dr. E. Lee Nelson due to my dad''s experience and surgery. She met with Dr. Vilavicenzio (V) and has a bad feeling with him. She will see if Dr. Nelson is in the Cigna Connect network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-08 16:09:46', '2023-02-08 16:09:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636745', 'Scott Jansen', NULL, '2-8-2023:  Andrea called &amp; said they are still being billed $50 for Health Select &amp; wondered why &amp; how long that''s been going on.  Since it''s that old plan, I let her know our Ben Admin would be the one to tt, but she''s gone for the day, so she''s going to LM for Patti.  Sent Patti FYI Teams chat just as backup/heads up too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-08 16:08:33', '2023-02-08 17:17:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113395016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '2-8-23 Darryl called bc he was confused since he received an approval for his neck surgery with a $50K cap on it. I let him know they do that as standard practice until they''ve had a chance to make sure it''s not pre-x. He said it''s definitely not pre-x. It''s only been an issue in the past 3 months and he''s not worried at all about anything on his record prior to that. He talked with Jennifer the other day who passed him to Zion. He landed at the Billing Dept who then passed him along to the Need Dept. He''s still working towards his $2500 IUA and is about $500-$600 away from that. He''s been instructed to do a physical prior to surgery to make sure he''s surgery ready. He will pay cash for that since it''s not likely a wellness check but a specific physical.  He remembered his friend Catherine (last name he forgot) had a surgery about a year ago and Zion waited until the final day to pay her surgery deposit. She was nervous but it all went through.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-08 15:58:12', '2023-02-08 15:58:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113395008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '2-8-23 I left a vm for Ryan. He''s trying to understand how to get a response about some alternative care and also wants to explore dental and vision options. He lives in TX, so HMA will be a good option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-08 15:40:36', '2023-02-08 15:41:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113396003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080094010', 'Amy Jacobs-Schroeder', NULL, '02.08.23:  Sean emailed on 2.6. Said their Cobra Dental &amp; Vision will be ending soon and asked if we have anything to offer them. I told him I will look into our options and we can set up a time to discuss them.  I asked him to let me know when his Cobra plan was ending. He responded not until next month. I suggested scheduling a call for Monday or Tuesday.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-02-08 15:33:58', '2023-02-09 14:16:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110548011', 'Steven Zaidman', NULL, '2-8-2023:  Sent Chana the RX quotes & she replied.  She doesn''t need them now, but the Rite Aid pricing is fine.  Stop & Shops price for all three items was $27.03 & Rite Aid was $19.25.  As of my quote, here is what the three items priced for:
     - Lisinopril (gen for Zestril) 20mg, #90 tabs = $9.57 at Rite Aid on RXGo
     - Hydroclorothiazide (a diuretic) 25mg, #90 tabs = $.95 cents at Rite Aid on RXGo
     - Atenolol (gen Tenormin) 25mg, #90 tabs = $8.73 at Rite Aid on RXGo 
She will contact us about 5-7 days before she needs to pick them up so we can send fresh coupons.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-08 15:20:08', '2023-02-08 15:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113395003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '2-8-23 Shawna wanted to see if C4 was better but she didn''t understand that open enrollment wasn''t year round and it''s already ended. She''s only gotten a mammo so far and was hoping for a lower price. But, she''s on the best membership at this point. She''ll stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-08 15:19:39', '2023-02-08 15:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113335072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111773010', 'Martha Keyes', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-08 14:40:42', '2023-02-08 14:40:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601439', 'Chelsie Dawydiuk', 'Aging in the 40 -49 Age band eff 4/1/23', 'Sent member 1st notice notifying her of the price increase -2/8 2nd notice sent 3/7 price updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 14:22:07', '2023-03-07 12:12:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088980002', 'Aaron Kline', NULL, 'Aaron reached out to me via SalesIQ earlier this afternoon requesting a ton of info he stated he never ever got sent to him. No QR cards, membership cards (which I explained with their plan they only have Zion who doesn''t send cards due being cash pay up to their IUA), no welcome email, fulfillment package, or link w/ username & password to the member portal. I sent him both the link & login info needed to the member portal as he needed that right away for his wife that has been asking for quite a while he stated. Along with several different email''s with details info regarding their Plan, what''s included, and how to submit bills to start a need with Zion. He is all set and thanked me ever so greatly as they have been waiting since April. All taken care of and gave business hours/times of when he can reach out either via chat or concierge line. I lastly said if it is an emergency that can not wait they can reach out to me via email and I will respond right away outside business hours. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-08 14:17:26', '2023-02-08 14:17:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092103002', 'Addie Amper', 'Age up to 30', 'Member will be aging into the 30-49 age band eff 4/1/23 - 1st notice sent 2/8/23 2nd notice sent - 3/7 Price updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 14:14:40', '2023-03-07 09:45:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078592091', 'Alan Fraughton', 'Dependent Aging out 4/23', 'Members son Aric will be aging out of the membership eff 4/30/23 - 1st notice sent 2/8', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 14:08:12', '2023-02-08 14:08:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113335067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111417002', 'Maria Shea', NULL, 'Maria called back and we completed her Welcome Call. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-08 13:59:51', '2023-02-08 13:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113391002', 'Timothy Grissom', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 13:55:17', '2023-02-08 13:55:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113335062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111417002', 'Maria Shea', NULL, 'Left detailed vm and sent a new scheduler. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-08 13:38:58', '2023-02-08 13:38:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113391002', 'Timothy Grissom', NULL, 'I got a phone call from Christine that this member enrolled in the wrong plan.  They wanted the Secure plan instead of the Care + that they enrolled in.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 13:30:48', '2023-02-08 13:30:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106724002', 'Stacy Cassidy', 'Dependent Age Out', 'Dependent Jenna will be aging out of the plan eff 4/30/23 1st notice sent 2/8/23 2nd notice sent 3/7', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 13:24:21', '2023-04-05 11:57:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330254', 'Debra Rice', 'Aging into Medicare eff 4/23', 'Member will be aging into Medicare eff 4/1/23 1st notice sent 2/8/23  2nd notice sent 3/9 Plan cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 13:18:30', '2023-03-09 12:11:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, 'Member cancelled eff 2/28/23  due to aging into Medicare', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 13:10:14', '2023-02-08 13:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '02.08.2023 Matthew called to learn how to connect with cardiologists that are on the network list. I shared that cardiology is not considered preventative that you need to  abide by the PHCS network for. Matt shared that he went for and wellness annual physical (preventative) with bloodwork, and they performed an EKG during the visit. 
I consulted with Jen via teams and she confirmed with me that EKG''s are not considered part of preventative care, but now that it was performed during the preventative visit, the visit has evolved into diagnostic, which is what I had explained to Matthew, but he didn''t seem to be receiving me.
I pulled Jen in, and she reiterated the above explanation regarding the EKG, but he was still confused as to HOW TO INITIATE the medical need and where to get the receipts to upload, per our guidance on opening a medical need. We offered for him to call us back when he''s ready to open a need, and we will guide him through it. Jen sent him the email of directions on how to submit bills into Sedera.
Per Jen via teams: Matthew wasn''t grasping that when him or the doc order a test that is outside of his preventative care, it turns it into a diagnostic appointment. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-08 13:06:59', '2023-02-08 14:42:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113318002', 'Thomas Parker', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 13:02:47', '2023-02-08 13:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132196', 'Laura Lee Pier', NULL, '2-8-2023:  Laura Lee called.  She needs help starting a ''med need'' for breaking her hip 1/15/2023 & surgery on 1/16/2023.  Has paid about $300 twds her IUA so far.  Has orthopedic follow-up that was part of the surgery.  PT wants to have her make those appts.  She''s going to scan her pymt receipts for what she''s pd & the hospital detailed med coding invoices scanned/saved to her comp & will call us for help in learning how to sub to Zion.  Had a split in the bone they had to repair (kind of like a crack in a windshield where it would get worse & worse w/time).
     - Hurt her shoulder too, when she fell & thinks it may be linked to the fall.  Let her know to get that documented with the doctor.  It may or may not be a single issue, or could be two...
     - Has questions about RXs (thyroid meds).  She''s trying to find gluten free options & her dosage would have to be combined per the pharmacist.  We discussed in detail, to make sure we quote specific mfg items, we''d have to know the exact name of the mfg brand, or where she can get that brand & we can price it there.  I think she understood, but she definitely struggled.
     - Sent & walked Laura Lee thru sub a med need for her ER visit & emerg surgery.  She knows what to expect, etc.  A few things she will need to wk w/Zion on:  1) She''s struggling to pay her 1k IUA.  I let her know they don''t generally wk on a ''med need'' until that amt is pd, but she could talk w/them since her surgical bills are way past that amt.  2)  When she fell, she also hurt her shoulder & that''s coming to light as she working past the hip issue.  I had her document in her sub this is also a concern so they know it all happend at the same time (will they work w/it as one issue?  Or 2 body parts?)  Told her I could only help her lay the foundation to try to get it considered on issue, but they''d be the ones w/the final determination.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-08 12:57:31', '2023-02-09 02:31:24');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113310002', 'Laura A Talley', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 12:57:04', '2023-02-08 12:57:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113215002', 'Morgan Vaive', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 12:55:41', '2023-02-08 12:55:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113156002', 'Jimmy Harris', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 12:53:58', '2023-02-08 12:53:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113141002', 'Scott Readence', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 12:50:49', '2023-02-08 12:50:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113138002', 'Anna Brannon', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 12:49:13', '2023-02-08 12:49:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113336057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, 'Member $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 12:47:28', '2023-02-08 12:47:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086852002', 'Brandon Ciullo', NULL, '02.08.2023 Brandon called to attain a list of PCP in his area. I plugged in the zip code he provided in PHCS, downloaded the list and sent it via outlook.
He had a RX request, so I sent him the RX Request Form link via CRM.
I guided him through finding a doctor of his choosing, calling them to make his appointment, and guided coached him on how to present himself to them in order to get coverage. I reiterated that he share with the PCP''s office that this visit needs to remain purely preventative, and then to ask them "how does their office like to process refill prescriptions?", that way they keep the preventative visit separate from the treatment (RX Request). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-08 12:37:41', '2023-02-08 17:45:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '02.08.2023 Mary called to learn how to go about getting coverage for her wellness visits; mamm & bone density. She is looking forward to her welcome call tomorrow, but wanted to make sure she''s not skipping any steps for her visit on Tuesday the 14th.
She''s fairly new, and shares that she has a sheet of paper that consists of PHCS, Planstin and Zion member information, so I guided her to make sure to present her Planstin card at the office, present herself as a cash pay patient, and preventative only.
After our call, I called Planstin had them send her a PDF version of card, just in case. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-08 12:15:06', '2023-02-08 12:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113380039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, '2-8-2023:  Thomas called, he''s still struggling to get pymt on his physical from Redirect.  This is an old plan and I cannot see what components it has (I''m assuming he''s corr w/Redirect).  Walked him thru utilizing & completing the sub to: www.redirecthealth.com/extrahelp/   so he can submit the invoice to make sure they''ve rec''d it.  He said he''s called them multiple times & doesn''t hear back.  I let him know this site is set-up for this exact scenario.  IF he has not heard from them in 48-hours, I gave him their ph # to call them again to see if they can see & pay the bill now, PLUS instructed him to call us if still an issue.  That we can call w/him at that point, but let''s make sure they have the invoice prior to that call by using this site..     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-08 12:14:25', '2023-02-08 12:18:11'),
