  ('zcrm_1579374000113336044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004580009', 'Andrew Bruno', NULL, 'I reached out to this member who said he cancelled LHS eff 1/1/23.  I told him that I could refund him the payments for Jan &amp; Feb.  I will send him out the cancellation link.  Member sent in cancellation I refunded him 2 mos.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-08 10:41:25', '2023-02-08 11:05:37'),
