  ('zcrm_1579374000113335021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088593002', 'Marija Nadel', NULL, 'Welcome call refresh complete. Updated address as well. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code card. Everything I spoke about she said she won''t remember. She was manly inquiring about the mental health part of the plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-08 08:20:13', '2023-02-08 08:31:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113335013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, 'Jared called because he is going to start receiving chiropractic care for a condition that he would not share. He asked if this would be something that would be shareable within his Zion Healthshare community and I let Jared know that as long as it would be a part of a medical need and the circumstances surrounding the chiropractic treatment are related to that need, that it may be shareable. I advised Jared to get a detailed treatment plan from his chiropractor and submit it to Zion for approval. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-08 08:08:02', '2023-02-08 08:13:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113335008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, 'Steven called to inquire about a dermatology procedure that he is having done next Weds. He wanted to know if he could pay for the procedure himself and then get reimbursed. I explained to Steve that Zion usually likes to pay the provider/facility themselves, to which Steve stated that he did exactly what he asked when he had his stint put in last year. I let Steve know that he could try to do that again, but that I couldn''t guarantee whether or not he would be reimbursed. Steve asked to speak to Zion so I transferred him on over. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-08 07:54:37', '2023-02-08 07:54:37'),
