  ('zcrm_1579374000113235120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, 'NOTE:  2-7-2023:  This memb was orig a part of a group: Advanced Construction, but he retired and is now on his own membership per Advisor: Diane Border.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-07 18:45:37', '2023-02-07 23:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113244031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113410109', 'Jeremy Colbert', NULL, '2-7-23 Jeremy wants dental first and foremost bc a veneer recently cracked that he had put on. I sent him the Delta Dental Clear Plan to review for $39 a month. He just moved here from PA to Boulder. He will complete the instructions to set up his C4 account and select me as his agent and call me tomorrow. Jeremy is self-employed and earning est $34,600. Healthy, no tobacco, travels a bunch domestically and internationally. He will buy travel ins for that. He was hoping to  have better ER coverage in case of an emergency, but low cost plans don''t have good ER benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-07 17:54:07', '2023-02-09 12:23:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113244026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, '2-7-23 I helped Laura re-enroll. She chose CARE+ at $1000/$265 and will pay for wellness on her own. Already done with colonoscopy, so that''s not an issue. I sent a note to Patti to make sure to honor her Aug. 1st 2020 start date. She will redo her Welcome Call and make sure CirrusMD is working after the change as well.  Bruce will complete his cancellation form next for March 1st as well as he moves to Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-07 17:45:08', '2023-02-07 17:45:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113244018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088818002', 'Shane Simmons', 'Member reinstatement', 'Diane emailed me on 12/26/22 requesting this member be reinstated since spouses coverage fell through.  I will update CRM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-07 17:37:40', '2023-02-07 17:37:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113270040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088818002', 'Shane Simmons', NULL, '02.07.2023 FIRST: This profile says it is cancelled.
Shane called to learn about how much a medicine cost over the phone. When I looked up his profile and confirmed it, I shared that his profile says it is cancelled. He was surprised, and said, "it should not be, I called Diane back in a day to not cancel". 
I checked the medicine he was asking for: Wegovy. It ended up being expensive ~$300 and more. They wanted to check another medicine, and I had sent them the RX request link. I guided them to star that email, and to go ahead and fill out the form with as many drugs as they have a prescription for.
As for his cancellation dilemma, I shared that I will check on their account from my end, and to please contact Diane Border on their end.
I consulted with Cari via teams, and we checked ADMIN123 that shows he is active and is still being billed (Billed in January for February), BUT A NOTE saying to cancel eff 1/1/2023. Cari and I  agreed to call Diane first and discuss the situation, then call Shane and let him know the process, then contact Patti via teams to bring it to her attention.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-07 16:23:29', '2023-02-07 17:26:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113270035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529553', 'Shelly Jamieson', NULL, '02.07.2023 Shelly called to discuss a billing situation, saying Planstin was making adjustments. I forwarded her to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-07 16:04:55', '2023-02-07 17:19:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113235100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075689380', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '2-7-2023:  Julie called.  She needs to sub a ''med need'', so I sent her the temp & walked her thru the process.  Her symptoms of tremors & other issues has not subsided.  They''ve done lots of testing w/no firm ans, so next wk she''s seeing a nurologist.  She''s already paid about $1700 twds her 1k IUA, so she''s going to see if offices will give her estimates so she can get pymts more easily once this is approved, or have them bill her when available.
     - She knows to call if she needs RX quotes (headed from the docs office to the pharmacy) or she can fill out a form when it''s not an immed form (I didn''t go over where to get the form).     
     - Sounds like she''s going thru a lot, so I let her know it''s okay to call us again.  That''s what we are here for.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-07 15:59:02', '2023-02-07 17:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113270027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, '02.07.2023 Michael called and he was very challenging. Not staying on the same subject before getting to another. Trying to complete all his tasks while on the call. Michael called for various reasons, and was portraying not knowing how to use PHCS, and was wanting to find a cardiologist, a colonoscopy center/provider.
It turns out he can use his cardiologist as a follow up from the previous medical need. 

I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, and was coached based on all his individual and many questions.
Jen guided me to have him search HCBB. I asked him if he''s had his welcome call, he said "yes, but who''s going to remember any of that". I reminded him of the post welcome call, and the resources in it, and he wouldn''t remember it or go find it. So, since I could not see where it was in the history (Cari found it later), I resent him another one, just so he has the RIGHT LINKS to click on to access.
I guided him through HCBB, and I''d like to share Michael''s demeanor was aloof in learning, by saying statements like "Who''s going to read all that?", referring to the email with all the resources that I RESENT him. After a cumbersome coaching session with Michael, he took the liberty and found the POST WELCOME CALL email that Jen had sent him in 8/2022. 
I tried my best to be effective, knowledgeable and empowering with Michael, but in the end of the phone call (that I had to end), I did not feel successful, HOWEVER he was equipped with the right resources to use and ask questions about later, if it suits him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-07 15:11:33', '2023-02-07 18:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113244013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, '2-7-23 Sara called to help her boyfriend. He''s paying a lot for a high ded plan. His parents own a plumbing company and are looking find a new option for the company as well. They have about 4 employees plus the entire family which is about 4-5 family members as well. Her boyfriend has his own biz too. They wanted quotes. I sent them the video and average price for SECURE with $1000 IUA as a reference point. I let her know I will need more information for exact quote depending on their needs and ages, etc. She''s excited to share it with them and absolutely appreciates my help!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-07 14:56:27', '2023-02-07 14:56:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113235095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603201', 'Kamaljeet Singh', 'Addition of newborn', 'Received email from Sedera that this member contacted them about adding a newborn to membership and that there will be a NICU stay involved.  I will send out Change form via out look and let Sedera know that I have.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-07 14:47:38', '2023-02-07 14:47:38'),
