  ('zcrm_1579374000113295013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096042001', 'Jacqueline Schaible', NULL, 'Jackie called about the same situation as below. I reiterated the info and sent her how to open a need with Zion. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-07 14:21:25', '2023-02-07 14:21:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113244008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007328025', 'Emily Kutz', NULL, '2-7-23 Emily is in upstate NY in a remote area. Kids are on a great health plan through NY state and paying less than $400 combined for just them. So, she wants MCS for just her now. She''s astonished at how great the plans are for the kids but nothing for adults. She also recently lost power and their furnace was down in -48 temps. Super brutal. She''s in recovery mode.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-07 14:00:20', '2023-02-20 15:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113235087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, '2-7-2023:  David''s having issue w/Redirect & the pymt to the anesthesiologist.  He''s frustrated enough, if we cannot get this settled, he''s saying he wants to cancel.  I wish he would have called us prior to the threat of collections!
-------------------------------------------
Sent request for David to: www.redirecthealth.com/extrahelp/:  URGENT!!!  A bill that was approved for pymt last Aug 5 2022, with claim filed on 9/28/2022 with Redirect for $900.  This has been rebilled every month since to Redirect.  It is now being submitted to collections at a time I CANNOT have that happen as I''m currently working on a loan.  My date of birth for confirmation is 11/1/61.  Please contact me immediately.
          -------------------------------------------
Their auto response:  Notice
          Normally, members aren''t required to provide bills to Redirect Health.

          Your healthcare provider should submit their claims directly to the Multiplan PHCS electronic payment number 86145. Claims submitted electronically by your healthcare provider are paid within 30 days. Alternatively, your healthcare provider can mail claims to: Redirect Administrators PO Box 211533, Egan MN 55121.

          If you need extra help, click the "Extra Help" button to submit your bill or receipt.
-------------------------------------------
     - Sent David the above address for bill submission as he''s going to dbl ck where the billing has been sent since Redirect says they are not seeing the bill.
     - David will call us back if he hasn''t heard from Redirect by tomorrow & we can call them directly to see if we can get this rush pymt made.  He''s rec''d a bill every single month since his appt in August, so that''s why I have him checking where they''ve been sending the bill for Redirect.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-07 13:52:48', '2023-02-07 23:06:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113295008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111054002', 'Andrea Reese', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! At first I left a detailed vm for Andrea since I could not reach her and sent her a new Welcome Call scheduler. I received an email from Andrea stating that she has been waiting on the teams call for some time. I advised Andrea that we could still do her call, so I called her on the number provided when she scheduled her call.', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-07 13:49:34', '2023-02-07 13:49:34'),
