  ('zcrm_1579374000113235055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899178', 'Daniel Klein', NULL, 'Notice of age up sent to member &amp; advisor 1/4  second notice sent 2/7 via outlook  Price updated in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-07 12:42:49', '2023-02-07 12:52:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113270022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, '02.07.2023 Ryan called to see if can add dental and vision on his plan. I said, we actually don''t offer that in any of our plans. He then asked if there''s anyone to talk to that could help him understand of his options. So I forwarded him to Jeffrey for more information. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-07 12:16:48', '2023-02-07 12:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113268008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068021', 'Ryan Donovan', NULL, 'Ryan called about possibly adding vision and dental. I referred him back to Wendy, as she has instructed not to speak with her members.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-07 12:10:01', '2023-02-07 12:10:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113235044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093928002', 'John Stagge', NULL, '2-7-2023:  Angela called.  She had a ton of questions:
     - Does her plan help w/mamm, etc?  Let her know they curr do not have any ''prev'' care.
     - She''s considering goint to SECURE because they do own their own bus.  We also talked about the 1k vs $2500 IUAs, price diff, etc.  She''ll think on it & knows to do both changes at once if they decide to go w/the lower IUA, because they limit how many chgs can be done annually (only once).  She knows to contact us/process the change BEFORE the 20th of month.
     - IF Secure/Planstin for ''prev'' = eff date of chg to new plan (ie: for mamm, prev care anyway). No wait for this portion.
     * NEED to go over 60-day wait if they chg to lower IUA for the new IUA to take effect?  Maybe Patti knows if they go to the new plan, is there still a waiting period.  This is why I didn''t say anything - it may be a non-issue if they stay with the $2500 IUA.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-07 11:59:05', '2023-02-07 13:28:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113270017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '02.07.2023 Linda Lebsack called regarding a billing question "Planstin doing an adjustment on her account"
I forwarded her to Patti, and left Patti a message via teams. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-07 11:58:52', '2023-02-07 11:58:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113235039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, 'Steve was transferred to me by Cari.  I called him back and answered his questions.  He is happy Sedera but spouse wants security of ACA no that hey qualify for a subsidy.  I advised that will be very short lived.  I gave him downsides of ACA.  He is possibly looking at having both for a period of time to see which one he likes better  I will try to get him to decide one way  or another.  He will be back in touch.  If he stays he will want to drop MEC.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-07 11:53:13', '2023-02-07 11:53:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113235034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162382', 'Juan Rosas', NULL, 'Member was sent email by Sedera giving them the impression that they were cancelled eff 1/1/23.  I spoke to Sedera and they admitted that email was very confusing.  Member went out and got other coverage and is looking to cancel eff 1/1.  I sent cancellation to them and will cancel back to 1/1 when I receive.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-07 11:48:23', '2023-02-07 11:48:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113235026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098675002', 'Tony Costa', NULL, '2-7-2023:  Iolani from the doc''s office - came in for obgyn appt, post-menopausal bleeding.  Iolani was able to conf details, so I did share w/her the 1k IUA, ''cash-pay'', potential help if &gt; 1k, etc.  She said they actually have quite a few pts on healthsharing, so it sounds like she understands.  I let her know Lauren would be the one to start a ''med need'' if we get to that point &amp; even then she''s ''cash-pay''as everyone shares the expenses.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-07 11:44:01', '2023-02-07 11:45:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113270003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109598001', 'Nathan Bertsch', NULL, '02.07.2023 Jenelyn called to get everything on the plan organized and wants to learn of the doctors around her, specifically Pediatrician. Jenelyn shared, she is not having success finding providers in her area, so she contacted the concierge line for assistance. I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, but was guided that it would be best to reach out to Joan for this information about providers in the members areas who are on the OPD plan.

I let Jenelyn know that I would contacting out OPD specialist, Joan, and if she does not hear from anyone by Thursday, to contact the concierge line back.

I messaged Joan via Outlook, Cc''d Jen and Cari for educational opportunities, to reach out to Jenelyn to discuss her concern, and equip the concierge crew with the imperative bullets needed to help guide and support our members on the OPD plan. One thing that stood out to me that Jenelyn said "Well, if you can''t help me with my plan, OPD, what can you help me with?" - I was hoping to be better prepared for her, but I''m glad she was patient and understanding with me. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-07 11:36:56', '2023-02-07 11:48:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113268003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114430002', 'Asif Khan', NULL, 'I assigned this lead from Tony to Leo, He''s made one attempt to contact this prospect, no follow up. I reached out to him today, reached him immediately. He is still interested and asked me to call him on Friday Feb 10th.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-07 11:16:09', '2023-02-07 11:16:09'),
