  ('zcrm_1579374000113235009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, '2-7-2023:  Jill called, she''s struggling to figure out how to utilize her healthshare.  I let her know that calling the Concierge Line first is a good way to get help (great traffic directors). 
     - She didn''t think she''d used her CirrusMD prev, but she''s already registered.  We got her into her app & she''s ready to chat when she wants to.  We disc the limited scope and she seems to understand.
     - WHLC:  She wasn''t near a computer, so I verally walked her thru the steps & what was available there.  She thought it would have labs & imaging, so then I went over:
     - Imaging:  Can help her find the fair price in her area.  She''ll call when she gets to this.
     - Labs:  Disc diff discount sites.  She has Quest lab near her.
     - RX Quotes:  She always uses GoodRX & asked if we could do a price for her.  She''s not in a hurry as she won''t need these for quite some time, but is curious how our prices look.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-07 10:50:33', '2023-02-07 11:31:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113244003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, '2-7-23 Jill just wanted to understand all of the benefits she didn''t realize that she has after reading my recent email about the upgrade and included benes. She will call the MPB Concierge Team to register for CirrusMD. She was pleased to learn about Life Care. She also wants to access WHLC for the discounts. She understands she might have to "upgrade" sometime but wasn''t forced to do so yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-07 10:44:34', '2023-02-07 10:44:34'),
