  ('zcrm_1579374000113164016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601108', 'Kevin Fechtmeyer', NULL, 'Kevin called because his daughter needs to see a provider for a UTI. I suggested CirrusMD but it appears Kevin hadn''t registered yet so I sent him an invitation. Kevin is going to register and start a chat, if he needs any further assistance he will give us a call. JAT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-07 09:16:17', '2023-02-07 09:16:17'),
