  ('zcrm_1579374000113104130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, '2-6-2023:  Thelma wants to see a gyno (hasn''t been in a long while) & wondered if/what is part of her healthcare.  Walked her thru (using post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail:
     - ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev care ONLY - curr req all prov involved be in PHCS ntwk, prov(s) must bill, must stay 100% medically coded as ''prev'', etc.  Notify doc off & make sure facility both in ntwk when make appt & upon arrival.
        Walked her thru PHCS Spec Srvcs ntwk search tool.
