  ('zcrm_1579374000113104100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904304', 'Katherine Waller', NULL, 'Katherine needs to realize she should be calling them or texting that she has the appts 48-hours ahead of time.  per Ashley at Redirect.

2-6-2023:  Katherine Waller called.  She has bills that have been submitted & never reimb.  Last week she went for blood work follow-up appt @ her PCP.  She did not rec the pymt promised.  Plus, she sub the bills for 3 chiro appts & her last PCP & none of those pymts has been rec''d.
     - She says she sub a few items to Redirect & has never rec''d any response/or the payments.
     -  I''d tried to sub an ''extra help'' req on their site, but it did something weird & I wasn''t sure they''d rec''d it, so I called them.  tt Ashley at Redirect, they show the 3 chiro & 1 PCP, so Ashley is sending a req for the claims dept to call Katherine at 970-759-3179, but, she doesn''t see that Katherine has called them in the past.
     - Katherine doesn''t seem to understand her plan, who we are, who Redirect is, etc.  I tried to do a bit of education, but am not sure how much stuck.

IF Katherine has not heard from Redirect by Wednesday, she will call us for further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-06 12:59:40', '2023-02-06 13:40:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113104086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130714', 'Steven Hase', NULL, '2-6-2023:  Steve called w/questions.  He thinks he''d like to drop the MEC/prev portion of his plan &amp; wondered what that would look like.  This is a relatively old plan &amp; the advisor shows as inactive, so I fwd''d him to Patti''s line.  He''ll LM if he doesn''t catch her right away.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-06 12:53:19', '2023-02-06 17:34:21'),
