  ('zcrm_1579374000113097043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114224002', 'Federico Gaytan Jr', NULL, 'Texted me saying they are ready to pick a plan this week.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2023-02-06 12:47:07', '2023-02-06 12:47:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113072030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082839002', 'Donald McClendon', NULL, '02.06.2023 Donald called to:
1-Check and see if braces that are needed to correct a tooth issue are shared.
2-Inquiring how getting a knee looked at will be covered.
3-If outside of the country, does he have coverage.
I consulted with Cari via teams, and she helped with:
1-Dental and orthodontics are rarely shared, but if he really wants, he can open a medical need and see what Zion''s response is.
2-I told him, we will then open a medical need for the ONE KNEE, and he will be responsible for his IUA. If his other knee has an issue too, then it is a separate medical need request.
3-Cari shared, Zion covers catastrophic events outside of the country. AND if interested in having a procedure outside of the country that the member would have to get approval from Zion for a Medical Tourism ordeal. 
Donald wanted to glance at the medical need request link, and did not have his Zion member ID #, so I transferred him to Zion, after we were done talking. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-06 12:41:54', '2023-02-06 13:11:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113104073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887102', 'Shelley Sanner', NULL, '2-6-2023:  Shelley has a mamm tomorrow.  She did conf when she made the appt they accept her PHCS network prev care.  She lives in a rather remote area, so I hope that''s accurate.  She will present her card & remind them that the prov that reads the images also needs to be part of the PHCS ntwk.
     - She tends to have dense breasts & often needs further ultrasound or something.  Those don''t tend to be covered, so she will conf w/Planstin it''s not & knows to keep track of receipts, detailed inv, etc, in case it becomes a need.  Then she''d be resp for her $2500 IUA, but we have 6mos deadline, so contact us for guidance ~ 4mos in if it could continue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-06 12:17:17', '2023-02-06 19:08:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113116038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Leonardo Moraes', 'Visit ID : 2830 Question : Please add yourselves to the list of providers at hsabank.com thanks.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-02-06 12:07:34', '2023-02-06 12:07:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113104068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663707', 'Olga Chwascinska', NULL, '2-6-2023:  Olga called.  She tt CirrusMD this weekend and was told she has a skin tag on her labia, so she needs to see a gynocologist.  She wondered how to find a gynocologist, so I took her to HCBB & explained how to use it, fair pricing, etc.  She seems to understand & knows if this looks like it will be > than her 1k IUA resp, she will connect w/us to sub a ''med need'' w/pymt receipts, detailed inv (super bills), & there is a 6-mos deadline so to call us w/in about 4 mos, etc for sharing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-06 12:00:00', '2023-02-06 12:55:54'),
