  ('zcrm_1579374000113072013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081872009', 'Dante Chupek', NULL, '02.06.2023 Cameron just found out they are pregnant and wants to know the best way to be seen by doctors and how this process all works.
I said "well we definitely want to open a medical need with Zion". I wanted to consult with Cari via teams on if she needs to go through network or be seen by whoever Zion approves.
Cari shared, they will need to open a maternity medical need, as soon as they receive confirmation. 
Cameron has not gone to see the Dr. yet, and does not have a medical initial visit date.
I recommended she make an appt ASAP, and call us back to start the maternity medical need request. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-06 11:50:44', '2023-02-06 12:20:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000113072008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658001', 'John Richardson', NULL, '02.06.2023 John called from the urologist''s office, to clarify why Planstin in declining the procedure he had done at the urologist.
