I consulted with Cari via teams, she shared that procedures are not preventative, but considered treatment. She also mentioned, urologists have no network.
I shared the above with John, and because he was interested in learning about other plans and lowering his IUA, I recommended he speak to our sales specialist, Jeffrey Bursteen.
He was interested in speaking with Jeffrey, so I forwarded him after we were done talking. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-06 11:49:30', '2023-02-06 13:14:53'),
