  ('zcrm_1579374000113092074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, '02.03.2023 Spoke with Diane as I called her, she briefly explained HMA, since I''m new to the concierge line. Shared some options and how they work with expensive drugs. Provided me with resources for educational purposes, and requested I keep her posted in  how we maneuver difficult situations such as RX requests Humira.
