  ('zcrm_1579374000113115004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108946002', 'Charles Warner', NULL, '2-3-2023:  Charles called re: PSA test & appt.  Seeing his urology specialist next week for what they think is the final follow-up test from his procedure back in April 2021.  He didn''t seem to have any info regarding pre-x & I didn''t dwell on this.  But he said "yeah, we didn''t talk about this at all", which I worry he''s not aware of the 24-mos lookback period.
