     - He asked about starting an HSA (which once he funds that, it could help w/these types of expenses).  He''ll look into getting one started for next time.  
     - Went over some education: ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative Care ONLY, Prev lab: simple Lipid panel could be incl in ''prev'' care, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-03 16:42:24', '2023-02-03 17:50:03'),
