  ('zcrm_1579374000113010014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064485435', 'Curtiss Newell', NULL, 'The Newells submitted aa cancellation form today, indicating a Jan 1 effective  date. Tracy said she contacted Leslie back in December, I had Tracy send me whatever written correspondence she had with Leslie. The texts indicate Leslie sent her the form on the 29th of January and indicated we could refund her the money. Tracy sent the form in today. I contacted Leslie and explained what I spoke to Tracy about, I told Leslie to call her and deal with it and find a solution.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-03 09:19:41', '2023-02-03 09:19:41'),
