  ('zcrm_1579374000112922041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '2-2-23 Carol and Charlie decided to join CARE+ $1000/$520 for now. They have no need for wellness at this point but may decide to add it in the future.  She also chose the HMA at $140 mo for 10,000 level. Chose VPS Choice Plan A with new glasses 1x per year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-02 15:37:14', '2023-02-02 15:37:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112922036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '2-2-23 Darryl called with Susan Atchison on the phone. He''s in severe pain with a neck issue. He needs his C5, C6 and C7 fused ASAP. He rejected an $8K steroid injection to help save money and he didn''t want steroids. They gave him some other pain med to help combat the pain. He can''t sleep. He''s looking at Steadman''s and Vail Valley Hospital. He let them know he''s self-pay and the hospital is giving him insights as to the best way to access at the best price with the same doctor. One hospital is way more affordable than the other and the dr. he wants works at both. He''s spent $900, $850 and $158 already to almost meet his $2500 IUA. He''s already created the new Need and has been working with Zion''s team. I recommended he call the MPB Concierge Team just to make sure he''s following the best process and for possible assistance in gaining the highest quality care at a fair price. I sent him the phone # and he''ll call them. He''s pretty freaked out about his pain and surgery right now. Sounds brutal! The hospital wants a cash payment up front for the surgery which got him super nervous too. I told him that''s customary and that the MCS company will be able to provide that once he submits all of the supporting documentation. He''s done that already with what he has so far. He''s on track. Susan will help him as well. He will let me know if he has any questions as he moves forward. He was very appreciative of my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-02 15:01:19', '2023-02-02 15:47:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112929020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083107002', 'William Lamb', NULL, '02.02.2023 William''s wife needs to get breast reduction to relieve low back pain, and he is asking how to go about this to get covered.
I offered to help open a medical need for this. At the same time, I told him it sounds like Zion might need a heads up for approval prior to it. I consulted with Jen via teams on this and she confirmed that he needs to speak to Zion about this.
After I answering his question I forwarded him to Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-02 14:54:37', '2023-02-02 14:54:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112989008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111538002', 'Kimberly TimmBerger', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!
