  ('zcrm_1579374000112989003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110168002', 'Bernard Huerre', NULL, 'Agnes called in with many, many questions since they have not had a welcome call yet. We went over self-pay, how to present her Planstin card, I verified that her OBGYN Schuchi Desai is in the PHCS network, and we discussed her having a welcome call. I sent her the scheduler. JT', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-02 14:10:53', '2023-02-02 14:10:53'),
