  ('zcrm_1579374000112953003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, 'I spoke to Jared and cleared up all the confusion. Because of the mix up with his effective date, his traditional plan cancelled him prematurely. He also told me about all the emails from planstin, zion, etc. He is scheduled for his welcome call with Vanessa on monday,Feb 6th. He is clear now, and looking forward to his welcome call.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-02 12:30:55', '2023-02-02 12:30:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112922021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096331001', 'Darrell Porter', NULL, '2-2-23 Krystyna called to find out about the card and why she doesn''t have it yet. I told her I just learned that they are working to run the file transfer tonight and hopefully get the cards out ASAP. She now wants a mammogram and has never gotten one before. But, she said her naturopathic dr is recommending she do one. I let her know that now to make sure it''s considered preventative and if they find something and need further tests, she will be responsible for the first $1000.  They also did not do their Welcome Call and don''t have the CirrusMD app yet. I will ask for the scheduler to be resent to them by Vanessa.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-02 12:11:44', '2023-02-02 12:11:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112922016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086942001', 'James Evans, Jr.', NULL, '2/2/2023:  James called right before his wife''s mamm (which was 8:30am mtn, so I called him back after my wk meeting.  By then she''d already gone, but, she got to the hosp &amp; pres her Planstin card &amp; was extremely pleased when they told her it was all taken care of. They''d bill Planstin etc.  Fingers crossed, it will continue to go smoothly.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-02 12:05:52', '2023-02-02 12:05:52'),
