  ('zcrm_1579374000112937003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356101', 'Jonathan Webster', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add Spouse back to membership eff 3/1/23.  I will update in A123 &amp; Notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-02 12:03:16', '2023-02-02 12:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112929003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082148002', 'Angela Johnson', NULL, '02.02.2023 Angela (Angie) called about her daughter dealing with medical issues they are unsure of. They have been to the Urgent Care 3X, might be gall bladder.
I recommended they open a medical needs request. However they do not have their Zion ID number, Angie tried looking for an email from Zion but she did not find anything. They do not have anything that has their member ID number on it from Zion, and they never received a card.
I sent Angie a medical need request and gave her Zion''s number to request their member ID number. 
Angie portrayed the confidence to fill out the medical need request on her own, and if anything would come up that she would question, she would call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-02 11:58:47', '2023-02-02 12:11:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112926003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401239', 'emmett murphy', NULL, 'Emmett messaged me on SalesIQ a little bit ago stating that his Welcome Call was at 1pm and it was 1:04pm Est and no one has called him, so he wanted to know if he is supposed to call someone. I reached out to both Vanessa and Jennifer asking if either of them was supposed to call him at 1pm est. Jennifer responded and said that on their Welcome Call calendar it says Emmett''s welcome call is actually next Thursday on Feb 9th at 1pm Est 11am MST his time. I let Emmett know this and he asked for me to email him the schedular so he can reschedule. I will do so right now. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-02 11:49:20', '2023-02-02 11:49:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112922008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109089002', 'Ralph Holding', NULL, '2-2-2023:  Ralph called.  He had questions on the e-mail he rec''d to sub a ''med need''.  We walked thru the form so he now knows what to expect and how to accurately complete the items.
      - He knows he is resp for the 1k IUA, but hasn''t pd anything yet.  I went over that once they have his ''med need'' going, he can call & pay that directly to Zion since his expenses are already > 1k.
     - He did get the ''cash-pay'' discount applied & it shows on his inv.  
     - Made sure he realizes he also has Zion''s ph # in the e-mail Jennifer sent & then trans him directly so he can get his Zion memb #.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-02 11:39:32', '2023-02-02 11:59:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112922003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125227018', 'Jennifer Abbott', NULL, '2-2-23 Jennifer called and was confused as to what her payment was supposed to be for Estefania. I sent her the grid of the break down of all costs. After much misunderstanding she finally gets it. She didn''t understand that the prices and calculation change every year and that the costs I showed her are based off the lowest cost silver plan for 2023.  She''s finally on board and will correct Estefania''s paycheck.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-02 11:38:14', '2023-02-02 11:38:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112918008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114408009', 'Kim Scott', NULL, 'Just spoke to Kim. She is ready to move forward with SECURE but had to confirm some things with her church. Is switching over from Liberty. Will call me later today to finalize the application.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2023-02-02 11:22:49', '2023-02-02 11:22:49'),
