  ('zcrm_1579374000112918003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119412018', 'John Nowell', NULL, 'Currently paying 845 for an insurance plan for just himself. Is unaffordable. Does own his own business. Has an HSA. Wont be looking to start for another 2 months as he is currently finishing physical therapy for an Achilles tendinitis. 
