  ('zcrm_1579374000112917003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111523002', 'Laurie Gershgorn', NULL, '02.02.2023 Laurie called to confirm how to get approval how to use her alternative medicine as her PCP. I was unfamiliar with this scenario, so I reached out to Cari via teams. I understood Laurie wants to get pre-approval via treatment plan as the email that was sent to her said. Cari was committed to another member and realizes this is longer conversation to have to call Laurie back when she is done. 
Cari offered a scenario as to how and when a treatment plan would be appropriate. She was detailed by getting into how to process the medical need to proceed, given the IUA has completed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-02 10:28:18', '2023-05-08 07:54:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112854039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061180', 'William Reyes', 'New Plan eff 3/1/23', 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-02 10:17:44', '2023-02-02 10:17:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112916003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093898002', 'Matthew Hoit', NULL, '2-2-2023:  Selina called.  Their 15 yr old, Kaelah passed out this am.  They called CirrusMD & spoke to Dr, Matthew Leonard at 8:30am Pacific time.  Selina was really struggling with having the conv over chat & asked if they could do a verbal ph call & was told "this is a chat based program" w/no offer for her to wait or have a verbal conversation.  I tt Jennifer & Joan in a concierge meeting & Joan is going to get me Nadia Wilder''s contact information so we can at least ask for guidance & have this addressed by CirrusMD.
     - Dr Leonard felt Kaelah should have an electrocardiogram.  So, I walked Selina through options on how to proceed.  She knows to present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a disc, offer to pay up to their $2500 IUA (fair priced cardiogram looks like $550 in her area, assuming we chose the corr procedure in HCBB).
     - Walked her thru how to use HCBB to select docs, etc.  She seems to have a good handle on how to proceed.  Hopefully, they can get Kaelah taken care of right away.  I did tell her w/cardiac issues, we don''t like seeing any hesitation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-02 10:17:36', '2023-02-02 16:49:40'),
