  ('zcrm_1579374000112858018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090968002', 'Thomas Griffith', NULL, 'Brenda reached out to me via SalesIQ asking for her Patient ID to look at the PHCS Network. I let her know there is no Patient ID required to do so and that she doesn''t have any sort of Patient ID with her plan here. I let her know I would send her the email with the link &amp; instructions for navigate the website to search for providers in the PHCS Network. She thanked me and is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-02-02 09:06:06', '2023-02-02 09:06:06'),
