  ('zcrm_1579374000112805033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076016', 'Mark Caprio', NULL, '2-1-2023:  Mark called asking about the tax form showing he''s had cov for the year - he lives in TX.  I think he''s sugg the 1095?  Patti addressed that in one of the Admin calls saying they can process their taxes w/out the form, then the forms are req''d beginning of March 2023 (?) to download for your records.  He wanted to conf &amp; get details so I put him into Patti''s VM, but let him know she''s already gone for the day.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 15:17:06', '2023-02-01 15:17:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111218002', 'Sean Ebert', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 14:59:38', '2023-02-01 14:59:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371027', 'Karen Faydenko', NULL, '02.01.2023 Karen wanted to know how to get reimbursed for the preventative appts she attended and how to get her Lab visit paid for, as she received her bill.
I consulted with Jen via teams, and she confirmed as long as they are in network it will be paid, specifically Quest and Labcorp are safe to go to.
Because she has already paid for her doctor visits, Jen told me that she needs to contact Planstin directly and explain what she said to me to them, so she can get reimbursed.
I suggested that she call the lab first, and connect them with Planstin to collaborate payment. That way she only has the doctor visits to discuss with Planstin. THEN call Planstin and discuss how to get reimbursed for the doctor''s visits. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-01 14:42:59', '2023-02-01 14:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112814002', 'John Courson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 14:37:16', '2023-02-01 14:37:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112816003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '2-1-23 Ruth called in a panic bc her friend said that Joe doesn''t qualify for Cobra with other group coverage. But, I called Rod and Patti to verify. Rod did not answer. Patti and I agreed that he doesn''t qualify if he had an employer who was offering him coverage through his work. That is not the case. He is paying on his own as a self-employed person to have a backup plan with SECURE to allow Ruth to join SECURE. He will only use SECURE as a secondary option since he has Cobra as his primary.  I told her to ask a Cobra expert if she was still concerned or the HR person for his company. But, she will leave it alone as is.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-02-01 14:34:57', '2023-02-01 14:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112811002', 'Dan Vandre', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 14:32:10', '2023-02-01 14:32:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112728002', 'Way Walters', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 14:28:34', '2023-02-01 14:28:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112660002', 'Timothy Rennert', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 13:53:32', '2023-02-01 13:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112618002', 'Antonio DeMarco', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 13:49:23', '2023-02-01 13:49:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098599023', 'Mujtaba Saifuddin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 13:48:34', '2023-02-01 13:48:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366082', 'Irene Mendyuk', NULL, '02.01.2023 Irene called to stop paying into her HMA. Her questions were, will I still have whatever money that''s been put into it? AND how can I stop paying into? I consulted with Cari on this, and she guided me to transfer her to her advisor, Stuart Lubline. That is what I did. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-01 13:43:15', '2023-02-01 13:44:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112463002', 'Alec Campbell', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 13:42:51', '2023-02-01 13:42:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112459002', 'Cathi Amaya-Sciacca', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 13:40:03', '2023-02-01 13:40:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109660001', 'Laura Hunt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 13:21:55', '2023-02-01 13:21:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064767127', 'Timothy Smith', NULL, 'Member''s 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM -2/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 13:10:53', '2023-02-01 13:10:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342056', 'Fred Blum', NULL, '02.01.2023 Fred wants to how preventative care with colonoscopies work. I explained that it''s preventative, until they pull polyps, then it automatically and instantly becomes diagnostic.
He then asked me what plan is he on, I confirmed his account, and told him Care+, which offers zero preventative care with Care+.
I guided him to learn more on HCBB for the costs and quality of procedures. I offered to transfer him to Charles, his advisor, to learn more about other plans with preventative care. He did not have time during this call to speak to Charles, but he has his number he said and will call him at a better time. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-01 13:08:29', '2023-02-01 13:20:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112805018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109799016', 'Robert Louchheim', NULL, '2-1-2023:  Rbt called back.  Found out it''s a torn miniscus root.  They''ve sched him for surgery on 2/10/2023, so no time for CareConnect.  He''s already paid $727, so he sub''d his ''surgical need'' today & knows to call & pay the bal of his IUA: ex: $2500 - $727 = $1773 once they''ve rec''d his need.
     - He will add to the info how they suddenly decided he needs surg & it''s now sched for the 10th, so there''s some urgency; that he plans to pay them the bal of the IUA; & wants to help facilitate the approval process so there''s no issue.  He already has them getting him the estimate for surgery based on ''cash-pay'' patient, but will not have that to submit yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 12:47:03', '2023-02-01 15:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112805013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103044012', 'Timothy McCoy', NULL, '2-1-2023:  Saundra called.  Wow, super difficult & totally does NOT understand what she''s purchased.  I have no idea who the advisor, Brown Dog Cafe, is on this one.  Maybe John Kach?  I don''t think I finished a single sentence w/out Saundra interrupting.
     - She started the call, asking about her ''Medishare''.  Got snippy when I was trying to figure out if she is an MPB memb or had the wrong #.  Once we realized she is an MPB member, I tried to explain she has a diff healthsharing company & they often have different guidelines, can have diff benefits, work differently for different items...  so, therefore, her comment of "well, it''s healthsharing and they are all the same, right?" is not actually accurate.
     - Her son went to the doc''s office in Oct.  She started asking when we are going to negotiate the pricing.  Tried to find out what he went for (prev care, diagnostic, etc)?  Which getting a straight answer was actually imposible.  It sounds like (if I''m understanding through all the ick), In Oct, he presented his Planstin card & they paid for the immunizations in Dec 2022.  "Why did it take you so long to pay that?"  I let her know billing can take 30-days and then it was paid within the next month, so that didn''t seem unreasonable in my experience, but that would be something Planstin (the prev care) company would need to address since they can see what the visit included.
        Then, she''s angry because "aren''t  you supposed to negotiate with the doctor''s office so I don''t pay so much?"  I asked again, was this a prev care appt?  She got snippy again, well I have a friend that has ''MediShare'' and they negotiate, so maybe that''s the service I need.  I let her know, if it was prev care, she should have paid zero, no negotiation nec.  She was incredibly tough.  At one point I quit talking because she kept interrupting and I thought she was going to contine talking.  She asked are you still there?  I said yes, I was trying to explain and am struggling to get the information out because of the conversation flow, she should continue, then I can answer.
     - I tried to explain the diff components:  she''s purchase more of a package of products = ''prev care'', telehealth, healthsharing, etc.  Again, she kept interrupting, so I just gave up.  Told her that maybe Planstin could explain since they paid for the immunizations, why the other was not covered.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 12:45:49', '2023-02-01 15:48:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112805008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, '1-31-2023:  Jared called, totally feeling mislead.  He orig called to find out why we still show the Jan eff date, because it''s thrown his whole ''insurance'' coverage off.  He  intentionally req''d a 2/1/23 eff date.  However, when he sub the new info without realizing it had the Jan 1st eff date showing, rather than Feb eff date, his old ins cancelled Jan 1st & has left him holding the bag.  He tried, after talking to MPB to get his old ''ins'' reinstated to the 2/1/2023 cancellation date & they were unable to accomodate that request.  He & his family were squeezing in things they needed done prior to this new plan!  Now, he''s receiving declinations for the items they were getting done prior to 2/1/2023 because of the screw-up on the eff date.  
     - He''s frustrated because he feels he was clear that he intended for this new healthcare to begin February 1st & that was not accomplished.  I passed the information to Jennifer because this gentleman has 41 employees also on this new healthcare.  He has lots of questions and mentioned he has his Welcome Call on the 6th.  From his questions (& the amount of bus he''s bringing us as a bus owner) I wondered if Jennifer giving him the golden glove treatment might be best in the ''Welcome Call''.  She''s called & offered that to Jared, but we aren''t sure if he will resched w/her or keep his orig on the 6th with Vanessa.  I just thought maybe Jennifer as the Lead, could go above & beyond, which is tough on Vanessa''s tight call sched.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 12:26:35', '2023-02-01 18:27:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will process &amp; refund the 2/23 share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 12:22:08', '2023-02-01 12:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090502002', 'Rita Pate', NULL, '02.01.2023 Rita called to make sure she can make her preventative care appts.
Was concerned with wait time, and finding mammography and other services in her area.
I consulted with Jen and Cari via teams, and both agreed no waiting time with Secure.
Rita was also concerned about when they take a mamm pic, but need to do it again, will it still be considered Preventative and she thought there''s a way to process it through, so the member is not charged (stays under preventative). I explained to her, with Jen''s guidance, it will become diagnostic and Zion will kick in once she''s over her IUA.
I guided Rita to the PHCS network link and the HCBB for learning more about where to go and how well they are rated. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-01 12:15:48', '2023-02-01 12:40:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112805003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107710002', 'Jana Baldwin', NULL, '2/1/2023:  tt Tyler, he was super nice.  It turns out he was at Martin''s (a grocery store near their new house), so he stopped by the pharmacy.  They not only filled the RX for him, they just multiplied the one time price for a GoodRX 30-ds, and gave him a 90-ds = $8.11 = amazing price.  He was super grateful we''d done pricing and said he appreciated the help.
     - He only has the one RX.  Says Martin''s or Meijer pharmacies are close for next time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 11:43:18', '2023-02-01 11:43:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084647002', 'Michelle Olejarz', NULL, '02.01.2023 Michelle called to cancel her plan with us. I forwarded her to Karen Torsoe, and provided her with Karen''s number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-01 11:35:27', '2023-02-01 11:35:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112793013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005185370', 'Bradley Dean', NULL, 'This guy phoned in with an attitude, just wants to cancel, doesn''t use it, doesn''t need it, doesn''t want it. I sent CXL form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-01 11:34:14', '2023-02-01 11:34:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102604002', 'Cynthia Shelden', NULL, '02.01.2023 Cynthia called to better understand how to maneuver her plan, given the child well visits and immunization.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-02-01 10:43:24', '2023-02-01 10:46:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111697002', 'Prasad Salunkhe', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-01 10:37:18', '2023-02-01 10:37:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112746003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110872012', 'Joshua Sigg', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2813 Question : Hi, I am trying to login to my account but I am not sure what my member ID is

I sent Joshua his member portal login info via email from Admin123. JT', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-02-01 10:23:26', '2023-02-01 11:03:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112745009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110872012', 'Joshua Sigg', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2812 Question : Hello, I am a new member of MPB health, I am trying to sign in to my account but do not know what by Member ID is. I checked my email and don’t have any info regarding login', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-02-01 10:14:58', '2023-02-01 10:14:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110789002', 'Devon Petersen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-01 10:03:45', '2023-02-01 10:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025389081', 'Kelly Mills', NULL, 'Kelly called for dermatology fair pricing and a list of dermatologists in her area. I sent her info from HCBB. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 09:51:30', '2023-02-01 09:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108430002', 'Mari Skalicky', NULL, 'Mari called in for a script quote form. I sent one via email and will be completing the quote. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 09:50:51', '2023-02-01 09:50:51'),
