  ('zcrm_1579374000112773038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111878002', 'Ian Jenkins', NULL, 'Ian called back regarding the MAP program. I sent him the info via email and transferred him directly to the MAP program. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 09:34:12', '2023-02-01 09:34:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112796005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013453097', 'Jose j De La Cerda', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  I will process &amp; refund 2/23 share Amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-02-01 09:04:27', '2023-02-01 09:04:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111239002', 'Lois Hurst', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Lois. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-02-01 08:33:42', '2023-02-01 08:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112793003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496019', 'Bruce Schanstra', NULL, 'Spoke to Bruce, very nice guy. His kids that are in college, the college is stating they don''t recognize this as insurance. He already signed up for traditional insurance and needs to cancel this plan.  He did mention that his one daughter that is not in school could benefit possibly from this plan on her own. I said she will have to enroll in her own plan. He will have her call me.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-02-01 08:23:03', '2023-02-01 08:23:03');
