  ('zcrm_1579374000112773013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107788002', 'Kevin Byram', NULL, 'Jamie called in looking for lists of pediatricians and PCP''s. I will be sending her those lists via email. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 07:33:17', '2023-02-01 07:33:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, 'See ticket JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 07:25:44', '2023-02-01 07:25:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112773003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107133002', 'Preston Jones', NULL, 'See ticket JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-02-01 07:25:21', '2023-02-01 07:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112731016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107710002', 'Jana Baldwin', NULL, '1-31-2023:  Re: RX Quote Atorvastatin (Calcium = Gen Lipitor) 10mg, #30, 1d = 30-ds.
     - This is extremely exp at his req''d pharmacy = Walgreens (cheapest was $95+).  So I e-mailed &amp; asked him:
1)  Is he open to Meijer Pharmacy?  #30 = $4.20; #90 = $9.10
2) Reg medication?  Has refills?  Would like which ds/qty?
        Have everything documented so I can easy send appropriate coupon.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 01:57:55', '2023-02-01 01:57:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112731011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, '1-31-2023:  William called to remove his daughters from the plan.  When we talked, we realized he will age into Medicare at the same time the remova of his girls would be eff & the whole membership will need to be revamped because as primary he must be rem''d 3/1/2023.  
     - He''s going to contact his advisor Michael Montes to get his wife setup on her own memb 3/1/2023 (which will rem their daughters & him).  Once he''s done that he will call & we''ll make sure he gets the cancellation complete.
     - I did let him know if the daughters wanted their own memberships, they would need to apply right away as well to keep their Zion longevity, but it sounds like they both have other ''ins'' already & are not worried about this.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 01:26:15', '2023-02-01 01:26:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112731003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '1-31-2023:  Chris'' asst Jason e-mailed (Perm to Disc rec''d 12/22/22) saying he canceled Jason''s memb by sending a cancellation notice to Zion on their website.  I replied & let him know that will now work as his memb is thru MPB & since he''s already tt Jeffrey Bursteen in the past & has still decided to cancel, let him know where the MPB cancellation form is, letting Jason know Chris must comp & sign that form. Sent my reply 2:30pm mtn.  at 1:15am 2/1/23, I do not see that they''e submitted the MPB cancellation form yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-02-01 01:16:25', '2023-02-01 01:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112663024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081753002', 'Anja Price', NULL, '1-31-2023:  Anja''s husb had a annual ''prev care'' appt in 8/2022, but although Planstin can see they tt the doc''s off to conf cov, the bill seems to get sub then disappear (which has happened twice ?).  She called to conf their memb # &amp; get an updated Planstin card.  Let her know new cards are coming soon anyway, but made sure she has Planstin''s ph# &amp; trans her there so she can req a new card immed (to conf the doc''s off has the corr memb # to get this bill proc).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-31 16:48:32', '2023-02-01 01:18:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112700006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '01.31.2023 Ryan called trying to log into his Sedera Portal in order to upload his documents to complete his conversion process. He could not log in, so he called us. I thought he was trying to log into our portal page, so when I checked his profile, the log-in information part was empty, and I could not help him get in.
So, I reached out to Patti,  via teams, in hopes she could shed light on that part so I can help him.
But it turned out he was trying to log into Sedera''s portal not ours to upload his docs (DL, proof of addy...etc). 
I consulted with Cari via teams and shared with her the above. She offered to show where his MPB log in information is. Offered me some effective questions to ask him to get more clarification. I called Ryan back and offered him the following to do items to get his items into Sedera (per Cari''s guidance):
Ryan TRIED called Sedera, but due to inclement weather, they were working remotely and he could not connect with them, so here''s what we suggested:
1-Send Sedera an email with all his documents, memberservices@sedera.com.
2-Try logging into Sedera with his phone/email again not from his phone.
3-Call Sedera again and press #1 to leave a voicemail. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-31 16:10:46', '2023-02-02 15:35:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112663019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076535957', 'Ryan Koehler', NULL, '1-31-2023:  Megan called.  Ryan''s parental agreement requires he have coverage for Kyla.  Megan wanted to know what they should provide.  I let her know both Planstin (=ACA MEC sm prev care ins policy) & Zion (catastrophic healthsharing) can often prov letters of membership.  She wondered if this will qualify for his agreement & I let her know only the lawyer can clarify that.  She has Planstin''s & Zion''s ph #s, but also knows to start w/Planstin in case they can provide both now that their memb srvcs have somewhat merged.  She will call if she needs further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-31 15:56:44', '2023-01-31 15:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112685060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113498002', 'Devin Miller', NULL, 'Ashley - 54 
Devin - 56 
State - Texas
Wants HSA, qualifies for SECURE.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2023-01-31 15:46:42', '2023-01-31 15:46:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112685055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108725002', 'Daniel Fleshman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-31 14:48:18', '2023-01-31 14:48:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112705003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109010', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, 'I spoke to Rick today, long conversation. He''s switching back to his previous health share company, when I asked why, he said he received poor customer service here. After a lot of back and forth, I managed to do a brief side by side comparison, he needs to lower his monthly premium and I gave him pricing on a $5k IUA. He''s going to consider staying. I did send the CXL link per his request.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-31 14:37:44', '2023-01-31 14:37:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112685049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109568001', 'Donald Whitfield', NULL, 'American Health Imaging (Veronica) called to verify that Donald''s MRI would be "covered" by his insurance. I explained what type of plan Donald had and advised that he is responsible for his IUA. I also asked for them to give Donald the best cash discounted price. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-31 13:47:47', '2023-01-31 14:26:54'),
