  ('zcrm_1579374000112639021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491580', 'Francis Lanzano', NULL, '1-31-23 Francis called bc he couldn''t complete the Upgrade with Sedera. He tried last night and other times and he could never get past the first page. Turns out it was an issue with Chrome. I suggested he try another browser and he did and it worked. He used Safari and was able to complete the upgrade process. He changed his IUA with Sedera and with our Cognito form to $1500 from $500 to keep his cost down to $206.78. He uses Nexterra and has unlimited communication with a PA there that he really likes and uses. I told him he will be billed in the next few days for both missing payments. The new IUA will be for Feb. onward, if it''s set up correctly now.  He glad his account is Active.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-31 12:38:34', '2023-01-31 12:38:34'),
