  ('zcrm_1579374000112663008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048283052', 'Abbod Attallah', NULL, '1-31-2023:  Advisor Zac Masters called.  Abbod just let hi know today is his last day to do the Sedera conv, so Zac was trying to remember the adv of Redirect &amp; Sedera.  I went online w/him and looked at Redirect''s adv.  Abbod has the 3-yr longevity clause kicking in on 4/1/2023 w/Sedera as well.  Hopefully, I was helpful.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-31 10:46:39', '2023-01-31 10:46:39'),
