  ('zcrm_1579374000112699003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068391159', 'Janet Mikeal', NULL, '01.31.23:  John called. Said his wife is transitioning to Medicare and wants to know if we have a "gap" plan w/MCS to offer them for their 20% coverage responsibility and what do they have to do to remove her from the membership.  I responded he''d have to re-enroll as a MO. In terms of the gap coverage for Medicare, the only plan we have is Healthcare Essentials and explained what it includes.  He asked for information and I sent him the link to my website as well as the MPB site.   I also told John, as time draws near to Janet''s 65th birthday month (June), she will get a notification that her membership will be terminated.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-01-31 09:36:05', '2023-01-31 09:36:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112698003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080558020', 'Laura Murphy', NULL, 'Spoke to Laura,  Cari transferred this directly to Guy last night. Nothing was solved. I went over everything with Laura, she wants to be at $500 per month for a family plan and have the catastrophic. We discussed switching to care plus. After giving her the numbers and what the plans offer, she''s going to talk with her husband and make a decision.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-31 09:35:13', '2023-01-31 09:35:13'),
