  ('zcrm_1579374000112685008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110308002', 'Robert Golden', NULL, 'Robert called with questions regarding his wife''s physical/OBGYN appointment today. We looked, and the provider that his wife is going to (Alyssa Barr) is in the PHCS network. We went over how to present her Planstin card and if they have any further questions they will reach out to the concierge team. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-31 08:39:33', '2023-01-31 08:39:33'),
