  ('zcrm_1579374000112692003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401239', 'emmett murphy', NULL, 'Emmett reached out via SalesIQ and asked about a "Tutorial" of sorts if they have been a member for a few years but never had to use the plan before until now. I emailed him back and explained about the Welcome Call. I let him know how that all works and emailed him the Welcome Call Scheduler so he can book a call whenever works best for him. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-31 07:46:20', '2023-01-31 07:46:20'),
