She guided me to scroll down, where I learned it''s they have Planstin-MEC as an add-on, Sedera as  MCS.
I shared that with him, but he is sure that he converted over to Zion.
Then he said that the mammogram needs to be a diagnostic mammorgram. TT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-30 12:55:29', '2023-01-30 12:55:29'),
