  ('zcrm_1579374000112553008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066943043', 'Linda Miner', NULL, 'Linda reached out to me via SalesIQ and asked if her plan covers Mammograms or blood work. I explained to her it does not and what her plan does cover, giving her an example of how it works. She responded saying what I told her was very helpful and answered her question in full. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-30 12:12:40', '2023-01-30 12:12:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '01.30.2023 Don Went to urgent care, they ended up needing to call a dermatologist in for him. Shirley is calling to see how to maneuver through all of this, without making the wrong step&nbsp;I simply shared that we don''t have any dermatology coverage, but there are very specific times where they do end up with Medical Cost Sharing. I consulted with Cari via teams, and she recommended I transfer them to her, as she had spoken to them before. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-30 11:53:46', '2023-01-30 11:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112535003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371027', 'Karen Faydenko', NULL, '01.30.2023 Karen called to learn more about: deductible vs IUA, are prescriptions part of the IUA, and would Cholesterol meds be part of medical need?
I explained the difference between a deductible and an IUA, and how it is used.
I explained about our prescription program, and she understood that unless it''s part of the same incident of a medical need, it would not be part of a medical need, and same with cholesterol medication.
Karen also wanted to move forward with her annual checkups: Mammography, colonoscopy... and wanted to make sure her providers/facilities are part of the network.
I tried finding her requests under the zip codes she shared, but I was not successful. I consulted with Cari via teams, and she recommended that Karen call the providers/facilities directly and ask for their NPI# (per entity of the procedure), and check with PHCS to see if they are in network. Karen was happy to make some phone calls to get herself situated with the right providers/faclities. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-30 10:57:06', '2023-01-30 11:29:23'),
