He was leaning more towards the virtual services. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-27 15:18:29', '2023-01-27 15:24:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112431041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '1-27-23 Anna called to get help ugrading her membership. She was 90% complete and figured she could do the rest on her own. She kept her membership as is and with the same $1000 IUA. She wants to do another Welcome Call soon to review her membership. She also goes to chiro often and wants to start using that portion of her membership. She hasn''t used it except for her annual wellness visit. She''s excited for that part. She was forced to get v to keep her job. Not pleased.  She is also self-employed. She says at her age (60) her ins would cost thousands of dollars a month. So, the increase was not a big deal here. She''s instructed to call MPB Concierge Team for the link to schedule a Welcome Call and instructions to access chiro moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-27 15:04:19', '2023-01-27 15:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112440028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', NULL, 'Jennifer asked me to speak with these people. Very nice couple. They wanted total clarity about the IUA. I went over the different levels and the pricing. After my explanation and recommendation, they decided to go from 2,500 to 1,000 IUA. I sent the link and told them it will be effective as of March 1, 2023', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-27 14:48:53', '2023-01-27 14:48:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112392026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107797002', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-27 14:42:49', '2023-01-27 14:42:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108522002', 'Michael Hulstrom', NULL, '1-27-2023:  Karen called in.  She &amp; her husband have a Nurse Prac: Jan Nelson (not curr listed in the PHCS search tool) they wondered if they can keep for their ''prev'' care.  We disc the PHCS ntwk &amp; Jan''s not listed, BUT be on the lookout in (hopefully) the next few months because we are moving to no ntwk.  Then, their curr NP, Jan Nelson might be an option.  She''ll call when she sees that card or if they need ''prev care'' sooner to look in ntwk.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-27 14:32:40', '2023-01-27 17:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415044', 'Tina Williams', NULL, '1-27-2023:  Scott called.  He & Tina are getting divorced & he''s trying to understand what they have.  I suggested their advisor, Zac Masters would be a good person to do that w/him.  I gave him Zac''s ph # & exp very briefly:  this is healthcare w/diff components, healthsharing, prev, HSA qual, etc.  Both Tina ( a realator?) and Scott (owns his own bus) could sep onto their own Secure memb & that would be relatively easy.  I let Scott know since the are both > 50yrs old, it would be $325 mo cont, rather than their curr Memb + Spouse amt of $625.  He seemed to understand & will reach out to Zac.  I let him know if he has trouble to call us & we''ll get him help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-27 14:29:03', '2023-01-27 15:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112392021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! I let Leo know that they are looking to switch their IUA amount to $1k. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-27 14:20:48', '2023-01-27 14:20:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, '1-27-2023:  Guy Travis called.  For some reason, he was on his mobile phone trying to guide Corey, then hit a bad cell zone & lost him, but not before telling him to call the Concierge Dept.
     Corey had already called in & is on the other line w/Nahla.  According to Guy, Corey is having his L4 & L5 discs reduced.  Having the procedure done at a public hosp.  This issue has come up in the last 30-days for Corey.
     I tt Corey (Nahla brought me in to the call - see above): Kansas Univ app will show everything he''s already pd & he can see the estimated surgical exp:  $8580.80 = w/''cash-pay'' discount.  I let him know that Zion can provide payment, but since he hasn''t uploaded anything, this is really short notice.
     Corey says he''s been away from home for the last few weeks because he''s struggling to sit in the car to get home (he''s sev hours away).  He thinks he''ll be there later tonight (but after Zion closes).  I suggested this plan of action:
     - Get home & use the link I just sent to sub your "Additional Doc" (bottom in the toggle list) since you already started the need.  Include all receipts for what you''ve paid to show you''ve paid your $2500 IUA already, detailed invoices (that hopefully include med coding or at least lots of details), & I sugg:  a cover letter that states this came up quickly & due to the pain they are pushing fwd w/the surg Tues at 2:00pm (ish, best I can remember).  Then nex Monday around noon his time, call Zion (the #s in the e-mail I sent) & hit #5 = Med Need Dept.  When you get to someone, let them know your need has quickly moved to surgical & you''d like to talk to someone about your options since the hosp is requiring money up front.
         He says he''ll do that & will call us back if he''s still struggling.  It''s his weekend w/his kids, so I hope he can find time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-27 13:51:10', '2023-01-27 16:11:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112436023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, '01.27.2023 Corey called letting us know he needs upfront money for his surgery on Tuesday at 2:45, for L4 L5 cause he cannot get around.
He''s been paying everything out of pocket, and he''s running out of pocket, but has not submitted any receipts.
He needs upfront money for the surgery, so I brought Cari in to explain to him that he needs to upload his receipts in order for Zion to even consider.
Cari forwarded him the link to upload his receipts towards the open medical need, and maintain contact information for Zion.
Cari suggested to him that he uploads all the receipts, show he''s covered his IUA, contact the surgical office for additional balances .......NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-27 13:37:47', '2023-01-27 14:33:26'),
