  ('zcrm_1579374000112391095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659990', 'Melissa Parenti', NULL, 'Member''s 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM-1/27 I spoke to member and went over RT &amp; Acct # with her and she said that that might have come in when she had an unexpected charge on her acct.  She told me to rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-27 13:14:43', '2023-01-27 13:28:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111677002', 'Michael Fueger', NULL, 'Member called in and told em that he needed to cancel at the end of February.  I told him he had not even started yet.  He told me that he was told he could cancel at any time.  I directed him to speak to Zac and then spoke to Zac who will talk to him', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-27 13:13:32', '2023-01-27 13:13:32'),
