  ('zcrm_1579374000112431036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092228002', 'David Bradley', NULL, 'David reached out in a response to an email thread between him and I from a little while ago asking about the Mental Health benefits he sees he has, and his daughter would like to start seeing a therapist. I explained to him how the sessions are spread out with the 12 per year, 4 a month, then a 2-month break, so on and so forth until the 12 are up. I let him know I would send out the MAP email that explains how to get started with everything. He is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-27 12:48:20', '2023-01-27 12:48:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671026', 'George Jarratt', NULL, 'Members 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM-1/27 1/30-member submitted PU form I will rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-27 12:39:52', '2023-01-30 10:29:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112431031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110554002', 'Dirk Anderson', NULL, 'QR Life Care Code for Kaden: H0365. No more additional spaces left to put more than 4 QR Codes in the fields above. Refer here for child Kaden''s QR Code if needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-27 12:38:43', '2023-01-27 12:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '1-27-2023:  Michelle e-mailed me asking for RX Quotes on her NP Thyroid.  She''s used that specific brand and would like to see if we can get her better pricing than Walmart is quoting her at $111 for the 2 items:
     - NP Thyroid Brand 60mg, #90 tabs = $40.25 at Walgreens on RXGo
     - NP Thyroid Brand 15mg, #90 tabs = $19.12 at Walgreens on WellRX
Sent her both coupons with info on how to do a pharmacy-to-pharmacy trans.  Let her know we try to stay at a sngl pharmacy for all their items to protect them thru the interactive software & so it''s one-stop shopping.  But, today the price diff is drastic!  KS: $134.53; Walmart quoted her $111 (the coupons I found = $117.59); or Walgreens = $59.37.
        She seems open to generic, but would like to see if they can get the NP Thy brand since she''s used it before.  NP Thyroid is considered a ''brand'' name by some pharmacies and is used as the ''generic'' at others.
        Made sure I used pharmacies showing as contracted w/Walgreens.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-27 12:24:36', '2023-01-27 12:30:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107137002', 'Anita Arneson', NULL, 'Member''s 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 1/27 1/30-final notice sent via email 1/31-Member submitted PU I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-27 12:22:48', '2023-01-31 07:18:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106045002', 'Lance Simonson', NULL, '1-27-2023:  Nahla brought me into the call since this is a very unusaul situation incl liab reimb too.  Lance fell off the roof at the church on the 21st (& shattered his heel?).  Has a CT Scan on Monday, 1/31.  Doctor thinks it will be several weeks before the swelling goes down and they can do surgery.  We set a plan of action.  The church''s liability ins is going to pay the first 15k.  Then, Lance & Amy know they will be resp for their 1k IUA.  Past that, the healthshare company will then consider the ''med need''.
     Lance is going to handle the pre-surgery exp as one sub for reimb to the liability comp.  They have a letter confirming they will reimb for the 15k.  Then, his second sub to them will be the surgical bills, which at least right now he''s assuming will be > the 15k.
     He knows to keep super good records on what is spent, reimb, goes over the liab ins 15k, etc.  We are planning to talk again once they have the surgical estimate so we can plan out when to start the ''med need''.  They are aware there is a 6mos deadline for sub to the healthshare comp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-27 12:16:41', '2023-01-27 12:16:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112431023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118238253', 'Sally Thomas', NULL, '1-28-23 Sally is leaving her job at the hospital on May 3rd and Cobra will cost her $800+. She''s healthy, no meds, thin, works out, etc. She''s retiring 6 mos. early to help her ailing mother. She will keep her private practice and work every Friday to avg. about $1200 a month to equal $14,400. Could range from $850-$1600. Her husband is on Medicare and does private consulting and earns about $38,400 to total $52,800. Live in Broomfield County at 80020. Est. APTC is $634. Wants to keep Dr. Heather Bright Hoffmeyer, Dr. Shahla Mousavi, Dr. Denise Kowecki (sp?), and Dr.  (Susan) Elizabeth Cruse. Dr. Cruse does NOT show up in the Cigna Connect network but the rest do, except I couldn''t find Dr. Kowecki to show up at all likely due to misspelling.  She wants to keep Cigna if possible.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-27 12:05:22', '2023-01-27 12:06:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112391048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105905002', 'Stephanie Mundy', NULL, 'Member''s 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via e,ail &amp; VM -1/27 unable to leave VM 1/30-Final notice sent 1/31-Member submitted PU form I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-27 12:04:27', '2023-01-31 08:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112431018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082133002', 'Vernon Fawcett', NULL, 'Vern reached out to me via SalesIQ about getting a price quote on what his monthly cost would be if it were to just be him alone on the plan he has. I pulled him up to get the info I needed to determine pricing of Member Only for his current plan of OPD Complete $1000 IUA. I gave him the price and he asked what would happen to his wife that is currently on the plan with him and if she would have to get her own plan individually, etc. I explained to him since he is the Primary member on the account that yes, his wife would have to re-enroll into her own plan since we can''t switch who the Primary member is. Lastly, he asked if she would have the same price as what I gave him of Member Only. I let him know that as long as she enrolls in the same exact plan and same IUA, then yes, his wife would have the same price. He got what he needed and is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-27 11:55:18', '2023-01-27 11:55:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112431013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104642002', 'Sarah Battista', NULL, 'Sarah reached out to me via SalesIQ this afternoon asked about how to go about cancelling her membership with us. She stated she just got a new job, and they are offering her benefits. There is nothing wrong or anything that happened in a negative way with us and her plan. I got her # and let her know Jeffrey would reach out to her in a few moments after me giving him her info and he is the one that deals with the cancellation process. He would walk her through everything she needs to do. Jeffrey gave her a call and she is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-27 11:51:33', '2023-01-27 11:51:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112436008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106045002', 'Lance Simonson', NULL, '01.27.2023 Amy called because Lance had an incident while volunteering at the church, on the roof.
He fell and injured his heel. They want to know how to submit a need and how to do that while using the church''s liability insurance, 15K. They are planning to open a medical need, but were not sure what came first and how the process works. I explained that medical cost sharing will always come second. 
I consulted with Cari regarding the rest of Amy''s question, and Cari explained that the ball is in completing the liability insurance portion, before anything kicks in on the Health-sharing''s end. Then Amy will fulfill the $1000 IUA, and then Zion''s coverage will start. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-27 11:23:19', '2023-01-27 17:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112440013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104642002', 'Sarah Battista', NULL, 'She''s getting employer benefits now, she was a little rude and didn''t want to discuss anything other than how she cancels. She was on the site doing the form already.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-27 11:20:23', '2023-01-27 11:20:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112403044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110449002', 'Jill Fitzgerald', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-27 11:14:29', '2023-01-27 11:14:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112440003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111686002', 'Byron Sealey', NULL, 'Spoke to Byron this morning, he is not happy, he was misinformed and was confused about his plan. This member should''ve been enrolled in the Secure plan, not Direct. Leo never asked if he was a business owner, which he is. Leo also told him to fill in his name under the referral, the man called us from an internet search. Leo collected $100.00 that I''ve informed Karina to deduct from his next check. I discussed the Secure plan with Byron, but it is $30. a month more, and he is distrustful at this point. Will probably cancel. He''s going to check other options, and let me know.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-27 11:07:08', '2023-01-27 11:07:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112369007', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104642002', 'Sarah Battista', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2785 Question : Questions about membership cancelation', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-27 11:02:22', '2023-01-27 11:02:22'),
