  ('zcrm_1579374000112256032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108617019', 'Adriana Baudry', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2781 Question : Hello, I was trying to get into the portal to check alternative medicine providers and when I try to sign in it does not recognize my member ID. I have never registered and don''t know how. I only registered for Cirrus MD.

Sent Adriana her member portal login information along with instructions. ~JTS', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-26 21:31:31', '2023-01-27 07:25:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111686002', 'Byron Sealey', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Nahla brought me into this call (see above) when Byron seemed confused by what he feels he was told when he purch this ''Direct'' plan.  
     - He says he directly asked if this would cover all his labs:  I let him know there are 2 scenarios
             1)  He''s ill or in the hospital and it will be a catastophic type ''med need''.  For this specific "issue" they will help with diagnostic labwork in figuring out what is wrong, but that''s only once his 1k IUA responsibility has been met on the "issue".
             2)  Preventative Care:  this ''Direct'' plan has a very limited amount of ''prev care'' and there are no labs in th prev/screening portion of this plan.
     That made him quite upset because he specifically asked & was assured.
     - Even if they were discussing SECURE, the ''prev'' labwork is minimal
     - Because this plan isn''t even eff until 2/1/2023 & the questions are more in the sales realm, I let him know Jeffrey Bursteen will be the person he needs to talk to.  Jeffrey went home sick, but did reach out to Byron, who is willing to talk to Jeffrey further tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 17:55:34', '2023-01-26 17:55:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Nahla brought me in for the call w/Whitney.  We went thru using his HSA for the pre-treatment for his wife''s colonoscopy was perfect.  That it''s not incl in the ''prev care'', but keep your receipt in case it moves to diag & at least he could try to submit twds the IUA.
     - Reminded him to make sure all prov involved are part of the ntwk: facility, prov, & anesthesiaologist.  He seems to have a handle on this & Nahla had him 99% of the way.  He just needed small final details.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 17:26:40', '2023-01-26 17:26:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112287077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107631002', 'Alissa Andrews', NULL, '01.26.2023 Alissa called to make sure she is able to receive the PDF version for  Planstin, due to a misspelling of the initial email. 
Her username/email is still the older/initial email that is misspelled.
When I called Planstin to request for her another PDF sent, they shared that they still have the older email on file, and the changes need to come from Patti. I wrote Patti a note via teams. 
I called Alissa back to confirm she should be receiving an email from Planstin in a few minutes. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-26 17:22:19', '2023-01-26 17:24:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296191', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '1-26-23 "We''re all signed up!" They joined Delta Dental Clear Plan, I assume for Feb. 1st start date. I should receive notification from Delta Dental tomorrow, I think.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-26 15:53:57', '2023-01-26 15:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093783010', 'Alyssa Beris', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Alyssa called again.  She tt Mizz & Sull re: couns prog & the docs they gave her told her they were unsure if Mizz & Sull is still a part of their srvc (it''s been years).  She said Mizz & Sull is having trouble when she tells them she''s part of MPB.Health, so I sugg trying MPowering Benefits (they keep telling her they cannot find her employer).  If this continues, I encouraged her to get the name of the person she''s speaking with and we''ll help her by calling them.
     - Re: counseling.  She understands the pattern & I went over can pay in waiting periods (but will have to work w/the counselor for what that looks like).  Also mentioned, if have too much trouble finding an available doc, ask Mizz & Sull to go out further from her location (that virtual couns might work) & she seemed open to that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 15:51:06', '2023-01-26 16:08:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112287072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '01.26.2023 Whitney called to ask about when was the last time he had his wellness visit, after confirming is account, I shared that we do not have access to that information or any details. However, the doctor''s office where he went OR if it was billed to Planstin, they too could provide him that information (based on Cari''s guidance via teams).
Then he asked about his wife''s upcoming colonoscopy procedure, and if the pre-treatment he purchased with his debit card would be also covered. I said that we usually would be able to research 6-7 discount sites in the future for most prescriptions, and that I don''t think we/Planstin can reimburse for the purchase. I brought Cari in at that point, where he was more specific to say that he used the HSA to pay for the pre-treatment. She did go over that was the right thing to do to use the HSA card, that in the past when she researched the med, she did not find anything less expensive than what he paid ($50~).
She also reminded him of the finding of polyps and it possibly changing from screening to diagnostic instantly (Free visit to paying the IUA $2500). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-26 15:39:00', '2023-01-26 15:39:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112316003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090968002', 'Thomas Griffith', NULL, 'Brenda, Thomas''s wife, reached out to me via SalesIQ earlier this afternoon. She asked how she would go about getting a Colonoscopy done. I explained everything to her on getting a referral first, finding a provider in the network, and lastly making sure she brings her Planstin card so the provider bills everything to Planstin directly. I looked up Gastroenterologist''s for her in area and emailed over the list, so she has it ready. She does not have a referral yet but said she will call her provider right away to get one. Lastly, I explained what would happen and what she needs to do if anything is found during the Colonoscopy and getting in touch with Zion if that happens, also that she is only to pay their IUA of $1000 if so. All set for now and fully understands what needs to be done correctly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-26 14:43:26', '2023-01-26 14:47:17'),
