  ('zcrm_1579374000112242074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Adam called about 2 items today:
     - 1095 - in the admin meeting Mon, Patti let us know these are not req''d until early March by law.  So I let him know this is not req''d to file his taxes, but when we get to March it''ll be available for his records.  He seemed fine w/that.
