  ('zcrm_1579374000112290064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107134002', 'Thomas Beaudin', NULL, 'Welcome call completed. Thomas was very rude during the call. He had asked a question regarding pricing to which I told him the concierge team can get him fair pricing in his area for certain items to which he asked if I could get him a list of all of the doctors in their area and their pricing schedules. When I told Thomas that this is not something that we have on hand but that we can get him the fair price for an appointment, procedure, etc. he stated that "the concierge team serves no purpose then, does it?" to which I answered that yes, we do serve a purpose. We continued the call and neither Thomas or Rachel had any questions. They will definitely be calling back for guidance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-26 13:21:34', '2023-01-26 13:21:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112287062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108403013', 'Patricia Walker', NULL, '01.26.2023 Patricia called concerned about being charged twice $295.
I confirmed her CRM account, and went on to check the billing on Admin123. There were two accounts, around the same time, and the same amount. I consulted with both Jen and Cari, and they both confirmed to transfer her over to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-26 13:06:41', '2023-01-26 13:06:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Eliz called for several items:
     - She was re-reading Wendy''s e-mail about WHLC.  I took her to our website & she realized she''s already registered for the site.  I made sure she knew how to utilize it for alt care discounts.  
     - She also asked about dental & vision.  We went over discounts and that depending on the issues, on occasion it can move to ''medical'', but there''s a very fine line between the two.  Her daughter is have issues with an infection & I let her know Sedera would be the ones that could determine if it''s dental or medical.  I also made sure she has her advisor, Wendy Scipione''s ph #, because Wendy does offer separate dental/vision policies (rather than just discounts).
     - It sounds like Eliz is considering dropping the "MPB" portion.  I let her know the advatages as I see them and sugg she talk to Wendy too.  She seemed opened to calling her when she''s ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 13:06:38', '2023-01-26 13:06:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112290059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238233', 'Michelle McCaster', NULL, 'Michelle is not a very friendly person. She called in to find out of the flu shot was something that was covered by her "insurance". I advised Michelle that it would be an out of pocket expense and she stated that this was all pointless. She asked to be transferred to Redirect. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-26 13:00:31', '2023-01-26 13:00:31'),
