  ('zcrm_1579374000112290054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109499017', 'Thomas Mele', NULL, 'Mary called to update her payment information. I walked her through the website on how to change her payment. I did transfer Mary to Patti because she would like her other payment info deleted. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-26 12:46:59', '2023-01-26 12:46:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112287054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111686002', 'Byron Sealey', NULL, '01.26.2023 Byron called concerned about not having received his cards yet, and how would he present himself, if something happened.
I confirmed his Direct Plan, and coached him on how he would present himself during an large cost situation (i.e. hospital visit and such). Then I proceeded to explain how the DPC part works, but he said I''m using terminology that he does not understand. I asked him if he signed with a DPC, he said that I keep using words he is not familiar with.
I consulted with Cari via teams on this, in the angle that I''m not sure how to help him if he does not understand the realm of his plan to begin with.
Cari guided him how to present himself during hospital visits, and Bryon proceeded to seem upset and confused with the plan, because he shared he was told that his lab tests for annual check ups would be covered. Cari did share that his plan would not cover lab tests (lipid i.e.), and suggested to speak to Jeffrey Bursteen. Cari left Jeffrey a warm transfer message, since Jeffrey was busy. I left a brief message via teams. We are hoping to connect with Jeffrey together, for educational purposes. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-26 12:22:37', '2023-01-26 12:24:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096331001', 'Darrell Porter', NULL, '1-26-23 Krystyna called bc they missed their Welcome Call and want to do it now. She also has her annual wellness visit with her gyno tomorrow and the Dr. is no longer in the network. She LOVES her Dr. and does not want to switch and apologizes since this is last minute. I told her I''d try to get her the new RPB card to avoid the network problem. I am waiting to hear back for that. She is thrilled that this will hopefully not be  a problem. Her appt is at 11:00 EST tomorrow, Jan. 27th. She was super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-26 12:16:44', '2023-01-26 12:16:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083455010', 'Leron Levy', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Leron called.  He''s very frustrated.  Does not understand this plan at all.  Asked him about his ''Welcome Call.  "I''m sure I had that", but I''m not seeing that was completed.  Almost all of his questions are ''Welcome Call'' items.  I sent him a new inv & he said, "well, I''m just too busy".  I let him know it only takes 20-30 minutes, and is really essential to understanding this healthcare.  He finally said, "I''m really picky", so I suggested sched w/Jennifer since she can more easily move outside "presenting".  
     - He wants to sched a screening colonoscopy & is upset because he needs it now.  We went over req''d ntwk for all prov involved  (he found the list Jennifer sent back in 8/2022), how it works if it moves to diag w/polyps, his $2500 IUA if that happens, req''s our starting a ''med need'' w/the healthsharing comp, etc., that some facilities will req a doc''s order, which then took us into: if you need to have your annual phys, call us, again curr req''s in ntwk w/other specifics we can go over.
     - Leron may be ok on this healthcare, but he''s going to have to start helping, so we can help him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 12:15:45', '2023-01-26 17:23:27'),
