  ('zcrm_1579374000112290046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107844010', 'Sheri Auten', NULL, 'Sheri called with many questions, as I see she did not have a welcome call. I answered her preventative care questions &amp; self-pay questions. Sheri then needed to verify why her account has not been put under her business name like she had intended so I transferred her to Patti for this answer. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-26 12:08:28', '2023-01-26 12:08:28'),
