  ('zcrm_1579374000112242045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081349010', 'Deepak Maragal', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Deepak & Supriyaa called in.  They are struggling still w/some items we''ve discussed before:
     - Their daughter''s physical: They sent Planstin the bill they had the doctor bill them for & say Planstin is saying it is out-of-ntwk.  Their doc is listed in the PHCS search tool: 
	Angello, Thomas A, M.D.	
             Pediatrics,Pediatric Allergy & Immunology
             73 Market St
              Yonkers, NY 10710
              914-607-4730
so I''m wondering if maybe it''s because the doc''s off didn''t do the billing directly to Planstin (there may be some language barrier for Deepak & Supriyaa as they have somewhat heavy accents).  They are going to call the doc''s billing office, make sure they give them a copy of their Planstin card front & back & let them know they did not realize the office must do the billing.  Then ask to be reimbursed once the off has rec''d pymt.
     - Deepak wondered what they do if they have to go to the hospital or ER.  When I started to explain how to present, he said, but the hospital & ER won''t treat you if you don''t have insurance.  I assured him that should not be the case and told him how to present: no ins, ''cash-pay'', do they offer ''cash-pay'' disc, pay up to your 1k IUA and ask to be billed for the balance, get pymt receipt & detailed invoice, then call us for help in sub a ''med need'' to Zion (he conf, we call you, not Zion directly & I ans yes).  We talked about 6mos deadline & not to wait "until we have our 1k paid".  That if it looks like treatment will continue and you are at 4 months, don''t wait, call & we''ll setup a plan of action.
     - Trying to make this easier for them to understand, I went into my diff sheets of paper example: Prev, telehealth, healthsharing.  It seemed like that helped, but I''m not sure how much they are understanding.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 11:21:05', '2023-01-26 11:21:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060475077', 'James Brown', NULL, 'I will cancel this member eff 2/1 due to cancellation submission on 1/24 .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-26 11:19:09', '2023-01-26 11:19:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110548011', 'Steven Zaidman', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Jennifer checked & it seems like the eff date was changed to 2/1/2023 on 1/9/2023.  Jennifer & I talked about not setting bad expectations, especially for someone who may become an advisor.  I e-mailed Steven & Chana about the RX Quote.  I''m letting them know we do not process these until a membership is active (in this case 2/1/2023) and I will be in contact with them then.  However, I also put in the e-mail, "please call the concierge line and ask for Cari if this is going to be an issue."  The quotes are set (other than their choice of pharmacy is not the best pricing) so, if they absolutely can''t wait I''ll work w/them.  Otherwise, I''ll call them on the 1st to discuss the pharmacy choices & pricing.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 11:03:24', '2023-01-26 11:10:06'),
