  ('zcrm_1579374000112242018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111599002', 'Diana Conde Gamez', NULL, 'Marc Clair on this account, called in and spoke to Patti. He was a little rude asking us to provide a monthly invoice to Diana''s employer who is paying the premium. Patti explained, we don''t provide invoices, and everything is listed on their monthly receipt. That wasn''t good enough for him, and he hung up. I overheard part of the conversation, and after getting the details from Patti, I decided to call. I couldn''t reach Marc, but I did reach Diana. I explained all the details are on the receipt, as well, she is paying ACH, so she can get the details from her bank if needed. She''s more than fine with that. I gave her my contact info to call me directly if she has any issues moving forward.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-26 08:43:54', '2023-01-26 08:43:54'),
