  ('zcrm_1579374000112290033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000917082', 'Marc Clair', NULL, 'Marc was quite rude to the concierge when he called in. Marc hung up on me 3 times when I was trying to assist him stating that my headset was bad. I attempted to switch headsets to see if Marc could hear me better and he hung up. When he called back he was demanding an invoice for his plan to submit to his wife''s employer. I sent him to Patti. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-26 08:13:49', '2023-01-26 08:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, 'Per Wendy this member has made the Sedera Transition and needs to be billed for January &amp; February.  There was an issue as the "Direct Plan" in A123.  So I modified the Redirect pricing since this is T3 as well.  I will have to bring that to John K''s attention on his return.  However billed out and all set.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-26 08:07:27', '2023-01-26 08:07:27'),
