  ('zcrm_1579374000112289071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, '1-25-2023:  Martha called.  She was told her son''s influenza shot was cov.  She called Zion & they told her she does not have any ''prev care''.  I went over the following with her:
     - Both our CRM & Admin123 show she has the Direct plan & should have limited ''prev care''.  I sent a Teams chat to Patti to see if she can make sure Zion corrects the issue.
