  ('zcrm_1579374000112289055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, '1-26-2023:  Nahla brought me into the call.  She sent Taylor the link to the ''Memb Chg Form'' to add the baby sho was born 3-days ago into the curr Zion memb.  Taylor doesn''t have the baby''s ss# yet, so I walked her thru how to sub the form & the importance of making sure she gets us the ss# asap.
     - Taylor asked about getting a plan with the ''prev care'' now that they have the baby.  She thought her mom would want to change the whole family to a diff plan.  Her mom is self-empl, so maybe they can go onto the Secure plan.  However, I did not go into details, but referred her to their advisor: Charles Frohman who can help them decide their best option.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-26 02:36:52', '2023-01-26 02:40:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112289044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742009', 'Bridgett Mansfield', NULL, '1-25-2023:  Nahla brought me in since this is OPD.  As I understand it from Bridgett''s description:  They were allowed to sign-up for OPD w/out a DPC selected.  She said she''s waiting for her doctor to join "the list".  I do not know if her doc also sees young children, so we''ll need to address a pediatrician as will if not.
     - Her 3-yr old Brody is really sick.  She said he gets fevers, but he''s acting odd.  She''s at the Urg Care & wondered what to do.  We agreed to focus on getting Brody care.  I explained that for now we will assume this will end-up be shareable (ER or Hosp.  Too much going around on the kids right now, so they seem to be admitting them often.)  She''s going to present as a ''cash-pay'' patient & knows for now we are assuming this will be a ''med need'' & they are resp for the 1k IUA.  She''ll pay as close to that as she can, ask for a ''cash-pay'' disc & to bill her for any bal, save receipts & detailed inv, then call us in a few days to sort through the situation.
     - I let her know IF this ends up being something that should have been a reg DPC doc visit, we can deal with that after the fact (why invoices & receipts will be so imp).
     - She was fine w/the above.  Joan called later in the day & was fine w/how I approached the situation.     - CA

