  ('zcrm_1579374000112289035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077233034', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, '1/25/2023:  Ashley called, they have Summer''s ss # now.  ILM w/detailed instructions &amp; also sent a follow-up e-mail that includes the link to the Memb Chg form.  tt Patti &amp; since they already added the baby, having Ashley put the ss# into Sect 5 "Comments" was a good way to handle this.  Gave details on how to fill out form &amp; also let Ashley know if she needs further asst.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-25 18:05:49', '2023-01-26 01:46:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '1-25-23 Carol lives in Longmont, CO. Yes, they do annual wellness and would love to continue to fund HSA. Interested in HMA and VSP. They want a March 1st start date. She''s thrilled about all I explained and she watched the video 2x. She also asked about Whole Health Living Choices. She''s looking at C4 option for $1100 but realizes that''s tax ded and this is not. I let her know that a small part of this membership is tax ded bc it''s ins. She will most likely choose this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 17:16:45', '2023-01-25 17:16:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '1-25-23 I just sent this to Patti in Teams, "Sandra Amico called and let me know she completed the upgrade with Sedera. I believe her new price will be $682.28. Right?? &nbsp;Or will you bill her $610 for Jan and $682.28 for Feb. Sedera says her new membership start date is Feb. 1st. You can now bill her for Jan. and Feb. She''s ok with that. &nbsp;Just let me know how you plan to bill her, so I can let her know. Thanks!!"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 16:47:02', '2023-01-25 16:47:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112287049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013453097', 'Jose j De La Cerda', NULL, '01.25.2023 Jose called to cancel. He asked if there was someone who speaks Spanish, but I did not have anyone to call or connect with. His English was fine, and understandable, and I was able to communicate with him.
