  ('zcrm_1579374000112289024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514133', 'Kelly Fleites', NULL, '1-25-2023:  Advisor Zac Masters called.  Kelly wants to chg to Zion due to the hefty price inc w/Sedera.  He tried to reach Patti, but she''s gone for the day.  I told him a chg form will not suffice in this instance.  They will first want to process a new application for the Zion prod, which won''t be eff until 3/1/2023 at this point.  Then, once they''ve done that, they''ll sub a cancellation form that dovetails to the new plan.  It sounds like he can totally handle this now that he knows what to do.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-25 15:23:48', '2023-01-25 15:23:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112289019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111990002', 'John Hill', NULL, '1-25-2023:  John & Mary called.  The call broke-up a bit, but I think everything was understood:
     - HSA:  They wondered how this works.   Planstin has given them their pdf card - I explained that the high ded on that card shows they qualify in case the financial institution they decide to go w/requests proof.  They are going to touchbase w/their financial planner first, then know they can choose whatever fin inst they''d like if they don''t go thru that person.  Also, they know they don''t qualify until 2/1/2023.
     - They are also thinking they should have gone w/the 1k IUA.  They will discuss & get with us in the next few days if that''s what they determine they''d prefer.  They know it''s extremely time sensitive.  We can get them to Patti if they decide they want to chg this IUA.
         Orig they asked if the HSA could pay for things under the 5k IUA.  We disc that might be an option depending on the expense, but I also noted John''s turning 60 this yr.  Maybe discuss w/your fin planner:  is it better to allow these funds to grow for retirement/Medicare uncovered expenses (since you are so close to the 65 yrs old)? 
     - Welcome Call Invite:  Sent a new invite.  Sugg they both try to be on the call as it helps with building a good foundation of understanding the prog.
     - The CRM has the child, John D Hill listed twice.  Admin123 looks ok.  Sent Patti a Teams chat asking if she could please fix the CRM.*
     - Patti replied when I got the req to corr their CRM file:  The pymt for 2/2023 was declined.  She e-mailed John this afternoon.  I let her know I hadn''t caught that, but if they call back, I can bring it up as well.     - CA

