  ('zcrm_1579374000112296026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000278027', 'Gabriel Hamilton', NULL, '1-25-23 Also, Gabe will be graduating from grad school this spring and he might need help if/when he gets a new job with benefits or even simply cancelling at that time. It might take a while to get a job first though.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 15:11:41', '2023-01-25 15:11:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000278027', 'Gabriel Hamilton', NULL, '1-25-23 Talked with Gabe bc I received an Anthem notice asking for proof of SEP. He was never notified by Anthem that his plan wasn''t continuing into 2023. So, he panicked and couldn''t reach me on Jan. 18th bc his phone wasn''t working. But, he reached C4 and they created a new separate account for him without Shelley Canonico (his aunt) on it now. He still was able to keep me as his agent. He chose a new plan with C4 helping him. They said they will push through his new plan with a Jan. 1st start date. TKT # is 230118-000913. He will let me know if he runs into any further problems. Looks like his income allows him to get 100% APTC, his cost is $0. 

