  ('zcrm_1579374000112296016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191499', 'Christopher Nolder', NULL, '1-25-23 Left vm for Chris bc payment didn''t work and he''s on the list of clients needing to upgrade still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 14:39:43', '2023-01-25 14:39:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112290023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, 'Emily called in with questions regarding the bill she received over a year later for her husband''s preventative care visit. I advised Emily that she would have to speak with redirect about this bill and she is having issues with an old injury that she may need to have checked, which I advised that it should be part of the same need for the same injury. I transferred Emily over to Redirect so that she could speak with them about the bill she received. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-25 14:02:36', '2023-01-25 14:02:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '1-25-23 Emily called bc she just got an old wellness visit bill from Dec. 8th, 2021 and didn''t know what to do with it. She had called Sedera and they said they don''t handle that. She''s not sure that she has the Redirect App. I suggested she call the MPB Concierge Team to get the correct app and register properly.  She also has a new Need that might need to go to Sedera now or soon. 

Side note- Then she let me know that she will not have her son Christian join MPB since they are already paying a TON of money to help him recover from his gaming addiction that he''s had since he was 14 and is now 29. The addiction program will help with brain mapping and will start in Houston, TX and end in Maui, HA. He''s a super intelligent young man who has become the victim of these gaming companies. But, they won''t begin the process until he is committed to doing so. So, brutal.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 13:59:12', '2023-01-25 13:59:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112289014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094922002', 'Lindsey Frick', NULL, '1-25-2023:  Lindsey called to get help:
     - Functional Care:  Lindsey had a lot of questions about Functional Doctors & if those would work if she decided to go w/a plan that has ''prev care''.  Told her right now Secure''s ''prev care'' req''s in ntwk, but when we move to RBP pricing it''s a tentative maybe.  It would dep on the doctor''s willingness to bill for her & to accept pymt from Planstin since they will not reimb.
     - Maternity Need questions:  Sent her the Maternity Guidelines I downloaded from Zion''s site today.
     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-25 13:51:11', '2023-01-27 13:03:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112287029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060921020', 'Holland Coors', NULL, '01.25.2023 Taylor called. She just had a baby. He''s 3 days old. Wants to add him. She wants to b able to have coverage for him.
I brought Cari in, and she sent Taylor guidelines and Cc''d me on it. And explained how Secure would be a good fit, cause her mom is self-employed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-25 13:47:56', '2023-01-25 13:47:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112290018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088732002', 'Sean Saulsbury', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-25 13:40:59', '2023-01-25 13:40:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112296003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, '1-25-23 I reached out to Melinda thinking she needed to upgrade. But, when talking with her she never received any emails from Sedera at all. She''s in the smaller group of clients who are in the MPB CARE+ CV with Sedera. After talking with Patti and looking over the account, there is no new product and no new price. We decided to leave well enough alone for now. She''s not on the list of members who have or have not upgraded. So, her price will remain the same for now until further notice.  She also said Sedera did a fabulous job of sharing in a recent medical need. She refers her friends to me and Sedera. I let her know if she send them directly to me that I will pay her $100 Referral Fee. She didn''t realize we were doing that anymore. I also suggested she just sends a 3-way email to give me the ability to track the lead. She likes that idea and will do that moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 13:22:41', '2023-01-25 13:26:22');
