  ('zcrm_1579374000112244063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111954002', 'Daniel Soto', NULL, 'Member''s Enrollment fee was declined by his bank  I will rerun since 1st months Share went through - 1/25 1/27- Share amount Declined as will I will email member Spoke to member he will fill out form. 1/30-final notice sent 1/31-member submitted update bank info 1 digit off in the Acct#', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-25 13:21:06', '2023-01-31 13:44:03'),
