  ('zcrm_1579374000112290008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'I reached out to Joy today to discuss the information that Wendy and I discussed. Joy didn''t answer so I left her a vm. I also sent her a detailed email with the fair pricing of a heart catheterization in her area as well as providers that perform the procedure in her area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-25 12:46:47', '2023-01-25 12:46:47'),
