  ('zcrm_1579374000112290003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091136002', 'Thelma Dillon', NULL, 'Thelma called in asking for medical advice because she believes she is having an allergic reaction to something she may have eaten. I advised Thelma that the concierge team cannot give medical advice but that she should start with CirrusMD. I walked her through how to access her CirrusMD account online and she is going to see what they say. She was very thankful for the time taken to walk her through everything. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-25 12:22:22', '2023-01-25 12:22:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112282018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, '1-25-23 Don called and I showed him how Angela can cancel her membership. She''s with Cigna now which I helped her with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 12:18:09', '2023-01-25 12:18:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112282013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, '1-25-23 Dawn is all set with completing the upgrade process. She had a Sedera person help her. They called her as well. She''s please about the price remaining almost the same and was appreciative that we stayed on her to get it done. Normally she ignores these types of things. :-)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-25 12:16:39', '2023-01-25 12:16:39'),
