  ('zcrm_1579374000112287003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096330001', 'Paul Lewandosky', NULL, '01.25.2023 Lisa called to get her name changed to her married name (From Lisa Lopez to Lisa Lewandosky), and she learned her email is not on the plan, and decided she wanted to add her email as well.
