  ('zcrm_1579374000112242013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109501008', 'Nathan Feler', NULL, 'Out of curiousity, I contacted Oscar about coverage in New York. It was correct that they are no longer providing coverage in New York. I contacted Nathan back and told him this, I told him I can pause the cancellation here if he decides to keep this. He was extremely happy I let him know about this. He''s going to contact Oscar to verify and let me know what he decides.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-25 10:04:48', '2023-01-25 10:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112273003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671026', 'George Jarratt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR Life code to member and wife. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-25 09:43:41', '2023-01-25 10:01:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109501008', 'Nathan Feler', NULL, 'I spoke to Nathan, he told me that he was signed up with Oscar (ACA). Mike Montes., sold him the plan to begin with. Mike Montes told this guy that the Oscar plan was no longer offered in New York, which was totally untrue, and sold him this plan. I asked this man if he''s spoken with Montes, he said no, he doesn''t return calls. Nothing I could do to keep this guy. Sent him the CXL form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-25 09:27:23', '2023-01-25 09:27:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112244003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111986010', 'Gerald Roper', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-25 08:53:57', '2023-01-25 08:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112242003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103350002', 'Nancy coleman staubitz', NULL, 'Spoke to Nancy, she is going through a divorce, she has no income, and her ex has cut off her payments for this plan. She applied and got accepted for Medicaid. I sent CXL form for her to become inactive as of March 1, 2023', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-25 08:53:42', '2023-01-25 08:53:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112218016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108894001', 'Conde Johnson', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-25 08:38:08', '2023-01-25 08:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112218008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107629002', 'Bryan McCay', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to resend out QR life code card. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-25 08:24:11', '2023-01-25 08:28:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112202013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109369027', 'Shandy Broom', NULL, 'Kelly called to inquire about the QR Lifecode. I explained what it is for and how to register online via the website provided on the card. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-25 08:16:32', '2023-01-25 08:16:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-25 07:51:28', '2023-01-25 07:51:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112198038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112463002', 'Alec Campbell', NULL, 'Alec emailed asking me further questions on the IUA.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2023-01-25 07:25:46', '2023-01-25 07:25:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112202008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109501008', 'Nathan Feler', NULL, 'Nathan called to cancel his plan, I sent him to Jeffrey ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-25 07:04:17', '2023-01-25 07:04:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112304001', 'Lynn Ware', NULL, '1-24-23 Lynn is 58 and husband is 59. They are both super active! She came to me through Sarah Bergstrom who is now Sarah Getzelman.

HI Wendy,

I''m looking for a new option for health care. Love this concept (I have researched this and watched the video.)

We live in Park City, UT and I''ve been using cobra for the last 18 months and now need new insurance (as of January 31!). 

We are very healthy and our lifestyle is active and we are very fit. I''d like to find out more. 

I''ll also try through your chatbot - but wanted to know how to proceed. I think we have some state laws about health insurance so I would perhaps do the Secure option. 

Best,

Lynn Ware Peek 
435.640.3931

Lynn LOVES the concept of this. She watched the video. She understands pre-x. She and husband are both self-employed now. They''ve always maxed out their HSA. The only health issues are that her husband has poly myalgia rheumatica. I don''t know what that is. For Lynn she recently learned that she has a genetic trait called alpha 1. She''s never had any issues or symptoms. She just decided to do the test bc someone in family has it. She''s a XC ski racer and has never had a problem. She''s not worried about it. She''s thrilled to be a part of something she can support rather than trad ins.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 18:21:25', '2023-01-24 18:25:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656124', 'Lesa Russell', NULL, '1-24-2023:  Nahla & I called Lesa back.  The RX is a controlled substance, so we disc this is not prev & won''t be something that will go twds a larger need of $2500 IUA.  She kept asking which card she presents (Planstin or Zion) so I went into education mode:  ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative ONLY (no diag or treatment) / Zion = catastrophic ''med needs'' > $2500 IUA.  Therefore, do not present any card.  Let them know you do not have ''ins'', you are a ''cash-pay'', ask if they offer ''cash-pay'' discount...  Since you set-up an HSA, some of your exp may qualify to use those funds.  She seemed to understand when we got done.  I think she''ll be a good fit for this healthcare as she learns how to present.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 18:03:33', '2023-01-24 22:48:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110548011', 'Steven Zaidman', NULL, '1-24-2023:  Chana sent in an RX Quote.  I''m a bit confused because this memb isn''t eff until 2/1/2023, but they already had their ''Welcome Call'' &amp; they are already requesting prescription prices.  I have it complete, but thought I''d tt Jennifer tomorrow.  I want to give good cust srvc, esp since Steven is an advisor lead (w/Wiley Long it looks like).  At the same time, I do not want Steven thinking all this prior to memb eff date is std.  I''ll doc results of conv tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 17:58:18', '2023-01-24 17:58:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529830', 'Joseph Lopez', NULL, '01.24.2023 Sent this to Michele, cause I don''t have access to tickets.

Joseph Lopez called this evening, he has been trying to cancel but got charged again this month.     I can see he''s spoken to Patti in 8/2022 (referred to Jane Kassel his advisor due to pricing concerns) & again in 12/2022 due to req of cancellation (where Patti again referred to Jane Kassel) so she could help him look at his ACA options & help with his cancellation if that''s what he decided.  Per Patti''s notes, she sent him the cancellation link, but he says he did not receive that.       Because this member is saying he is not hearing back from Jane Kassel and it''s more than a single issue, we are notifying you.  I do not yet have access to the ticket system, so I''m sending this to you.  Let me know if you need further info. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 17:58:04', '2023-01-24 17:58:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656124', 'Lesa Russell', NULL, '01.24.2023 Lesa had her wellness visit and needs to go see her doctor for a Zantacs RX Quote, and knows the doctor is going to want to bring her in for an appointment. She wasn''t sure what card to use. 
I consulted Cari via teams, but she was with a member. I offered to call Lesa back.
Cari and I called her back 5:10PM. Cari asked her if she has an HSA, and referred Lesa to pay for the visit in that manner. Cari reiterated she will not present as Planstin or Zion, but as cash-pay patient, ask for a discount. And explained how to request an RX Quote with us; via phone if in a hurry, or fill out a form on line if not. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 17:03:10', '2023-01-24 17:15:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112215002', 'Brenda Harms', NULL, '1-24-23 Brenda is healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. She''s a W2 employee but also a coach and has her own LLC in CO. She wants SECURE for the wellness and HSA compliance! She also has a DPC for $75 a month but prefers SECURE over DIRECT for HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 16:51:58', '2023-01-24 16:51:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, '1-24-23 "I have a new employer and they are providing health insurance effective 2/1/23." I sent him the cancellation form to complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 16:17:39', '2023-01-24 16:17:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, '1-24-23 Left vm to let Dawn know to make sure she completes the upgrade to her membership and that her price went from $340 to $344.97. Hopefully I will hear from her. I also sent the email just before.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 16:13:08', '2023-01-24 16:13:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529830', 'Joseph Lopez', NULL, '01.24.2023 Joseph called and  was extremely upset with MPB''s ongoing charge from his account.
