  ('zcrm_1579374000112200060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348024', 'David Kellers', NULL, '1-24-23 David called me back and got the lowdown for if he needs surgery. He hurt it helping a woman put chains on her car. He completed the upgrade process and didn''t make any changes. He was pondering adding the MEC but he doesn''t need any expensive wellness items yet, so I discouraged adding it for now.  His new price is $344.65/$500. It''s best to keep the $500 IUA since he will have  a need soon. He visits the Dr. on March 7th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 15:43:10', '2023-01-24 15:43:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112127002', 'Christopher Kanotz', 'NEEDS: Permission Form for Wife to Access Profile Information.', '01.24.2023 Monica, wife, called ......', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 15:36:20', '2023-01-24 16:13:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110465010', 'Frederick Ashcraft', NULL, '01.24.2023 I was able to generate a sample coupon for Fred''s future reference for the following RX Quote:
