  ('zcrm_1579374000112201050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083353010', 'Lauren Martty', NULL, '01.24.2023 Tanner called wanting to get help accessing HCBB, since him and his family moved to a new area (6 mos ago), he is setting everyone up with the appropriate providers and doctors. 
