  ('zcrm_1579374000112184117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725199', 'Susan McCormick-Davis', NULL, '1-24-2023:  Susan called for several items:
     - Having her ''bone density'' scan.  Talked to her about plain bone density scan fine, some new scans do more than that & those don''t get pd for.  She has chosen an in ntwk prov.
     - Has her mamm coming up - disc > 2 yrs (& they look at months, but she assured me we are good).  She''ll confirm both imaging & reading prov in ntwk.  IF something comes up, we talked about see if a date past 3/1/2023 would be a risk & if not a clean slate going to Medicare is best.
     - Turning 65 3/2023.  Told her to sub her cancellation for between 2/1-2/15/2023 for 3/1/2023 eff of her Medicare.  She''ll call if she needs help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 15:16:18', '2023-01-24 15:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348024', 'David Kellers', NULL, '1-24-23 David called bc he had some questions. He might need a surgery upcoming in March perhaps bc of a skiing injury. He wants to know what he needs to do to prepare for that. In a vm I told him to call the MPB Concierge Team or call me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 15:06:58', '2023-01-24 15:06:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103631002', 'Robert Green', NULL, 'Sent CirrusMD support an email regarding assisting him with signing in. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 15:01:55', '2023-01-24 15:01:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104790012', 'Jessica Perez', NULL, '01.24.2023 Jessica called, cause she missed her welcome call with Jennifer. She said she was having a hard time connecting. So I referred her to the email with a link for her to reschedule that Jennifer sent, and had given me the heads up in receiving Jessica''s call coming in. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 14:45:25', '2023-01-24 14:45:25'),
