  ('zcrm_1579374000112184112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103631002', 'Robert Green', 'NOTE: Caution 2 Robert Greens! This is Robert''s b-day = 12/12/1963', '1-24-2023:  Ran across same name when working w/other Rbt.  Trying to make easily noticed note for future ref.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 14:19:29', '2023-01-24 14:19:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061081', 'Robert Green', NULL, '1-24-23 Helping Robert to upgrade now but hit a road block. The Continue button won''t work. Trying another browser now.  The new browser worked no problem. He completed the upgrade and I reminded him of the other benefits he has access to such as Life Care and Virtual Healthcare. He will call MPB Concierge back now to get his CirrusMD app registered properly. He was enjoyable and easy to work with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 14:18:21', '2023-01-24 14:42:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112213003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095555002', 'Kyle Larsen', 'Recap on how to use program', 'Kyle called and said he was confused as to how the program worked.  And needed a refresher.  I quickly reviewed everything from the member''s portal aspect so that he could review it with me at the same time.

I also updated his email address and password for the portal since he was having issues with it.  He seemed to be satisfied.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-01-24 14:12:26', '2023-01-24 14:14:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112177040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103256010', 'Ruby Guyer', NULL, 'Member''s 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via VM &amp; email - 1/24 1/30-Final notice sent out via email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-24 14:08:46', '2023-01-30 12:32:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061081', 'Robert Green', 'NOTE: Caution 2 Robert Greens!  This is Robert ''A'' (for Allen) Green 11/27/1964', '1-24-2023:  Robert called, realized we have 2 sep Rbt Greens.  Verified b-day.  He rec''d Sedera call that he needs to conv or his memb will be cancelled.  Got his advisor''s name & ph # = Wendy Scipione & let him know she is great at helping her memb w/the Sedera Conversion.  Trans him directly to her # (looks like she''s on the ph), so he will LM if he doesn''t catch her.  Sent Wendy Teams chat as backup.  He know this is time sensitive & needs to be done asap (w/1/31/23 deadline, but get done in next few days in case any issues.)     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 14:08:42', '2023-01-24 14:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112177035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348024', 'David Kellers', NULL, 'Member called into ask about how to use plan. Left VM.  I returned his call, I asked if he had completed the Sedera transition of which he was totally unawares.  I explained the re-enrollment and the whys of it and assured member if he needed Healthcare $ they would be there.  He said that he would look through his emails and do the transition.  I explained the IUA and the opening of a need and the uploading of the receipts &amp; bills.  Also presenting as Cash Pay.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-24 14:01:13', '2023-01-24 14:01:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109169002', 'Thomas Chairez', NULL, '1-24-2023:  Thomas called wanting to cancel his memb eff: 2/1/2023.  He has not yet spoken to his advisor Leslie Jablonski (whose name he didn''t even recognize.  How did she sign him up if he doesn''t know her name?).  I made sure he has her name &amp; #, he will call her.  IF he has not heard back from her by this Thursday, 1/26/2023, he will call us back so we can get someone in the corp off to help him with the cancellation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 13:52:23', '2023-01-24 13:52:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112193023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098599023', 'Mujtaba Saifuddin', NULL, 'I spoke to Mutjaba, nice guy. Went over the plan with him, and I asked if he''d done his welcome call. He answered that he had not. I had Jennifer send him the scheduler for him to set up the call. He''s happy with everything.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-24 13:43:34', '2023-01-24 13:43:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '1-23-2023:  John called.  Issues...
     - RCI:  Rec''d a bill from his PCP showing majority of visit was not pd for.  He says he hasn''t rec''d a EOB.  Told him we cannot see this, so talk w/RCI (=Regional Care) at 1-800-795-7772.  They should be able to provide the EOB so he can see what was & was not pd for.  
       He was frustrated because "he cannot figure out our healthcare.  I encouraged him to call the concierge line BERFORE he does things so we can help him sort thru curr guidelines for whichever component he will be using.
     - Colonoscopy:  Anesthesiaologist keeps billing him from Jan 2022 even though he got it pre-approved & doc was suggested by Redirect.  He already has an appt w/his Redirect Specialist, has the app, so there''s not much he needs from us on this right now.
     - MAP: Wendy sent him e-mail in 12/2022 re: counseling.  He thought he could get his curr counseling cov''d.  We disc their ntwk, he can nominate them, but does req in ntwk.  He''s not someplace he can finish this conv.  Will call when he can.  Haven''t shown him how to access MPA yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 13:40:49', '2023-01-25 02:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108617002', 'Bobbie Esten', NULL, 'Left a detailed vm and sent Bobbie a new welcome call scheduler since they did not show up for their call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 13:33:12', '2023-01-24 13:33:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '1-23 / 24-2023:  Linda called back several times & really just needed more hand holding.  Even though she told her son "do not present a card, you are ''cash-pay'', no ''ins''," one of his son''s friends was helping & gave the hosp some card, she''s thinking Planstin & now she''s panicked.  She''s going to call the hosp & ER to let them know again, no ins, etc.  She pd the 1k IUA & called to understand the process now that this req''d surgery today.
     - Sent her the temp for sub a ''need'' & walked her thru the process, expectations, etc.  She only has per pymt receipt since this all started yesterday, but I had her start the need since it''s moved from an ER Visit to a Hosp & Surgery need.  She''s calling the hosp to get a final detailed inv.  It sounds like she''s worked w/med coding before, so she''s on top of this.  She will call if she has questions throughout this ''med need''.  
1/24: Made sure she has Zion''s ph # & trans''d her to conf their Zion memb #.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 13:31:47', '2023-01-25 02:57:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '1-24-23 Sandy called and wasn''t sure if she completed the upgrade entirely or not. The process wasn''t intuitive. She will call Sedera right now and get back to me. I let her know her account was put on hold and she will be billed for Jan. and Feb to keep her account active moving forward. She said that''s ok.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 13:19:51', '2023-01-24 13:19:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141001', 'Kevin M Ryan', NULL, '01.24.2023 Kevin called with a direct and forceful demeanor regarding changes and who to speak to.
I was not able to hear most of Ken''s initial statement when I answered the call, he spoke in a low and mumbling voice. 
I apologized for not being able to hear him, and requested that he repeat himself. He spoke slower and with more annunciation, then said with an off-putting tone "Is that clear enough?". Which I responded, changing your address & e-mail is quick and can be done from the Member Portal & Updates page.
Kevin was not very happy with the idea of me leading him to a page for him to complete, but I thought I was encouraging him to maneuver the resources he has with his plan.
After guiding him to complete the form, he states that he received a number of error message, and then got into THIS IS WHY I JUST WANT TO SPEAK TO SOMEONE TO GET THIS DONE, BECAUSE THIS ALWAYS HAPPENS.
I then asked if I could put him on hold, and check with my trainer, where to go from here. When I was asking Cari on teams, Kevin hung up. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 13:03:52', '2023-01-24 13:16:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '1-24-23 Patti suggested that I have them complete the upgrade and report back to Patti to bill them for Jan. and Feb. Just left her a vm at 1:00 pm MST.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 13:00:31', '2023-01-24 13:02:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128134', 'Sandra Amico', NULL, '1-23-23 Sandra and Daniel Amico and family were not billed for January. Their plan was cancelled by our team due to the upgrade process. &nbsp;However, the new product was not added back. If you look in Admin123 you can see their plan listed as Inactive and in the notes it shows as Member Retained. This member has NOT cancelled and we need to bill her ASAP as well.  T told Patti and she suggested to ask   I Dayra. Dayra can''t do it and has passed me back to Patti.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 13:00:06', '2023-01-24 13:00:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111923312', 'Matthew Joppich', NULL, '1-24-23 Matt called bc Justin Acker proposed possibly making Matt an employee and paying for part of his membership moving forward. I told him that is fine. But, Justin doesn''t have enough employees for a list bill but he can just change the payment method and pay for Matt and deal with the difference in his pay check. He will talk it over with Justin and decide what will make the most sense moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 12:15:29', '2023-01-24 12:15:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Spoke with Joy today, she is concerned that it is taking so long for her to get a resolution. She is telling us completely conflicting stories stating to me that she is in no hurry to get any procedures done. Per Joy''s request, I will be reaching out to Wendy so that we can put our heads together and get caught up on what is going on with Joy. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 12:14:18', '2023-01-24 12:14:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112193018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106024002', 'Douglas Miller', NULL, 'Doug called back, he said he emailed us on the 15th, requesting a cancellation. He has a pre-existing back issue requiring surgery. He only sent in the CXL form yesterday. We are going to refund his money by the end of the week. He''s fine with that. He should''ve never been enrolled to begin with.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-24 12:04:41', '2023-01-24 12:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112126002', 'Kathleen Kuosman', NULL, '1-24-23 Katie has been given a Feb. 1st start date per Patti and charged already. All set!
I left her a vm now letting her know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 12:02:49', '2023-01-24 12:04:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112193013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106024002', 'Douglas Miller', NULL, 'Cari informed me that Doug wants to cancel. I never received a call or email from him. I tried to reach him, but got his voicemail. I left a message for him to call me back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-24 12:02:00', '2023-01-24 12:02:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106711002', 'Amber Miller', NULL, '01.24.2023 Needed log in information to log in.
I confirmed her account and guided her to log - in with success. I urged her not the change the passcode due to future challenges in logging in. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 11:55:53', '2023-01-24 11:55:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108535002', 'Malisa Formanek', NULL, '01.24.2023 Malisa called to know how to proceed with the colonoscopy for her husband, on Friday, so it is covered.
Malisa will not have her welcome call, till next week. So I shared with her, that it is one of the preventatives, until they find any needed extractions, then it evolves into diagnostic and medical cost sharing.
I asked Cari via teams how are we coaching patients to present themselves, PHCS or RBP? She said PHCS for now, so all  medical suites need to be in network. 
I shared that with Malisa who had the email Planstin sent with the PHCS link. She found out, the facility/hospital is not in network. I shared with her, AO 2/1/2023, that may no longer be necessary, if they can wait to have the procedure later. I explained the RPB process, and suggested when she calls to change the appointment, to ask them to connect with Planstin and start the RPB process for the future. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 11:51:49', '2023-01-24 11:58:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012379061', 'Lindsay Patterson', NULL, '1-24-2023:  Lindsay called.  She''s in pain from ''pink-eye'' &amp; wondered where to start.  We agreed CirrusMD was a good starting place.  I helped her get into her CirrusMD acct via computer &amp; when we got off she was about to start a call.  She will let us know if she needs us to price up an RX.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 11:30:12', '2023-01-24 13:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112193008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094737002', 'Faviola Meschi', NULL, 'Faviola emailed me asking if we got any word yet on this claim. I said, to my knowledge, we are still waiting. As soon as I can get a definitive answer, I will let her know. She''s happy I followed up with her.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-24 11:24:18', '2023-01-24 11:24:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106024002', 'Douglas Miller', NULL, '1-24-2023:  I didn''t get the Teams chat sent until today to Jeffrey Bursteen.  tt Jeffrey &amp; he wasn''t aware of anyone w/this scenario, so I''m not sure why Douglas did not leave him a message yesterday.  But, at least now Jeffrey''s aware of the request.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-24 11:23:09', '2023-01-24 11:23:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693017', 'Deirdre Bingman', NULL, '01.24.2023 Deirdre called to learn what to put down on school forms for her son, when they ask for insurance information.
I wasn''t sure so I asked Cari, and she said the member has to call Planstin and attain that letter. AND since Planstin and Zion are a sister company, they could also try asking them for a letter from Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 11:09:56', '2023-01-24 11:09:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109093019', 'Paul Bond', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 11:00:12', '2023-01-24 11:00:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112202003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, 'Martha reached out to me via SalesIQ just now and asked if she is to bill MPB for her Flu Shot. I got her info to pull up her account which is under her husband Jason. They have the Direct Plan and I explained to her what that means and that they are cash pay for everything other than catastrophic injury/illness medical emergencies. Then for that type of situation they are cash pay only up to their IUA of $5000. Anything after is to be submitted to Zion and start a Need with them. She was unaware of this and thought they were paying extra for the Preventative benefits. She then asked if everything applies to their son. I looked and confirmed that their son Ryan is under them, so it does include him. I explained to her about the SECURE plan and that she can always contact Michael Montes, who is their healthcare advisor, and discuss possibly switching plans to the Secure, as that seems to be the type of coverage they are looking for. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-24 10:52:50', '2023-01-24 10:52:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027311063', 'Goldy Wareing', NULL, 'Goldy stated she called MPowering and was told to call the concierge so that we could look over the bill that she received from Redirect. I explained that we cannot see the bills and that we do not help with the decision making when it comes to Redirect and what is paid. Goldy understood and asked about Sports Medicine. I advised that she can go to any Sports Medicine doctor she wants, present as self-pay, and to open a need with Sedera if she believes it will go above her IUA amount. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 10:50:45', '2023-01-24 10:50:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080584001', 'Zubair Niazi', NULL, '01.24.2023 Zubair called trying to access his member portal.
I confirmed his account and guided him to log in with his log in information. Zubair shared interest towards changing his alph-numeric passcode, and I urged him not to (due to guidance from Cari and Jen, changing the initial passcode will result in logging in challenges).NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-24 10:48:42', '2023-01-24 11:11:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079921029', 'Ryan Padwe', NULL, '1-24-23 The EIN for SRP Group is 87-1938097.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 10:37:10', '2023-01-24 10:37:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112200003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912017', 'Stephen Padwe', NULL, '1-24-23 The EIN for SRP Group is 87-1938097.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-24 10:36:54', '2023-01-24 10:36:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109171008', 'Sherry Allen', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 10:34:45', '2023-01-24 10:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112177024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she had to change her billing &amp; address since she has now moved I will send her those links via email (via outlook)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-24 10:18:47', '2023-01-24 10:18:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112177019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052500084', 'Marie Green', NULL, 'Marie called in it is her intention to cancel her Sedera membership.  I will send her out the Cancellation Link via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-24 10:15:24', '2023-01-24 10:15:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109357023', 'Mark FARR', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 10:09:26', '2023-01-24 10:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071992009', 'Jason Cooper', NULL, 'Martha called wondering why she received a bill back from Zion from when her 15-year old son received his flu vaccination. It stated that she did not receive the cash price and that they would not pay this since it was not the cash price. Martha and I called Zion together where I introduced her to Katie who would explain the bill to her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 10:07:18', '2023-01-24 10:07:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079921029', 'Ryan Padwe', NULL, 'Ryan called inquiring about his dental/vision plan. I let Ryan know that there isn''t anything included with his plan but that I could put him in touch with his advisor to see what she has. Ryan said he would reach out to her on his own. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 09:56:28', '2023-01-24 09:56:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112198008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112463002', 'Alec Campbell', NULL, 'Spoke to Alec answered his question he left on the SalesIQ.  He is 52 and currently looking at all our options.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2023-01-24 09:43:06', '2023-01-24 09:43:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082048002', 'Maginel Galt', NULL, 'Maginel called to check in with us. She''s so sweet and just wanted to make sure she was up to date on everything. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 09:38:44', '2023-01-24 09:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010870127', 'Heather Braeutigam', NULL, 'Heather called with questions regarding why she received a bill from her preventative care services. Since I could not see the bill, I transferred Heather to Planstin for this explanation. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 09:36:26', '2023-01-24 09:36:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107684002', 'John Newton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with John and Jennifer. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 09:35:43', '2023-01-24 09:35:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084611010', 'Margo Hrabak', NULL, 'Margo called in frantic and short because she does not know how to use her plan. We went over quite a few items, and Margo also wanted a guarantee that whatever provider she uses is in the network. I let Margo know that I could not make any guarantees as we do not have control of who is in the PHCS network. Margo felt better when we got off of the phone and will call back with any other questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 09:34:38', '2023-01-24 09:34:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'LeAnn called for a refresher; we went over searching the PHCS network and she wanted a guarantee that whatever provider she found was in fact, in the network. I told her that I could not give guarantees, reason being is that providers fall in out of the network constantly. She then asked to be transferred to RCI to see if they could verify that a provider is in the network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 09:32:15', '2023-01-24 09:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112177014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054542144', 'Kenneth Whitham', NULL, 'I received notification form Sedera that this member would be cancelling.  I reached out to him and he will be cancelling.  I sent him out the link and will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-24 09:12:23', '2023-01-24 09:12:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109411002', 'Stacy Gloster', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa  Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 08:59:57', '2023-01-24 08:59:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112193003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060475077', 'James Brown', NULL, 'Spoke to James this morning, he''s a game player. He said he cancelled through Mike Montes, but that was back in Sept. 2022. He has pre-existings that he knew about and just wanted those taken care of. He told me that we can''t preclude him because of pre-existings. I sent him the CXL link, which he sent back already. And he already called his bank to cancel the charge.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-24 08:50:26', '2023-01-24 08:50:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109361008', 'Laura Roessler', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 08:36:40', '2023-01-24 08:36:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112177006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, 'Member called in wondering why we were charging him for Jan &amp; Feb since he aged into Medicare eff 1/1/23.  After looking into this member''s DOB was wrong in A123 so he never got notified and cancelled.  I will refund him for Jan &amp; Feb pmt paid in error.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-24 08:27:55', '2023-01-24 08:27:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109760002', 'Jomaldo Barbosa', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 08:19:14', '2023-01-24 08:19:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112184003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109502001', 'David Hartman', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-24 07:40:50', '2023-01-24 07:40:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112165001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110880002', 'Alexander Crowe', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2760 Question : Just had a question about the minimum essential coverage on my plan (the secure plan)', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-24 07:26:56', '2023-01-24 07:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112158008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, 'Catherine called about her CirrusMD account, she is signed up and she is going to log into the services today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-24 07:24:36', '2023-01-24 07:24:36'),
