  ('zcrm_1579374000112133001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110880002', 'Alexander Crowe', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 2758 Question : Just had a question about the minimum essential coverage on my plan (the secure plan)', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-24 06:31:36', '2023-01-24 06:31:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112107066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, '1-23-2023: Hillary called.  She hasn''t rec''d the pre-pd card yet for Wednesday and is starting to panic.  If she hasn''t heard anything from them by 2pm eastern tomorrow, she''ll call &amp; we will call Zion together.  They''ve asked her duplicate info, like they don''t realize she already supplied what they''ve asked.  Hopefully, she''ll rec the $.  This is causing her a lot of stress &amp; she''s already stressed about the biopsy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-23 23:34:46', '2023-01-23 23:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112096030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112463002', 'Alec Campbell', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2757 Question : What happens if the medical costs of all members in the community exceeds the membership fees (IUAs + monthly fees)? Do members then get a bill for additional costs even they didn''t incur them? Has this ever happened?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-23 22:28:19', '2023-01-23 22:28:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110465010', 'Frederick Ashcraft', NULL, '01.23.2023 Fred needed to get an RX filled ASAP, when he did, he paid a lot of money. He has not had his WC, so I sent him the email to schedule one. Frederick was not aware of the RX Quote program that we have at MPB, he would not have presented his Planstin card to use at the pharmacy.
I will search his drug tomorrow and see what I can find.
Valsartan, 160mg, 180 amount (3 months), one oral 2x day for 30 days. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 18:00:46', '2023-01-24 14:23:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '01.23.2023
Joy called to follow up on the situation with the grant and CareConnect. She was supposed to hear back from Jen, but didnt, yet. Was supposed to hear back from Wendy with some good news, but didn''t yet. She''s feeling a bit unsettled, given she thought she was approved for a special "grant", but no one is communicating with her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 17:50:41', '2023-01-23 17:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112107061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106024002', 'Douglas Miller', NULL, '1-23-2023:  Douglas called.  On the 15th of this month he e-mailed a bunch of people that he did not want to start this plan (says he didn''t hear back from anyone). -- he''s realized he has large pre-x items & cannot move fwd with MPB.  I let him know that Jeffrey Bursteen sb able to help him w/the cancellation & that I''ll also send him a Teams chat to make sure he gets Douglas'' VM & desire to cancel.  His payment was pulled, so he''s also looking for a refund since his memb will never have begun.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-23 17:43:23', '2023-01-24 11:21:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112107050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095870002', 'Anthony Lopez', NULL, '1-23-2023:  Anthony called, he wondered if there is a way to have a diff draw date for his monthly contributions.  I told him they draw everyone''s mo cont on the 20th, but that our Ben Admin Patti would be the one to ask in case I''m wrong.  He LM for her &amp; knows she''s already out for the day.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-23 17:24:41', '2023-01-23 17:26:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '1-23-23 They went to Children''s Hospital/Urgent Care for Remy. They specifically said we think we just need Urgent Care but we aren''t 100% sure. The Admin folks just sent her to the back and said we''ll figure it out. They gave her a pee test and tried charging them $3000 when they left!  Per Jennifer''s notes above and her great assistance they paid $300 but still expect a ridiculous bill. I suggested that he fight it again and reiterate that they are self-pay without ins and were in essense forced in to the ER for no good reason. The total bill should be $300, not $3K. He''ll work on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-23 16:04:34', '2023-01-23 16:06:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '1-23-23 Hilary got a surprise bill 1 1/2 years later for a surgery she had done. She paid the full deductible already so, it shouldn''t be her responsibility anymore. I told Michael to have her submit it to Friday Health to deal with. He might have Hilary call me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-23 16:02:44', '2023-01-23 16:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112107045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107285002', 'Rick Rife', NULL, '1-23-2023:  Rick called, he''s looking for guidance on the 2 open claims they have.  There''s one for him &amp; one for his wife.  I let him know those are w/his healthsharing company Zion, we cannot see the ''med needs''.  I made sure he has their ph #, gave him dir - use menu #5, let them know you are struggling to understand where both ''med needs'' are at, &amp; maybe you can ask to have one processor if not already.  Then I trans him directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-23 16:01:40', '2023-01-23 23:43:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112126002', 'Kathleen Kuosman', NULL, '1-23-23 Katie just learned that her plan promised via C4 to auto renew with her subsidy didn''t actually give her the subsidy and is charging her full price. She doesn''t want to continue with UHC/RMHP. She prefers to go with CARE+. She does mostly acu and natural healing modalities and doesn''t trypically do an annual wellness visit. I let her know if she does, she will not be reimbursed for the wellness but will still be ahead financially.  She''s healthy, young, 27. She was my only attendee at BOLO in Boulder in Nov. She''s happy to join CARE+ $1000/$215.   I''m asking Patti is she can get a Feb. 1st start date due to errors out of her control with C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-23 15:40:54', '2023-01-23 15:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662022', 'Jaime Klingelhofer', NULL, '01.23.2023 Jaime called to check on the automatic payment, because it did not come out on the 20th.
I checked Admin123, and scrolled down to see the payments. I did not see an approval for her payment to be extracted from her account. 
Therefore, I wasn''t sure if Patti can see more on her end, so I forwarded her to Patti to leave a message or speak with her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 15:33:57', '2023-01-23 15:33:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112107034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '1-23-2023:  Kimberly called confused.  I think on the 6th we were talking PCP?  I didn''t put that down, but that''s in the back of my mind, so this is for something different.
     - Went & got her mammogram & pd cash.  Called Zion first & they told her this wasn''t something on their component.  Then, was told she needed to send the info to Planstin to get reimb.  I let her know Planstin will not reimb members.  She''s going to call the prov, get them a copy of her ID Card so they can bill for the service & reimb her once they''ve been reimb.  [I''m a bit concerned because she said she gave them her Planstin card when she arrived.  Hopefully, she chose someone in network!]   She''ll call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-23 15:28:09', '2023-01-23 15:43:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '01.23.2023 Linda called inquiring about the approach and steps to moving through, after her son injured his collar bone. She asked if she presents the MPB card as her insurance card.
I shared that sounds like it would fall under medical cost sharing, given it is not preventative and it could accumulate a large medical cost. I shared that he would present himself as a cash-pay patient, requesting the discount pricing for cash-pay. She was not feeling comfortable with my delivery, perhaps, and so I offered to ask my trainer for clarification, but she requested to speak to my trainer instead.
I brought Cari in, who explained the presentation process her son will need to practice when he goes into care, she explained the medical cost sharing kicking in after the IUA has been paid, she explained that there might be a  need to open a medical need in the future. When Linda is ready and has all her papers in order (bills and invoices), to call us the concierge consulting line back and we will walk her through it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 14:38:33', '2023-01-23 14:38:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103737002', 'Matthew Hatcher', NULL, '01.23.2023 Matthew called to check on the automatic payment, because it did not come out on the 20th.
I checked Admin123, and scrolled down to see the payments. It looked green, approved to be extracted from his account. 
However, I wasn''t sure if Patti can see more on her end, and why he can''t see the deduction from his side, so I forwarded him to Patti to leave a message or speak with her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 14:27:53', '2023-01-23 14:32:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112119004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '01.23.23:  Recvd. an email from Emily.  She said she''d like to schedule a call to review some questions she has. She didn''t remember if she had a Welcome Call. She went to the doctor a few times this past year but didn''t know if she should submit the receipts to Zion.  She also asked if she has to pay each time she uses CirrusMD.  I responded and explained how the Need and IUA works; also explained how CirrusMD works.  I suggested we set up a call for the end of this week or next week.  I also suggested she set up another Welcome call, if she feels the need.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-01-23 14:10:49', '2023-01-23 14:10:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371027', 'Karen Faydenko', NULL, 'Script quote done for Fluoxetine.~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-23 14:09:28', '2023-01-23 14:09:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '1-23-23 Carolyn called to find out about tax implications and forms needed. I let her know she''ll receive the 1095-C form in early March but it gets filed directly with IRS for their needs. Nothing to wait for. I also let her know the tax-ded portion is $105 for EC. She said she''s really happy with Zion because she needed a finger surgery (I think) and they actually paid up front the day before the surgery! The hardest part is getting the providers to give the correct bills and such.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-23 13:43:55', '2023-01-23 13:43:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785008', 'Michael Morrison', NULL, 'Michael called to update his payment info, I sent him the member payment update form ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-23 13:43:02', '2023-01-23 13:43:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100495002', 'Paul Eckenrode', NULL, 'Left detailed vm and sent a new scheduler. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-23 13:32:35', '2023-01-23 13:32:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112073067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109933001', 'Ryan Fleck', NULL, 'Member''s 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 1/23 Spoke to member he will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-23 13:30:01', '2023-01-23 13:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110308002', 'Robert Golden', NULL, '01.23.2023 Robert called inquiring about the number of billing deductions from his account. So I forwarded him to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 13:24:09', '2023-01-23 13:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108730001', 'Elizabeth Dreher', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-23 13:18:13', '2023-01-23 13:18:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '1-23-23 Carol graciously allowed us to reschedule until Wed. so I can hopefully have my voice back. I also forgot to send her the video which I did right now. She was super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-23 13:07:45', '2023-01-23 13:07:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109175019', 'Juliann Jordan', NULL, '01.23.2023 Juliann (Annie) called to clarify how to increase the deduction from the HSA account through her boss, I wanted to consult with Jen and Cari on this. Cari came in on the call and said, our MPB Secure plan only qualifies them to have the HSA.  She also asked if Annie had her welcome call yet, and how important it is to have the education from that call. Annie hadn''t had her WC, so I resent her the scheduling link.
It sounds like all other questions have to go through the company that is holding their HSA for them.
Cari left the call, and Juliann asked about how it work if someone has another insurance outside of Planstin/MPB plan, I said when it comes to medical cost sharing, there is a part in the form that asks about another form of insurance. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 13:01:15', '2023-01-23 13:05:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679122', 'Marty Kirby', NULL, '1-23-23 I just emailed the Kirby''s to introduce myself in case they need help moving forward since she no longer works with MPB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-23 12:58:57', '2023-01-23 12:58:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679122', 'Marty Kirby', NULL, '1-23-23 From Patti, "I just heard back from Sammi Bessert that member Marty Kirby is actually going to remain with MPowering as the pricing is lower than it would be if they moved over. So, no need to cancel this membership. They have also finished migration so they are all set."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-23 12:58:22', '2023-01-23 12:58:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112073052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108610009', 'Paul Raby', NULL, 'Member''s 2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 1/23 1/24-Spoke to member he has had some financial difficulties and will have a new debit card by end of week.  He will fill out the PU form and let me know when I can charge.  Member called in and directed me to charge on present CC.  He will update at a later date.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-23 12:45:06', '2023-01-27 14:24:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108730001', 'Elizabeth Dreher', NULL, '01.23.2023 Elizabeth called cause she thought they missed the welcome call, but after consulting with Jen and Cari, Jen said they are 34 minutes early, and they are scheduled at 3 EST. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 12:27:42', '2023-01-23 12:27:42'),
