  ('zcrm_1579374000112094008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111964102', 'Michael Santa Maria', 'Vetting Call', 'Spoke with Michael.  Prefers to be called Mickey.  Has worked with Jane Kassel over the years in referring others to this platform.  Became a member himself in 2022 and now wants to offer it to his clientele.

Sent out "Getting Started" email.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-01-23 12:13:50', '2023-01-23 12:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112107008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109799016', 'Robert Louchheim', NULL, '1-23-2023:  Robert called.  He had an accident, hurt his knee on 1/9/2023.  Saw orthopedic doc 1/17/2023, got x-rays, pd out of pocket, doc ordered an MRI.  Has appt w/orthopedic again @ end of the mo for doc to look at his MRI results.  (Doc thinking it could be torn miniscus?)  
     - So far has paid:  $528.05 towards  $2500 IUA.  
        He was a bit confused because he thought he''d gone w/1k IUA, he''ll look into.
     - He is going to pay for his ortho appt at the end of the mo & find out what the doc thinks.
     - IF doc wants alt treatment, ie: PT, he knows that req pre-approval, but he''s resp for first $2500 anyway.  IF surgery or other treatments, I let him know we have Care Conn if >5k & they are really good w/people.
     - Robbie knows 6mos deadline for sub ''med need'', takes a few weeks to get approval, etc.  He will call to see if we should sub ''med need'' after this next appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-23 12:10:00', '2023-01-23 14:07:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112073042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103639001', 'Jared Toldo', NULL, 'Member''s  2/23 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM - 1/23 1/30-final notice sent via email 2/6- final email sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-23 11:58:59', '2023-02-07 07:22:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112079013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092940002', 'Curt Freeman', NULL, '01.23.2023 Curt called to confirm coverage on colonoscopies. I shared I am fairly new the concierge line, but do understand his plan offers one colonoscopy, but after confirming with Cari and Jen via teams, I also shared with him the 6 month waiting period, which he is passed and the limitations shared on the guidelines. Curt felt appeased with how to move forward from here. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-23 11:49:47', '2023-01-23 11:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112045033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109104710', 'Delaney McGrath', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-23 11:06:26', '2023-01-23 11:06:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000112107003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096042001', 'Jacqueline Schaible', NULL, '1-23-2023:  ACL surgery before, but was on her other knee.  Hasn''t seen a doc yet, but thinks she needs an MRI.  Wants to see a diff ortho doc because she doesn''t think her''s will take this ''ins''.  Went over a little education = not ins, 1k IUA = her resp.  She tt retired doc, he said to wait for swelling to go down, then get the MRI.  MRI provider req''s doc''s order, so she''s trying to decide who to see for that order.
     - Walked her thru HCBB in case she wants to use diff ortho.  We talked about how the payments work:  ''Cash-pay'', ask for disc, pay as close as poss to your 1k IUA, sub ''med need'' (we''ll help w/that), 6mos deadline, if surg & >5k Care Connect, etc...  Also, let her know:  once item approved, healthshare pymts generally quik so many docs like the speed of pymts.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-23 11:05:26', '2023-01-23 13:58:48'),
