  ('zcrm_1579374000112087003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110433001', 'Zachary Freedman', NULL, 'Zach called on Friday, 1/20/2023 after hours basically. I did speak to him that day. He wants to cancel, because he won''t be covered with this plan. He has pre-existings that Chrisine Corsini apparently didn''t completely discuss with him. He should have never been enrolled. I sent him CXL link and we will be refunding him for February.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-23 09:53:37', '2023-01-23 09:53:37'),
