  ('zcrm_1579374000111912211', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, 'Michael called and we did a conference call with his wife Hillary who was in the ER with their daughter. She had originally gone into the Urgent Care clinic, but was told that they will need to be triaged into the ER. Hillary and Michael were unsure of the process: We went through how to present as self-pay, the hospital is asking for a $300 deposit since she is a self-pay and she is going to pay that, they will bill her the rest and the Remacles will call us once they are ready to open their need. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-20 14:22:07', '2023-01-20 14:22:07'),
