  ('zcrm_1579374000111989008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082160001', 'Faisal Ladak', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to cancel.  I asked if he spoke to Guy which he didn''t.  Said that he got other PPO coverage.  Told me it was private insurance not marketplace.  Also could not give me any reason why he was cancelling.  I will send him out Cancellation request and I advised him of the deadline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-20 13:43:01', '2023-01-20 13:47:35'),
