  ('zcrm_1579374000111912196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, 'Corey called to remove his dependents and get the price change. I sent him over to his advisor for the price change and sent the member change form link via email. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-20 11:58:00', '2023-01-20 11:58:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111983073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, 'I got a call from Wendy about this member that his Pmt will not go through. She had him make some changes to his plan. He has cancelled Redirect and has gone with RCI. Increased IUA to $1000 IUA.  Member has completed transition so Sedera does not need to be informed.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-20 11:31:49', '2023-01-20 11:35:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111984036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-20 11:05:10', '2023-01-20 11:05:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111932043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046884055', 'Tracy Roye', NULL, '01.20.2023 Franklin was not able to log-in, and it turned out that he was on the wrong page. I led him to our Member Portal & Update page, shared the plethora of platform access buttons there, and gave him his log-in information.
Franklin also need assistance in submitting a Zion medical need request, because his son broke his wrist in October 2022.
I emailed him the link/template, and walked him through the form''s completion, explained the Zion deadline of 6 months, and the email to expect from them.
