  ('zcrm_1579374000111973069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810440', 'Erin Nissen', NULL, '1-19-2022:  Advisor JC Clark called a few days ago, asking about what the price of adding family memb(s) to Erin''s Sedera memb.  Nahla caught that call & knowing Patti was out sick, trans JC to Jeffrey Bursteen.  JC then called back still trying to ge the info & I sugg to Nahla, that JC''s parent producer, Wendy Scipione might know?  JC called back saying Wendy said to call Patti.  So today I put her thru to Patti''s line (but, it was after the FL office hours, so she LM.  I also sent a heads up to Patti, that JC & I went over the deadline tomorrow = (chg form would have to be sub BEFORE 3pm Eastern) if they want a 2/1/2023 eff date for additions.  JC knows we are now on the wire, but I went thru how to sub the chg form if that''s what the memb decides to do, once they know what the chg does to the mo cont.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-20 01:02:49', '2023-01-20 01:02:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111972016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '1-19-23 Suzanne called bc she hasn''t been sent a Cigna Card yet and she was quoted $180 for her two meds, Fosamaz and Adderral Generic versions. On GoodRX they are about $15-$20 each or less. I told her to try that and let me know if she runs into troubles with just paying cash. She will and was super appreciative that I called her after hours.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-19 19:16:48', '2023-01-19 19:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111972008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '1-19-23 I talked with Joy and her adjusted gross income is less than $130K so according to John T, she will qualify for the hospital bill eraser program! She was very touched and feels very supported. She was about to cry. She was up at 4:00 am last night worrying about how she was going to pay for a possible open heart surgery. It might not be that bad, but she doesn''t know yet. I told her I can''t promise anything yet bc the deal isn''t signed. But, the goal is to get it going for March, 2023. Also, in Aug. 2023 she will have up to $125K in sharing if it comes to that as well.  She is incredibly appreciative!  We are both hoping for the best!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-19 18:36:15', '2023-01-19 18:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111974050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005605321', 'Robin Cressy', NULL, '01.19.2023 Robin called back regarding the false gender on his present account.
This has not been fully addressed, since some we have been short staffed, due to multiple simultaneous illnesses.
I brought Cari in on the call to and she apologetically explained the situation to Robin, and that he is not set aside. His concern is on the forefront, but we are waiting on our specialists to get back to the office.
We offered him a timeline: We send this to admin next wednesday. Should he still not see the change on CirrusMD by the first of February, to call us back so we can escalate the matter. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-19 17:35:13', '2023-01-19 17:35:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111974042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111949002', 'Jay Andre', NULL, '01.19.2023 Jay called asking about chiropractic visits and how they are covered. I explained to Jay that chiro visits are covered/discounted in two ways: either being part of large medical need with a treatment plan approved by Zion, OR through the WHLC discounted program.
Although Jay has not had his welcome call yet and his plan does not begin till 2/1, I walked him through the WHLC website and he registered (was not cognizant of the reasons why we don''t do educational calls prior to the beginning of the plan or before the welcome call).
He saw that CA is not supportive/offering practitioner discounts. I asked Cari, and she confirmed it, and that she learned that about 3 days ago.
I sent Jay the initial welcome call email so he can register for it in February before we get booked up. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-19 16:42:39', '2023-01-19 16:42:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111893062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058247082', 'Anne-Marie Marron', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2739 Question : how do I update my address?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-19 16:18:21', '2023-01-19 16:18:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111973064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108404009', 'Mark Carty', NULL, '1-19-2023:  Re: call w/Nahla above.  Just wanted to clarify in case Mark was confused.  I let him know I did NOT think his DPC memb fee is elig on his HSA.  He called asking specifically if any component would help pay that amt.  It''s that time of year where he''ll be tt his acct anyway, so he''ll verify with them or the HSA comp directly.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-19 16:03:52', '2023-01-19 16:03:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111950044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, 'Spoke to Stephen, he was mad that he got charged for labs, but it was already almost 2 years ago. He spoke directly to Zion, and his premium through them would be $80. less. He would lose the HSA, the MEC, to save $80.. I had him send me his labs for review. He is now thinking about staying.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-19 15:10:53', '2023-01-19 15:10:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111950039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118300', 'Rick Papaleo', NULL, 'Considering cancellation, after speaking with him, he''s going to think about what I said, and hold off for right now. I emailed him the cxl anyway.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-19 15:07:39', '2023-01-19 15:07:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111970008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118300', 'Rick Papaleo', NULL, 'Spoke to client about possible cancellation....tried to determine the reason and could not get an acceptable answer....provided information to Jeff Burnsteen about reversing his concellation.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2023-01-19 14:52:32', '2023-01-19 14:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111974037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899178', 'Daniel Klein', NULL, '01.19.2023 Daniel called to change his banking information with us. I guided him to our member portal page to the update forms. 
