  ('zcrm_1579374000111974024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109664001', 'Rebecca Meighan', NULL, '01.19.2023 Rebecca called to get help with logging into her MPB portal. I walked her through the MPB site to get to the signage page and gave her the log-in information. She was able to access it no problem. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-19 13:49:29', '2023-01-19 13:49:29'),
