  ('zcrm_1579374000111973029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789002', 'Martin Smith', NULL, '1-19-2023:  Martin was told in his ''Welcome Call'' to let us know if he hadn''t (in his words) "rec''d his ins card yet".  So, we went over a bit of education.  He understood how to present, but thought he''d have an id card.  We disc, most often, Zion no longer sends out cards because it was causing issues when people presented them like an "ins" card.  He was good with that.
     - I was also able to let him know the MPB.Health cards were a bit behind for Jan due to the qty of new memb w/Open Enrollment.  He will call us back if he doesn''t have that card by the end of the month so we can send a new one.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-19 13:26:06', '2023-01-19 13:26:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976002', 'James Stinson', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 13:23:08', '2023-01-19 13:23:08'),
