  ('zcrm_1579374000111973024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, '1-19-2023:  Stephen called to "I think I want to cancel".  I trans him to Jeffrey Bursteen''s line, but he will call us back if no asstance by noon Central time tomorrow since the deadline is tomorrow!  Told him Jeffrey''s really good at getting back to people, but that''s his backup plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-19 13:09:07', '2023-01-19 13:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111974019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105619002', 'James Paulus', NULL, '01.19.2023 Laura called to get a prescription quote filled. I sent her the link from our MPB.Health site and walked her through the steps to reaching it on her own, if she needs to in the future, for other components.
When we pulled up the form together, it seemed as though Laura thought we could see her actual prescription, because she did not have it in front of her to fill out the RX form on Cognito, but kept telling she doesn''t have  the information to complete it. 
I shared with her that CIrrusMD would have sent it to the email of the user who called in the session (to James'' email). Then we go into the conversation of who''s email was used in order to sign James up.
I called Cari in for a bit of reinforcement on what I was trying to explain to Laura, and as I was speaking to Cari, I lost Laura.
I called Laura back, while Cari was still on line with me, and left her a VM. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-19 12:53:41', '2023-01-19 12:53:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111973011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093783010', 'Alyssa Beris', NULL, '1-19-2023:  Alyssa called.  She was struggling with the information Rosana sent on the 6th & asked for guidance.  We went together to the MAP site thru the MPB.Health website & she was thrilled it was so easy.  (Prob just having someone hold her hand.)  She''d been trying to register, so I was able to help her with the ''Access Code'' instead, walked her thru what''s on the site w/guidance to the 1-800# & new form for srvcs.  She''s going to call to get names for the counseling srvcs.  She''s in OH, so I went over the req''d pattern of visits, etc.  She appreciated the extra help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-19 12:46:49', '2023-01-19 12:52:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933226', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086614014', 'Fernando Ortega', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation citing how terrible healthcare is in this country.  They will be moving.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 12:43:14', '2023-01-19 12:43:14'),
