  ('zcrm_1579374000111933216', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096022', 'Aleesha Nichols', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation citing issues with the Preventative her provider pushed back on working with Planstin on the RBP model so she cancelling.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 12:18:19', '2023-01-19 12:18:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111974013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110468002', 'Emma Mallon', NULL, '01.19.2023 Emma called to get assistance with logging into M&S EAP program to make an appointment with a therapist. I brought Cari in and she backtracked Emma a bit to log-in from the MPB.Health site instead of the link shared in the presently generated Post Welcome Call (which seems misleading and confusing):
MPB.Health > Hover over Mbmr Port > click on mbmr port
Clicked on Mental Health & LifeCare > Sign-in > THEN enter the code MAP.
Cari guided her to call the 800# ontop to receive more detailed guidance on any of the components and how to introduce herself (as being an MPB member). 
Cari also walked her through how deep and detailed the large square icons go in offering information on the topics. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-19 11:57:26', '2023-01-19 11:58:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111974008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108404009', 'Mark Carty', NULL, '01.19.2023 Mark called asking if his DPC membership fee is covered under Planstin. At first I got confused as to why he''s using DPC and Secure together. They learned he is paying for  DPC outside of his MPB plan.
