  ('zcrm_1579374000111950029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086614014', 'Fernando Ortega', NULL, 'I spoke to Fernando, he said his wife was taking care of this and suggested cancelling. He said they are getting another plan. I asked if he has the details of the other plan, he said no. I asked him to call me back with his wife on the line to do a side by side comparison.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-19 11:22:57', '2023-01-19 11:22:57'),
