  ('zcrm_1579374000111973003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, '1-19-2023:  Hillary & I called Zion & tt her Zion ''needs'' proc Kimberly.  We discussed that her updated bill from her appt on 1/9/2023 (showing the zero balance) will be a bit longer because the office''s billing gal is still out sick.  However, Hillary conf for Kimberly, they will adjust the invoice to show the zero balance her receipt shows since they gave her the 30% disc for paying at the time of service.
     - Hillary pd the balance of her IUA w/Kimberly in the call.  I stepped out for a bit for them to process that.  Her IUA sb pd in full now.
     - Since IUA pymt proc succ.  Kimberly sending notice to ''med advocacy'' team & they will either provide virtual pre-pd cc or will pay directly (Kimberly sent Hillary a follow-up e-mail).  When using the digital pre-pd cc, Kimberly said you can use your name & address w/Zion''s zip = 84770.  That made Hillary a little nervous, so we decided she''ll use her name & Zion''s address off their website that includes that zip: 1506 S SILICON WAY SUITE 2C
ST. GEORGE, UT 84770
     - Hillary will get itemized stmt after the process & submit to Zion as part of her ''medical need''.  If their''s a difference since it''s just an ''estimate'', Hillary knows to contact the Advocacy Team = (888) 399-0017 to adjust the amt pd.  Send itemized stmt via e-mail w/sub line:  " Hillary Harris: breast biopsy ''medical need'' ".  Kimberly = Ext 223 (Kimberly wks on comp srvcs, up & coming = advocacy team).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-19 10:57:43', '2023-01-20 01:08:16');
