  ('zcrm_1579374000111972003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '1-19-22 Talked with John T and we MIGHT possibly have a hospital bill eraser program by March that can possibly help Joy in her situation as well. If she makes less than $130K or 400% of poverty level then she may qualify.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-19 10:43:47', '2023-01-19 10:43:47'),
