  ('zcrm_1579374000111969032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110449002', 'Jill Fitzgerald', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-19 10:01:22', '2023-01-19 10:01:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110882002', 'Marc Swiatek', NULL, 'Member cited some health issues as reason for having to cancel prior to start.  Jeffrey spoke to member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 09:56:24', '2023-01-19 09:56:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111950024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110882002', 'Marc Swiatek', NULL, 'I spoke to Jen, they have a medical issue and want to go through their current insurance. This doesn''t fit the bill for them. Justin probably never asked about pre-existings. I emailed CXL form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-19 09:48:08', '2023-01-19 09:48:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111969024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109410009', 'Craig Schkade', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-19 09:13:48', '2023-01-19 09:13:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899138', 'Andrew Eisenberg', NULL, 'Andrew called regarding immunizations: DTap and MMR. Both show that they are covered under preventative care and I stated that to Andrew. He insists that he needs to call Planstin to verify that they will pay for these immunizations even though I stated differently. He chose not to use one of the two providers I found in his area and will be going to the community health center. I advised Andrew that he would not be reimbursed by Planstin if he decided to go out of network and he didn''t seem too concerned. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-19 09:11:47', '2023-01-19 09:11:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111954017', 'Christopher Aragon', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 09:02:59', '2023-01-19 09:02:59'),
