  ('zcrm_1579374000111933171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', 'Previous Membership 8/1/2020-1/31/2023', 'Connected Wkst Bridge', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 08:53:38', '2023-01-19 08:53:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109674015', 'Katherine Morgan', NULL, 'Katherine called back in regarding adding her newborn to her plan; the issue she was curios about was not having the newborns SS#. I advised Katherine to go ahead and put 000-00-0000 in for the SS# and to update us once she has the actual number. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-19 08:52:15', '2023-01-19 08:52:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 08:44:54', '2023-01-19 08:44:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111969015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106407002', 'Maria Faria', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-19 08:44:53', '2023-01-19 08:44:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933136', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111977009', 'Roseann Hummel', NULL, 'I spoke to Roseann last night, She call me back after having gotten two of my voicemails. I explained our plans and how they work. She said her husband no longer gets offered healthcare benefits where he works and is looking for a plan for them. She has a genetic mutation which has no symptoms or diagnosis of illness. Therefore after reffering to zions clause on Genetic Mutations, it looks like she will not have the preexisting clause apply to that, which I''m sure relieved her. She wants to get care plus potentially and then switch over to SECURE for the HSA benefits, but will need to start an llc or some type of self employment. She will decide by friday for february coverage.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2023-01-19 08:32:17', '2023-01-19 08:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111969008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110468002', 'Emma Mallon', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-19 08:25:29', '2023-01-19 08:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110883001', 'Veronica Gomes', NULL, 'Member cancelled plan prior to starting as she had 2nd thoughts .  Per Zac family member talked her out of this.  Going on the marketplace.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 07:48:18', '2023-01-19 07:48:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110495002', 'Darin Zogopoulos', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Updated address as well. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-19 07:47:12', '2023-01-19 09:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078716002', 'Jack Sevison', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Leslie.  He now has coverage thru wife''s employer.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 07:36:04', '2023-01-19 07:36:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679122', 'Marty Kirby', NULL, 'I received email from Sedera advising that advisor Sammi Bessert will be taking this member direct to Sedera. I responded to Sedera that this was ok and I let Wendy know. No need to transition this member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 07:33:36', '2023-01-19 07:33:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111916147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111964061', 'Joanna Prisiajniouk', 'Vetted Agent', 'Interested in offering our Products to her clientele.  Is very familiar with healthsharing.  Had reviewed our products prior to phone call.  Is ready to get started with training process.
Sent out Getting started email.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-01-19 07:13:06', '2023-01-19 07:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111933106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108734002', 'Amy Winsand', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-19 07:11:53', '2023-01-19 07:11:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108423002', 'Varesh Patel', NULL, 'Dr. Patel called because he was confused as to why the cards did not have his children''s names on them. I explained that they only have the primary member''s name on the cards. We also discussed doing a welcome call and I sent him the scheduler via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-19 07:11:33', '2023-01-19 07:11:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111958060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, '1-18-2023:  Kelly is going to find out if in prev yrs the doc has rated/coded her mamm as high risk since they''ve been paying.  Or, maybe they miscoded it.  She will investigate w/the doc''s office &amp; Planstin &amp; will let us know if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-19 04:02:17', '2023-01-19 04:02:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111958046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105619010', 'Emmalynn Ibrahim', NULL, '1-18-2023:  Emmalynn called needing an RX quote.  Here''s what I sent her:
     - Valacyclovir 1gm, #30 tabs = $20.30 at Publix on RxGo.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-19 03:48:31', '2023-01-19 03:48:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111958040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108946002', 'Charles Warner', NULL, '1-18-2023:  Charles called.  He just got off his', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-18 21:46:08', '2023-01-19 03:45:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111901036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109018002', 'Cathie Kovacs', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2736 Question : Can’t register for MAP because a company name is required and it doesn’t like any I put. Please advise', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-18 19:49:32', '2023-01-18 19:49:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111954002', 'Daniel Soto', NULL, '1-18-23 His gmail account keeps bouncing back. I just tried his GATech.edu instead.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 17:10:09', '2023-01-18 17:10:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165360', 'Connie Mansour', NULL, '1-18-23 Connie called bc Friday is still showing the full price to pay to them. I told her to call C4 tomorrow when lines aren''t tied up with final enrollment folks. She will find out if/when they sent the latest file to Friday on her behalf.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 16:49:47', '2023-01-18 16:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111958026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331068', 'Brian Guarneros', NULL, '1-18-2023:  Brian has been having issues w/his shoulder & knee.  Downtown Healthcare = spec in regenerative medicine.  I let him know this is outside their normal scope.  He can try to sub it as a ''Alternative Medical Need'', but I would include:  all his paid bills towards his 1k IUA (doc visit, x-rays, etc), AND a treatment plan from them showing exactly what will happen & how much it will cost.  Include a cover letter w: Success rates (ie: shoulder surg = 40% succ, their treatment = 90%; knee, same type of examples), that he''s seeing it as money saving because these treatments are far less expensive than the surgeries he''ll require, less invasive, etc.
     - He will call when he''s ready to sub this ''alt med need'' req.  Told him sometimes, we will appeal their decisions, so no there is no guarantee, we can just try.
     - He knows there is a 6 mo deadline for sub of expenses to incl them, but thinks he''ll have everything way sooner than that.

His info reg these treatments:  As we get old, we lose stem cells & that''s what our bodies use to repair dmg, so PRP (Blood spinning to localize the stem cells in the area that needs repair).  Connects to your body to understand it repairs in that area.  > succ for older people because younger people have not lost the same # of stem cells.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-18 16:43:56', '2023-01-18 17:41:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086614014', 'Fernando Ortega', NULL, '01.18.2023 Zahira called to get guidance on maternity need with Zion. Zahira found out yesterday that she is 4 weeks pregnant. She is traveling to Spain, and her due date will fall during the time she is there. She wanted to get learn how to proceed from now and when she is there.
I consulted with Cari via teams, she told me to tell Zahira that only Zion can guide her on being out of the country and giving birth.
I shared that with Zahira and offered her Zion''s number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-18 15:37:30', '2023-01-18 15:37:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496019', 'Bruce Schanstra', NULL, '01.18.2023 Bruce called concerned about finishing a college form on line that is asking for insurance, but not recognizing what he inputs.
I consulted with both Cari and Jen via teams. Most university clinics are not in network in order to accept Planstin. Jen asked to attain the doctors'' names in order to look them up and see if they are in network. And  she also suggested that Bruce contact both Planstin and Zion to attain a proof of insurance to submit to the university.
I called Bruce back, but he was driving. He said he will try us back either this evening or tomorrow morning. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-18 15:23:41', '2023-01-18 15:33:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, '1-18-23 She is re-enrolling in CARE+ since different membership from MPB CareZ Worksite Bridge. Her original start date with Zion is 8/1/2020! I''ll send a note to Patti to make note of that. Also her DOB is in Feb. when she turns 50. Price is showing as younger price.  I will have her cancel her MPB CareZ now as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 15:22:55', '2023-01-18 15:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Joy called in regarding Wendy''s note below. I will be looking into Care Connect to assist with this issue. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-18 14:25:10', '2023-01-18 14:25:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111958021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111697002', 'Prasad Salunkhe', NULL, '1-18-2023:  Haritha called asking about the dental & vision on thier plan.  I went over no prev dent or vision, disc dent available on the disc component after their eff date 2/1/23; or they can tt their advisor to see if they offer a true dent & vision policy.  She seemed to understand, but there is definitely a language barrier.  When we got done, I think she was clear.
     - When Planstin has been sending out the new member cards, they curr have the Dent & Vision ads on the back, but it did not seem like that was what she was seeing, she told me no I''m not seeing that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-18 14:24:42', '2023-01-18 14:24:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111916142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111952027', 'Mike Stocke', NULL, 'This company provides HSA, FSA, HRA, ICHRA, and Cobra. Located in Wisconsin, 75 employees. Looking to possibly establish a business relationship with us. I discussed this with Michele, and  she will  speak with him. We will first present this to John Troutman.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-01-18 13:54:15', '2023-01-18 13:54:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111916137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111923312', 'Matthew Joppich', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-18 13:50:27', '2023-01-18 13:50:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111916132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-18 13:43:18', '2023-01-18 13:43:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111916127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153628', 'Mojisola Collins', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-18 13:27:49', '2023-01-18 13:27:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111923312', 'Matthew Joppich', NULL, '1-18-23 Matt is enrolling now on phone and in a slow area for service. Choosing SECURE EC $1000/$625.  Matt couldn''t get past the final page. It kept telling him that the system needed his signature even though he signed it about 5 times. I found the enrollment in Admin123 and called Patti. She could see everything she needed to manually input the missing billing info into Admin123 and she will bill him the $125 when she completes the process. He should be all set now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 13:21:04', '2023-01-18 13:39:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111958016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, '1-18-2023:  William called.  He isn''t receiving his invoices in time ea month to pay them.  It sounds like we are billing him?  He says it''s not an automated pymt ea mo.  Told him I haven''t run into this before.  Trans him to Patti''s line & he will LM since she''s out sick.  He thinks it''s becuase they are mailing things to his physical add, instead of his mailing add/PO Box).  His mailing address is listed in the CRM & Admin123 accurately: PO box 431, Kelseyville.  Sent backup Teams chat to Patti as well.     - CA

Posting this here, because I documented in both Jonathan & Carly''s files & thought I should notate it here as well but Patti beat me, so I wanted this in the proper order:

2-8-2023: William Vanderwall has three memberships he''s paying for = Jonathan & Carly''s dad.  William called to cancel Jonathon & Carly''s healthcare (leaving his w/his other child''s membership alone), because Jonathan & Carly both have other coverage now.  Due to Jonathon being an adult (even though William is paying) and Carly being on a separate contract at 17-yrs of age, I trans William to Patti''s line.  He will LM if she''s gone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-18 13:13:51', '2023-02-08 18:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '01.18.2023 Kristen called to understand how to proceed with getting a mamm. and colonoscopy done, per her doctor''s request. She had an annual in the fall.
She wants to know if they are covered. I shared Healthcare.gov link via CRM email. She shared that she has not done either of the above procedures.
**I got Cari on the phone to go over her RX quotes, due to missing or misunderstood information. We got the right information from her and I will search the quotes.**
Kristen shared her daughter failed her hearing test in HS. They checked with ENT doctor and found fluid behind her eardrum (hence the antibiotics), possible infection. A surgery could be involved but they don''t know yet, till they heal the infection.
Cari address how much they have paid so far, to connect to the IUA. Kristen shared a few itemized bills. She needs to call and learn more about her bill. Has an ENT follow up coming up. Initial hearing test was in 10/2022. Beginning December will be her initial visit for her Medical Need, due to her audiology appointment. 
Kristen will call to get guidance to open a medical need. Cari guided her to collect her itemized bills, and to present herself as a cash-pay patient (AND NOT self-pay). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-18 13:06:09', '2023-01-18 13:40:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', NULL, '1-18-23 Enrolled in SECURE $1000/$625 with Phil on phone and included 2 kids. He knows about Welcome Call and to have both of the on the call and the Quick Ref Guide to print and save. He should be good to go for Feb. 1st, 2023 start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 13:01:09', '2023-01-18 13:01:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111916119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking w/Jeffrey.  I will cancel. Will now have employer Coverage', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-18 12:42:57', '2023-01-18 12:46:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111950019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, 'Lana was transferred to me by Cari. She is getting employer benefits at no cost to her. I sent CXL form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-18 12:38:40', '2023-01-18 12:38:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '1-18-23 Joy now understands she moved from Sedera to Zion Aug. 1st of 2020. She had immediate sharing up to $25K, year one, $25K year 2 and $50K year 3 which she''s in right now. If she can make it to Aug. 2023 she will have up to $125K. But, for now she needs a heart catheter exam that Boulder Community is quoting $15K. She Might need open heart surgery to repair the valve which is likely very expensive.  She had an Echo in 11/2017, but had it checked again in 2020 and 2022. She has a bicuspid heart valve and heart murmur. So, Zion is considering the valve problem pre-z and will share up to $50K. Nextera hasn''t been super helpful, they just sent her to Boulder Heart in BCH. I suggested she call MPB Concierge Team for assistance with the highest quality care at the best price. She will do that. I gave her the #. BCH also mentioned some program they have for self-pay patients to help bring the cost down which she will look into. I mentioned the Special Needs fund as well that she might get assistance from that. She was calm and doing her best to do her homework before getting too upset about it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 12:36:11', '2023-01-18 12:41:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111958008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, '1-18-2023:  Lana called.  Both she & her daughter have employer provided health ins now, so she wanted to cancel.  She''s a friend of Jane Kassel''s so she''ll make sure Jane knows & is aware of the cancellation.  Since it''s already the 18th (& they are cancelling due to employer prov ins), I trans her to Jeffrey Bursteen''s line to get help w/the req''d cancellation form (she''ll LM if she doesn''t catch him).  Also sent him a Teams chat as a backup & let her know if for some reason she hasn''t been able to connect w/Jeffrey by tomorrow afternoon to please call back so we can be of further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-18 12:35:35', '2023-01-18 12:38:17'),
