  ('zcrm_1579374000111958003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077689037', 'Dale Wondisford', NULL, '1-18-2023:  Dale called - he wanted to change his banking info.  I walked him to the update form &amp; he completed it while we were on the line together.  I can see the cognito form was rec''d.  He wanted to make sure he beat this month''s payment deadline.  Since it''s the 18th, I assured him he should be fine.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-18 12:03:57', '2023-01-18 12:03:57'),
