  ('zcrm_1579374000111912079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119002', 'Azeem Tajani', NULL, '01.18.2023 Azeem called regarding the Referenced Based Pricing (RBP) with Planstin.
He had just finished speaking to Karen Torsoe, who mentioned it to him. He was contemplating to switch to a PPO platform for his and his family''s needs, but she mentioned RBP and he gave us a call for more clarification.
I explained the process of having RBP instead of PHCS: Conduct the appointment to bring the doctor''s office on board and willing to contact Planstin for collaboration on pricing and billing, at the same time as he''s making the appointment (how I''ve been explaining it to members). 
He asked if he can have the new card sent to him. I called Planstin to confirm that, and they are sending them automatically by February.
I called Azeem back and left him a VM, repeating the above from my conversation with Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-18 11:59:52', '2023-01-18 11:59:52'),
