  ('zcrm_1579374000111912044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111954002', 'Daniel Soto', NULL, '1-13-23 Daniel is 25 yrs old and working for a start-up. He takes Adderall XR 30mg and Prozac 40mg. I looked it up on GoodRX and told him the price range which he was ok with. But, Concierge can hopefully get even better prices. He wants a Feb. 1st start date with CARE+. I explained Life Care and Virtual Healthcare in relation to his mental health needs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 11:11:19', '2023-01-18 11:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112994002', 'Carol VerMeer', NULL, '1-18-22 Carol is 53 and husband 54. He will be leaving his W2 job Feb. 3rd and moving over to work for their family business moving forward. They need C4 or MCS for March 1st. She knows of Zion from her friend in bootcamp class. I need to find out who that is. I will send her the video next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-18 11:00:46', '2023-01-18 11:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058875042', 'Denzel Rodriguez', NULL, 'Denzel called in because he needed new MPB/Planstin cards and inquired about dermatology. I let Denzel know that dermatology is not in the preventative care realm and that is when he would lean on Zion for anything about his IUA. He also had an ECG done during his physical and wanted to know how he gets that paid. I let him know that the ECG is something he would have to pay out of pocket for since it is not included in the preventative care services. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-18 10:48:00', '2023-01-18 10:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111932028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-18 10:40:52', '2023-01-18 10:40:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111912026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, '01.18.2023 Kelly talked to RCI - Per Cari''s request.
Kelly had a mamm. each year for 5 years and was covered. However this time around, RCI did not cover it this year, because healthcare.gov recommends it every two years. 
I consulted with Cari via teams, and brought her in on the call for more education for Kelly.
Cari shared the guidelines from Healthcare.GOV, confirming the 2 year timeline, and suggested that Kelly speaks with her doctor again to reconsider coding (high-risk vs. other...etc). OR call and speak to RCI and explain the miscommunication of coding possibility and see if that can shed light on a mistake.
Kelly shared they put two codes on there. She asked if HealthCare is a new component. Cari explained it is derived and parallels the MEC base of coverage (Obama Care). 
I sent Kelly an email with the Healthcare.gov link in it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-18 10:37:18', '2023-01-18 11:16:11'),
