  ('zcrm_1579374000111912003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165343', 'Renee Athay', NULL, '1.18.23 - I have been attempting to reach Renee for several weeks regarding her 7 biopsies and how she should submit these to Zion. I left several messages letting Renee know that all she needs to do is call the Zion member services line and they would be happy to assist her in submitting these items correctly. I don''t believe these will be shared since I, from what I gathered from both Wendy and Renee, these biopsies were done over 6 months ago. I will wait for Renee to call me today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-18 07:02:47', '2023-01-18 07:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111846056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109674015', 'Katherine Morgan', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 2733 Question : Hi there! Looking to chat with someone about adding my newborn daughter to my plan. Thank you! -Katie

