  ('zcrm_1579374000111823106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Heidi called re: her annual appt &amp; getting it on her Planstin - we disc must stay prev.  Curr can us her PHCS ntwk doc by presenting that card, will chg when she rec''s new card.  She''s concerned because she doesn''t think her doc will work w/Planstin when it''s no ntwk &amp; that''s why she chose this plan, because he accespts PHCS.  Asked about mammogram, thinks she''ll wait for no ntwk.  Will call us if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 20:36:44', '2023-01-17 20:36:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Angela called about a test she has every few years, but it costs thousands of dollars.  She felt like Planstin has said they will pay some of it in the past.  I let her know the best place to get conf/denial is by calling Planstin directly.  Made sure she has their ph # &amp; trans her there.  She''ll call back if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 20:03:39', '2023-01-17 20:03:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108211002', 'Karen Sachs', NULL, '01.17.2023 Karen called about an email link for CirrusMD sent to her two weeks ago, but expired.
I resent her that invitation, and she was able to accept it.
Then I consulted with Cari, if I can send her the initial welcome call email reservation. 
I sent Karen the email, and she was happy to set up the call.
She asked, if she is still covered before she can get the welcome call completed, and I said yes. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 17:42:23', '2023-01-17 17:42:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '01.17.2023 Timothy requested an RX quote for Sildenafil, 100mg, 30tablets, preferably at Safeway Pharm.
