  ('zcrm_1579374000111868036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, '1-17-23 Since the price just went from $436 to $561 she chose to move to CARE+ $2500/$445 to keep the membership fee down. She will pay cash for her wellness visits and doesn''t need a colonoscopy quite yet. She will also look at Spot for her 19 year old son who snowboards and could hurt himself at any time. I can''t get a quote any longer without creating an account with Spot. She will look into that to protect him. She completed the Change Form online and did so for Feb. 1st effective date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-17 16:42:27', '2023-01-17 16:42:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096022', 'Aleesha Nichols', NULL, '1-17-2023:  ILM for Aleesha re: no ntwk req on Planstin.  If the e-mail she rec''d letting her know Planstin is no longer req PHCS ntwk prov has the new pdf Planstin cards attached - present the new pdf card to the doc''s off when you make the appt &amp; ask them to plez call Planstin (made sure she has their #) to see if they accept her "insurance".  They were resisting, so my thought was this would allow Planstin to get them to buy in.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 16:30:03', '2023-01-17 19:52:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693017', 'Deirdre Bingman', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Deirdre called - I walked her thru getting to &amp; common mistakes on updating her bank acct info to a new bank acct.  She was working on it as we got off the phone &amp; knows to hit submit (not save).     - CA

I can see she submitted the form.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 16:20:00', '2023-01-17 16:21:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111868031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050550098', 'Sarah Price', NULL, '1-17-23 Sarah had an outstanding wellness visit bill that she was being threatened with collections. So, I reached out to the CSA Team with Redirect twice and finally got a response from Mike Bechtol letting me know it was paid today. Sarah was notified and is all set. Yay!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-17 15:53:47', '2023-01-17 15:53:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105466010', 'Anna Marie Somera', NULL, '01.17.2023Anna Marie called to understand how to make an appointment with her PCP, and to get clarification on the newsletter that went out today, sharing the no need to search through the PHCS network to visit the doctor.
I guided her through: calling the doctor of her liking, saying this apt is purely preventative, explained why that''s important and shared an incident about another member that went wrong in that area, ask the office to collaborate pricing and billing with Planstin.
She asked how to convince or get the doctor to want to do the collaboration, I consulted Cari on it and the response was that it''s up to the doctor''s discretion. 
She then asked if there''s a way to find a doctor in her area, and I then guided her to HCBB and coached her on how to use it to find a high quality low cost PCP and more. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 15:52:20', '2023-01-17 15:52:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111868026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122049065', 'KC Steury', NULL, '1-17-22 Confirmed with Aspen an ERC Specialist and Wade also proving they have paid in full via direct pay on Dec. 29, 2022. They are all set and now awaiting funding from the IRS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-17 15:46:33', '2023-01-17 15:46:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Mary called.  Her total bills for her finger are around $1700.  Sent her the temp for sub a ''med need'' to Zion &amp; went over details on how to do it &amp; what to expect.  She knows she''s resp for the 1k IUA (she''s already pd ~$700 of it).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 15:31:54', '2023-01-17 20:07:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107629002', 'Bryan McCay', NULL, '01.17.2023 needs guidance on getting vaccines for travel purposes to Laos. Where to go? Is it covered? Do we have a prescription program that covers it? 
I needed to call him back when Cari became available.
After consulting with Cari, I learned and shared with Bryan that vaccines for travel are probably outside the scope of the MEC plan and are not part of the healthshare program, and to have him call Planstin, because immunizations can often be combined & it can be difficult to make sure they are on the list. 
I urged Bryan to call us back, if he has questions after talking w/Planstin. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 15:00:51', '2023-01-17 16:09:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093928002', 'John Stagge', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Angela &amp; John called re: CirrusMD.  John needs to call re: back pain.  Their accounts are mislinked, so: since he needs to call right now, he''s going to call knowing we will send a support ticket in the next day or so to correct how their accounts are setup.  They are fine if I send the supp tckt in the next day or so since we are short handed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 14:36:27', '2023-01-17 20:40:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111868021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', NULL, '1-17-23 Will talk again tomorrow for final decision. Husband is still a little leery.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-17 14:16:07', '2023-01-17 14:16:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808040', 'Thomas DeAngelis', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Thom called.  He didn''t receive the list &amp; pricing Jennifer sent on the 16th.  Since she''s out sick, I walked him thru utilizing HCBB.  He appreciated the time &amp; effort, allowing him to find a female doc for his wife.  They think she needs an orthopedic doctor.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 14:15:07', '2023-01-19 03:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111801086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111873002', 'Gregory Cox', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-17 14:05:12', '2023-01-17 14:05:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105287002', 'Isaac Griffin', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Hope called, she never rec''d the information on setting up her CirrusMD.  Because I found out that Hope''s e-mail is what was listed on the application & linked to Isaac, & what Isaac used to setup his CirrusMD acct, I realized why she hadn''t rec''d the invite from earlier.  She said they share e-mail addresses, so I was able to send her an invite using Isaac''s e-mail for her account.  She knows they need to remember they''ve swapped e-mail addresses for CirrusMD, but was fine & did not want me to submit a correction.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 13:53:43', '2023-01-19 03:53:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111868013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176160', 'Kari Mitchell', NULL, '1-17-23 I called Kari bc her plan with Friday is showing as not paid for, ie. not effectuated yet. She''s chosen a plan with Stephen Klein instead. So, I clicked to cancel her Friday plan but it still shows up in her Plans on C4. I told her to login and review it and to contact Friday Health directly to cancel the plan and payment they are waiting for. She will do so. She''s in the airport right now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-17 13:44:58', '2023-01-17 13:45:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, 'Jared emailed me asking me to call him. I spoke with him and he was not happy. He wants control regarding cancellations if an employee leaves or gets terminated. I explained it is handled individually, that I explained the same to Tracy. I toldd both of them, to let me know in a timely fashion the status of an employee, and I will handle the rest, just as I did with Jace Olsen. He also thought vision and dental was included, as that is what Leo eluded to in an email. Leo stated, "dental and vision discounts are included in the plan". Jared forwarded me the email where that was stated. I explained all in detail, he is now very happy and will continue to stay with us. I told him to contact me directly with any issues moving forward, and provided my direct contact info.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-17 13:42:50', '2023-01-17 13:42:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111868008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '1-17-23 Friday is showing they haven''t paid their first month''s premium yet! Left vm for Dan and Rachel just now and will email Rachel too.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-17 13:32:03', '2023-01-17 13:32:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820256', 'Lori Mower', NULL, '01.17.2023 Lori''s advisor Misty Berryman called on Lori''s behalf, regarding a preventative billing issue with Lori''s preventative visit at her doctor''s office.
Misty shares that Lori''s doctor''s office billed with the wrong coding from preventative to new establishment instead. Thus rendering Planstin to decline the payment on the bill.
Lori appears to feel lied to by her advisor and MPB, when in fact her feelings should be aimed at her doctor''s office, which is what Misty coached her with before speaking with us. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 13:27:39', '2023-01-17 13:54:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005277005', 'Alice Lee', NULL, '01.17.2023 Alice called to see how to log-in into her MPB Portal. She wants to know more about the referral program in WHLC. 
I referred to Cari on this, and Cari addressed WHLC as a discount only site.
In the past I remember hearing one can refer a practitioner to the WHLC discount site. I needed to learn about this and call Alice back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 13:08:18', '2023-01-17 13:08:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104633018', 'Robin Lacrimosa', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Robin called.  Their business was told they have a 60-day waiting period to use their preventative care on mamm &amp; colonoscopies.  I let her know w/this particular plan, there is no waiting period.  Right now she''s just planning to see her reg doc, but will call when she''s int in getting instructions for the other care.  Her entire office is getting this benefit, so she was thrilled to hear for her (at least) these srvcs are already available.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 12:53:10', '2023-01-19 03:57:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000072096022', 'Aleesha Nichols', NULL, '01.17.2023 Aleesha called regarding an email she received stating Planstin will no longer be working through the PHCS network. Asked "does that mean one can see any doctor they like, and how does that process?"
I told her, yes to being able to visit with any doctor/provider she would like, AS LONG AS the office is willing to not only collaborate pricing with Planstin, but also process the billing directly to them as well.
Aleesha said, she had just finished talking to her traditional insurance provider due to the cumbersome process her doctor is showing difficulty in wanting to participate.
I had consulted with Cari on a lot of the above details, but I offered Aleesha a call back from cari and I (since cari was with another member), so that Cari can be more detailed in the process.
Aleesha accepted to hear back from us, but it looks like she''s already has her mind made up on switching to traditional insurance.NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 12:40:23', '2023-01-17 12:40:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, '01.17.2023 Mendy called trying to understand why the Dental office is not finding her insurance in the system.
I shared with Mendy, that Dental and Vision is separate, and I confirmed it again with Cari via teams.
Cari asked to be part of the call, because she just had finished a call regarding the same topic.
 I brought Cari in, and she explained to Mendy: no dental/vision (that''s extra cost), independent advisors may sell from different places more components, that planstin card send cards with information on it (such as OptumRX) as adverstisement, and that MPB has asked that they not do that.
I gave Mendy Michael''s number, which she already had, and directly transferred her to him NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 12:18:20', '2023-01-17 12:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111801081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, 'Per Jeffrey''s note below I will process cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-17 12:17:48', '2023-01-17 12:17:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, 'Matt called me back. He got better coverage at a better price through his wife''s employer. I sent him the CXL form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-17 12:07:31', '2023-01-17 12:07:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111801076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881016', 'Michael Grace', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy, member submitted cancellation.  He will be going on spouses employee benefits.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-17 12:07:19', '2023-01-17 12:07:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111823031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086707002', 'Linda Pringle', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Linda called asking about her dental &amp; vision on her plan.  I let her know what is incl: cataract surgery after 1 yr waiting period, disc prog = dental prog &amp; laser surg you can get discounts on, but no dental or vision maint on her plan.  I made sure she has Jane Kassel''s ph # &amp; trans her to her office to see if Jane offers something that would work for her.
     - Her VSP is not allowing Costco as an option &amp; that''s about to renew, so she''s looking for something diff.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 12:02:14', '2023-01-17 12:16:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111870001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2730 Question : Hello, I am a MPB Health member and am interested in the site from your newsletter today Choices by WholeHealth Living', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-17 11:37:35', '2023-01-17 11:37:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111801068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887142', 'Jacob Ramsden', NULL, 'Per note below Wendy spoke to member.  I will process cancellation.  I was unable to send Confirmation via CRM.  I will send via Outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-17 11:21:41', '2023-01-17 12:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111868003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111923312', 'Matthew Joppich', NULL, '1-17-22 Matt is still pondering the $1000 vs $2500 IUA. The $1000 is pushing his limit for affordability. He wants to fund the HSA. In 2023 he can fund it up to $7750 + $1000 since he''s over 55. That can negate most of the cost of CARE+ vs SECURE. He''s going to pass on the HMA for now. I think the HSA is enough for him to fund at this time and he likes the tax benefits. He was super apologetic for putting me off one more day. But, he needs more time to run the numbers and sit with it. We will reconnect tomorrow at 1:00 MST to enroll likely in SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-17 11:21:35', '2023-01-17 11:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109410009', 'Craig Schkade', NULL, '01.17.2023 Received a message from Julia looking for someone to help Craig to give him his time and date to his welcome call. I told her I do not have access to viewing the calendar and should contact Jen, Cari (maybe), or Vanessa.
