  ('zcrm_1579374000111823023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '1-17-2023:  Maurine called.  I walked her thru submitting her ''med need'' to Zion (which she uploaded &amp; sub while we were on the phone).  She ended-up in the ER again for this same issue.  I let her know those expenses should go towards this same ''med need'' since it is "issue specific".  She''ll call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-17 10:45:58', '2023-01-17 12:18:42'),
