I sent her CIrrusMD invitation link. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 10:30:46', '2023-01-17 10:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111854006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '01.17.22:  Jim called me.  Said he had an excellent experience with Zion for his Cataract Sx.  He got approved in 4 days and was sent a credit card to pay for the expenses above his IUA.  The only confusion was that Zion told him they would get all the med. info., etc. for him and 2 days later he received an email from them saying they are having difficulty getting the info. they need and he has to get it for them.  He called them and they told  him to ignore that email.  That happened twice and he had to call them twice to confirm Zion would manage this for him.  They paid for all his services and meds. for that need.  He was very impressed and happy with the service.  He said it was easier than dealing w/insurance.  I asked him to write this experience up for us to put in the newsletter, which he agreed to do.  He also suggested we do a 1 - 2 min. video on who to call for what purpose:  Planstin for preventive care, Zion for Sx less than $5000 and MPB/Care Connect for $5000+ Sx and what the process is for each need. He is also sending me the email he got from Zion so I can see what they sent him.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-01-17 10:26:22', '2023-01-17 10:26:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111853003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075520001', 'Scott Totten', NULL, '1.17.2023 Scott called asking if he can use OptumRX.
