I consulted with Cari via teams, but she was with a member, and requested that we call Scott back because it entails a lot of details. I asked Scott if that was ok and he was accepting. 
Called him back  with Cari to coach at 10:37MT, and left a VM.NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-17 10:13:05', '2023-01-17 10:42:37'),
