  ('zcrm_1579374000111768056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109481009', 'Bonnie Fritz', NULL, '1-16-2023:  tt Bonnie, she called in with some of the information for her RX Quote(s), however did not have quantity.  I priced up two sizes that look most common.  This item isn''t listed on many sites, but the two that did list it have prices within ~ $1 of each other.  I tried different variations because of the way these priced, but I think this is accurate:
