  ('zcrm_1579374000111768048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '1-16-2023:  Matt called.  His wife got really good employer provided insurance &amp; he wants to cancel.  Sent him to Jeffrey Bursteen''s line, he''ll LM if he doesn''t catch him &amp; sent a follow-up chat so it doesn''t get lost.  Matt knows he''ll have a legal form to sign &amp; by the 19th is idea.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-16 14:36:33', '2023-01-16 14:41:45'),
