  ('zcrm_1579374000111783116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110556002', 'Darrell Scott', NULL, 'I reached out to Lydia about these 2 enrollments.  Issue was Member enrolled on their own did not speak to any advisor nor did they have a presentation.  they enrolled in Secure and then realized that they did not qualify.  So they re-enrolled in Direct.  I have cancelled original Secure enrollment &amp; corrected Direct enrollment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-16 14:23:25', '2023-01-16 14:23:25'),
