  ('zcrm_1579374000111768038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887142', 'Jacob Ramsden', NULL, '1-16-22 Talked with Jacob. He''s able to get a good subsidy in State of WA since he has properties there and lives there as well as in Aspen. He might claim WA as primary residence. He knows if he cancels now he can''t re-enroll in WA. He can remain or re-enroll if he continues to live in CO. His income is about $30K but he has had to pay $ back in the past. So, he''s pondering his options for another few days before the 20th for pmt. He''s also interested in the HMA which I will send him now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-16 13:40:55', '2023-01-16 13:40:55'),
