  ('zcrm_1579374000111768033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '1-16-2023:  Jennifer called in again - Rite Aid is giving her greif about the RXGo coupon.  This seems to be a theme with them.  They are telling her they cannot honor the coupon & the price on the coupon would basically be for 1 unit, not the 2 quoted.  We reran the quote for 1 unit & it''s $7.51!  I sent her the updated coupon and she is going to call the help line to see if she can get assistance.  I''ve asked her to let us know as we don''t want to continue sending discounted coupons that are not working.  She printed out the coupon in black & white, so said the highlighting hadn''t really been obvious. To date, anytime the pharmacy talks w/RXGo the issues have been resolved, so fingers crossed that''s the case here.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-16 13:24:12', '2023-01-16 13:24:12'),
