  ('zcrm_1579374000111783111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, 'Member aging into Medicare eff 2/1/23 No Cognito', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-16 12:37:33', '2023-01-16 12:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111791008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100606002', 'Matthew Cromey', NULL, '01.16.2023 Matt called inquiring about whether a hearing aid would be covered by the medical cost sharing part of the plan.
I consulted Jen and Cari via teams. I received the following information:
Per Zion Member Guidelines: Audiological treatment to correct hearing loss is shareable.  [So, if part of a larger need & the loss is during his membership.] Also,  Hearing Aids Expenses related to hearing aids are not shareable.
Per Cari, after sending in his audiology testing & diagnostic bills, he should submit hearing aid receipts, without expectations for them to be shared.
I called Matt back for that last piece of information. Matt requested an email sent with the language shared on topic, and I sent him a copy of these notes including Zion''s Member Guidelines. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-16 12:35:11', '2023-01-16 12:48:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111792003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, '1-16-22 I''ve been in communication with Silvina about possibly cancelling and I sent her the instructions on how to do so last week. She has everything she needs. I also left her a vm today to see what she found. Sounds like she''s working with someone else for her new plan. I let her know I''d love to learn what she found that she likes better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-16 12:34:32', '2023-01-16 12:38:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111789028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098616001', 'Jace Olsen', NULL, 'I spoke with Tracy and informed her we need a cancellation form from each member individually. I sent her an email explaining that.
Tracy,

Nice speaking with you this morning. Per our conversation, moving forward, if an employee is either terminated, or leaves voluntarily, they will need to complete a cancellation form. This is done on an individual basis. To avoid billing for a following month, the cancellation must be received by us no later than the 19th of the month. To avoid any delays, or miscommunications, I''ve included my direct contact information. Please reach out to me directly, and I will reach out to the member and walk them through the process. We appreciate your association with us, and look forward to a continued business relationship.

Regards, 

Jeffrey Bursteen
Sales Manager/Director of Member Services 

561-286-3539
salesmanager@mympb.com', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-16 12:33:53', '2023-01-16 12:33:53'),
