  ('zcrm_1579374000111789023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111608002', 'Kevin Hooks', NULL, 'Kevin called in wanting to cancel, his effective date is Feb 1,2023. He currently has a plan with Zion, paying $268.00 per month, and we are at $325. I went over his current plan with them and the one he enrolled in with us. He doesn''t have a MEC, with his current Zion plan, and no HSA. When I did the comparison with him, he agreed it is worth the difference, and decided to stay with us. He also mentioned that he can''t reach Mike Montes. I gave this member my direct contact info, in case he needs any help.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-16 12:29:24', '2023-01-16 12:29:24'),
