  ('zcrm_1579374000111789018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109743011', 'Jared Fisher', NULL, 'Spoke to Tracy on this member, apparently, Jared was to become effective as of Feb 2023, but was billed and became effective 1/1/2023. John K sent an email asking for a signature for the plan change. Bottom line, they were billed for January. After my suggestion, and discussing with Patti and Karina, we will credit them for January, and apply that credit toward February payment. They are happy with that, and it saves this group.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-16 12:23:28', '2023-01-16 12:23:28'),
