  ('zcrm_1579374000111787008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106211002', 'Colin Stroumpis', NULL, 'Chris called regarding Grayson''s nose surgery. We went over how to open the need with Zion and she will reach out if she needs any assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-16 08:35:36', '2023-01-16 08:35:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111787003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004808040', 'Thomas DeAngelis', NULL, 'Thom called because he needed guidance regarding his wife''s knee injury. We went over the self-pay process, opening a need with Zion, and I will be sending him a list of providers from HCBB with fair pricing. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-16 08:34:54', '2023-01-16 08:34:54'),
