  ('zcrm_1579374000111732015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111992001', 'Lars Ensign', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2720 
Question : Hi I am interested in an HSA-compatible healthshare coverage plan for one person (me).  I was on my wife''s employer-based health insurance but that benefit was eliminated.  I am currently on an expensive plan with my employer.  My wife and I already have a jointly-owned HSA.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-15 11:54:11', '2023-01-20 13:06:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111720069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659413', 'Brad Uhlig', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Brad''s ex-wife &amp; the mother of the children on his memb called.  I did not give her any information, but encouraged her to make sure Brad &amp; the kids have their CirrusMD setup so it''s available when they need it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-13 18:19:26', '2023-01-13 18:20:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111720064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Melissa called back while Nahla was on lunch, so I handled the issue w/the derm appt.  Melissa''s very confused.  Here''s how it went &amp; the final plan of action:  
     - Presented: (see my conv w/Melissa on:
     - Discount, doc not honoring...
     - How did Planstin become involved?  
     - She''s going to...', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-13 18:18:36', '2023-01-13 18:18:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111720056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095870002', 'Anthony Lopez', NULL, '1-13-2023:  Anthony called.  There are concerns about thier little one re: nutrition &amp; speech therapy.  He wondered if we could recommend anyone &amp; if there is help financially.
     - I resent his post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail &amp; walked him thru HCBB - did mention for those items there may not be any data, so he may have to ask their doc for referrals instead.  Could ck google reviews as names are coming up to', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-13 18:13:52', '2023-01-13 18:13:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111762053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109781008', 'Lauren Guida', NULL, '01.13.2023 Lauren requested two RX Quotes, preferably from the pharmacy Baileys; Adderall XR 30mg, 30 days AND Adderall 20mg, 30 days.
After a few hours of researching the drugs, I learned that the Bailey''s Pharm is not contracted with any sites. I consulted with Cari, and she shared some drugs are scheduled and scheduled2, and it makes it more challenging for the patient by requiring a hard prescription from the Dr.
I called Lauren and left her a message. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-13 18:06:24', '2023-01-13 18:06:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111701044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012657055', 'Michelle Kinkead', NULL, '1-13-23 Michelle sounds like she found an indemnity plan for short-term for the rest of the month. I explained how those work and the risks involved. She will let me know when she chooses her plan. She will likely go with the Cigna plan I recommended after she browses a little further. She knows of making 100% certain to pay Cigna in 7-10 days or the possibility of getting cancelled. She was super appreciative. She''s all set for now. Also she re-selected me as her Advisor. She wasn''t sure I was still doing this and was happy to talk with me again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-13 16:32:26', '2023-01-13 16:32:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111762039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109000002', 'Ronald Ware', NULL, '01.13.2023 QR code/Vault account is wanting to charge him, when it should be included in his plan.
Vanessa sent him a link (Post Welc. Call Email), he clicked on it, it took him to MyHealth.net, Cari asked about the fulfillment package in order to sign in onto the Vault and QR code. She shared they may have sent the packages on the 10th, and should reach him in a week or so, if they have not received them by the 25th, to call us and let us know.
Cari explained about the cards that will reach him and how to use them or how the QR code is used. She also asked about other platforms set ups: CirrusMD for both, not just Ronald. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-13 16:14:08', '2023-01-13 16:22:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111720044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109000002', 'Ronald Ware', NULL, '1-13-2023:  A call came in from: 678-315-5494 showing Greg Ware.  He could not hear me (&amp; I just got off from tt another member, so I''m not thinking it''s on my end).  I called him back, he answered, but he hung-up because he still could not hear me.  Hopefully, it''s a cell phone dead zone &amp; he''ll try us again from a diff location.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-13 16:13:34', '2023-01-13 16:13:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111762034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106792002', 'Anne Silseth', NULL, '01.13.2023 Anne called back because Molly''s pain was increasing and they are going to the Lakeview Clinic tomorrow, and she wanted to know what to do then. 
I reiterated to make sure to present herself as cash-pay patient, request the discount as such, and collect bills in PDF versions.
Anne asked if they are going ...', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-13 16:12:23', '2023-01-13 16:12:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111701039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887142', 'Jacob Ramsden', NULL, '1-13-22 He acquired ins recently and thinks he wants to cancel MPB. I left him a vm to help him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-13 16:08:11', '2023-01-13 16:08:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111720036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109708344', 'Matthew Koen', NULL, '1-13-2023:', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-13 14:34:39', '2023-01-13 17:59:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111701034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111923312', 'Matthew Joppich', NULL, '1-13-22 Matt is 57 and has two kids, 11 son, soon to be 14 daughter. They are all super healthy, no-pre-x, no meds, no tobacco ever. Justin prefers naturopath and chiro. He doesn''t really do a wellness visit, just sees his naturopath on an as needed basis. He''s interested in funding the HSA and also interested in the HMA. He watched the 9 min video and my interview video. He works for Justin Acker for the last 3 years as an independent contractor, not an an employee. I let him know this membership is different slightly from Justin''s bc it''s the best option now vs what Justin had available to him at the time. He''s cool with that. He is not in a rush to get onto ACA plans by the 15th. So, we will reconnect next Tuesday after he''s reviewed the options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-13 14:29:33', '2023-01-13 14:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111720028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075520001', 'Scott Totten', NULL, '1-13-2023:  Loreen w/Cl Clinic Fin Advocate (?) called on behalf of Scott.  He presented himself pretty well, but is struggling to pay his 1k IUA.  She said right now, it''s not over that amt, so I let her know he''s resp for up to the 1k amt &amp; is ''cash-pay''.  She may be able to work w/him on pymts or something since it''s curr &lt; his 1k IUA?
     - Loreen seemed to completely get it, so I think he''s in good hands.  She will have him call us if he has further questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-13 14:27:09', '2023-01-13 14:27:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, 'Member will be turning 65 in 2/23 I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 14:02:52', '2023-01-13 14:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111701029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111961002', 'Philip Kendzior', NULL, '1-13-23 Talked with Phil, Jennifer''s husband. He''s a bit skeptical bc they used a company called Ona based in SLC that did not share in their medical expenses when they arose. I''ve never heard of Ona, so I can''t speak to that. I explained how this works and the backup plans financially as well. He asked about the pre-x clause and I explained it to him and let him know anything on record in the past 24 months will be pre-x and if he goes to dr. and complains of any health issue spanning prior to the start date will be considered pre-x bc symptomatic. Makes most sense for him to join with kids at 50-64 SECURE $625/$1000. He will discuss it with Jennifer and I will talk with her again on Tuesday, next week for final determination. He was thankful for my time and explanations.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-13 13:58:03', '2023-01-13 13:58:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059964202', 'Tracy Goodemote', NULL, 'After speaking with Misty member submitted cancellation citing lower cost.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 13:56:53', '2023-01-13 13:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111762017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060856001', 'Jerry Dodge', NULL, '01.13.2023 Jerry called inquiring about renewal rates with medical cost sharing
I thought I needed to send him to Jeffrey, but Cari said we can take care of this one, and to bring her in to learn how to respond to inquisitions about rate increases.
Cari shared how we are different from the traditional insurance, and UNLESS there''s a universal platform change, there won''t be any increases in rates. Once you''re a member, you''re always a member until you decide you''re not. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-13 13:55:08', '2023-01-13 14:03:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 13:50:22', '2023-01-13 13:50:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111768003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080972002', 'Atalie Troutman', NULL, '01.13.23:  Recvd. an email from Atalie.  Said she''s doing well. She had to get some shots (flu and TB?) for school but didn''t contact the Concierge because she was in a time crunch and just ended up going to CVS to get her shots. But she said she should have called.  I responded to her email.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-01-13 13:48:42', '2023-01-13 13:48:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105316001', 'Susan Brady', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy per note below this member went with Trad Ins.  I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 13:41:22', '2023-01-13 13:41:22');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000111766003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109659001', 'Kimberly Alston', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-13 13:25:37', '2023-01-13 13:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111720023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010460007', 'Madonna Kilcollum', NULL, '1-13-2023:  Madonna called, she''s turning 65 in Feb & wondered what she needs to do.  I let her know they generally send out instructions via e-mail (but I couldn''t find it in the CRM or in Admin123) so I just walked her thru the cancellation form.  She sent it before we were done & sadly, did not add the notes we were discussing.
     - She''s been thrilled with her memership.  I asked if she''d be int in videoing or writing a review since she''s been so happy, so other members might realize how great the service has been.  Her response was Dakota & A... asked her to do that but how are we different?  How sad that she''d be a member how many years & has no idea who we are or how we are involved.  She could not say enough about Zion & how they helped her thru the death of her husb & all of his medical bills.  Zion even flew Dakota & A... out for her husb celebration of life.  I explained who MPB is & how we''d love other members to know how helpful the concierge, our product that includes Zion, etc, were in her life if she felt like sharing (video, in writing, or...).  I do not expect her to do this for us since she''s completely unaware of MPB.  Yet, she called us to cancel.  Really a weird situation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-13 13:20:17', '2023-01-13 18:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111715008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109797002', 'Kim Vailati', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-13 13:12:21', '2023-01-13 13:12:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111762003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106792002', 'Anne Silseth', NULL, '01.13.2023 Anne called to be guided on how to proceed to get reimbursed/or process an injury her daughter had skiing. 
She shared that she missed her welcome call so a few base information was provided regarding a medical need and Zion. I emailed her the template "Missed Welcome Call - Reschedule...".
While Anne and her husband were in FL, her daughter Molly injured her leg while skiing in MN. She was taken to the hospital via ambulance, they thought her femur or ACL was broken, but it turned out to be bone contusion.
They did not pay the IUA, the hospital said they will bill them. Molly did present herself as a "cash-pay" patient. 
I started guiding Anne to where to find the medical need link, I also sent her an email "How to Submit a Zion Need....", and walked her through each part of the need.
Brought Cari in to confirm: She coached Anne to call the billing dept to pay the $1000 IUA, and request the cash-pay discount, and with the payment she will receive a PDF receipt (one she will upload to the medical need). Explained how and the purpose of an IUA. Explained that Molly is considered an adult and Zion will be contacting Molly directly when it comes to the signage portion.
Cari explained Zion works faster when the IUA is paid and a receipt is uploaded to the need.
We went over details like the timing of receiving confirmation from Zion or to follow-up is around 72 hours. To go ahead and follow-up with Zion with the number included in the email I sent, and later from the email they send with the processor''s name and contact number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-13 13:09:42', '2023-01-13 14:50:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791079', 'Francis Ramirez', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 2/1.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 13:04:40', '2023-01-13 13:04:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation due to Provider issue outlined below.  I will cancel eff 2/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 12:58:53', '2023-01-13 12:58:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110162002', 'Leslie Harris', NULL, 'Zac emailed me letting me know that this member went with an insurance option.  I will cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 12:50:29', '2023-01-13 12:50:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, 'After being in contact with Wend this member submitted Cancellation.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 12:40:18', '2023-01-13 12:40:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111697002', 'Prasad Salunkhe', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 12:38:06', '2023-01-13 12:38:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111736058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111697002', 'Prasad Salunkhe', NULL, 'I left VM for this member because the entered the same SS# for both of their dependents.  This needs to be corrected.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-13 12:37:42', '2023-01-13 12:37:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111701021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768243', 'Haley Collins', NULL, '1-13-23 I called Haley after talking with her mom, Liz who said Haley couldn''t reach me. But, I don''t have any missed calls from her. It''s very strange.  Haley was telling her mom she was panicked bc of the deadlines.  I explained CARE+ to her again and she it''s exactly what she wants. BUT, she said her previous membership didn''t share anything. However, it looks like she was on CARE+ then too, but I can''t tell if it was the version with Sedera that had the same name. Either way, she''s happy with having access to the virtual healthcare, low IUA and Life Care. So, she''s enrolling now in CARE+ for $215/$1000 and I waived the $100 fee since she was a member previously. I had to let Liz know if I waived the $100 then I won''t also pay her the $100. She was cool with that.  Haley doesn''t use tobacco and no pre-x, no meds, no alternative care desired.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-13 12:35:40', '2023-01-13 12:38:24'),
