  ('zcrm_1579374000111701003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '1-13-22 Kath Irwin McGauhey and Fred Besch are married now. She was thinking to look at Covered CA bc her income is low. But, she didn''t understand that now that she''s married it will need to be their household income combined. So, that changes the equation. She seemed less interested in Covered CA at that point. She wanted to better understand her membership and what''s included and how to use it. They only have SECURE as an option at this point bc they need the ACA compliance for CA. They are each paying $300 now for $2500 IUA. If combine memberships it will be $550 instead of separately $600 and only up to 3 IUA instead of 6 per year. She will discuss with Fred and we set an appt for 10:00 MST on Tuesday, Jan. 17th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-13 10:52:35', '2023-01-13 10:52:35'),
