  ('zcrm_1579374000111652008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110260002', 'William Burg Jr', NULL, 'Mendy called regarding weight loss medication and if it is something that is shareable. I explained that weight loss is something that would be shareable after her first year of membership but since she is looking to do this ASAP, that it would be something she would pay out of pocket for. Mendy understood and will be doing this prior to her first year of membership being over. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-13 07:39:58', '2023-01-13 07:39:58'),
