  ('zcrm_1579374000111591160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '12-29-2022:  Jason did not follow instructions to call us regarding sub a ''med need'' for Chris''s colonoscopy.  He instead sent an e-mail.  I responded to his two e-mails that we cannot sub the need for him &amp; he needs to call the concierge line during bus hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 17:25:37', '2023-01-12 17:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '01.12.2023 I did not hear back from  Hope so I generated a coupon email and sent her findings of:
Sprintec, 0.250mg/0.035mg, 1/day (X7): Costco $26.56
OR
Sprintec, 0.250mg/0.035mg, 1/day (X7): CVS $21.57
I then called her to reiterate the details in advantages of using Costco, and if she wishes to increase her packages to 8 instead of 7 that I can do that for her.
After speaking with Hope, she confirmed to get the 8 pack instead, and would not want to go to Costco. I emailed Hope a new coupon for 8 packs at CVS for $22.95.NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-12 17:18:35', '2023-01-12 17:34:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111579018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105316001', 'Susan Brady', NULL, '1-12-23 Susan already chose an Anthem plan with C4 through some other broker. She didn''t realize I could have helped with that as well. Bummer! She doesn''t even remember her name. But, she said she''ll reach out to me in the future if she changes or returns to MCS. Her Welcome Call with Vanessa put more fear into her about her pre-x even though we discussed each item at length and she had a clean updated record from her dr. regarding her heart health. Vanessa told her if palpitation is on her record that she won''t be protected in case of a heart attack and thryoid nodules she wouldn''t be protected for cancer. We had gone over everything extensively with discussing her record, etc. She prefers reg ins for now until she''s even further away from any problems to have a better clean bill of health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-12 16:57:53', '2023-01-12 16:57:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111579013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028115309', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '1-12-23 I talked with Jeni bc she left a vm saying she wasn''t eager to switch to Anthem. But, in talking with her she let me know she submitted 2 items to Zion which were both rejected. The first was she was dealing with mold issues and the practice she worked with was a combo of MD, Naturopath and Nurse Practitioner. They wound up treating her mostly with herbs. She said she called in advance and they told her mold will be shared. But, she waited more than 6 months to submit it first off. She didn''t know the rule which is understandable.  She couldn''t remember if she called Zion directly. I don''t see any communication with our MPB Concierge Team.  Assuming it was Zion, they didn''t educate her about the 6 month time limit or about needing pre-approval for alternative care. They just rejected sharing the expenses. Then she had hormonal expenses which she says were rejected as well. We didn''t get into that part. I don''t know if she was just on meds or herbs or what. Those won''t be shareable anyhow. She thinks it''s too difficult to track down the bills and submit everything they want. So, if she comes back to me in the future, she thinks she will stick with traditional ins. now moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-12 16:27:29', '2023-01-12 16:27:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496019', 'Bruce Schanstra', NULL, '01.12.2023 I did not hear back from  Kristine so I generated a coupon email and sent her findings of:
* Adderall 15mg, 30 days, for 1/day: Costco $11.89
* Adderall 15mg, 30 days, for 1/day: Stop N Shop $10.25
I also explained an opportunity to save more at Costco, if she has a membership (per Cari''s guidance via teams) NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-12 16:04:55', '2023-01-12 17:18:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, '01.12.2023 SILVINA called to cancel today. I offered to transfer her to our specialist, Jeffrey, and to leave him a message.
I called her back and let her know via VM that he is out until next week, but he will make sure cancellations are processed prior to the 20th.
Silvina called back concerned that she would not have coverage for the rest of January. I explained to her that the payment made on 12/20th was for the entire month of January. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-12 15:19:43', '2023-01-12 15:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079922001', 'Pamela Luna', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Bryan called for quite a few things:
     - He''s on his Zion portal & sees a double pymt from Oct?/Nov? 2022.  I let him know he can see all of his pymt receipts in his MPB.Health Memb Portal & got him into that.  He knows we collect the money, so from our reciepts (& I dbl ck''d Admin123 & it agrees w/his MPB.Health Memb Portal) there aren''t any duplicate pymts.  When he saw that he was fine & relieved.
     - He asked about where he can see the various srvcs on their plan.  I sent him a copy of the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & let him know we have one item in trans soon = PHCS ntwk will go to a diff type of pricing w/no ntwk, so it will open your doc options to docs who are willing to work w/Planstin on price & billing (to watch Pamela''s e-mail for their new pdf Planstin card & then to call us so we can go over how to present).
     - Asked where he can see the items cov on the ''prev care'' because he''s thinking of having his annual phys:  Took him to the e-mail healthcare.gov link & went over a few things there.  Also mentioned HCBB near the bottom that may be helpful in finding a doc (once no ntwk is req''d) because it will let him know who is high quality & fair priced.  If he wants to go before they rec the new Planstin, no ntwk card, he will call & we''ll show him how to look in the PHCS ntwk.
     - Talked briefly how a prev item can go to diag.  Gave colonoscopy example & how it goes from no chg on screening to $2500 IUA on diagnostic.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 14:43:35', '2023-01-12 16:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105428002', 'Steven Vertz', NULL, '01.12.2023 Steven emailed his responses to us and connected us with his daughter to complete the research and download a coupon.
