  ('zcrm_1579374000111591093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Patricia called to follow-up on how to determine if the mammogram center she''s sched her mamm with is in ntwk (= inside the hosp, which she says is in ntwk).  I pulled up what we can see & I don''t see any mamm cntrs, imaging cntrs, or radioligy cntrs inside the hosp listed as in ntwk.  We went over options:
     - Get the mammogram center NPI #, call PHCS direct to see if that mamm cntr NPI is considered in ntwk.
     - She may resched out a ways.  She''s not in a hurry, so she knows the ntwk issue will go away once she rec''s the new updated pdf Planstin card & we have no idea if that''s soon, or down the road.  IF she rec''s that card, she will call to get instructions on how to present.
     - I did go over if utilizing the PHCS MultiPlan Spec Srvcs ntwk, all entities must be in ntwk.  ie:  imaging cntr, facility, comp that reads the image, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 13:44:21', '2023-01-12 13:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104790012', 'Jessica Perez', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Jessica called asking a lot of basic ''Welcome Call'' questions.  When I asked her, she said we had cancelled her ''Welcome Call'' on her.  It turns out she sched prior to her effective date &amp; did not resched.  I resent her the sched temp &amp; she was on sched while we were on the ph together.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 13:36:24', '2023-01-12 13:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093412002', 'Aaron Smith', NULL, '01.12.2023 4196519286 called in, it only rang 3X, and we missed it. I called back within 30 seconds, in the attempt to speak to someone, but there was no answer and no option to leave a message.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-12 13:35:38', '2023-01-12 13:36:33'),
