  ('zcrm_1579374000111591068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032158', 'Wenda Gao', NULL, '01.12.2023 Jeffrey called to ask how to be able to go see a PCP, and be covered.
Firstly, I shared he can contact any PCP of his choosing, explaining the RPB version of Planstin approach.
After consulting with Cari to ask if biopsy is an automatic diagnostic, and she corrected me by saying to still guide via PHCS Planstin approach, and biopsy is official diagnostic. 
I explained to Jeffrey the difference with preventative vs. diagnostic and that biopsy is not under preventative care.
He understood and said he will go to get the check up and keep it preventative. I offered him to call us back if his visit turns into diagnostic. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-12 12:50:17', '2023-01-12 13:01:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Jennifer called to get RX quote coupon updated.  This particular item is difficult to find with the exact strength listed, etc.  I wonder if some may be listing it in a different manner?  I found a great price for her locally that shows exactly the way she requested the item:
     - Ipratropium Bromide Nasal Spray  21mcg, 30ml canister x #2 units = $30.72 at Rite Aid thru RXGo.  There were cheaper pharmacies, but they were not convenient for her (it was about a $8 diff, so she chose this coupon.  [if she has problems, there was one other place that was relatively convenient, but it was even more expensive.  She says there''s not much around her.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 12:19:42', '2023-01-13 18:15:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '01.12.2023 Melissa called to confirm her lab works would be covered if done at the office, OR does she have to go to discount labCorp.
I consulted with Cari, and she shared to make sure the lab is in network, and they usually only cover the lipid panel and sometimes Sucrose pd. 
Melissa decided to go to LabCorp to do her panel. She also asked about a situation with being overcharged at a Dermatology visit. She has connected Planstin and the Derm Office regarding the matter, in hopes that Planstin would help her get the Derm. office to reimburse her the overcharge.
I was unsure of the matter, I asked Cari via teams, but we are shorthanded and Cari was pre-occupied with another member. I asked to call Melissa back. We attempted to group conference with her, but did not reach her. I left Melissa a message to call us back regarding the Derm. billing situation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-12 12:18:00', '2023-01-12 13:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111536002', 'Chester Yang', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Chester called.  He was trying to log into the various componenets.  I let him know his accounts are not active until 2/1/2023.  He does have the info to upload his proof of self-emp on his MPB.Health memb portal & he has sched his ''Welcome Call'' for 2/2/2023.
     - His advisor told him he could sign-up for dental in his portal.  I let him know there is a discount program available after his eff date, but dental policies are often through the advisor.  Since his advisor told him to sign-up thru his portal though, she may not offer that & that means the only option will be the discount program.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 12:16:07', '2023-01-12 12:17:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111556096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, 'Member called in she is cancelling due to the fact that her Provider will no allow her to pay cash once she has submitted Insurance info (Planstin).  She has incurred alot of expenses.  I sent out the cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-12 12:11:14', '2023-01-12 13:05:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636259', 'Michael Prestel', NULL, '01.12.2023 Mike called to better understand how to utilize his preventative care (maintenance annual visits).
I confirmed Mike''s account, and explained through the Planstin preventative lens. 
He asked if he pays for it first and gets reimbursed. I said do not pay for it, and that he is to contact his provider to make the appointment, while on the phone, offer the office his Planstin card and present himself as a "cash-pay" patient, and have the provider''s office contact Planstin  to collaborate "cash-pay" discount. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-12 11:33:34', '2023-01-12 11:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111591034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109668001', 'Mara Luthy', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Mara called.  She has a fee on her acct called "Memb Fee" &amp; she wondered if it might be from us.  I let her know it doesn''t look like it (nothing here or in Admin123).  She''s going to call her cc/bank &amp; see if they can provide better details.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 11:33:24', '2023-01-12 11:33:24'),
