  ('zcrm_1579374000111591022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065985001', 'Denise Uhlig', NULL, '1-12-2023:  Denise called & needed help getting setup on her CirrusMD.  We got her into her account & she was all set when we got off the phone.
     - We also disc the diff components of her plan.  She knows to watch for her new pdf Planstin card & to call so we can go over the chgs if she needs her prev care, HCBB, etc.
     - They were super pleased w/an issue their daughter had last yr where she almost died.  I asked if she''d be int in sub a quick video for the newsletter.  She''s going to mention it to Brad (who is on his own acct) because he took care of everything.  If he''s int, she''ll have him call us.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-12 10:36:31', '2023-01-12 11:05:14'),
