  ('zcrm_1579374000111591017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108407001', 'Dean Kuiper', NULL, '1.12.23@11:50 am- Jennifer had an accident today. I called Dean Kuiper, and left the following msg to cancel her Welcome Call for today: "Your Concierge consultant, Jennifer, had a minor accident this morning and, unfortunately, will not be able to conduct your Welcome Call today.  We''re sorry for any inconvenience and would like to re-schedule your call for another day."  I called twice (  from cel and GO TO ) I left her a msg, sent an email to reschedule the welcome call. The reason why I called from cel phone as well is that on that case I can send a msg with urgent delivery.. . RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-12 09:37:59', '2023-01-12 09:37:59'),
