  ('zcrm_1579374000111557008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109795001', 'Elise Schadauer', NULL, '1.11.23:  Recvd. an email from Melissa Lilly/Planstin telling me Elise called Zion wondering why she didn''t receive a "packet" as she was told she would.  Melissa asked me if we send packets out.  I responded by asking her to provide the member''s name so we could look it up and see what her need is.  I emailed Melissa and said this member should have called MPB as it is an MPB issue, not Zion.  I asked her to instruct Zion''s customer service team to direct our MPB members back to us when they call with these types of questions.  *Note:  Melissa said Zion doesn''t send out packets, just a letter and membership card.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2023-01-12 08:55:13', '2023-01-12 08:55:13'),
