  ('zcrm_1579374000111518045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101203001', 'KERRY SAYLES', NULL, '1-11-2023:  Kerry called.  She had an ''ins'' sales guy askinbg her for her ''ins'' ID card so he could compare.  We disc & did some educ:  this is diff, not ''ins'', no card as such.  She has her MPB.Health card, so she did rec her ''Welcome Pkt''.  Her address is both pysical & mailing (no PO Box).
