     - Sent her the temp for sched a ''Welcome Call''.  She seemed to realize most of what she was asking will be cov in that call & was nice about it.
     - She''s going to Belize & wondered how international care worked.  We went over emerg care only.  They will want you to get stabilized & home.  She''ll make sure she takes the concierge & Zion''s ph #s in case (knows it has to be during bus hours for both entites).
