  ('zcrm_1579374000111518040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, '1-11-2023:  Maurine called.  They are releasing her from the hosp & the hosp is struggling w/the no ins, ''self-pay''.  I coached her to tell them: she is ''cash-pay'', ask for a disc, ask to pay the 1k IUA and have them bill her the balance of the ''cash-pay'' balance.  They told her they were sending in the financial need group & I told her she could tell them, she does not have ins, but may get help with an expensive bill.  She seemed confident w/that.  She will call us in the next few days to sub a ''med need'' so we can get the process going so approval can be underway.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 17:16:28', '2023-01-11 17:16:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111518035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107380001', 'Edward Barlow', NULL, '1-11-2023:  Katie called.  Their daughter has a nail on one of her hands causing her a lot of pain.  She called CirrusMD & they sugg she take her to a derm.  We went over the 2 derm in HCBB that might be options & I sent her an e-mail with their info.  She knows to present as ''cash-pay'', no ''ins'', ask for a disc, save receipts and get detailed inv if poss, pay up to her 1k IUA & ask if they can bill for bal if it gets to this point.  She will call us to help her start a ''med need'' if that looks nec.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 17:07:40', '2023-01-11 17:07:40'),
