  ('zcrm_1579374000111518019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075520001', 'Scott Totten', NULL, '1-11-2023:  Scott called.  His heart specialist just called him saying he''s out-of-ntwk so they are having the financial aid office get w/him.  It sounds like his PCP sent over his Planstin info?  He''s going to let them know that info does NOT qualify for anything but his ''prev care'' & present himself as a ''cash-pay'' pt, ask for a ''cash-pay'' disc, pay his 1k IUA & ask them to bill him the balance that reflects the discount so he can get the balance together.   That there is NO ntwk for this care.  He will have them call us if they have questions.  [We did not go over starting a ''med need''.  Seemed like he was rushing off the phone?]      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 14:02:26', '2023-01-11 14:03:11'),
