  ('zcrm_1579374000111532016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058017335', 'Daniel Basch', NULL, 'This member was transferred to me by the Concierge.  He had questions about his pricing and also an additional change of approx $75-$80 which he wanted to know if we were charging.  I gave him his price and advised that the other charge was not us and directed him to speak to Analisa about this.  He then brought up that he wanted to cancel his membership.  I originally told him to speak with Analisa about this but the Concierge mentioned he should talk to Jeffrey.  I told him that Jeffrey would be back in touch with him.  After speaking with Jeffrey during which he gave no reason or any new plan that he was enrolling in he determined that he was unsaveable.    Member submitted cancellation which I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-11 12:48:03', '2023-01-11 12:48:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111521013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098327002', 'Cindy Gordon', NULL, '01.11.23@12:23- Cindy, a new agent has been told by John K that concierge will price lab test for her. Tried to verify info with concierge team but no one had replied until now at 2:50 pm. . Since she has not had a welcome call, i also sent her a link . Jen advised that " I would just let Cindy know that she can go to the following sites with you to compare pricing on these tests. The issue with the concierge team doing the pricing is that the member does not always give us the correct lab info over the phone:

www.ultalabs.com

www.anylabtestnow.com

www.jasonhealth.com

www.walk-inlabs.com

And Cari added "Rosana, we refer the member to the sites Jennifer sent you.  They look up what they think they need from the doctor''s orders & they get their own pricing.  We are just traffic directors.  This way we do NOT ever accidentally give a member the wrong price.  It''s up to them to get the correct pricing.  We do NOT want that liability.

