  ('zcrm_1579374000111532003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090502002', 'Rita Pate', NULL, 'Member called into to me asking about Eligibility for the Secure Plan after I processed her Request to Change her plan.  She is not a business owner.  In her conversation with Mike Montes he never let her know that she had to be an Ind Contractor in order to be eligible.  I will email Mike and ask where this went wrong.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-11 12:16:42', '2023-01-11 12:34:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111521008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096329001', 'Christopher Cappuccitti', NULL, '01.11.2023 Jennifer called to confirm she is covered towards a well woman visit, and to help her find an OBGYN near by her.
I explained to her, and confirmed with Cari, that she received a one well woman a year & women get one PCP preventative as well. Should she need to extend her OBGYN visit to see another specialist, it evolves into diagnostic. Then she can call us back to walk her through the process of opening a medical need with Zion.
I reminded her to refer to the Planstin card for preventative ONLY, and to guide her doctor''s office to contact Planstin, to discuss ''cash-pay'' patient pricing, AND to do that while she''s setting up her appointment.
Jennifer seemed appeased in feeling helped and learned how to maneuver her preventative with an OBGYN visit. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-11 11:46:55', '2023-01-11 11:46:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111479008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109496019', 'Bruce Schanstra', NULL, 'Kristine called in because they believe her son has some knee issues from playing basketball:
