  ('zcrm_1579374000111518011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101203001', 'KERRY SAYLES', NULL, '1-11-2023:  Advisor Karen Torsoe sent me a Teams chat asking me to "check" Kerry''s account.  Karen is in Norway, so their internet blocks Admin123.  I let her know the info she gave me looks like what we have on file & suggested she have Kerry call the concierge line at her conv (gave her our # & hours).  Kerry''s saying she didn''t rec anything from MPB.  I''m betting she''s thinking she needs an ''ins'' card?  She also lives in a remote area of CO & I''m wondering if they have a PO Box instead of rural delivery?   I mentioned to Karen that Kerry did not sched/have her ''Welcome Call'' which is when we confirm / educate people about expectations, id cards, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 11:15:15', '2023-01-11 11:16:33'),
