I checked with Cari via teams and she confirmed that''s the appropriate way to maneuver the plan with Planstin, AND she offered extra information to share with Kristine for educational and empowering purposes, which I would have like to share with Kristine ( i.e. I would have liked to take her to their post Welcome Call e-mail.  Show her the MEC portion, healthcare.gov & let her know it''s in transition from PHCS to the new pricing, RBP), but Kristine seemed appeased with just the answer about Preventative billing and presentation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-11 10:31:40', '2023-01-11 10:31:40'),
