  ('zcrm_1579374000111509016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '1-11-22 I''m recommending the Friday Bronze Copay Plan which is the cheaper option. She might adjust their income one final time. Now it''s at $78,584. She will also find out which carriers her dentist accepts for individuals and she''ll look at mental health network. She''ll call me later today to finalize for Feb. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-11 10:26:14', '2023-01-11 10:26:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111241002', 'Joseph Pascoe', NULL, '1-11-2023:  Colleen called.  She''s trying to upload their proof of self-emp (Sched C), but keeps getting an error code when she''s trying to upload them in her portal.  I trans her to Patti''s line for help.  She''ll LM if she doesn''t catch her.  Maybe the files are too large?  Or they system is down?  I checked Admin123 &amp; do not see that anything uploaded re: proof of self-emp.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 10:19:24', '2023-01-11 10:26:09'),
