  ('zcrm_1579374000111419071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '1/10/2023:  Shirley is asking specifically for the OPD doc: John Littel''s info.  I made sure she had that, sent her Prim Partner''s website as well, because the OPD plan will not incl the HSA qualification they like.  Let her know we should discuss their options re: ''prev care'' by when they want to have their appts.   Asked her to call me at her conv.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 02:56:44', '2023-01-11 02:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111419063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032126', 'Rebecca Schiff', NULL, '1/10/2023:  Patti realized the diff in pricing is a tobacco surchg.  I sent an e-mail to Rebecca that I can now review w/her to see if we can find an option for her that includes ''prev care''.  Made note that we have about 1 week to change if she''d like for a 2/1/2023 eff date.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 02:36:47', '2023-01-11 02:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111419058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104973012', 'Lynne Howard', NULL, '1-10-2023:  Reid sent me a quoe for the Synthroid BRAND 100mcg, #90 tabs: Synthroid 100mcg x 90tabs $65.95 + $9.95 shipping.  The best local prices started at $134 for the same thing.  Sched del of my e-mail tomorrow at 6:00am eastern with Reid''s quote &amp; contact info.  [Synth mfg offers similar pricing for qualified patients, but I know what a great job Reid does, so I did not mention this.  If she requests something different, it might be an option.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-11 02:31:36', '2023-01-11 02:31:36'),
