  ('zcrm_1579374000111419048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '1-10-2023:  Rosana asked for assistance on this.  Kallie lives in one of the problem PHCS areas - it''s super hard to get appts w/the few in ntwk docs, so normally I would have talked to her prior to sending instructions, but it was too late.  I''m hopeful the instructions Rosana sent will be a assistance to Kallie &amp; if she run into issues, we can then look at other options (like how quickly they need this, etc.) when she calls again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-10 18:02:22', '2023-01-10 18:02:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111419043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079595009', 'Michael Sanford', NULL, '1-10-2023:  Michael called re: their HSA.  In looking at the Care+ & tt Michael, it sounds like they have an HMA.  I sugg they call their advisor Zach Masters to conf, but as I understand it, using those funds will just take them back in their ammortization type ''matching'' schedule, but depending on how far they are into the schedule it doesn''t ''match as high a percentage''.  It''s further into their schedule that the better ''matching'' happens and Zach sb able to tell them the implications.  Michael was fine w/that.
