  ('zcrm_1579374000111434003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109280001', 'Suzanne Roumani', NULL, 'I spoke with Suzanne, she was going to cancel. I asked why, she said she wasn''t clear on the plan. I went through everything with her, and advised her to do her welcome call. I initially tried to reach out to her advisor, Dianne Border. I left a voicemail for Dianne, then proceeded to call the member. She''s fine now, I will reach out to concierge to make sure they schedule welcome call.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-10 14:20:01', '2023-01-10 14:20:01'),
