  ('zcrm_1579374000111433003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575482', 'Christina Brown', NULL, 'Andrea contacted me about this member with questions about Proof of coverage for her so that will be going off to college.  I shared that we have had a mixed bag of results with the colleges.  Possibility going with the college plan might be an option.  Also Wendy brought to my attention that member had been billed for the Redirect option when she had been on the PSD plan.  I looked at it and this was the case.  I added the correct plan to A123 and after I speak with Andrea refund the member the difference of $141.91 we over charged.  I will ask Andrea to let member know of correct price.  1/12-Member refunded out of A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 14:05:36', '2023-01-12 07:11:02'),
