  ('zcrm_1579374000111397037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, '1-10-22 Jennika is considering doing the DIRECT membership to access mammo and colonoscopy. She''s willing to pay for the small wellness items on her own. The price increase is too much for her going from $436 to $561 at the $2500 IUA. CARE+ removes her ability to do the wellness which is the only thing she needs. DIRECT will get her monthly down to $505 which is more doable for her. She also had another agent send her a plan option. But, she''d love my opinion and would love to continue working with me since I can help with all trad and MCS options. She forgot that I do all of it and prefers to stay with me. :-) She will send me the other plan option to review.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-10 13:57:25', '2023-01-10 13:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111427011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '1.10.23@ 3:30 Pm- Kallie wants to schedule a colonoscopy for her husband but she is not sure if her old provider is part of the our network. I am not familiar with this old Sedera plan so I asked Cari to help me.  I sent Kellie instruction to find a provider in network .....As per Joan "Rosana, you and Cari are correct that we are still using the PHCS network for Planstin members who have a MEC, until these members receive a new membership card from Planstin designating the new RBP (reference-based pricing) on the card.  Therefore, you must go through the PHCS network for all components of this member''s colonosocopy (initial provider (who this member went to to find out they needed a colonoscopy, the physician who performs the procedure, the medical facility in which the procedure is being performed, the anesthesiologist, etc.).  They all have to be in the PHCS network for her husband not to be billed." RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-10 13:56:46', '2023-01-10 15:19:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111419012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109280001', 'Suzanne Roumani', NULL, '1-10-2023:  Suzanne was transferred over from Planstin, wanting to cancel her membership.  Trans her to Jeffrey Bursteen''s line.  She will LM if she doesn''t catch him &amp; knows there is a form she must sign.  Also sent Jeffrey a Teams chat as a backup so she''s not missed accidentally.  Let Jeffrey know, at least in the past, Diane Border''s done a good job of saving her members in case he hasn''t worked w/her yet.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-10 13:36:50', '2023-01-10 13:36:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111361059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111976010', 'George Elkins', NULL, 'George is currently self employed, he was reffered by a friend, he''s currently on blue cross blue shield tennesee, One of his children is on state medicaid, called tencare. That specific child is disabled and is special needs, he needs to confirm with his wife if this plan would be ok for their family while keeping their child on the state medicaid. he will confirm his choice by friday.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2023-01-10 13:36:34', '2023-01-10 13:36:34'),
