  ('zcrm_1579374000111427003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097036002', 'Charles Knox', NULL, '01.10.2023 Charles called and had a hard time getting through, before I answered his call. Stating someone seemed like they were trying to pick up his line, but with no success.
