  ('zcrm_1579374000111397027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789024', 'Sundiata Soon-Jahta', NULL, 'Welcome call completed! Scott didn''t ask many questions so he may need further assistance in the future. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-10 13:11:55', '2023-01-10 13:11:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111397019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575482', 'Christina Brown', NULL, '1-10-22 Andrea called bc her client is showing that she''s been moved to PDHC from PSDHC and Andrea never moved her and hasn''t marketed Redirect. This looks like a mistake. Plus her price just jumped about $200. It looks like this needs to be corrected entirely and refunded the difference. We tried calling Patti but she didn''t answer. Andrea will get Patti''s help on her own and sort it out. They need to show proof of ins for kids college. The MEC will be used for this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-10 12:15:54', '2023-01-10 12:15:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111397008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111398011', 'Max Springer', NULL, '1-10-22 Max chose SECURE over trad ins. He chose $245/$2500 since he''s never sick or injured. He enrolling now. Therapist charges $85 an hour which is only $10 more than his co-pay now. So, not worth worrying about.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-10 11:39:29', '2023-01-10 11:41:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111397003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111955009', 'Abram Dunaway', NULL, '1-10-22 Abe is 46 and lives in C Springs. He''s changing careers to help his wife with her small business. He''s healthy, no pre-x. He needs a Feb. 1st start date. Was referred my Mara Simoneau. Wife has coverage through work and may remain on that plan. He and 10 yr old son need benefits. Son is cautious and not likely to get into trouble health wise other than colds and sinus infections. They do their annual wellness visits and funds an HSA. SECURE is the best option for what he wants. $1000/$525 or $1000/$715. He thinks trad range from $550-$850. Isn''t sure what Cobra will cost or what wife pays. He will find out. He asked me to call him early next week.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-10 11:31:22', '2023-01-10 12:23:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111331031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059299094', 'Randall Hettinga', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to remove dependent Brianna from membership eff 2/1/23.  I will notify Planstin &amp; there will be no change to billing since still a family.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 11:03:17', '2023-01-10 11:03:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111331026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090502002', 'Rita Pate', 'New Plan eff 2/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 10:58:55', '2023-01-10 10:58:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111348013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238273', 'Jennifer Bradfield', NULL, '1-10-22 Philip is interested in adding the MEC for wellness since Jennifer is doing her mammos, pap screenings, etc. It''s only $69.32 more and they can fund an HSA. Total membership fee will be $745.97 EF PDHC $1500 IUA. He needs to complete the change form by the 15th to avoid SEP (we think) and make sure he''s completed the Upgrade process with Sedera. If not, add the MEC when asked to get the correct tier for pricing through Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-10 10:58:47', '2023-01-10 10:58:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111331021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090502002', 'Rita Pate', NULL, 'Rita submitted Change fro to Change plans from Care + to Secure eff 2/1/23.  I will update in CRM &amp; A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 10:41:01', '2023-01-10 10:41:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111331016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', NULL, 'Member called into the Concierge to ask about proof of Insurance for Taxes.  I called her back and told her that the 1095C''s go out  in the early March timeframe.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 10:38:30', '2023-01-10 10:38:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111357013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001060051', 'Matthew Ross', NULL, '01.10.2023 Matthew called to get clarification on preventative vs. diagnostic, and whether to open a need towards a colonoscopy or wait. When he shared it would def. become diagnostic, I confirmed with him to definitely open a need, and to call us if he would like guidance in that process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-10 10:37:30', '2023-01-10 10:37:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111316026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671026', 'George Jarratt', NULL, 'No response. Not able to leave message. Mailbox full. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-10 10:33:40', '2023-01-10 10:33:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111357008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098361002', 'Don Maycock', NULL, '01.10.23@11:30am- Shirley needs an address change . New address - 3041 N.E 104 TH AVENUE -SILVER SPRING- 34480- OCALA..  Please add her email : redheaddo@protonmail.com .She  is looking for a list of chiropractors and masseuse in her area  zip code: 23114. RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-10 10:18:27', '2023-01-10 10:18:27'),
