Delta Dental of Colorado', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-10 10:08:20', '2023-01-10 10:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111357003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089051001', 'Patricia Smith', NULL, '01.10.23@ 11:00 AM - Patricia called to find out if BONSECOURS SAINT FRANCIS MEDICAL CENTER RADIOLOGY DEPARTAMENT,  zip code  23114 is within PHCS network. She needs a mammogram.. I am working on it... Will offer a list of other facilities as a back Plan. RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-10 10:06:33', '2023-01-10 10:06:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111348003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104633001', 'Cathy Gibbons', NULL, 'Cathy called in for the following:
She wanted me to explain to her why, when doing a PHCS network search, the name in the address located on the search is different than the name of the office located at the address. I told Cathy that I wasn''t sure why this would be, but that facility is in the network.
Cathy also stated that she doesn''t understand why she has to stick in a network, I explained that until she receives her new Planstin card in the mail, that we do need to stick within the PHCS network. 
We did cover a little information regarding the RBP pricing, but again I reiterated to Cathy that we currently do still go by the PHCS network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-10 09:49:19', '2023-01-10 09:49:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111316016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109171001', 'Amy Hindman', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-10 09:36:20', '2023-01-10 09:36:20'),
