  ('zcrm_1579374000111286008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109367016', 'James Bracken', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to correct IUA.  Member made error at time of enrollment.  Changing IUA from $2500 to $1000.  I will update in A123. Verification sent via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 08:21:59', '2023-01-10 08:50:54'),
