  ('zcrm_1579374000111286003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091197009', 'Stephen Jacobs', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation request.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 08:14:13', '2023-01-10 08:14:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111267003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106407002', 'Maria Faria', NULL, 'Victor called in again today because he believes we are ripping him off. I tried to reiterate to him several times that we are a legitimate company and that we have his wife''s best interest in mind. Victor kept repeating that he isn''t sure if this company is legit. I''m not really quite sure what more I can say to solidify to him that we are legit. I explained to Victor that we will go over more in the welcome call that he has scheduled. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-10 07:58:32', '2023-01-10 07:59:35');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000111264003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082102022', 'James White', NULL, 'Spoke to James, he''s receiving employer benefits now, much lower premium, and a low deductible. Emailed CXL form', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-10 07:49:41', '2023-01-10 07:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111253003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109481002', 'Lucy Pirner', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-10 07:40:01', '2023-01-10 07:40:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111244008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', 'New Plan eff 10/1/2022', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 07:22:28', '2023-01-10 07:22:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111244003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', NULL, 'Per Nahla &amp; Cari this member''s info in the CRM was not updated when she changed her plan in response to the Zion price increase of 10/1/22.  I will update accordingly', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 07:21:12', '2023-01-10 07:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111243003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109410002', 'Kelly Bentley', NULL, 'Member submitted PU for.  I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-10 07:14:22', '2023-01-10 07:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111236037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104973012', 'Lynne Howard', NULL, '1-9-2023:  RX Quote req for Synthroid BRAND 100mcg, #90 tabs.  The brand is quite exp, but Reid has had amazing pricing in the past.  Call &amp; tt Lynne - getting a quote from our international shopper &amp; will let her know what I find out.  She said she''s not out of her RX &amp; she appreciated the heads up on what is happening with her quote.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-09 18:18:05', '2023-01-09 18:18:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111236032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '1-9-2023:  Nahla brought me in to the call w/Nancy Johnson.  I talked to her for just a few minutes, but she was quite disgruntled that I wouldn''t just openly talk about Mariah''s membership with her w/out the signed permission form on file.  She got angry & became rather beligerant telling me how disappointed she is in me & unimpressed (because I''m protecting our member''s privacy) she is with MPB.  It seemed like she isn''t understanding the different entities & therefore thinks she''s always talking with MPB Concierge.  However, when I look back, she''s spoken primarly w/Wendy.  Nahla is connecting w/Wendy Scipione to see if maybe she can help Nancy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-09 18:07:54', '2023-01-19 04:05:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165360', 'Connie Mansour', NULL, '1-9-23 "Approval arrived in the form of an email that says the cards are on their way for the Bronze plan which started 1-1-23  YAY.  My acct says I only owe a $2 or something, that''s great.
thank so much,  Connie"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 18:04:42', '2023-01-09 18:04:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111181026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '01.09.2023 Nancy Johnson called to confirm Mariah''s start date with MPB. I confirmed Mariah''s bday (which now I know I should not have, given we don''t have a permission form on file).
Nancy asked how would Mariah get reimbursed for Chiropractic visits. I explained USUALLY members attain a discount for alternative medicine like chiro. visits through WHLC, UNLESS the medical cost sharing company approves it towards a medical need.
Nancy also wanted to know how to navigate WHLC to attain a chiropractor. I shared that information as well, thinking it is not personal information about Mariah, and it is ok. After consulting with Cari, I learned I should not be discussing anything with Nancy. I brought Cari in on the call to be more constructive in the delivery of explanation to Nancy. Cari did a wonderful job in further protecting Mariah''s information by letting Nancy know that we do not have a permission form on the MPB database. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-09 18:03:55', '2023-01-09 18:03:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '1-9-23 Hi Wendy -

So, I guess what happened, is Connect For Health (CFH), had to cancel the Gregg and Jennifer plan, which I told you. They were supposed to resubmit my portion. They did not. I think they think you should have resubmitted my portion. But they never told me this. I realize this isn’t all make sense.

So, I started calling. Tickets were opened. Nothing happened with tickets for some reason.
I have a 12/15 ticket, and a 12/28 ticket.


I called today. A woman named Geraldine is calling me Tuesday, tomorrow, at 2pm. I wonder if I can patch you in to the call, if I need to. I don’t think I will need to, though. Geraldine said that she did get it send to the enrollment correction dept. New ticket number 230109 - 001601.


I think for now, you don’t do anything. Let’s see if they get it done.


Just keeping you in the loop,
Jennifer', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 18:03:49', '2023-01-09 18:03:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111236024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082102022', 'James White', NULL, '1-9-2023:  James called to cancel his membership.  It''s after hours for the FL office, so I let him know Jeffrey Bursteen is helping members through these requests, but he''s out for the day.  Therefore, James is going to LM for Jeffrey.  I''ll also send Jeffrey notice in a Teams chat as a backup to the VM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-09 18:03:48', '2023-01-09 18:06:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111236019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080311001', 'Nancy Johnson', NULL, '1-9-2023 - Re: Mariah Bauer - Please see Mariah''s acct for interaction w/Nancy as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-09 17:58:26', '2023-01-09 17:58:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111063013', 'Stephanie Hoffman', NULL, '1-9-23 Stephanie sent this email which is no longer necessary but great for proof.
"Sure.
I would like to request that Wendy Scipione be my personal Agent/Advisor.
Thanks,
Stephanie Hoffman"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 17:19:13', '2024-04-18 12:26:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111398011', 'Max Springer', NULL, '1-9-23 Max is 43 and healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. He''s interested in alternative healthcare options, tries to do wellness and likes HSA. So, we looked at Friday Health Bronze Co-Pay for $301.98 plan with $9100 Ded and MOP bc he wants access to mental health. He goes 1x per week. Also explained SECURE for $300/$1000. He will find out what the cash price is for additional mental health visits and if his therapist accepts Friday Health. If yes, maybe go with Friday. If not, definitely go with SECURE since he''ll have to pay on his own anyhow. Although, he still might have to change counselors either way. He will let me know as soon as he gets a response from them.  
Also, he is married now and filing taxes jointly. But, they are separating and his wife and son are on her employer plan. He''s self-employed and getting his own plan. For some reason C4 thinks they might qualify for Medicaid. But, their household income is around $150K. Very strange but not relevant anyhow. He will pay full price of his plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 17:14:11', '2023-01-10 11:39:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035480226', 'Konstantinos Stamatiou', NULL, '1-9-22 Konstantino called to better understand his membership. I explained all of the companies and what they offer. He feels much better and totally appreciates my expertise and guidance. He will likely call the MPB Concierge Team for help with adding his son to CirrusMD and accessing Whole Health Living Choices and to make sure he has the most current Redirect Health app.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 17:07:02', '2023-01-09 17:07:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111181021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105428002', 'Steven Vertz', NULL, '01.09.2023 Catherine accidentally put in two identical RX Quotes for Albuterol HFA 90mcg.
After I priced 1 and 2 cans, I called her to confirm that she has enough refills to complete her transaction at the pharm.
Catherine responded that she went ahead already and purchased the 1 can, 30 days (as a one time use), due to influenza & bronchitis symptoms. I went ahead and labeled both RX''s as complete.
At the same time, Steven had emailed me and Cari (responding through a previous email thread), requesting birth control pill for his daughter.
Cari coached me that birth control is a little different by asking Steven the name of the birth control pill she is on, and if they are okay with generic instead of brand. I responded to him with that inquisition. I''m waiting to hear back to move forward. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-09 16:24:36', '2023-01-09 16:24:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '1-9-22 Talked with Tania and she will reach out to Drs. office again to get the itemized bill and send it to me for me to forward to Steve Schone. The office isn''t responding to her emails, so she''ll call instead. This makes her feel MUCH better to have the cost covered since that''s what she was banking on. She didn''t want to use all of her HSA money in the 1 few days of 2023. She will put the money back into her HSA as well once she gets reimbursed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 16:12:42', '2023-01-09 16:12:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '1-9-22 Steve Schone called to let me know that Planstin will pay for her wellness visit since she had so much trouble with her provider. Tania needs to send me the bill and I will forward it to Steve. Steve will forward it to Leslie Kraning who was approved the cost since she didn''t have her card yet. YAY!!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 16:04:53', '2023-01-09 16:04:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '1-9-22 Chuck sent email with valid point saying CirrusMD is overlapping with Redirect and therefore he doesn''t want to use it or even register. I told him he doesn''t have to use it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 15:54:20', '2023-01-09 15:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111236014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, '1-9-2023: Jacqueline e-mailed requesting cancellation of her plan.  I replied to her (&amp; cc''d Jeffrey Bursteen), letting her know Jeffrey helps work thru the cancellations w/our members &amp; that he would be in touch.  Made sure she knows that the cancellation requires her signature so she''d know the e-mail was not adequate.  Sent Jeffrey Teams chat so he''d look for the e-mail too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-09 15:43:59', '2023-01-09 15:43:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111236003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108725010', 'Scott Burns', NULL, '1-9-2023:  Scott called w/more questions re: pre-x items.  He wanted to know how pre-x is determined again, so we went over how the guidelines describe pre-x, the 1 yr waiting period, phase-in period, calculating your saving w/MPB vs having the pre-x pd right away on trad ins, etc.
     - He asked about trad ''ins'' & open enrollment period.  He''s going to think, because he''s not sure this is a good fit for his family & their pre-x conditions. (Daughter''s ongoing back issues.  Son''s stomach issues. Etc...)
     - Scott also said when he talked to Rosana he had a super difficult time hearing her.  That she didn''t seem to hear what he was saying either due to background noise & the connection.     - CA

It came to my attention after-the-fact, that Scott needed help regarding his son''s endoscopy.  I called & LM offering to help if our conversation did not answer his questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-09 15:14:21', '2023-01-09 15:32:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111181016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005692772', 'Marguerite Sherwin', NULL, '01.09.2023 Marguerite called requesting a lab that is close to where she lives. 
At first, looking at her profile on CRM, it showed her plan was Care+. So I had a hard time understanding what she wanted covered when she doesn''t have preventative with Care+.
While consulting with Cari via teams, Cari checked Admin123 and realized she had changed plans to Direct, where now she has preventative and she can go to any lab she likes, as long as they practice RBP. During that time, Marguerite had to go and hung up.
During my call with Muffy, she shared that she attempted to have her lab work done at Cleveland Clinics, but Cari shared conviction via experience with them that they are adamant about working with traditional insurance only.
I called Muffy back and left her a VM to call us back so I can give her the details and options of the labs and how to research one (JasonHealth.com AND WalkinLab) NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-09 15:12:26', '2023-01-09 15:12:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111181008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086537002', 'Katherine Kavich', NULL, '01.09.2023 Called to learn how to attain proof of insurance for tax documentation. 
I was unsure, so I needed to call her back (both trainers were pre-occupied).
After consulting with Jennifer via teams, I called Katherine back to transfer her to Planstin and make her request with them.
It turned out that she needed documentation of proof coverage for her preventative and medical cost sharing. SO I forwarded her to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-09 14:58:40', '2023-01-09 15:05:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091197009', 'Stephen Jacobs', NULL, 'Stephen called Leo to cancel, stating that he''s now getting employer benefits, yet he''s self employed. I tried to do a side by side, but his wife was telling him to hang up on me and not talk to me. I sent CXL form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-09 14:54:34', '2023-01-09 14:54:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111173009', 'Jonathan Surdam', NULL, '1-9-22 Enrolled in Delta Dental Clear Plan $39 for Feb. 1st start date. He already received  a digital ID card. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 14:53:12', '2023-01-09 14:53:12'),
