  ('zcrm_1579374000111235003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106216002', 'Jarrod Hunt', NULL, 'Jarrod messaged me in response to my greeting message on SalesIQ and he asked if we offer any Dental benefits or anything along those lines. I explained to him about the WHLC program that is included in his plan and that he would need to speak to his Advisor about the Dental Plans we do offer outside of his Plan though. As a type of Add on plan. I gave him the member concierge phone number for him to call about WHLC and I will give his info and whatnot to Leonardo to call him asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2023-01-09 14:15:02', '2023-01-09 14:15:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111190047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '1-9-22 Etta confirmed in her account that she upgraded to Select+ as of Oct. 1st with the new Select guidelines. All set for that and she knows her new monthly fee now too. She will call MPB Concierge Team for access WHLC for discounts on dental and vision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 14:11:29', '2023-01-09 14:11:29'),
