  ('zcrm_1579374000111190042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480020', 'Marian Salley', NULL, '1-9-22 Marian called and wants to make sure she''s protected in case her lymphoma comes back. It''s been in remission since about 2015 but she gets regular checkups and has another one coming up soon in March. I suggested she gets a letter from her doctor stating it''s been in remission and provide a date. I will pass it along with Dr. Lee with Zion and get his response.  She knows of Jan. 15th deadline in case we need to switch her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 13:26:55', '2023-01-09 13:26:55'),
