  ('zcrm_1579374000111190037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '1-9-22 April enrolled in SECURE EF $2500/$765. She included Alec who is 22 and had his own catastrophic membership with LHS. This will protect him way better. She is sending an email to LHS to cancel her own membership and will have Alec cancel his own. They are good to go for Feb. 1st start date. I waived the $100 fee since was a former MPB member with me. She appreciated that! She was happy with how easy it was.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 12:57:32', '2023-01-09 12:57:32'),
