  ('zcrm_1579374000111190003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '1-9-22 Bobbi called to make sure her C4 Cigna plan is active. In her C4 account everything looks good and effectuated. But, I asked if she''s seen the new billing come out and she hasn''t yet. So, I told her to call Cigna directly and make sure he account is up to date with the billing and that she''s good to go for 2023. It looks like her plan was put through on 11/3/2022. So, it''s before any issues were taking place with renewals, as far as I know. She will let me know if she runs into any troubles.
UPDATE - payment went through today for $1481.34.  We also checked to make sure her new address is showing - 369 Cree Ct. Lyons, CO 80540. It is showing up in all areas of C4, so no problems. She also received her notification from Cigna at her new address in Lyons. All appears to the accurate.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-09 10:49:58', '2023-01-09 10:58:57'),
