  ('zcrm_1579374000111161003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', NULL, 'Member emailed me an email chain showing that she cancelled her daughter Hope from the plan last year from RCI.  Member never contacted either MPB or Sedera about this change.  Member not happy about having multiple entities.  Clearly did not understand plan.  She has requested cancellation I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-09 10:32:59', '2023-01-09 10:32:59'),
