  ('zcrm_1579374000111133028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111535002', 'Michael Furi', NULL, 'Michael let me know he will call me Wednesday to finalize his application.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2023-01-09 10:09:41', '2023-01-09 10:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111115018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103260002', 'Beth Fults-osburn', NULL, 'Beth called and she did not verify that her OBGYN was in the network and is very disappointed that she is at her appointment and is just now finding out that the doctor is not in-network. I asked Beth if she called us here on the concierge team for assistance and she stated no, that she just wants to continue going to the doc she''s been going to for 25 years. When I explained to Beth that she does need to verify that the doc is in network, she got upset and stated that this plan is worthless. I tried to explain to Beth that if she were to have contacted the concierge team we would have walked her through how to find an in-network provider and how to present her card. Beth said this insurance just isn''t working out for her. She will be contacting Leo. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-09 09:51:47', '2023-01-09 09:51:47'),
