  ('zcrm_1579374000111120013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108424017', 'Jennifer Eisenberg', NULL, '01.9.23 @11:19 AM-  Jennifer called asking for  her ZION MEMBER NUMBER before submitting  a need request.. I had to stay in the call because I am not sure if the call would drop if I left. Her Zion number is  @ 122451440. RB.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-09 09:17:34', '2023-01-09 09:18:42'),
