  ('zcrm_1579374000111120008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109285002', 'Michael Danze', NULL, '01.09.23@ 9:50 AM - Michael called to learn about his new plan. I sent him a link to schedule a welcome call. The letter reads .... " We would like to schedule a 30 minute welcome call to review all of the features and advantages available to you with the MPowering Benefits Group Medical Cost Sharing Program" . Are we going to call  ourselves  MPB.HEALHT OF MPowering Benefits. ??    Rb
