  ('zcrm_1579374000111131003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904017', 'Angie Hernandez', NULL, 'On 1/6/23 I received an email from Sedera letting me know that this member would like to cancel.   Somehow this member found and filled out the Cancellation request.  Over the weekend, member emailed me and Sedera letting us know that they did not want to cancel because they were in the middle of a need.  Advisor Denny Watkins said that member''s spouse and he had a discussion earlier in the week and that is where this request came from.  Clearly there was some misunderstanding.  I will attache a copy of the submitted cancellation request and then delete same.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-09 07:46:40', '2023-01-09 07:46:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111115008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089271002', 'Kimberly Jarman', NULL, '1.9.23 - Kimberly called about her telehealth. We got her all set with resetting her password and she is going to see what the CirrusMD doc says about her illness. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-09 07:34:01', '2023-01-09 07:34:01'),
