  ('zcrm_1579374000111005142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '1-6-2023:  Skiing in Jackson Hole & hurt his knee.  Can tell he needs to see an orthpedic doc and will need an MRI, but he travels a lot & was unsure how to find a good doc.  
     - His first concern:  when he got hurt on the mtn, he was afraid he didn''t have help if he used the emerg srvcs at the bottom of the hill, so declined med care.  We went over how it works: no ins, ''cash-pay'', ask for ''cash-pay'' disc, offer to pay your 1k IUA & ask them to bill you for the bal, etc.  Then, call us w/det med coded inv, pymt receipts & we''ll show you how to sub a ''med need'' req.  He appreciated knowing for next time.
     - He got home to Aspen & called us.  He leaves tomorrow (for a week) for Salt Lake & wondered how he can find a good MRI/ortho doc to see while he''s there.  We got into his post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & I taught him how to use HCBB.  He was grateful & decided he''s going to see if he can get the MRI while he''s gone (I don''t know if they will do this w/out a doc''s order), but if he can, he''ll bring the results to his doc when he''s home.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-07 16:35:10', '2023-01-07 17:12:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111005137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '1-6-2023:  Kimberly called & orig tt Rosana who had questions, but Joan decided to trans this to me.  When I tt Kim & asked whether she went to an in network provider, she said she went to the same "in network" office she always goes to.  (I didn''t address this right now, hopefully they did not leave the network.)  We then discussed needing to present her Planstin card at the appt.  She said, you know, I did give them my card.  The gal at the desk was new though, so she wasn''t sure why they hadn''t billed Planstin.  She''s going to go back to the doc''s office to see if they can bill for the procedure and reimb her when they receive the money.  Hopefully, it won''t bounce back because of a network issue.  (Fingers crossed!)     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-07 16:34:52', '2023-01-07 16:34:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111055023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '01.06.2023 Unfortunately Christopher injured his knee skiing. Wants to know how to proceed to searching for a specialist and be able to use our services.
He is sure he will need an MRI.
I brought Cari in given such a new scenario, and sensitive situation for Christopher. 
Cari suggested he get in front of a computer to access HCBB to start his research.
She guided him to find his Post Welcome Call Email by Vanessa.
Cari then proceeded to guide him through maneuvering HCBB. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-06 18:00:40', '2023-01-06 18:10:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111005129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106407002', 'Maria Faria', NULL, '1-6-2023:  Maria''s husb Victor signed Maria up for this plan.  He called &amp; Maria kicked in on getting an idea of RX pricing.  They don''t need the items now, so he''s fine if I look it over &amp; get back to them next week.  I tried to show him how to pull up the RX Quote req form, but the link wasn''t working, so I just took everything over the phone.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-06 17:43:46', '2023-01-06 17:43:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111055018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '01.06.2023 Kristen send in an RX quote via Cognito forms for NP Thyroid 90MG, 90days, Generic OK.
I found her:
NP Thyroid, 90MG, 90 Days: Walgreens $52.95.
NP Thyroid, 90MG, 90 Days: King Sooper $94.74
I sent her both coupons, because her preference was KS, but seriously more than the other pharmacies, so I saved the least expensive coupon from the other pharmacies and checked with our international shopper, Reid, just in case. Reid did not have an option for us on this drug.
I went ahead and forwarded her the coupons I downloaded for her: KS and Walgreens. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-06 17:14:06', '2023-01-06 17:14:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111064026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111063013', 'Stephanie Hoffman', NULL, '1-6-23 Heather Eden moved Stephanie to me to be her Advisor after showing proof of our email communications. Stephanie has a DPC and couldn''t afford her DPC+MPB Direct, so she cut out MPB and went to Zion Direct.   I educated her on everything this summer.  Heather is delightful to work with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-06 17:08:33', '2023-01-06 17:08:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111005121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, '1-6-2023:  Juan called.  His wife is having pain that she wants to see gyno for & he wondered how to hndl it since it''s not ''prev care''.  We went over presenting as ''cash-pay'', asking for a ''cash-pay'' disc, no ins, & making sure to save all pymt receipts, get detailed inv, etc.  If looks like will be ongoing we only have 6 mos to sub a ''med need'' so they inclued the early  expenses due to that specific issue.  Pay up to your $2500 IUA and ask them to bill any bal past that if they can.  Call us & we''ll walk him thru how to sub.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-06 17:04:20', '2023-01-06 17:04:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111064021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '1-6-22 Dear Wendy,
