Marta', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-06 16:04:10', '2023-01-06 16:04:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111055013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109499017', 'Thomas Mele', NULL, '01.06.2023 Mary called because she was struggling with logging into her MPB portal to change her banking information for payment.
We backtracked and started over with me on the phone, but it worked just fine at that time. 
I shared with her, just in case she could not access her portal again in the future that she can access a lot of forms without signing in through the member update forms list. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-06 15:39:03', '2023-01-06 15:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000111064016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, '1-6-22 Lisa and Tim wanted to explore other options for 2023 because they didn''t understand that they can go into a doctor in person. She thought she could only do virtual healthcare. She has a bump she wants looked at and a should issue. She also wants to see a podiatrist possibly. They''ve been members for 1 year already.  These will not be deemed pre-x. They are all new and she hasn''t even seen a doctor for anything yet. Their wellness visits went fine. Except, her Dr. did a dexascan that she had to pay for since it was coded as diagnostic. I explained how ACA works and she understood. We reviewed C4 plans and Friday Health is the cheapest at $88 with $1097 APTC. But, is she needs surgery on anything, it will cost them likely the MOP of $9100 per individual. If he needs something too, then it could be $15K-$18K instead of $3K. The decided to stay put. That was with his income at $70K estimated. Their Cobra dental and vision will run out at the end of March. They want both and they are NOT interested in the HMA. He wants regular ins and he will find out what carriers their dentist accepts. I''ll research for them at that point.  Also, the use Dr. Jose Delgado, Dr. Jennifer Christensen, Dr. Mark Birmingham.
They will stay put for 2023. I also reminded them the last bill should have included their $25 annual renewal fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-06 15:36:16', '2023-01-06 15:36:16'),
