  ('zcrm_1579374000111005106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651012', 'Sheila deAnda', NULL, '1-6-2023:   Sheila called very confused by her healthcare & all the entities.  I took her back to her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & we went over how there will be adj since last year (ie: no PHCS ntwk starting 1/1/23), but that the e-mail is a great resource!  Unfortunately, Planstin told her today the chg was not effective until 2/1/23 last week, when in fact it is as of 1/1/23.
     - She''s going to watch for the new Planstin pdf card & get that to her colonoscopy prov.  We talked about everything must be coded as ''prev'' (& anything not could throw off the coding).  Alos went over how to hndl, IUA, etc, if becomes diag.
     - They are doing an endoscopy while they have her under that is pre-x & diagnostic.  We disc making sure they code them appropriately, trying to keep the ''prev'' & the ''diagnostic'' separate for pymt by Planstin on the colonoscopy.  She seems to truly understand how this works.
