  ('zcrm_1579374000111015033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106535002', 'Richard Lancaster', NULL, '01.06.23- 11:23 AM-   Richard Lancaster is a brand-new member. Just called to ask about steps to take if he needs a prescription quote.  He is not in need of any prescription right now. I confirmed he had his W.elcome Call  with Vanessa.  I confirmed he received a post welcome summary email on Dec 7/22.  Suggested he uses as a reference if has any additional questions.  Rb.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-06 09:19:38', '2023-01-06 09:19:38'),
