  ('zcrm_1579374000110976006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104598010', 'Anna Hopkins', NULL, '1-5-2023:  Michele Rebal asked me to call Ann Hopkins re: her ID card.  According to Anna she was told in her ''Welcome Call'' she should have a Zion ID cd.  I let her know they don''t actually send Zion ID cards any longer &amp; I explained why.  Also went over how to present as a ''cash-pay'' pt, ask for a ''cash-pay'' disc, pay up to your 5k IUA, get det inv w/med coding &amp; pymt rec.  If something does happen, call us for instructions on sub a ''med need'' because there is a 6mo deadline for sub.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 23:52:34', '2023-01-05 23:52:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105651001', 'Emily Ordal', NULL, '1-5-2023:  Daniel called & I brought Nahla into the conversation to show her how to handle his questions.  
     - We went over his req''d immunizations and it looks like his Planstin sb helpful w/some if not all.  I ck''d that KS is on the OptumRX eliq pharmacies & let him know he presents his Planstin card & has the pharmacy call Planstin who will get them the info/or get them to OptumRX to get the nec info for billing.  But, what is cov''d he should not owe anything for.
     - He''s also trying to select a new PCP.  He couldn''t find their post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail so I resent the orig.  Then we got him registered on HCBB and I explained how it works.  He''s going to watch for their new ''no phcs'' Planstin card pdf.  I told him how to present the card to his choice of office (he''s going to find some offices of int between now & then).  He knows he has to keep everything medically coded as ''prev care''.  Once he gets set he knows he can call for more guidance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 21:05:55', '2023-01-05 21:05:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066023017', 'Christopher Aird', NULL, '1-5-2023:  Kayla contacted us via SalesIQ, but the sales chat was missed.  Julia sent me a copy so I could reach out to Kayla who only prov a contact ph #: 425-306-7592 (no e-mail address).  I called & LM for Kayla.  Zion does not do allergy testing.  [In a non-emerg situation.]  I encouraged her to contact the concierge team when she needs guidance & prov our hours & #.  I also let her know I can provide a copy of the curr Memb Guidelines so she knows what is & is not shared if she wants to call us w/her e-mail address.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 20:31:58', '2023-01-05 20:31:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056904243', 'Samantha Camerino', NULL, '1-5-2023:  Daniel called.  He wanted to find an in ntwk PCP.  We went over the chg to the ''prev care'' & no longer having a req''d ntwk.  Then I resent him his post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail so we could walk thru HCBB together.  He wanted help knowing where to start.  He''ll watch for his new pdf Planstin card for the RBP and will call if he has questions.  We went over how to present to the doc''s off, must stay ''prev only'', etc.  It sounds like once he picks an office, he may call again to go over the specific details.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 17:49:00', '2023-01-05 17:49:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110939054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, '1-5-22 Bruce is aging into Medicare March 1st and Laura needs to join on her own. She can rejoin SECURE. She works for BVSD as W2 only part-time. But, she also has a quilting business that she does on the side. She will set up a business license with the State of CO. She knows to do this Feb. 1st -20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-05 16:51:53', '2023-01-05 16:52:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110939049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '1-5-22 John wanted to understand how to access all of his benefits. He wasn''t familiar with CirrusMD. He sort of remembered me sharing about Life Care. He never knew of Whole Healthy Living. He''s interested in accessing all of them. His sister was diagnosed with terminal cancer recently and he realizes Life Care might be a great, helpful resource for this. He completed his upgrade a while back. He''s all set on that front. He knows of the new cost from $378 to $493.78. He realizes is he went back to health ins. that he''d probably freak out about the cost. So, he''s ok with the membership fee increase. His wife has a great LTC policy from a former employer. But, he''s been self-employed all along and was curious my thought about LTC. I mentioned Living Benefits through NLG and explained how that works and opens up the opportunities for help in case of critical, chronic or terminal illesses. He will review Living Benefits online on NLG''s site and reach out if wants to learn more. He was super thankful I called him and answered all of his questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-05 16:43:46', '2023-01-05 16:43:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110939038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111173009', 'Jonathan Surdam', NULL, '1-5-22 Tom and Debra are the parents of Jonathan. He''s 27 and they are helping him to get proper ins. He''s been in a drug and alcohol rehab program here in CO since Feb. of 2022. He''s gone through each phase of the program and graduated as an alumni of the program. He seems to like CO and he''s working at a restaurant in Boulder now as W2 employee making $36K per year. He will get about a $168.04 APTC. I recommended the Friday Bronze Co-Pay + Vision Exam. His cost will be $100.54 and full cost is $268.58. They will review it further and ponder. They might just enroll him on their own. I let them know about making payment which is most important 7-10 days following enrollment. Also, they know of the Jan. 15th deadline. All set for now. 
C4 Acct # 6106420568', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-05 16:16:57', '2023-01-05 16:20:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110939028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, '1-5-22 Amanda called and I reviewed her entire membership with her and she feels like she has a grasp again. She knew nothing about CirrusMD. She will call Concierge to get that set up and wants to learn about Whole Health Living Choices as well. She better understands when to use Redirect and Sedera. She knows of the price increase and added benefits with the new Guidelines. She seems pleased with all that included and will make better use of the benefits. Her son went to Urgent Care this past year for $600+ and was told to go and and get better. So, it was a pointless visit and $600 later. She will use the virtual app now. All set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-05 15:29:59', '2023-01-05 15:29:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091198002', 'Robyn Hallet', NULL, '1-5-2023:  Robyn is following-up re: pre-x cond (some kind of female issue).  Coming up on 1 yr = 5/1/2023, she learned from Rosana at that point she''ll phase into the 25k avail for sharing.  She''s going to see the doc & wanted to know options.  In her mind, if the doc thinks it will be surgery, she asked what happens if the cancels her memb, gets norm ins that''ll pay for all the pre-x, then after everything is done, she comes back.  We discussed it could mean reset on timelines & poss more pre-x items.  She seems to understand, is going to think about it,. She''ll let us know if she needs further asst.  She even asked about the fees if she decided to re-apply down the road.  She knows we do not have an ''open enrollment time period'' in the same way std ''ins'' does.  Robyn seems like a pretty good fit for our memb, except the pre-x issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 15:18:56', '2023-01-05 21:47:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108725010', 'Scott Burns', NULL, 'This note is out of order, I was still documenting when Rosana talked to Scott (see her above note):

1-5-2023:  Scott called (eff 1/1/2023) asking how he gets his daughter''s physical therapy for her ongoing back issues paid for.  He confirmed this is a pre-x condition.  Because his memb is only a few days old, I did not go over how pre-x items are not covered.  Instead, I felt it was imp for the sales team to address this.  Maybe they went over things & Scott will remember when they talk?  I reached out to the sales mgr Jeffrey Bursteen & he''s going to call Scott tomorrow w/or w/out Leonardo.  (Nahla helped out & left Scott a VM re: Jeffrey calling tomorrow.)

I did not give Scott any idea of the issue since his expectations seem very off.      - CA

While I was getting w/Jeffrey, it looks like Scott called back (I tried calling him & had some issues so maybe he was returning my call?).  I guess he didn''t mention to Rosana that we were already working together & it looks like she took the conversation into full education.  I did let Jeffrey know via a Teams chat this happened so he is aware of the situation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 14:59:54', '2023-01-05 23:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110912028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108725010', 'Scott Burns', NULL, '01.05.23-@ 4:38 pm - Scott called asking what steps to take to get physical therapy expenses reimbursed.  I sent him a link to schedule a Welcome Call first so he can learn about his plan.  Will check with Cari about P.T protocol. RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-05 14:43:40', '2023-01-06 10:00:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110939023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110465002', 'Josiah Payne', NULL, '01.05.2023 Josiah called to confirm the paperwork he uploaded would suffice to confirm him a business owner.  After consulting with Cari via teams, I forwarded him to Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-05 14:39:18', '2023-01-05 14:39:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109511001', 'Tierney Gonnello', NULL, 'Patti got her documentation complete before I did, so this refers to the above messages.

1-5-2023:  I called Dr Deepa Minhas''s office again today.  Phyllis is who Tierney''s been working with.  She said they are using a new 3rd pty billing agency & they can only bill for people on their list.  She kept coming back to they no longer accetp PHCS & to be honest, I was unable to get her past the PHCS thing.  I finally asked if they can bill & she said no, if it''s not in their list they cannot.
     tt Tierney, she understands the issue & knows ''prev care'' would be at their exp, but ''cash-pay'' for issues might still be an option w/the healthsharing.
     At this point of the conv, she decided they do not want the Secure plan, they want to go to something w/out the prev care & are ok w/no HSA qualification.  Since it''s just a few days into the memb, I trans her dir to Patti''s line.  She will LM for Patti if she doesn''t catch her to get the plan corrected.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 14:24:16', '2023-01-05 14:25:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110962013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104076002', 'Troy Ireland', NULL, 'While doing a search on Admin 123, I found an interaction, with a note that came through the member portal from this member, indicating that they want to cancel. I left a message for Troy, called the other number and spoke to his wife Eleni. She explained that there was an issue with something being denied from Zion, and preferred I speak with Troy. Gave her my info, he will call me tomorrow morning.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-05 14:05:34', '2023-01-05 14:05:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109511001', 'Tierney Gonnello', NULL, 'Member will be changing their plan as their pediatrician is not open to working w/Planstin.  So they want to change their plan to the Care+ and save the money', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-05 14:03:31', '2023-01-05 14:03:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, '1-5-2023:  Hillary called back, I tried to bring Rosana into the conversation, but when her system reset we lost her from the call.
     Hillary has been having follow-up mamm (3D w/ultrasound due to dense breasts) and wanted to know why they weren''t being pd for.  After disc we realized it''s the ''diagnostic'' medical coding that is causing issues.  The doc''s off keeps telling her ''ins'' covers follow-ups.  I explained her healthcare has diff components, which is diff than std ''ins'', which she seems to understand, although her doc''s off does not.
     For this ''follow-up'' appt (which they think is the last follow-up), they are telling her it will be med coded as diagnostic.  She knows this one will be her resp since it will be < her 1k IUA.  IF they decide she needs another follow-up appt, that will again be diagnostic, we went over there is a 6mo deadline for sub the exp on a ''med need'',  She will call me so we can go over a plan of action on how beat the deadline & include the next diag procedure as long as it''s within the year mark, so it can all go twds a single IUA & she would then prob have some sharing available.
     If this is her final follow-up, she knows that her ''prev care'' thru Planstin & the MEC may not cover the 3D w/ultrasound on a screening, so we''ll want her to speak to Planstin prior to the screening down the road.
     She seems to be getting stuck in a gap, the doc''s off not understanding that it''s the medical coding that''s causing issues, and the prev care vs diagnostic issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 13:57:47', '2023-01-05 14:01:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110929002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742009', 'Bridgett Mansfield', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2690 Question : Lost my user Id', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2023-01-05 13:50:52', '2023-01-05 13:50:52'),
