  ('zcrm_1579374000110939018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '1-5-22 April is interested in SECURE for ES or EF. April has been with LHS for many years and has learned it takes about 9 months to get reimbursed. But, she is wanting to be a little better protected. She''s paying $489 for Liberty Unite which is $2000 AUA with 15% co-share for all costs above AUA and protection stops at $1M. Son Alex is 22 and they got him the most catastrophic, affordable plan that protects him only up to $50K! She''s interested in adding him back to the family. She''s leaning towards $2500 IUA / $765 EF or $550 ES with SECURE. The only issue is Alex has had tosilitis that kept coming back every month but that''s when he was dating a girl that had tonsilitis and it''s probably why it never went away and is totally cleared up now bc they aren''t dating anymore.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-05 13:00:01', '2023-01-05 13:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110962003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476126', 'Robin Korosec', NULL, 'I spoke to Robin, nice lady. She is getting on her husband''s plan through his employer.  Small premium contribution, and the employer is paying 80% of the deductible.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-05 12:44:52', '2023-01-05 12:44:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110909053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110495002', 'Darin Zogopoulos', NULL, '1-5-2023:  Darin called.  He ended-up in the ER today for kidney stones.  Orig he called for us to price his 4 RXs from the ER, but only had drug names & no qtys.  He was going to get qtys, but when I hadn''t heard back, he said they told him his total chg for the 4 was only ~$20, he decided just to grab them.  He''ll let us know if that chgs.
     - Since he''s not feeling well, I let him know there''s a 6mo deadline on sub a ''med need'', so he''s going to call in the next week or so to get help sub the ''med need'' for this issue.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 12:31:10', '2023-01-05 12:31:10'),
