  ('zcrm_1579374000110939013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091920135', 'Karen Vaughan', NULL, '1-5-22 Karen was needlessly kicked off of Sedera per their communication to her. Then they told me she didn''t have to cancel until 12-31-23. I tried to save her but she''s already signed up with Ambetter for 2023 and doesn''t want to make changes again. It''s such a big bummer because she didn''t want to cancel and she technically didn''t have to. Grrr.....  Sedera was only cancelling Access clients and not Select+ clients. The Select+ can remain through the end of 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-05 11:33:55', '2023-01-05 11:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110939008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '1-5-22 I sent Sally an email explaining her membership and all that''s included but she never saw it. So, I sent it again now and left her a vm to make sure she finds it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-05 11:29:25', '2023-01-05 11:29:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110912008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108404001', 'Helen Placente', 'Need to reschedule Welcome Call', 'Justin was transformed to me from Cari stating that his member''s Welcome Call needed to be rescheduled and when she called the Concierge Team she was told they could not reschedule the call.  He asked for the link to the Welcome Call Calendar and that he would help her out in scheduling the call.  I have sent her the email with the link as well as cc''d Justin on it.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2023-01-05 11:15:55', '2023-01-05 11:15:55'),
