  ('zcrm_1579374000110805067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107483002', 'Mario Perkins', NULL, '01.5.23- Mario Perkins ****  happy member ****  called to find out when and why he did not see any withdrawal from payments from his account.  Send his info to Patti.Rb.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-05 09:56:19', '2023-01-05 09:56:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110887051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077181001', 'Andrea McDonough', NULL, 'Andrea was transferred to me via Kelly F. Andrea and I discussed that she may need surgery, but would like to start with alternative care such as acupuncture and massage therapy. We went over registering for Whole Health Living Choices, and I sent her a list of in-network OBGYN''s in her area. I also advised that if this surgery is not specifically for fertility issues (which it sounds like it is more for pain and discomfort) that she ask the doctor to specifically put in their notes that it is for the pain only. Andrea understood and will reach out if she needs further assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-05 09:43:13', '2023-01-05 09:43:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110887046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090076002', 'Robert Domzalski', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as he will be aging into Medicare eff 2/1.  I will process cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-05 09:41:18', '2023-01-05 09:41:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110887041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078746049', 'Suzanne Swearengen', NULL, 'Member called in to ask a question re: business eligibility.  She is the owner of the business and her husband is employed by the business, she wanted to know if they could put him on as the primary.  I advised if she was the business owner she would have to be the primary and also that they would have to re-enroll.  She understood.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-05 09:39:16', '2023-01-05 09:39:16'),
