  ('zcrm_1579374000110886003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109649002', 'Sean Clouse', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Added secondary email as well. New to medical cost sharing. Very nice couple. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-05 07:59:59', '2023-01-05 07:59:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243567', 'Tanya Dueri', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Tanya called.  She went to the doc because she''s not feeling well.  They think it''s a hormone issue &amp; are trying to diagnose what type of imbalance.  It looks like she''s going to go over 1k IUA &amp; I made sure she''s aware of the 6mo deadline.  I sent her the temp for sub a ''med need'' &amp; we walked thru the process together.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 03:09:07', '2023-01-05 03:09:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110450002', 'Marianne Bashista', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Marianne sub an RX quote req for 2 items.  She''s fine w/the cheapest pharmacy.  We were short team membs due to illness today, so I ran these late at night & sent Costco''s coupons w/out getting to tt her to make sure that works.  Jewel Osco is second cheapest at a total of $44.07, rather than the Costco combined total of: $42.94.  Here''s what I sent:
     - Escitalopram 10mg, #90 tabs = $16.97 at Costco on RXGo
     - Norethindrone Acetate 5mg, #90 tabs = $25.97 at Costco on RXGo     - CA

1-6-2023:  Marianne decided she wanted Osco Drug instead, so here''s the new info:
      - Escitalopram 10mg, #90 tabs = $12.94 at Osco on RXGo
     - Norethindrone Acetate 5mg, #90 tabs = $30.36 at Jewel Osco on RXSaver     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 03:04:17', '2023-02-06 08:27:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107450009', 'Rita Lusteg', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Rita sub an RX quote.  After letting her know the options, she chose Costco.  I let her know in the e-mail with the following coupon, that Costco sometimes offers an even better disc than we can get, depending on the memb she has.
     - Alendronate (gen Fosamax) 70mg., #12 tabs (usually comes in a 4 tab dose pack, &amp; she wants 3  mos = #12 tabs = 84 day sup) = $8.99 at Costo on RXGo (highlighted details in the coupons paragraph).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-05 00:53:42', '2023-01-05 00:53:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110433001', 'Zachary Freedman', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Zachary called back & I didn''t realize he & Nahla had been talking.  He isn''t effective until 2/1/2023.  He says his advisor told him we would price up his RXs for him.  I let him know we do that for our active memb, but his memb isn''t eff yet.  We did a quick price on 2 of the items on they were super low.  The 3rd item is super exp, but he says his ins is no longer paying for it anyway.  At the end of the conv he says he hadn''t rec''d the form the team memb said they''d be sending, so he''ll watch for that.     - CA

I sent notice to:  Michele (& Jeffrey before I realized it was Michele''s resp)  re: the advisor signing up the memb & telling him to call us to see if it will work for him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 21:57:30', '2023-01-05 14:06:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605002', 'Kirk Schults', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Kirk called.  Said his sales rep told him to call the Concierge for all of his questions & never let him know he needs to sched a ''Welcome Call''.  He said he''d never rec''d info on how to sched that, then realized he''d prob deleted it.  Resent Patti''s ''Your Enrollment Complete'' e-mail from Outlook and went over how to sched his call.   He wanted me to do his ''Welcome Call'', but I let him know the team members who take care of the ''Welcome Calls'' set aside time off the phones to do the calls, that I cannot do that right now.  He''s going to sched his call and hopefully, that will take care of his questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 19:01:50', '2023-01-04 19:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109000002', 'Ronald Ware', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Ronald called.  His daughter is leaving for college tomorow &amp; he wanted to know if she''d have an ID Card to take w/her.  We went over how to present, that she''ll receive an MPB.Health reference card &amp; what is on it.  He''ll make sure she knows to say she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt, no card, no ins, &amp; that she has our ph $ to call w/questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 17:58:49', '2023-01-04 17:58:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, '1-4-2023:   Janet Thomson called to see if we had the CirrusMD issue has been corr.  I let her know it was actually her case that brought the issue to our attention & they submitted the correction support ticket, but it curr looks like end of bus tomorrow.  Hopefully, CirrusMD''ll send the correction e-mail with instructions to her once it''s resolved since Jennifer sent over the support tckt yesterday.  I''ll try to monitor once this is resolved and hopefully Jennifer or I can let her know the prob has been corr.
     Janet then went into how right out of the gate in the New Year & she can''t use her telehealth which is why she has the plan, so she''ll just cancel if she has to...  etc.  That now she has to spend more money for a doc''s appt.  I apologized and let her know we are very sorry for the inconvenience.  That we are working to resolve the issue now that we are aware of it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 17:56:55', '2023-01-04 17:56:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Healther called.  She wants to see a derm to check a mole she''s concerned could be cancerous.  We disc 1k IUA, only if issue may be shareable IF &gt; that.  She knows 6mo deadline for sub expenses for this issue if it looks like it''s nec.  Otherwise, will be out of pkt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 17:51:38', '2023-01-04 17:51:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789017', 'Pamela Wende', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Nahla covered pretty much everything, except that I gave Pamela a few names of oral surgeons in areas she said were most conv out of HCBB.  Pamela''s internet was down, but Nahla is sending her the HCBB instructions so she can look further if she desires.  I let her know we can walk thru how to use it when she gets it, but gave basic info:  Looking for green/green = high quality/fair priced providers.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 17:48:48', '2023-01-04 17:48:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105093002', 'Elizabeth Koster', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Eliz called.  She ended-up in the ER the day after Thansgiving.  She woke-up w/an excruciating headache &amp; fever.  The CirrusMD doc said she should go to the ER right away.  It turns out she had meningitis.  She called to learn how to sub a ''med need''.  Sent her the temp &amp; went over everything.  She knows there is a 6mo deadline.  If she needs further asst, she will let us know.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 17:42:28', '2023-01-04 17:42:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110867067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789017', 'Pamela Wende', NULL, '01.04.2023 Pamela is seeking a dentist and details on dental coverage through Planstin. 
I confirmed with Cari, via teams that we do not have dental coverage whatsoever.
The ONLY options:  WHLC has discount programs, and perhaps the advisor may offer real dental plans.  IF it becomes a ''medical'' need  (surgeries), then sometimes it moves to the medical cost sharing.
She has not had her welcome call yet, for another 2 weeks, and she needed to talk to someone for guidance.
Cari explained examples of what might be considered a medical situation, where healthshare would kick in. She explained pre-existing situations, and Pamela''s situation might fall under that, and for her it would not kick in till next January in 2024.
Cari guided Pamela to check out the WHLC site for discounts on visits, and asked Pamela registered for the site. 
Willing to travel to Sacramento to find a dentist, since none are close to her home.
Cari did share about not needing to be bound to a network anymore, since 1.1.2023.
HSA info. relayed: Pamela can choose any institution she wants, but be mindful of all the fees that are extracted. The tax advantage of it, and how she can use it towards her dental bills.
Cari searched for providers in Sacramento and Roseville (Nicholas Rotas) for her on HCBB with . And I sent her an email with instructions and a link to access HCBB, via outlook.
Due to little reviews found on HCBB, Cari guided Pamela to research on google for more reviews and rating. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-04 15:45:46', '2023-01-04 17:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '1-4-22 Lisa has paid twice now. She''s all set on that front. She''s mailing the check bc she can''t do anything online. She wants help with that. Cigna acknowledged her initial payment so her plan is Active. She sent the 2nd payment a few days ago via check in the mail. She will call Cigna to fix her online account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 15:39:06', '2023-01-04 15:46:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108407034', 'Bih Shya Gau', NULL, '1-4-2023:  I also was able to confirm that Bih Shya has a ''Welcome Call'' sched w/Jennifer on Fri, 1/13/2023 at 3:30pm eastern.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 15:38:04', '2023-01-04 15:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110805043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105651001', 'Emily Ordal', NULL, '01.04.23- EMILY FORSBERG/Ordal called to provide Nahla with her husband cel phone. 720.935.41.39. I related the msg to our concierge team. RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-04 15:24:54', '2023-01-04 15:24:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110805038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108407034', 'Bih Shya Gau', NULL, '01.04.23- Bih Shya Gau  (from Taiwan) called to confirm if  her Welcome Call was really scheduled for Dec 13 at 15:30.  I don''t have access to Welcome Calls Calendar  but Jen came out of her day off to confirm the call.... RB.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-04 15:09:20', '2023-01-04 15:09:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110867056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476126', 'Robin Korosec', NULL, '01.04.2023 Robin called to cancel with us due to attaining traditional insurance. I forwarded her to Jeffrey B. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-04 15:00:20', '2023-01-04 15:00:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare 3/1/23 1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor - 1/4/23 Spouse has already re-enrolled and Wendy told me that he will be submitting cancellation.  I will cancel plan', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-04 14:57:20', '2023-02-08 13:05:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899178', 'Daniel Klein', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50 age band eff 3/1/23.  1st notice sent - 1/4/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-04 14:46:59', '2023-01-04 14:46:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '1-4-22 I re-educated Karen on their entire membership. She was feeling lost and has paid for all of her endocrinologist visits, labs and imaging for her thyroid bc pre-x. But, they are members long enough that it Might be shared. But, I told her it might not be shared either since it''s maintenance possibly not shareable. But, encouraged her to call Concierge Team for pricing on imaging and labs that she needs often. Also, she had an ER visit in Oct. and that worked well with Sedera. It was shared quickly and easily. She and husband have blood pressure and cholesterol meds. They are now working with a nutritionist to improve their diets. Husband is newly diagnosed with diabetes as well. She asked about other memberships, but I recommended they stay put bc past their pre-x clause and they use the chiro care. Will use it more once they get reimbursed. She will send me an old bill that needs to be paid from about 1 year ago. Also they have their sons annual wellness visit from Aug. that still needs to be paid. I told her to contact Concierge for help with escalating it or send it to me to forward along if no resolution soon. I reminded her of Life Care. She''s feeling better again.  New cost is $1047.28 from $910 with $1500 IUA.  Not worth switching to SECURE at $915/$1000 bc of usage habits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 14:34:33', '2023-01-04 15:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, 'Member will be aging into Medicare 2/23. 1st notice sent 12/13/22.  2nd notice sent - 1/4', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-04 14:19:38', '2023-01-04 14:19:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, '1-4-23 Liz said "This is the most awesome insurance of my life! I know I''m not supposed to say insurance but I don''t know what to call it. The learning curve was huge. " But, now  that she''s used it, she understands how it works. She''s thrilled!  She has a double knee replacement coming up soon. Feb. 1st is the first knee surgery and the 2nd is sometime soon thereafter.  She also asked about massage, PT, chiro and acupuncture. She does mostly all alternative care her entire life which has served her very well until now that she needs knee surgeries.  I told her to call the Concierge Team for Whole Healthy Living Choices discounts on alternative care. She is thrilled to get some discounts if she can and also wants them on dental and vision. She lives up in Summit County, so options will be more limited.  Also, Elizabeth used to pay $900+ for her terrible ins with Anthem about 3-4 years ago. So, she''s even more thrilled about how affordable this is even though the price increased significantly for her this year to $493.78 from $378.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 13:57:04', '2023-05-17 12:45:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061768243', 'Haley Collins', NULL, '1-4-23 Elizabeth (Liz) is Haley''s mom and she wants Haley to contact me again to re-enroll. Haley was too confused the first time around but now Liz understands how it all works, even though Sedera is slightly different. She''s grasping self-pay. Haley is 29. I told Liz I can waive the $100 of the $125 since she was already a member in the recent past. Hopefully I will hear from Haley very soon. Liz will be seeing Haley tonight and will give her my #.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 13:52:07', '2023-01-13 12:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120814004', 'Reid Collins', NULL, '1-4-23 Elizabeth Collins referred her son to MPB and Redirect but he just contacted Redirect and signed up for a plan through them without understanding what he was doing. So, she''s instructing him to call me and sign up correctly through MPB. I explained CARE+ to her in quick terms. He''s healthy and just needs the basics in case of something terrible happening. She also thinks the mental health benefit will be terrific for him.  He never does his annual wellness visit, so CARE+ is great at $215/$1000. She will have him contact me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 13:49:31', '2023-06-15 14:45:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108946002', 'Charles Warner', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Charles called concerned that his payment method on file is linked to the wrong address.  He could not get his computer to work, so I manually sent him Patti''s "Pymt Chg Form" link via e-mail so he can take care of it later.  I went over in the e-mail how the lower pymt info section is where he will put the address linked to his bank acct, yet if it asks at the top of the form in his primary memb info section for his add, that would be the home address he has listed on his memb.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 13:47:32', '2023-01-04 13:47:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001375013', 'Betsy Gustafson', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Betsy called to ask how to sched her ''Welcome Call''.  Sent her the link & made sure she knows to input her full name & the ph # she wants them to call at the sched time.
     - She also said she cannot find her Planstin card.  I reminded her ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev Care ONLY.  That their plan chg''d to no req''d ntwk on 1/1/23, so they are actually sending new Planstin pdf files to everyone in the next few days, so she''ll have that soon.  I let her know most places accept the pdf w/no issues.
     - She had questions on her influenza (?) shot.  I let her know Planstin can provide OptumRX approved pharmacies in her area.  Then provide your Planstin card at the approved pharmacy where they will call to get info on billing the items for her.     - CA

Betsy wrote back & she sched her ''Welcome Call''     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 13:46:15', '2023-01-05 00:16:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110867045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105651001', 'Emily Ordal', NULL, '01.04.2023 Danny called to confirm if the vaccines he has to take that are required by his EMT program, are covered under his Planstin insurance portion. 
He said he was going to email me the list of the 6 vaccines, and I offered to call him back after I have consulted with Cari. 
Cari guided me to show Danny how to access all this new information, via his Post Welcome Call Email.
There Danny can independently search about his topic, and for this time he needed to view the ACA government link regarding vaccines. 
Then Danny will contact Planstin to generate Pharmacies via OptumRX, then visit the chosen pharmacy with Planstin card and present it, for the pharmacy to contact Planstin then, in order to attain the code for billing on vaccines.
I called Danny back and had to leave a message for him to call me back, so we can go over the process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-04 13:18:33', '2023-01-04 17:36:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057645157', 'Lisa Profera', NULL, 'Member''s 1/23 payment declined 1st notice sent - 1/4.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-04 13:05:00', '2023-01-04 13:05:00'),
