  ('zcrm_1579374000110868026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106218014', 'Alexander Tocco', NULL, '1-4-22 Alexander never made his payment. He thought he qualified for Medicaid all of the sudden. But, once I told him we input his income at $22K then that sounded right. He owes $34.66. I told him to call Cigna to make his payment. If they don''t let him and they already cancelled his plan, I told him we''d have to move to a backup plan and re-enroll. I asked him to let me know. He was at work and distracted. We will see. He said he understood.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 11:28:22', '2023-01-04 11:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109511001', 'Tierney Gonnello', NULL, '1-4-2023:  Tierney called.  They took this plan because their docs were in ntwk &amp; she was ready to cancel because her daughter, Wrenley Gonnello''s doc quit the PHCS ntwk.  I was able to let her know the  ntwk no longer matters &amp; she asked me to call the doc''s off = closed until tomorrow:  Dr. Deepa Minhas (female) 973-543-1996     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 11:27:12', '2023-01-04 11:27:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106218014', 'Alexander Tocco', NULL, '1-4-22 Left vm for Alexander to make sure he made his payment of $34.66 to make his plan effective.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 11:20:06', '2023-01-04 11:20:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '1-4-22 I left a vm for Lisa to pay her $11.13 which was due by 1/1/23. I hope she paid it already. Otherwise, we might have to re-enroll her for Feb. 1st. Case: 0U667F from Cigna.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 11:17:36', '2023-01-04 11:17:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571380', 'Barbara Young', NULL, '1-4-2022:  Barbara called in.  This plan is just too hard for her (having to sub her own need, etc).  I went to trans her to Jeffrey Bursteen, but she said she doesn''t have any WI-FI until Friday, so she''ll call back then and ask for him, knowing there will be a form she needs to sign.  Since Friday is a few weeks in front of the deadline, I didn''t pursue her any harder.  We just left it she''ll call Fri for him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-04 11:10:54', '2023-01-04 11:10:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109497017', 'Lucas Butterfield', NULL, '1-4-22 Lucas called bc Anthem can''t find him in their system to make his payment. I called C4 and spoke with Shakira who says no payments are accepted via C4 which is absurd since they give that option. Either way, his updated file with the 1/1/23 start date was sent on 12/30/22. So, he needs to give it more time for them to see him in their system. She said it can take up to 21 days. I told him to keep calling every few days to try to make hjs binder payment so  it becomes effective. He will definitely do that. He has some back pain from ski instructing that he wants to do PT for soon, if possible. He can pay cash if need be and then get reimbursed but knows that''s no ideal.  TKT # is 221216-001828.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 11:10:07', '2023-01-04 11:10:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110805028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110880002', 'Alexander Crowe', NULL, 'Call back friday 10 am mid morning.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2023-01-04 11:07:05', '2023-01-04 11:07:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110843044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, 'No response. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-04 11:02:52', '2023-01-04 11:02:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110867008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '01.04.2023 John called bc  he wanted more clarification on what his current plan is.
He inquired specifically about having all the appropriate contact information, since the Sedera conversion.
He inquired about  chiropractic services and our mental wellness program/services. I shared about M&S EAP, but then he seemed confused as to where he would access this. I got the impression he needed different guidance since he is on an older plan, so I consulted with Cari to learn more, but had to offer John a call back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-04 10:55:34', '2023-01-04 10:55:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110843039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109271002', 'Patricia Reuss', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-04 10:43:34', '2023-01-04 10:43:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110868003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '1-4-22 Marta and Bill are a little concerned, mostly Bill is concerned about a major health event and the costs being shared. They were thinking of getting Marta a reg health insurance plan to protect her even more. But, they''d have a super high ded of $9100 and wants MCS to cover that part. But, they understand it''s considered secondary and it''s flipping it on its head with paying the first dollars in. I suggested Living Benefits with NLG as a better option to protect themselves and their assets. This will take care of the critical, chronic, terminal illnesses that they sound like they''re worried about. They will ponder it and get back to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-04 10:23:38', '2023-01-04 10:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110867003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084812002', 'Hermilo Cavazos', NULL, '01.04.2023 Hermilo called sharing that him and his wife are trying to get pregnant and wants to make sure they are covered, since adding his wife to the plan. She is covered, she''s passed the 60 day mark as a new member.
I consulted with Cari via teams, I shared they don''t have to open a need until they are pregnant, call us back at this number and we will guide them from there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-04 10:23:35', '2023-01-04 10:23:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110861008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085046010', 'Mary Stavros-wells', NULL, 'Spoke to Mary, she was in a hurry to leave, was a bit rude and just wants to cancel. CXL form sent', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-04 10:21:20', '2023-01-04 10:21:20'),
