  ('zcrm_1579374000110843018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662008', 'Juan Enriquez', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2023-01-04 09:21:36', '2023-01-04 09:21:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110805023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077181001', 'Andrea McDonough', NULL, '01.04.23- Andrea McDonough called asking if ZION would cover infertility related treatments.   She needs  a procedure called hysteroscopic lysis of adhesions (or adhesiolysis), where a camera type instrument (hysteroscope) is introduced vaginally into the uterine cavity to allow direct surgical treatment of scar tissue under anesthesia. Long story short,  i reached out to Jen and she confirmed that: 1- out of preventive care, no need to be in network, 2- Zion does not share infertility related issues including acupunctured treatment for which she is hoping to be reimbursed.  I sent Andrea an email stating that ZION will not share fertility expenses. RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2023-01-04 09:20:03', '2023-01-05 08:36:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110860008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039700101', 'David Larochelle', NULL, 'David called because he is receiving a bill from the anesthesiologist from his preventative colonoscopy. I had to transfer David to Redirect since they are responsible for that bill. JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-04 08:58:18', '2023-01-04 08:58:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110848013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'Member''s enrollment Fee &amp; Share Amount declined 1st notice sent  - 1/4 via email Member submitted corrected Acct # I reran.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-04 08:55:24', '2023-01-04 10:27:12'),
