  ('zcrm_1579374000110778024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109367016', 'James Bracken', NULL, '1-3-2022:  Leah says the higher IUA was a mistake &amp; after-the-fact, she tells us she''s already tt Patti.  Let her know Patti will guide her correctly.   She''s going to put her question about when the change to the IUA will be effective into the comment section so Patti can see it &amp; answer.  She called because she didn''t know how to find the form Patti told her to fill out.  Nahla was able to guide her to the corr cognito form...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-03 18:27:11', '2023-01-03 18:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110762064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107380001', 'Edward Barlow', NULL, '01.03.2023 Edward called to learn how to move forward after speaking to CirrusMD regarding back pain.
CirrusMD recommended a back specialist, after hearing his symptoms. He consulted with us to see how to attain a specialist and if he needs a PCP.
I consulted with Cari for detailed guidance, given the sensitive situation.
Cari discussed Pre-existing conditions: symptoms, treatments, doc visits.
Cari took the time to coach in detail on how to use HCBB to his benefit to search providers, hospitals and facilities and how they are rated.
Cari went in to also guide Edward on Healthgrades as well for ratings, and compare to google and what their patients are saying.
    -Present as cash-pay-patient, and that some facilities might ask for a referral, and reminded him that he is responsible for his $1000 IUA.
    -Discussed the medical need process and imperative timelines.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-03 17:20:21', '2023-01-03 17:40:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110762059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '01.03.2023 Tina called to gain more confidence and understanding of our MAP Mental health benefits.
Tina also wanted guidance on how to use WholeHealthLiving, and I brought Cari in to provide detail guidance on how to access the site:
-our website mpb.health.
-Member portals and Updates
-scroll down to the additional resources
-click log-in, can register if you have not
-USE the name primary name, bday...etc on the MPB account (Frederick...)
-Everyone who is on the plan will use the same account.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-03 17:06:27', '2023-01-03 17:06:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110762054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109367016', 'James Bracken', NULL, '01.03.2023 Leah called to help changing IUA to a lower one.
I referred to Cari, and she suggested to be brought it due to rules and regulations on using it when going down to a lower IUA.
Cari guided Leah on the form, to be detailed on the comment section, to help communicate with Patti. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-03 16:43:10', '2023-01-03 16:43:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110772046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, '1-3-22 Calling to understand when to use Apex/RCI card vs MPB card and if the flu shots are at no cost. I explained the cards and I forget if flu shots are included at no cost with ACA. She will call MPB Concierge Team now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-03 16:12:59', '2023-01-03 16:12:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110772041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '1-3-22 Tania was at her wellness visit at All Valley Women''s Care for her annual wellness visit and they won''t let her leave without paying cash. They won''t accept a RBP pricing. The ONLY want to accept in-network rates and won''t provide the Medicare reimbursement rate. Cash price is $425 as new patient and only $30 less as returning patient. Both women in the billing dept were very difficult and unwaivering. John K and Steve Schone were offering their advice. Steve is getting Desiree to move Tania to RBP tomorrow and will send her the new card. I asked Steve if Planstin could at least pay Tania back the RBP price and Tania pays the rest. He will let me know tomorrow. MPB might be able to pay the rest. She has a mammogram coming up at Aspen Valley Hospital. I told her to wait until she has to card and present the card to make sure they will accept the rate and possibly even have it paid up front from Planstin. She will hold tight on that front. She was a good sport but also frustrated bc this was a huge problem for her last year and it took many months to deal with. She''s willing to find another doctor''s office for her women''s wellness visit in the future who will accept RBP. Steve believes the ins cost is far less!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-03 16:05:53', '2023-01-03 16:05:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110762040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093035002', 'Corey Davis', NULL, 'in a lot of pain during the call
went to the doctor last week
first time using the insurance
pain in leg radiating from back down to hip to leg
got an appointment with Kansas City Uni. for his hip, lower spine, THEY say it might not be anything wrong with the hip and maybe herniated disc causing sciatica.
Lays on stomach most of the time.
Helped him open a need  with Zion, needed to forward him to Zion to get his member ID#.
Needs to remove spouse and children off his plan, so I walked him through completing the change form on the member portal update. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-03 15:11:07', '2023-01-03 15:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110772036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '1-3-22 Jennifer received notification from C4 and her response is this. 
Hi Wendy - 

I think this is the first part, where connect for health cancelled me and Gregg, together. They said they had to cancel both of us together, then they would open an account for just me.

I will wait and see,
Jennifer
I believe she''s correct. They had to cancel both plans before they could select one for just her. We tried to do this every way possible and it never worked. They are working on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-03 14:49:32', '2023-01-03 14:49:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110775046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002020095', 'Laura Herrera', NULL, 'Per Diane this member wants to cancel ASAP.  I assured her that I could cancel them now prior to billing on 1/5', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2023-01-03 14:48:38', '2023-01-03 14:48:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110762029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, '01.03.2023 Janet Thomson tried using CirrusMD cause she''d rather not have to go in to see the doctor but she received a message saying "Your account is inactive please contact your provider".
I consulted with Jen on this one, But I had to call Janet back to get her the guidance she needed. After speaking to Jen, it appears the glitch is on CirrusMD''s platform, so Jen emailed them and Cc''d me to observe the process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2023-01-03 14:43:45', '2023-01-03 15:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110772028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110789002', 'Devon Petersen', NULL, '1-3-23 Devon watched the video and is working part-time as employee since October as W2 as project manager for travel business. Could work FT with benefits but is choosing to work part-time to also create her own jewelry business. She loves rocks, stone and silversmithing.  She loves polishing rocks/stones to make jewelry. She will set up her LLC or business license before Feb. 1st to show self-employment. She has really bad cramps and went to get them checked out and her doctor and records say everything is fine, no problems found, no cancer, etc. Yes, she does her annual wellness visits and she does not currently have an HSA. She''s 31, soon to be 32 in the next few weeks. Wants Feb. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-03 14:31:00', '2023-06-05 10:49:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110778016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '1-3-2023: Steve called.  He needed help sub a ''med need'' to Zion.  He has a cystoscopy next week due to ongoing blood in his urine, so decided he will wait until after that appt to sub his ''med need'' as he knows he''s going over the 1k.  I made him aware of the 6mos deadline.  He will call if he needs further asst.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2023-01-03 14:27:31', '2023-01-03 15:36:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110715033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, 'Liz called in about a prescription: She is being told by Publix and Kroger that they no longer accept GoodRx coupons. I advised that this could be because these companies are coming up with their own prescription programs. I sent Liz a script quote form via email and she asked if she could request me when she calls the concierge team and I said absolutely. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-03 14:18:15', '2023-01-03 14:18:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110786008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053916930', 'Zachary Irisawa', NULL, 'Going on wife''s plan at zero cost. emailed CXL form', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2023-01-03 14:03:56', '2023-01-03 14:03:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110715028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, 'Thomas called because he had a physical done back in November and it still has not been paid. Due to the fact that he has Redirect, I transferred him over there. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2023-01-03 13:56:07', '2023-01-03 13:56:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110729041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '01.02.23- Stephen called about opening a need with Zion since he feels that his bills will go over $ 1000. 	He   was told he needs to do an ultrasound and scope cystoscopy.
