  ('zcrm_1579374000110772023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '1-3-23 Suzy needs help to simplify how Sedera and Redirect work and what''s included. She says she refers people to Sedera all the time! But, she''s struggling with it all herself now and the conversion/upgrade is super confusing. I left her a vm just now after missing her just about 10 min. ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2023-01-03 12:42:07', '2023-03-15 16:03:14'),
