  ('zcrm_1579374000110519026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009614029', 'Kathryn Tagenel', NULL, '12.30.22 - Kathy called in last minute to do her Sedera conversion. Noticing that Charles Frohman is her agent, and he can be very hard to reach, I offered to find out the answer to her question: Is the increase from $233.00 to $249.65 the correct amount that will be taken monthly from her account. I advised that yes it was, then Kathy continued to read numbers from her computer screen. I advised Kathy that I would have to transfer her to Charles or Sedera, to which she told me that was unnecessary because I am the one taking the money from her account that I should know why I''m taking that amount from her account. I told Kathy that normally the concierge would transfer her directly to her advisor without answering any questions regarding the conversion and that I was trying to assist her any way that I could. I then stated that I would transfer her directly to Charles since she was not willing to listen to what I was saying. Kathy hung up on me. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-30 14:21:02', '2022-12-30 14:24:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110550008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110552002', 'Sheryl Hadley', NULL, '12-30-22 Sheryl just enrolled in SECURE $1000/$325 for Jan. 1st, 2023 and requested start date from John. She has Lyme disease and knows it won''t be shared in year one. All set. Uses mostly naturopaths and knows that must be pre-approved first.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-30 14:16:36', '2022-12-30 14:16:36'),
