  ('zcrm_1579374000110519021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779530', 'Jaelynne Lay', NULL, 'This member called in asking if there was something she needed to do to retain her membership. After looking at the plan name, I reached out to Patti Baron because I was a tad confused. Patti graciously took this members call and will advise her about the Sedera platform transition. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-30 10:42:14', '2022-12-30 10:42:14'),
