  ('zcrm_1579374000110519013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058609028', 'Teresa Smith', NULL, 'Teresa called in very nervous because she had a mammogram done and it is showing an inconsistency in the imaging. The hospital has asked Teresa to come in and have a follow-up diagnostic mammogram along with an ultrasound. Honestly, I could not get a word in edge wise with Teresa until I had to be firm with her to let me finish explaining this information to her. She finally was settled down and I reassured her that we would be happy to assist her in opening a need with Zion if this goes above her $2500 IUA amount. The issue is that 35 years ago they found something in this same breast and I am not sure if they would consider this pre-existing. I advised Teresa that we could speak with Zion about her past breast issues but she did not want to at this time and is just going to "ride the wave" until she needs us and she disconnected. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-30 09:36:39', '2022-12-30 09:36:48'),
