  ('zcrm_1579374000110474003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078746049', 'Suzanne Swearengen', NULL, '12-29-2022:  Suzanne called.  Curious which of the Planstin cards she has are corr.  Let her know a few chgs coming (no longer PHCS ntwk req''d) 1/1/23, so she may rec yet another card.  Any will work, but after 1st call &amp; we''ll help her und how to get prev care pd for.  Also mentioned RX (Optum on older card generally more expensive than our disc prog, but to call &amp; we''ll guide).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-30 02:56:25', '2022-12-30 02:56:25'),
