  ('zcrm_1579374000110440052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406145', 'Casey Richter', NULL, '12-29-22 Casey called to understand her options. She''s interested in possibly switching to SECURE. She sees a chiropractor 1x per month for maintenance and such.  So, she''s considering remaining to make use of that. Her cost went from $311 to $428.78 at $500 IUA. She could move to SECURE $300/$1000.  I just realized if she changes her IUA to $1000 her new cost with PDHC will be $339.78. I called her back and let her know. She will likely stay put. She knows how to use Redirect for the chiro visits bc she gets a 50% discount from her connections in town. Redirect knows this and will just pay on her behalf each time. So, it makes the most sense to stay put. She''ll let me know if she wants to change her IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-29 17:14:34', '2022-12-29 17:19:49'),
