  ('zcrm_1579374000110440042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '12-29-22 Jenny called me at 1:24 and wants help comparing the Anthem plan offered by her employer. She doesn''t really want to switch but needs to understand. I left her a vm now at 3:49. She has to decide today. Hopefully she''ll call me right back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-29 15:51:11', '2022-12-29 15:51:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110438093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079660001', 'Janice Higgs', NULL, '12.29.2022 Janice called to get into her portal. 
