  ('zcrm_1579374000110438088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078240001', 'Samuel Haefner', NULL, '12.29.2022 Samuel called to reinstate his membership. I transferred him to Jeffrey, after I offered him Jeff''s number. I did guide him to leave a VM, given the hours difference. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-29 15:40:44', '2022-12-29 15:40:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110440032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '12-29-22 Cameron had a cyst on her rt hip which she believes is all set now and the Need can be closed out. She has an achilles injury that she''s been tending to on her own and it''s never reached the $1000 IUA. She''s doing needling, etc. Her daughter is totally healthy and no issues. Cameron also had a ruptured appendix in Oct. 2022 and went to the ER. She just received her first bill of $407. I recommended that she reaches out to BCH to get the remaining bills at the cash price and create the new Need. She will work on that. Once that''s wrapped up and she''s confident in her health, she''ll reach out to me to make the switch to SECURE at $1000/$525 vs $1000/$699.28. She knows to contact me before the 20th of the month for the next month''s start date.  She was super appreciative of my help. She also does get chiro care but they have a chiro in her office and she''s not charged for it. So, it''s ok if she loses the chiro and PCP with Redirect to save $175 a month!  She''s on track and feeling confident.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-29 15:15:21', '2022-12-29 15:15:21'),
