  ('zcrm_1579374000110460098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109371008', 'Colleen Jennings', NULL, 'Spoke to Amy about this member.  She will be going to reg insurance as she has some potential Health issues.  I expressed that she shouldn''t have bee enrolled in the 1st place  w/health issues', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-29 14:50:11', '2022-12-29 14:50:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110440027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061092044', 'Charles Kinne', NULL, '12-29-22  "Wendy –
Thank you. I called and spoke with Octavia, Ref. No. for the call 221229-001388. Octavia said the Exchange has had a major malfunction regarding people who selected new plans after they had been automatically reenrolled, and that all would be straightened out by January 1. She said I did nothing wrong and therefore I would be insured as of January 1. I challenged her, saying (1) how will you fix in two days what you haven’t fixed in the past 22 days and (2) you say I’ll be insured, but you are not Anthem.
Still, she says it will all be fixed in due time and there is nothing else for us to do.
I’m okay with that explanation if you are. Do you think I should do anything more?
Thank you, and Happy New Year!"
I let him know this is good news and there''s nothing more for us to do. I reassured him they will backdate his plan to Jan. 1st if they don''t resolve it before then. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-29 14:46:51', '2022-12-29 14:46:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110440022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, '12-29-22 Lorene was in a car accident about 12 months ago. The driver was in a rental car and driving around as an Uber driver. So, the insurance for both of that was terrible. The car ins covered her up to $25K and stopped. She has about $6K more in bills of which it sounds like most or part were within the past three months. She''s also been seeing a chiropractor 2x week and about $3500 worth so far to deal with her whiplash and mild concussion. She doesn''t have the Redirect Health app on her phone and didn''t remember they cover up to 12 chiro per year which she will likely blaze through and/or has already used. I suggested she calls Concierge Team for assistance in creating the new Need and getting reimbursed and/or pre-approved for the chiro portion. Then once the 12 are done she can include the rest in the Need with Sedera. She''s also do osteopathic work and massage to manage the pain. Once she is feeling back to great health and has been reimbursed for her Need, then we can revisit other options to bring her cost down. It''s not a good idea to change her IUA now either. She completely agreed. She will call the MPB Concierge Team next and work on moving forward with all of those costs and reimbursements. She was incredibly appreciative of my help!!! I also explained to her the upgrade with Sedera will show a lower cost for the sharing portion only. She will work on it today since she knows Dec. 31st is her deadline. You can tell she''s been in pain from the accident and just doing everything she can to deal with it and do so naturally.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-29 14:42:54', '2022-12-29 14:42:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110399037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442111', 'Sarah Getzelman', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2650 Question : Hello,', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-29 14:11:32', '2022-12-29 14:11:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110440013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '12-29-22 Left vm for Anna to help her review her options. On PDHC and price went from $350 to $419.78 with $1000 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-29 14:02:56', '2022-12-29 14:04:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110460093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438028', 'Richard Reiter', NULL, 'Member is in WA and cannot continue w/Sedera.  They did not let us know this.  I will send out the cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-29 13:48:08', '2022-12-29 13:48:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110466011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '12-29-2022:  Jennifer started w/labs in Feb or April (some mold, hormone, etc.).  Herbs for hormones & mold & it is working.  I can hear she''s very overwhelmed with this.
     - She''s feeling better & they are working on both the hormone & mold issues w/success.  However, she did not start the need when we talked about it back in March.  Now I''m concerned we are past the 6mo deadline.  But, am having her submit everything.  Walked her thru process of sub a ''med need'' again (she still had the link from 3/2022).  I was helping Rosana w/Jeni, so at the end of the call, Rosana was planning to forward Jeni to Zion to get her memb # for the ''med need'' req.
        Even though they''ve been working on this for quite some time, she says she hasn''t rec''d much in inv, etc.  Then she said she can download for their portal (?).  Hopefully, she''ll get this going immediately!  She was very apologetic that she didn''t do it when we talked before.
     - She''s moving due to the mold & will call us when she''s set so we can show her how to update her address.  I did not want to add anything more to the conversation because I could hear her struggling.
     - Jeni''s employer is considering offering health ins, but she''s struggling to understand the differences.  I made sure she has her advisor''s name & ph #, letting her know Wendy is really good at comparing & contrasting for people.  She was thinking she may quit the MPB prog for 1 yr to try the other & come back if she doesn''t like it.  Since she could end-up w/pre-x items, I sugg she talk to Wendy to make an educated dec & why.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-29 13:28:21', '2022-12-29 13:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110415037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064974189', 'Jennifer Rulon', NULL, '12.29.22- Jennifer needed help with submitting receipts for labs/tests . Member was  sick and doctor tested for  mold infestation and hormones unbalances..  Jennifer  spoke to Cari prior this call  and sent her an email with a link to submit bills and a  Medical Need Request.  Jennifer asked to talk to Cari since she was so helpful. Cari and I called Jennifer  right back. Cari walked her through on how to submit and attach  receipts and documents.... Also we provided her ZION number -(888) 920-9466 .  This call was handled with very specifics detailed instructions  and tons of kindness from Cari. The call lasted 30 min. Also,  this member will be leaving MPB once she is getting insurance from her new job.  Jennifer Zion Membership Number is 122124892.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-29 13:03:04', '2022-12-29 13:22:33'),
