  ('zcrm_1579374000110438060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, '12-28-22 Lorene wants to discuss other options since her price just increased by $100 with PDHC from $378 to $493.78 at the $500 IUA level as of Jan. 1st on the Dec. 20th billing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 16:59:41', '2022-12-28 16:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110438055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, '12-28-22 Suzy wants to discuss other options since their rate went to $732.28 PDHC from $625. If they switch to SECURE and HSA compliance, they can bring their cost back down to $625/$1000. I left her a vm just now and let her know I have some options to share.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 16:53:45', '2022-12-28 16:53:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110438045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '12-28-22 Helen called to make sure she''s all set for her Jan. membership to remain active. I left her a vm to let her know I can''t see that. But, I do know she hasn''t been cancelled and they''ve extended the deadline in case of problems with upgrade. Told her to call me if need be still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 16:09:00', '2022-12-28 16:09:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110438040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '12-28-22 Jennifer tried to pay for her plan but C4 has now cancelled both plans since we couldn''t cancel one at a time. They cancelled both. She does have a ticket in and did call to get it resolved after I asked her to do so. Her TKT # is 221215-000606. She said they told her it''s processing. Anthem has no record of her plan of course since C4 isn''t showing it right now. But, C4 has record of her plan in their system. She will call them every day to find out status and will keep me posted via text.  She''s super nice and let her know they will honor it even though it''s nerve wracking. She was cool!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 16:02:06', '2022-12-28 16:02:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110438035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058649064', 'Maria Hassett', NULL, '12-28-22 Maria called and texted bc she thinks she due for a knee replacement this year possibly. I let her know to create the need right away. She''s seen a chiro and PT recently. She''s in her 3rd year of sharing with up to $50K. I suggested she talks with Concierge Team for highest quality care at best price and possibly bundled cash rate and payment up front for that. Worst care she can jump on John''s insurance if need be. But, she''s thrilled to understand the Need won''t reset on Jan. 1st and will also create  a new Need for hormone health issues now as well. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 15:34:29', '2022-12-28 15:34:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110438030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081054002', 'Stephanie Foo', NULL, '12-28-22 Stephanie Foo was not pleased with her experience with her wellness visit since she didn''t remember to show her Planstin card and wound up paying $600 for the visit with no reimbursement bc she paid cash. Then she tried to use CirrusMD for multiple things without success. She contacted them with a sore throat that she had for a month, showed them a photo and they said it''s just a sore throat and they can''t tell anything more. She went to Urgent Care and they told her it was strep throat and gave her meds. Then she reached out for Covid and they said they can''t help, go to Urgent Care. Finally she inquired out a UTI and they referred her to Urgent Care.  So, it sounds like CirrusMD was  a huge failure for her. Her husband got a new job with benefits, so they are trying that for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 15:15:42', '2022-12-28 15:15:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110415017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053916930', 'Zachary Irisawa', NULL, '12.28.2022 Zachary called to cancel his membership.
