  ('zcrm_1579374000110438025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354202', 'Louis Romero', NULL, '12-28-22 Called Louis back and showed him both plans are showing in his account accurately. We both took screen shots of the plans. I let the C4 Rep know that we never requested cancellation of his plan for Jan. 1st. Louis reiterated his payment went through for the $1100 after it was rejected the first time. He will wait for the Supervisor to call him back.  We both hope it will be resolved by Jan. 2nd.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 14:53:44', '2022-12-28 14:53:44'),
