  ('zcrm_1579374000110438008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354202', 'Louis Romero', NULL, '12-28-22 Acct # 4008135184. DOB 05/18/1958. Talking with C4 Rep Michael Angelo who is looking over notes. It sounds like it''s not guaranteed to be backdated to Jan. 1st.  Michael is noting that Louis already paid for Jan. He cannot be cancelled out of his current plan if they don''t approve the backdating of the new plan. He''s adding a follow up to the notes on his ticket. TKT # he''s doing follow up with is the same 221227-001082 and new TKT 221228-001877. I have made it clear multiple times that his plan CANNOT be cancelled for Jan. 1st. Michael is now saying he can''t make a changes but he won''t guarantee a Jan. 1st start date. Now he''s requesting a Supervisor call back request to go to the client.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-28 14:00:46', '2022-12-28 14:37:27'),
