  ('zcrm_1579374000110430003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '12-28-2022:  Chris &amp; Jason called.  They had questions on Chris'' colonoscopy &amp; endoscopy.  Turns out they pulled a polyp, so Jason is going to call tomorrow to get directions on how to start a ''med need''.  My suggestion is to include the endoscopy as well if it is diagnostic?  Jason''s going to find out how they are coding it so we will know.  No word from the Med Dir yet on Chris'' pre-x situation, but we talked &amp; we''ll wait until the beg of Jan to send a 2nd req due to the holidays.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-28 12:16:40', '2022-12-28 18:03:26'),
