  ('zcrm_1579374000110415003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097350001', 'Charles Ridenour', NULL, '12.28.22 Jessica called about ways to save money once her husband ages to Medicare and will be removed from there current plan. I spoke to Jenifer and she stated that the family plan was canceled by Pati . There is no cancelation cognits form available. 
