  ('zcrm_1579374000110378003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, 'Colleen called in for a list of naturopaths and orthopedists in her area of 28748. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-28 09:32:55', '2022-12-28 09:32:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110320073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107285002', 'Rick Rife', NULL, 'Rick called in because he is having some gall bladder issues that may require treatment. We went over the self-pay process and collecting all bills/receipts for a medical need.  We also discussed that if Rick requires surgery to call us back here on the concierge line for direction. He is going to open a Need with Zion for the bills he has accumulated (he has almost paid his IUA) and we''re keeping our fingers crossed about surgery. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-28 09:28:12', '2022-12-28 09:28:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110320068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100610002', 'Jenna Kulik', NULL, 'Jenna called because she wanted to know if allergy testing and treatment for her child are a shareable expense. As per Zion Healthshare Guidlines:
Allergy Treatments
Allergy testing and medication is excluded from sharing. Members can take 
advantage of the Rx Share program to receive prescription discounts. Medical need 
requests that arise out of non-seasonal allergies, such as an emergency room visit for 
an allergic reaction, may be considered for sharing', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-28 09:26:20', '2022-12-28 09:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110351047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105476001', 'Keith Schupp', NULL, '12.28.22- Mel called to confirm that her plan was canceled. Rb', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-28 09:20:34', '2022-12-28 09:20:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110370003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '12.28.22:  Emailed Mary Ann.  Confirmed that the CareZ Connected Worksite plan includes Zion''s preventive services.  Still checking the other items.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-28 09:04:06', '2022-12-28 09:04:06'),
