  ('zcrm_1579374000110351042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659263', 'Julie Sombrio', NULL, '12.28.22- Julie called to find out how to get in touch with TELEDOC(members still calling cirrus md telemedicine that way). I was not familiar with this plan MPB CareZ - Worksite - Bridge (30445) so I called Jen to help. They had a lot of fun on the phone as its with Jen around.... It seems Julie has a pink eye and she want  to get a Telemedicine  Consultation. We sent Julie an  invite email from Cirrus MD.  She confirmed receiving it during the call... We explained that this is a TEXT BASED service  first platform.  Julie is a very  happy member for many years and it was a pleasure helping her. Also she mentioned that her husband had a urgent care visit but didn''t not need  any help with that issue... Julie  is  such a sweet ❤ Heart...!! Jen also send her a prescription quote to speed things up in case she needed medication. RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-28 08:57:35', '2022-12-28 08:57:35'),
