  ('zcrm_1579374000110351031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090935002', 'Tracy McKinney', NULL, '12.27.2022 Tracy called to inquire about opening an HSA through her Secure plan.  I brought Cari in & Cari let Tracy know that her Planstin card can be used to prove she has a high ded ins plan, but she can utilize any financial institution she would like. 
We talked about the purpose of the self-employment forms to protect both parties for tax auditing.
Her husb has an HSA w/Cigna, so she may call to see if she can get hers there too.
Tracy may call and confirm with Patti that everything''s on file in order to make sure she''s compliant. 
Tracy was worried about what she would have prove to qualify for Secure, but, Tracy referred her husband, so maybe that''s what she used to show she''s self-employed. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-27 17:37:58', '2022-12-27 18:02:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110325041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090935002', 'Tracy McKinney', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2638 Question : I am a member and would like to establish an HSA account. Am I able to do this online and within the next 3 days? I would like to make a contribution for 2022', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-27 16:57:13', '2022-12-27 16:57:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110350013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '12.27.22:  Cari left me a message in Teams that Mary Ann is thinking about cancelling her CareZ Connected Worksite plan.  Cari suggested to her that she call me.  
I called Mary Ann.  She and her husband Jamie said their friends are telling them health sharing is dangerous because it has no major medical guarantee in case they get sick and they''re thinking of taking an insurance policy.  They wanted to discuss and review what their current plan offers in terms of major medical, etc.  I explained how medical cost sharing works and it fully shares any major medical costs that may arise, how their IUA works, as well as submitting a need etc.  We reviewed their other services as well.  They feel totally better and will stay with their current plan.  I told them I would find out the following:  1) how much their monthly share fee would be with a $1000 IUA, 2) if they have Zion''s preventive services w/their CareZ Connected Worksite plan, 3) if their are any DPC providers near them is Weston, 4)  how much the OPD plan would cost them and if their are any OPD providers for them, 5)  Mary Ann needs a new MPB membership card.
They currently are paying $189/mo. for M&S for their concierge doctor, in addition to the $343 they are paying for their MPB plan.
May Ann''s land line is:  954-389-2415
Mary Ann asked me to call her on her cell (954-882-8694) when I find out the above information.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-27 16:19:45', '2022-12-27 16:19:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110351023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294010', 'Christopher Kelly', NULL, '12.27.2022 Chris called to confirm that all his paperwork for the HSA portion is in order. I referred to Cari and Jen via teams, and Jen confirmed I should transfer him to Patti. 
I direct transferred him to Patti and messaged Patti afterwards for the heads-up. NT

Via teams, Patti confirmed that she spoke with Chris.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-27 14:54:27', '2022-12-27 16:48:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110351018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081146002', 'Lisa Doughty', NULL, '12.27.22- Lisa called to find out if would be any changes on her plan for 2023.  She stated that she is paying $ 625 a month  but ZOHO showed $500 PAYMENT .  I checked on ADM 123 and found a receipt with her latest payment which I emailed to  her. Also , I called her back to confirm that will be no changes for 2023.  As long as she is paying her membership she has a plan in force.. I reminded her that this is not  an insurance plan that renews every year. RB.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-27 14:46:28', '2022-12-27 14:46:28'),
