  ('zcrm_1579374000110359008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '12-27-2022:  Robin called.  Zion sent her an e-mail re: her ''med need'' saying they are "assuming" her condition is pre-x.  She wants to know why they''d just assume?  They have perm to get her med records & this is NOT pre-x!  Then, she re-read & it says she must appeal w/in 30-days or it''s null & void!
     She''s totally distraught!  Are they paying for the biopsy?  What happens if it is cancerous, she feels like their lack of effort is adding stress & she doesn''t know how to proceed.
     I had her reply very simply:  "This is NOT a pre-existing condition.  Please pull my records.  Do NOT make assumptions."  She''s cc''ing me and I will bring this to light when John Troutman approaches Zion in Jan.
     Hopefully, Robin feels better.  We looked up the avg price for the biopsy she''s having & although it says avg price is $1200+, the facilities near her in Louisville, are all high priced facilities.  She''s going to use the fair priced info to see if as a ''cash-pay'' patient they will bring it down from the $3500+ they''ve quoted her.  If nothing else, this biopsy sb no worries for pymt as their assumption still allows 50k help this yr.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-27 13:48:40', '2022-12-27 13:48:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110351008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091198002', 'Robyn Hallet', NULL, '12.27.22- Robyn called to find out about pre-existing conditions for her Secure Plan. Following Cari''s instructions I cut and past ZION GUIDLINES PRECONDTIONS and email to her. RB.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-27 13:43:32', '2022-12-27 13:43:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110350008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087060131', 'Emily Hubbard', NULL, '12.27.22:  Jenn forwarded an email from Emily to ask if she has to do anything to renew her Care + plan.  I called and l/m that her plan automatically renews, so she doesn''t have to do anything.  I also emailed Emily and repeated the message.  I also told her I want to schedule a "catch-up" call w/her in Jan. or Feb to see how she''s doing w/her plan and to see if she has any questions, etc.  I asked her to let me know when she would be available to set up a call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-27 13:41:32', '2023-01-23 14:06:54'),
