  ('zcrm_1579374000110262008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109671026', 'George Jarratt', NULL, 'Asked member to reschedule their welcome call for some time after their 1/1/2023 start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-27 07:16:30', '2022-12-27 07:16:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110262003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109087010', 'Broc Sheue', NULL, 'Broc scheduled his welcome call prior to his Jan. 1, 2023 start date twice. I asked Broc to reschedule his call for some time after his start date. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-27 07:14:22', '2022-12-27 07:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110257003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110162002', 'Leslie Harris', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-26 14:20:14', '2022-12-26 14:20:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110213009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106312002', 'Steven Welch', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2633 Question : Does my health plan include vision?

**UPDATE**
I left Steven a message regarding dental and vision plans that some advisors sell separately. ~JTS', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-26 08:50:00', '2022-12-27 09:19:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110161034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106616001', 'Janet Banks', NULL, '12-9-2022:  Janet doesn''t actually need these yet.  She will give us 5-7 days notice to get her a coupon when she''s ready.  Today Von''s was $69.24 total = the best place for what''s available.
     - Mometasone Furoate Nasal Spray 50mcg, 1 unit = 17gm = $42.60 on WellRX
     - Lisinopril 5mg, #90 tabs = $8.45 on RXGo
     - Albuterol Sulf HFA Inhaler (gen Ventolin) 8.5g of 90mcg(?), 1 unit = 8.5mg = $18.19 @ Vpms pm RXGo
     [While talking she mentioned she will also need Zolpidem (gen Ambien), but that''s not incl above.  $12.62?]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-23 18:12:00', '2022-12-23 18:12:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110161029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '12-22-2022:  Created my cover for Chris'' letter for the Med Dir at Zion to review his situation and send it all to Sissy (pron: CeeCee) at Zion.  Chris acknowledged he saw it, so now we are watching for Zion''s reply.  Jason (whomever that is) has been given permission to talk with us.  Need to discuss w/Jennifer to see if we need to call him still.     - CA

12-23-2022:  Jennifer said I should reach out, but with the holiday weekend I have not yet gotten that done.     -CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-23 18:04:47', '2022-12-23 18:04:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110161024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132121', 'Inga Hughes', NULL, '(note is out of chronological order)  Realized I hadn''t put in my notes:  12-20-2022:  Inga seems to struggle with this plan.   I swear in passing we''ve discussed dental &amp; vision are not a part of the plan before.  We went over that again because she''s sure this should be shared.  At first it sounded like she was just starting a ''med need'', then later it almost sounded like her ''need'' has already been declined.  I''m not sure we are getting the total picture.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-23 17:58:32', '2022-12-23 17:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110161019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, '12-20-2022:  Jacqueline called needing guidance on the Sedera conversion.  She hadn''t tt her advisor Jeff Kanter yet &amp; had questions about pricing, etc.  I referred her to him &amp; let her know a gal named ''Wendy'' that Jeff knows well can support him if he has questions.  She was going to give him a call.     -CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-23 17:53:38', '2022-12-23 17:53:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110154037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081238002', 'Joseph Scaturro', NULL, '12.23.2022 Joe called back to talk to Jeffrey, but it was 5:09pm before the Xmas weekend.  Transferred Joe to Jeffrey''s VM, but later Jeffrey told me he went ahead &amp; talked to him.  Just documenting this to show Joe''s effort in responding re: his desire to cancel. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-23 17:37:24', '2022-12-23 17:37:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110161014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105392002', 'Craig Larson', NULL, '12-23-2022:  Emily was confusing the components so we just walked thru ''prev care'', Zion, &amp; CirrusMD.  She actually has a really good grasp of how this works.  Sounds like they were on Liberty &amp; she hated having to turn everything in to go twds the AUA.  She seems lika a great fit for this healthcare!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-23 15:48:55', '2022-12-23 15:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110124046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, '12-23-22 Aubrey decided to cancel Sedera and go with Zion for DIRECT membership after getting charged the high rate without the IUA change. She''s tired of that so hoping this will work well and it will also be more affordable at a lower IUA level. Cancelled the account and sent notice to Patti to change start date to Jan. 1st and refund the initial fee and then charge the new amount after refunded. If all else fails they will go with a Feb. 1st start, but not ideal since will be left exposed. She was super appreciative of all of my help!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-23 14:08:50', '2022-12-23 14:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110105024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294010', 'Christopher Kelly', NULL, 'Chris called to check on his verification paperwork he sent in to Patti. I transferred him over to Patti but I also let Chris know that I will check with her on Tuesday to see if she spoke with him. If she did not, I will reach out to him on Tuesday to let him know that we received his information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-23 13:35:07', '2022-12-23 13:35:07');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000110105019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082503008', 'Timothy Schaewe', NULL, 'Lisa called in again regarding the issue from below. She also had a Dexa scan done before calling the concierge line to see if it was something that was a covered expense, and of course it is no. Lisa wanted to know why MPB.Health would not pay for her Dexa scan since she has "coverage through MPB too". I advised Lisa that MPB.Health is the umbrella for the plans and explained the components of the plan. Lisa stated I was wrong to which I explained again about each component of the plan. We finally got to the point where Lisa understood why the Dexa scan was not paid by Planstin and who the components of her plan are. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-23 13:11:10', '2022-12-23 13:11:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110154023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105392002', 'Craig Larson', NULL, '12.23.2022 Emily called to learn how to choose in network for Planstin for Mamm, Pediatrician and OBGYN in UC Health.
I may have confused Emily by saying "cash-pay", so I brought Cari in to declutter my misinformation and reiterate the process for Emily, and separated Preventative, Zion and CirrusMD to be the primary elements and the sub-elements that accompany each one differently. 
Emily confirmed her understanding of the process of each, the change for Planstin AO 01.2023.
She requested a digital card for Planstin to be sent to her. I offered to call Planstin and have one sent now, and again in January ONCE the change of removing PHCS logo off the card. 
When I called Planstin to order a digital card for Emily, I got to speak to Crystal. Crystal said that they are still using PHCS network requirements, and will be in 2023. She went ahead and sent the digital card (with the PHCS logo) to Craig''s email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-23 13:11:06', '2022-12-23 15:03:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110112143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616071', 'Joshua Davis', NULL, 'Member submitted address update via Change Form.  I will update in A123, CRM &amp; FTNi', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-23 12:30:18', '2022-12-23 12:30:18'),
