  ('zcrm_1579374000110110018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081238002', 'Joseph Scaturro', NULL, 'I tried to reach Joe at his office and his cell, no response. Messages left for him to call me back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-23 11:30:26', '2022-12-23 11:30:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110110013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628002', 'Timothy Crotty', NULL, 'Sabrina submitted the change of plan form and the change of advisor form. I informed her she needs to provide her children''s SS #''s and she will be charged the difference of $85.00 to reflect the cost difference in plans. She is very happy with the process.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-23 11:29:16', '2022-12-23 11:29:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110161003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816343', 'Mary Ann Harpenau', NULL, '12-23-2022:  Mary Ann called to cancel.  We discussed a bit &amp; she thought calling her advisor Joan Phelps would help her make the decision.  She''s on the cusp, but at least Joan''ll have a chance to talk with her.  I sent Joan a heads up via Teams chat since she''s trying to be off for the holidays so she''ll know to expect the call.  If she decides to cancel, she''ll call back &amp; ask for Jeffrey (Bursteen).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-23 11:28:00', '2022-12-23 11:32:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110124041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109790008', 'Maxwell LaFon', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of January 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-23 11:21:04', '2022-12-23 11:21:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110124036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785008', 'Michael Morrison', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online welcome call after start date of January 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-23 11:06:57', '2022-12-23 11:06:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110124031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785015', 'Ivonne Gonzales', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online welcome call after start date of January 1 , 2023. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-23 10:50:21', '2022-12-23 10:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110154003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, '12.23.2022 Macay called to inquire for his wife, Emily, about any assistance we offer towards mental health.
I shared the service we offer through M&S EAP. I explained how the sessions are delivered and divided.
To be sure I did not miss any pertinent details, I confirmed with Cari via teams, she requested that I call him back after I gather more information for him.
Called back and left him a VM.
Per Cari, I also shared with him the option to pay for more sessions during the 2 month break in between session sets.
Plus, to know, should a mental situation be perceived as more of a crisis situation, to know they can contact CirrusMD and speak to 1 of the 2 Psychologists/Counselors for immediate attention and further guidance. 
In addition to the above, I informed Macay that the sets of sessions totaling 12 per year is not solely per membership, but per member on the membership, so if he is the care giver and needs someone to talk to, he has that option to do so.
For investigative purposes to cover all needs they might be experiencing, I asked Macay if it might be postpartum. In order to get the baby added to the membership, if so. Macay said that they did have a baby 1.5 years ago, but he''s unsure if it''s related.
I gave Macay M&S EAP''s contact number, -800-543-5080 , he said he''ll have Emily call and start the process. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-23 10:19:58', '2022-12-23 11:13:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110112075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109777009', 'Christine Holly', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-23 10:14:30', '2022-12-23 10:14:30'),
