  ('zcrm_1579374000110112055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109799001', 'Yumeng Liu', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-23 10:05:33', '2022-12-23 10:05:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110110008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109087002', 'Michelle McCartney', NULL, 'Spoke to Michelle, nice lady. Her brother who is an attorney talked her out of this plan. She signed up for an ACA plan. I talked to her about the Secure Plan, she is a business owner. Had the advisor talked to her about this initially, it would have been a better fit. Too late now. CXL form emailed', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-23 10:02:47', '2022-12-23 10:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110112041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678145', 'Scott Hahn', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel.  I directed him to Zach to start the process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-23 09:35:38', '2022-12-23 09:35:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110124023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109367008', 'Randy Ballheim', NULL, '12-23-22 John recognized they were referred by my clients. I am reaching out to them today. It looks like they chose the $5K IUA. I need to make sure they understand how it works.
UPDATE - I sent her a Welcome email and a suggestion of changing the IUA and making sure she understands how it works.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-23 09:21:49', '2022-12-23 09:46:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110124018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109943001', 'Paul Vanslyke', NULL, 'Spoke to member will schedule welcome call after start date of January 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-23 09:20:01', '2022-12-23 09:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110124013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109967002', 'Ronald Johnson', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of January 1, 2023. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-23 09:12:02', '2022-12-23 09:12:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110112021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109511001', 'Tierney Gonnello', NULL, 'Member''s Enrollment fee Declined I left VM for member to ask if it was ok to rerun the payment as Share Amount has been processed . 12/27 - Since I did not hear back from this member I reran Enrollment Fee. See What happens.  1/5-I went over RT &amp; Acct # and 1 number had been cut off of the account #.  I cancelled both Enrollment Fee &amp; Share Amount because member wasn''t seeing them in her account.  I reran with corrected Acct#.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-23 08:57:17', '2023-01-05 14:17:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110112016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-23 08:30:23', '2022-12-23 08:30:23'),
