  ('zcrm_1579374000110075016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667255', 'Kathleen Kronz', NULL, '12.22.2022 Kathleen called with numerous questions and feeling rushed to complete her appointment needs before the year ends.
She started out asking if telehealth costs anything, and I shared that it does not, it is part of her plan that she has.
She asked to generate a list of the following specialty doctors: OBGYN, Gastro., Colono (she is interested in completing ''Cologuard'' at home)., and PCP.
I shared the changes about Planstin that are coming up in the new year regarding the shift away from "in-network" boundaries.
She proceeded to want the lists requested in order not to miss out on her testing for this present year.
Inquired about how the IUA cycle flows. Cari gave her a detailed explanation: per incident/issue specific, per rolling year. She gave examples of how it is issue specific and a number of IUA''s max per year.
Was worried about her hormone and getting prescriptions for free for them. Cari clarified we offer discounted coupons. Not free.
I realized she needed further details that I do not have, and asked if we could call her back, since this became a more in depth circumstance, and speak with a more seasoned employee to address these questions in more detail. She said "it is not in depth, I just need to know if I can have those lists to make my appointments before the end of the year", and continued to ask more questions. 
I repeated to her that I don''t want to disservice her by sharing the wrong information, and if it is okay to call her back with a trainer, and that we would call her back today.
I referred to Jen and Cari for guidance, after the concierge meeting. 
Cari sent Kathleen an email with all the links for services and government guidelines to have.

*** Cari input was added later in the evening while speaking to Kathleen. *** NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-22 14:05:45', '2022-12-22 18:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110050031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110083002', 'Benjamin Stephan', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Customer', 'Visit ID : 2627 Question : Where did our previous chat history go?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-22 14:04:15', '2022-12-22 14:04:15'),
