  ('zcrm_1579374000110075008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105428002', 'Steven Vertz', NULL, '12.22.2022 Steven emailed asking for the pdf version of the prescription card so he can laminate himself. Sharing that he cannot open the pdf (coupon) sent. He would like to do the comparison himself, since in his experience Walgreens charges them $50 for the Lisinopril, while Walmart w/o a card charges only $10. 
I pulled Cari in, as I was not understanding the core of the problem, aside from not being able to open the PDF, and maybe she could shed light on the best way to solve the problem.
