  ('zcrm_1579374000110062023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093624002', 'Omri Abuhasera', NULL, 'I spoke to Omri, she said she cancelled 3 months ago, yet there is no record. She thinks she should be refunded for 3 months. I explained we can not do that. I asked who she spoke with, she said she didn''t know and has no records . I asked if she submitted a form, she said she did, but I don''t see anything. I emailed her the link to cancel by Feb 1, 2023', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-22 12:08:51', '2022-12-22 12:08:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000110075003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712080', 'James Fuson', NULL, '12.22.2022 Jim called to learn how to move forward with a Dermatology appt.
Dermatologist apt this Tuesday, rash, never had it, thinks it''s gross, hoping it''s an allergy. in case it is not....what does he do? 
He mentioned CirrusMD and wants to know if the Tuesday appointment would suffice without CirrusMD.
I messaged our inner group on teams, both Cari and Jen responded with corroborative guidance.
Cari affirmed to talk to CirrusMD first, keeping the Tuesday appt, see if they can help with the rash. If they can''t help, continue on with the appointment.
I told Jim, if the appt on Tuesday turns into a diagnostic, to go ahead and call us back to help him in opening a medical need with Zion. 
Jim was responsive. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-22 11:49:45', '2022-12-22 11:49:45'),
