  ('zcrm_1579374000110060032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093624002', 'Omri Abuhasera', NULL, '12-22-2022:  Omri called upset she was charged this mo saying she cancelled 3 mos ago.  When I asked how she cancelled (who she spoke to, did she sub the signed legal form for cancellation, etc., she said she didn''t know.  I checked Cognito forms & there''s no form when I search under her last name, so I told her I don''t see any form of notice in our records.  At that point I let her know I was trans her to our office memb:  Jeffrey Bursteen that is helping people with the process.  She will LM if he cannot answer.  Also sent him a Teams chat so he has the info in writing as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-22 11:36:20', '2022-12-22 13:07:35'),
