  ('zcrm_1579374000110033031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529830', 'Joseph Lopez', NULL, 'Member called in and asked why we were charging him as he had not agreed to Sedera''s Terms &amp; Conditions &amp; the higher price.  He then cancelled w/Jane who never informed us.  So member was upset saying we stuck it to him around the holidays.  I told him that he informed two people that didn''t bill him.  I sent him the Cancellation form and advised him of the timeframe.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-22 10:23:42', '2022-12-22 10:23:42'),
