  ('zcrm_1579374000110062008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628002', 'Timothy Crotty', NULL, 'Spoke to Sabrina, she was very dissatisfied and wanted to cancel and get refunded. She told me she hada terrible experience with Karen Torsoe. She told me Karen was vague in answering questions, took other calls during the conversation. I let her get everything out, then I went over the plan, with her. I suggested the Secure plan over the Care Plus that they currently have. They are business owners, they have the necessary documentation, and they have an HSA set up. After going over the plan and giving her pricing, she would like to upgrade to the secure plan providing they can make the switch for effective date Jan 1, 2023. I told her I would double check, and do my best to make it happen.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-22 09:56:34', '2022-12-22 09:56:34'),
