  ('zcrm_1579374000109960029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '12-21-2022:  Finally got a cover letter ready to attach to an e-mail Chris sent over to send to Sissy at Zion.  Fwd''d everything to her attn at member @zionhealth.org for her to fwd to the Med Dir so we can give him a better idea of how to proceed.  Chris acknowledged he rec''d his cc''d copy.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-21 18:09:06', '2022-12-21 18:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109960024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466094', 'Chad Broker', NULL, '12-21-2022:  Chad (& his wife Gina) called in to cancel his membership.  She said she e-mailed someone last week, but hadn''t heard back.  I let her know our office gtlman Jeffrey would help them process the cancellation, however I asked her to supply where she''d sent the e-mail so we can figure out why she hadn''t heard back.  She may have even e-mailed the advisor?  She wasn''t sure.
     - Sent Jeffrey Bursteen Gina''s contact information: (602) 628-4524 (after Chad LM for him saying his wife is easier to connect with), so they can go over the cancellation process.  Did let them know payments processed thru already, so not to be shocked when they see that.  They were very nice about.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-21 18:03:11', '2022-12-21 20:58:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109948011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283143', 'Kristianna Simmons', NULL, '12.21.2022 Kristianna called concerned about her bill increase of about $150.
She has a Sedera plan. She remembers receiving an email about completing paperwork towards the conversions.
Her billing has been consistent since the increase in September, but not this month. 
I was going to transfer her to Pati, but via teams, Cari clarified her plan being Sedera and that she needs to speak to her advisor, Wendy Scipione. 
I explained the situation of Sedera''s platform change, and recommended that she speak to her advisor.
Kristianna was understanding and seemed more at ease at the end of the call. I transferred her to Wendy''s line. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-21 17:31:42', '2022-12-21 17:31:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109960016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032126', 'Rebecca Schiff', NULL, '12/21/2022:  Rebecca Schiff called my off line.  Her dad told her she had ''prev care'', but she didn''t have a card or anything & wondered how it worked.  I remembered her father Bryan & I put her on the Care+ plan because she would be in Australia for 6 mos of her first year as a student abroad.  Plus, since she''s at an age where she must be on her own plan, she didn''t have a way to prove self-emp at that time.
     - When I went to look at the price diff if we could get her qualified for a plan w/prev care, I noticed she''s paying $265/mo & even Admin123 shows that.  But, the only place I find that price for Care+ is the highest age bracket = 50-65 yrs old & she''s been 26, & now 27 on the plan which sb $215 per month?  I sent Patti a chat to confirm in case I''m missing something.  Once I tt Patti, I will call Rebecca back & we can decide how to proceed.  I did NOT mention the pricing above to Rebecca, just told her I need to get details before we go over options.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-21 15:45:23', '2022-12-21 17:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109960008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, '12-21-2022:  Called Rebecca back - there''s no price diff with Memb &amp; Fam, regardless of 1 or 2 children.  Let her know that.  Also sent Patti a chat that I answered the pricing question, but if there were other questions, I was unaware of those.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-21 15:26:20', '2022-12-21 15:30:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109965003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, '12.21.22- R.G called  inquiring if by removing  Georgia from her plan , her monthly bill would be lower than  $ 690.  I suggested she contacted  Mike . Montes her advisor. She said no need. I called her back to let her know that removing Georgia will not lower her payment.  A family constitute  of two spouses and one child . Also I emailed her with copy to M. Montes  some additional . RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-21 14:59:36', '2022-12-21 15:30:52'),
