  ('zcrm_1579374000109922016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098951004', 'Sam Simonds', NULL, '12-21-22 Sam called bc he was worried he hadn''t paid yet bc he saw one charge. It looks like it comes in possibly 3 fees with Anthem Off-Exchange as $16.96, $29.60, $441.39. He''s all set and thankful for the help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-21 13:24:28', '2022-12-21 13:24:28'),
