  ('zcrm_1579374000109899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109890002', 'Daniela Moebus', NULL, 'She is a german expat, now has her green card and ss number. she is getting off of a cigna international expat plan because she no longer qualifies. She won''t qualify for medicare until 67 so at 65 she will need a short tem medical plan. She is healthy no preex, plays tennis 5 times a week and is also a virgo :). She will speak to her accountant to help setup her hsa. She still works, though only 25% as much as she used to. She is a lawyer.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-21 12:26:00', '2022-12-21 12:26:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109881013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '12-21-22 April actually remained with LHS this whole time! Now it makes sense why Sally Hammond told me that she waits 9 months to get reimbursed. I swear April said she''s on Zion, but that''s not the case. She thought the new option, when I presented it years ago, sounded too complicated.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-21 11:56:23', '2022-12-21 11:56:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109873026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, '12-21-2022:  Rebecca called.  Georgia turned 18 in Nov & is off to college in Jan.  She needed the healthcare cov letters to sub to the school so I made sure she had Zion''s #, Planstin''s # is on her card, and trans her dir to Zion at the end of the call.  Let her know they did some restructuring & Zion may trans her to their sister comp Planstin to get both letters, but it used to be done dir w/Zion.
     - Since Georgia''s now 18, also asked Kelly F to send an MPB.Health card so she''ll have it for reference while she''s away from home.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-21 11:54:05', '2022-12-21 11:54:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109884008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080239001', 'Candece Niss', NULL, '12.21.2022 Called Candece in reference to a ticket put in, to help find a doctor in HCBB.
She was driving, so I asked if she could call us back and ask for Nahla. That way I can guide and coach her to use the HCBB website. Candece took my name and our number down to call later this evening.
Likes to be called Candee.
Candee called back around 4:45, once she was in front of the screen for me to guide her. 
I emailed her the HCBB link, and walked her through signing in, searching for doctors, searching for procedures, maneuvering the website and interpreting the icons presented, finding the reviews on specific doctors in healthgrades, narrowing down the medical elements the doctor is successful at under his page, explained how the ratings and information are derived. 
Candee was excited to play around with it on her own, and knows to call us should she not be able to find what/who she is looking for. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-21 11:32:01', '2022-12-21 17:17:09'),
