  ('zcrm_1579374000109834023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106407002', 'Maria Faria', NULL, 'Maria''s husband called in several times and hung up before I could finally get to him. He thought he was being scammed because he hasn''t received anything for his wife''s plan to date. I explained our process on sending out our welcome packets and scheduling Maria''s welcome call. He seemed pretty calmed down once we went through everything. He will be anxiously awaiting Maria''s welcome packet. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-21 09:27:09', '2022-12-21 09:27:09'),
