  ('zcrm_1579374000109879003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063804100', 'Roger Gaudreau', NULL, '12.21.22:  Recvd. an email from Amy late yesterday to ask what their share fee would be if they drop their son from their membership.  They are now paying $615/mo. w/a $2500 IUA.  For a M&amp;S at the same IUA, their share fee would be $425/mo.  Emailed Amy back to let her know.  Also mentioned possibilities w/DIRECT.  Told her to let me know if she''d like to schedule a call to further discuss her options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-21 09:12:19', '2022-12-21 11:03:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109834018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101104002', 'Tennison Barry II', NULL, 'Tennison called to change his IUA. I sent him the member change form link, advised that he is past the change date for January, and also let Guy know via teams that his member wants to make this change. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-21 08:51:59', '2022-12-21 08:51:59'),
