  ('zcrm_1579374000109756016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107788002', 'Kevin Byram', NULL, 'Jamie Byram messaged me on SalesIQ asking if she is supposed to get a Planstin card that she got in the mail. I explained to her what that is and that seeing her, and her family have the Secure plan, that yes, they were meant to be sent those cards. She said she is new to all of this and was confused. I explained what type of situation she would use the Planstin card and when not. I told her everything about the plan will be explained in the Welcome Call they are going to be having soon. Also, I let Jamie know that at any time she can call her Member Concierge or Healthcare Advisor whenever she has any questions or concerns. She thanked me and said she will keep an eye out for the Welcome Call. Jamie is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-12-20 13:51:11', '2022-12-20 13:51:11'),
