  ('zcrm_1579374000109778086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000123199001', 'Carey Reynolds', NULL, '12-20-22 The only person missing is her NP Linda Tuzzolino. The other doctors are Dr. Sheila Ling and Dr. Emma McCarty appear to be in-network and the meds appear to be included on the drug list. I can''t get the Cigna plan to pull up the document to share in the same way. But, it''s the Cigna Connect Flex Bronze $0. Her cost will be about $520.86 after her subsidy of $720 is applied. She can pay half the cost with the Friday Bronze Copay plan instead. She''s on many generic meds. Gabapentin, estradiol and Adderall/ amphetamine ER capsules 25 mg. She on Cigna Open Access Plus now and gets drugs through Xpress Scripts which she wants to keep! But, if she pays half the cost with Friday, she might be willing to switch. She''s just had supply chain issues with the drugs when not using Xpress Scripts. The mail-order seems to solve the supply chain problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-20 12:36:30', '2022-12-20 12:36:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109778081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '12-20-22 Jana is preemptively looking at her options for when she retires in a year. She works for the State of CO and lives in Glenwood Springs. As of now, she pays $1900+ a month with a $3200 ded (I think). She will get a $230 credit towards her plan each month to bring it down to $1700. There are plans as expensive as $3500 for her family. She''s 52, husband 50 and self-employed and daughter is 14 now. They are healthy and avoid meds as best as possible. But, husband has inhaler for mild asthma. Jana has mild thyroid meds and takes an estrogen suppository for menopause. Husband also has an Epi pen for bee stings. They do their annual wellness visits and they currently fund an HSA. SECURE $1000/$915 is the membership I quoted that suits them best. I let her know I can help with all of the traditional options as well. I sent her the overview as well. She will keep my information and contact me in a year or so when she''s ready.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-20 12:25:24', '2022-12-20 12:25:24'),
