  ('zcrm_1579374000109778028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779146', 'Shana Larsen', NULL, '12-20-22 Her new employer is a member of Vail Valley Partnership which is why she was able to keep her current membership. She had asked and they originally said not. Then she asked again and they said Yes. So, by staying with them it''s $15 cheaper a month and easier since no move is necessary. So, no for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-20 10:22:03', '2022-12-20 10:22:03'),
