  ('zcrm_1579374000109710061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109045022', 'Liam Reynolds', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to cancel prior to start date.  I will cancel in A123 &amp; refund any Enrollment fees.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-20 09:31:19', '2022-12-20 09:31:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109769018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '12.20.22:  Called Daryl, answered her questions and assisted her in enrolling in DIRECT w/a $1000 IUA.  When she got her confirmation it stated her last name as Logan (her previous last name). I called Patti and she changed it back to Morris.  Told her if she had any issues with the last name to contact me.   Reminded Daryl to schedule a Welcome Call after 1.1.23.  Emailed her to thank her.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-20 09:26:40', '2022-12-20 10:51:50'),
