  ('zcrm_1579374000109769010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918002', 'Elizabeth Anderson', NULL, 'Spoke to member will reschedule welcome call after her start date of January 1, 2023. Basically did a welcome call was on phone for 22 mins  going over plan and any questions they had. This is all new to them. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-20 08:59:07', '2022-12-20 08:59:33'),
