  ('zcrm_1579374000109710008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092115002', 'Nicolas Gossum', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to add spouse eff 1/1/23.  I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-20 07:41:24', '2022-12-20 07:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084642013', 'Nicole Pietramale', NULL, 'Nicole called in because Craig went to the ER yesterday due to a shoulder injury. We went through the self-pay process, how to submit a need with Zion, and I advised Craig and Nicole that if they need any assistance to reach out to us here at MPB. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-20 07:37:51', '2022-12-20 07:37:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109710003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093481010', 'Sanjay Bhattacharjee', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove dependents from membership.  I will change plan in A123 &amp; update billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-20 07:30:18', '2022-12-20 07:30:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109655156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000272', 'Katelyn Doty', NULL, '12-19-2022:  Katelyn called.  She''s planning to get her prev annual & pap after 1/1/2023.  Wanted to know the process.  Let her know: ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative Care ONLY.  As of 1/1/23 no ntwk req''d.  Told her to choose the office she wants to go thru.   When making appt, be specific ''prev'' care only & notify doc''s off of Planstin, give info so they can call to agree to payment w/Planstin before she gets there so she knows the off will bill Planstin for her & if she provides the info when she makes the appt, they should have agreed prior to her arrival.  Since she won''t be going for weeks, she will call to get the bal of the guidelines nearer the appt.  We went over ''prev care ONLY'', etc, in case.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-19 19:26:17', '2022-12-19 19:26:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109655148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081769002', 'Robert Henchel', NULL, '12.19.2022 Robert had his initial visit date for the above need in July. 
He was concerned, because the hospital bills continue to trickle in sporadically and he didn''t want to runout of time regarding the 6 months period.
I consulted with Cari and she shared, as long as he has an open need, he needs to submit the bills as they come. Also, to contact his processor at Zion to voice his concerns. 
I spoke again with Robert, and relayed what Cari shared. He was open to chatting with Zion. I gave him Zion''s general number, but reminded him that he has an email with his processor''s name and number in it that might be more helpful. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-19 17:34:23', '2022-12-19 17:34:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109609041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '12.19.22:  Daryl emailed on 12.16.22.  Asked if we found any providers in her area. Also asked me to send her a link to get started on cancelling w/Sedera (Partially Self-directed plan) and enrolling in DIRECT.  I explained we did research providers in her area but I wasn''t happy with them for her. Asked her to confirm which specialties specifically she is interested in and I will research further.  I also send her instructions on cancelling her current plan and enrolling in DIRECT.  I requested to assist her in enrolling to make sure it went smoothly for her if she could be available for a brief call sometime tomorrow.
Daryl emailed, asked if I''d be available to call her at 11:30 a.m. tomorrow.  I responded yes.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-19 16:00:29', '2022-12-20 08:40:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109661056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '12-19-22 Mary, Doug and Augustine Evans chose to move their membership to SECURE $915/$1000. We completed their new application and cancelled their current membership. They are all set to go for 2023. I waived the $100.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 15:50:17', '2022-12-19 15:50:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109609036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '12.19.22:  Denise emailed. Said her computer is not allowing her to access the Cancellation form. I responded, giving her instructions to access the form through her Member Portal. Meanwhile, she used her phone to complete and submit this form.  I, then, received an email saying she can''t get the discount code to work to delete the enrollment fee.  Eventually, I realized I told her to click on the x in the red circle, instead of the green circle.  So I emailed her w/the correction.  Texted her to see if she tried this.  
Denise emailed that she completed her enrollment in the DIRECT plan. I responded to thank her for her patience in getting the enrollment done and reminding her to schedule a Welcome Call after her 1.1.223 start date.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-19 15:47:45', '2022-12-20 08:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109609031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '12.14.22:  Denise emailed, said she''s free to discuss what steps she needs to take to move forward with Sedera Cancellation and MPB Direct enrollment.  I checked with Patti, then emailed Denise full instructions on the above, including Cancellation form link.  Told her to call me w/any questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-19 15:40:38', '2022-12-19 15:40:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109661048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779146', 'Shana Larsen', NULL, '12-18-22 She left a vm stating she''s able to stay with Sedera via Vail Valley Partnership. Her cost with them is $804 vs with us once we add Sedera''s Admin fee of $25, it will be $820.97. She prefers the lower price and will stay with Vail Valley.  She didn''t know she could stay originally since she moved jobs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 15:39:50', '2022-12-19 15:40:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109661040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '12-19-22 I just discovered it looks like April went direct to Zion after she completed step 1 of the LHS conversion process. They have two accounts, one for her and her husband and the next for Alec. They removed Aiden in Oct when the price increased. I spoke with April and she said she''s being billed on the 2nd of every month for both accounts. She''s billed at $489 for ES and $119 for Alec. These are not our prices. So, I can only deduce that this is Zion directly. I''m emailing Heather Eden now to rectify.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 15:16:46', '2022-12-19 15:19:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109655076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109518002', 'Elisa Kammeyer', NULL, '12.19.2022 Elisa called to correct one of her children/dependents SSN. I was not sure how to by-pass some of the requirements on the form, so I guided her to ask to REMOVE that dependent then ADD the same dependent with the correct SSN.
I can see that she completed the cognito change form, so it''s there for Patti to make adjustments.
She also wanted to add a newborn, prior to the 20th (tomorrow), but does not have the SSN yet. I transferred her to Jeffrey for a speedy turn around. 
After consulting with Cari, she said we need to go through the form still, using section 5.
I emailed Elisa, she called back and I walked her through it to make sure she gets to submit it today. 
So you might find two change forms from Elisa, both about the above. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-19 15:06:10', '2022-12-19 17:42:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109661035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '12-19-22 Dan wanted to make sure Emunah was not forced to be on CHP+. With his income at $52,295 it put the 2 adults on a plan and Emunah on CHP+. So, their APTC was about $581. But, if we bumped up their income to $61,500 that put them over the CHP+ threshold and gave them an even bigger APTC of $724.54 bc now it''s accounting for 3 family members, not two.  They chose Friday Bronze RX Copay  plan. Friday Bronze Rx Copay Bronze/HMO	$778.70 APTC $724.54. So, they are actually paying less than they would be if they put Emunah on CHP+. They really aren''t sure of their income for 2023 of course. They are both self-employed. So, we just increased Dan''s income by $9205 to make the $61500 as their best guess.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 14:51:12', '2022-12-19 14:51:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109655062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000087844002', 'Steven Tyler', NULL, '12-19-2022:  Steven called.  He needed to update his address.  Walked him to &amp; thru the chg form.  He was completing as we talked &amp; will get it submitted.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-19 14:41:03', '2022-12-19 14:41:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109641277', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570152', 'Pamela Nichols', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-19 14:37:46', '2022-12-19 14:37:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109670013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108294010', 'Christopher Kelly', NULL, '12/19/22- Chris called to confirm that his tax return has been update on the system? try to transfer to Pati but no answer ..Sent Pati a message since I am not sure the answer to that question. Asked her to call him back. RB', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-19 14:32:20', '2022-12-19 14:32:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109655054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109499017', 'Thomas Mele', NULL, '12-19-2022:  Nahla pulled me into the call above.  Mary is trying to decide if she can use our plan and can cancel the her current insurance, but she''s very confused about what she''s just signed up for.
     - I first let her know some of her questions will be ans in the ''Welcome Call", but she said she can''t wait until then because she needs to understand better what she''s purch.  Until then she can''t cancel her ins & does not intend to have both.
     - Wanted to know how she goes about her prev care derm appt.  I let her know prev derm, screenings are not a part of the plan, but if there are issues, then that might be shareable.  That took us into the next conversation:
     - Her IUA.  We talked about how she''d be resp for the $2500 IUA, then if the issue is above that the healthsharing would potentially kick-in.  I gave the example of having moles that are issues and the newer Derm removal = $2500.  That if they are diff parts of the body, say shoulder, calf, and ear, that would be three separate issues which could be $7500.  That''s when we talked about IUAs & specifically the $1000 IUA, resp for up to 3/yr, and what happens if there are 4 or more issues in that time period.  At this time, she realized she should have gone w/the $1000 IUA.
     - She accidentally misspelled their last name when she sub the application.  She & Nahla got stuck.  I think I could have gotten her thru it, but she needs to tt Jeffrey Bursteen about the IUA anyway, so I did not go further into it with her.
     - She thought they only had to worry about her husband''s cancer for 2 years, then it''s paid, right?  Turns out his cancer was 9-1/2 yrs ago.  It was the type, he was told, it will either be cured in 6 months or it''ll be an issue.  He has had NO treatment, NO medications, NO symptoms, NO continued medical tests, NOTHING since then.  I explained the diff between how this would work if it is considered a pre-x vs not.  & let her know it''ll be the doc''s notes & records that could throw a kink in how it is perceived.  She understood.
     - I had Nahla tran her to Jeffrey since 2 items in the application (spelling of Thomas'' last name  & the IUA need to  be corrected).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-19 14:21:44', '2022-12-19 14:44:56'),
