  ('zcrm_1579374000109661024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109662015', 'Henry Miller', NULL, '12-19-22 Alaina Mulawka and Henry Miller are starting their own farm and wine business. The are planning to grow their own food and then do mirco greens for the local restaurants. They plan to do an olive oil business down the road. They are super healthy, no tobacco, organic foods, yoga, etc.! She did a home birth and even saved the placenta in freezer. They just moved to Hotchkiss, CO 81419. They don''t do the typical annual wellness bc they do all of that in their lifestyle. Choosing CARE+ $2500/$480.  They watched the video and had very few questions. They seemed very well adept at what was included and not. They are excited about this option and chose Jan. 1st start date 2023. They seem like ideal clients for CARE+! I also told her about the 60 day waiting period if they choose to have another child. She got it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 13:26:43', '2022-12-19 13:31:56'),
