  ('zcrm_1579374000109655044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109499017', 'Thomas Mele', NULL, '12.19.2022 Mary called to get clarification about the numbers on her Planstin card, the difference between Planstin and Zion, how to present herself at the doctor''s office, wanting to know the "codes to use" towards her preventative.
