  ('zcrm_1579374000109661019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165427', 'April Porterfield', NULL, '12-19-22 Sally Hammond mentioned she had a conversation with April Porterfield about utilization of their plan and I looked up April''s account and it looks like she cancelled HES and joined MPB Carez Connected for Oct 1st start date. But, Patti can''t find any record on the account in Admin123 or FTNI, therefore no proof of her paying. But, she seems to think they are still Active. I just left her a vm to see if she''s being billed and if so, through whom?', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 12:01:03', '2022-12-19 12:01:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109655029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081349010', 'Deepak Maragal', NULL, '12.19.2022 Supriyaa called for educational purposes about Planstin, appointments, and reimbursements.
