  ('zcrm_1579374000109654013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108414002', 'Carl Adams', NULL, 'Spoke to Carl, decided to go back to traditional plan through Blue cross of Florida. just wants to cancel, couldn''t do a comparison, CXL form emailed.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-19 11:28:02', '2022-12-19 11:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109661008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '12-19-22 Sally is going to talk with Pete one final time. He got a clean bill of health from his dr for everything except sleep apnea. They will contact the dr. and find out if that''s a concern or not. He''s had it for 10 years, so they aren''t too afraid but I told her I truly don''t know what bad can come from sleep apnea. They will inquire with their dr. to make sure they can sleep at night. They understand there''s no sharing for anything related to sleep apnea in year 1 and the increased sharing each year thereafter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 11:26:13', '2022-12-19 11:26:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109655021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '12-19-2022:  Linda called.  Their acct is doing their business taxes & was asking about the expenses they have for the bus to write-off.  I was able to let her know that the Planstin portion = actually ''prev care only'' ins is $135/mo for the memb + fam membership, but the majority of the balance goes towards their healthsharing component and the acct sb able to tell them if either of the items can be written-off as a bus exp.   She had further questions, so I trans her to Patti''s line.  Let her know Patti gets bombarded this time of month, so to LM is Patti cannot answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-19 11:24:06', '2022-12-19 11:28:03'),
