  ('zcrm_1579374000109661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '12-16-22 Tina decided to go with SECURE and HMA to keep costs down and to give them the flexibility for employees that are in different states. One son/employee lives in TX, so the dental, vision and accident plans would all be an issue. Also the dental plan Cesar gave to them was out of network for their dentist. They then wanted to understand the tax benefits of a Cafeteria 125 plan. But, that looks to simply give them the flexibility to fund an FSA, HSA, etc. You can''t get tax benefits on MCS or HMA. But, they don''t want the limitations put onto the Cafeteria plan either. So, they will move forward with us and we will enroll their sons/employees on Monday at 2:00 through their customized link.  They will pay only $200 to set up the List Bill while Planstin and Cesar had $300 in fees to set up plus a $10 Admin fee monthly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-19 10:54:48', '2022-12-19 10:54:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109654008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103350002', 'Nancy coleman staubitz', NULL, 'I spoke to Nancy, she wanted to cancel, because she said it was all very confusing for her. I went over the plan and detailed out everything. I also found out, she never did the welcome call. I told her she needs to do that. After explaining everything to her, she will stay with us.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-19 10:41:20', '2022-12-19 10:41:20'),
