  ('zcrm_1579374000109317046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '12-15-2022:  Quentin has the estimate on his ''prev'' colonoscopy.  I sent him the temp for sub a ''preventative needs req'' for his Direct Zion plan & walked him thru the form.  He''ll get that sent over right away.  He''s wanting to have a second test w/it (it''s like an extention of the colonoscopy), so as they are going thru the process on the std colonoscopy, he knows to tt the Zion ''needs processor'' to see if it could be included.
