  ('zcrm_1579374000109389100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165343', 'Renee Athay', NULL, '12-15-22 Renee had a very scathing email about how her Need was handled with Zion. Tim Hirsch responded by letting me know that she doesn''t understand the Guidelines regarding skin issues. I looked in the Guidelines and each spot is considered a separate Need. She has $10K in bills and she''s trying to buy her time until she moves to Medicare. She was so frustrated that she just paid everything. But, after 3 IUA''s, as long as the other ones are above $500 she can still get reimbursed. We will talk on Friday, Dec. 16th to see if I can help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-15 16:37:22', '2022-12-15 16:37:22'),
