  ('zcrm_1579374000109349137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656075', 'Erin Sortino', NULL, '12.15.2022 Erin called and said she spoke with Pati yesterday in billing, and was wondering if she was available. I said, she should be, unless she''s on with another member, then she can leave a message and they''ll get back to her within the day. She was happy with that and I transferred her to Pati. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-15 14:01:33', '2022-12-15 14:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356274', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108535010', 'James Robertson', NULL, 'Member requested IUA Change &amp; member also chose "list bill" option.  I sent him the pmt update link and told him that I wouldn''t make any changes until I received the pmt update from.  He received and will fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 13:56:59', '2022-12-15 13:56:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109389046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082309014', 'Livia Hall', NULL, '12-15-22 Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver Silver/EPO $819.35, APTC $730.08. She also enrolled in VSP Choice Plan B $12.22. All set! Kept her income at $25,200 for 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-15 13:56:23', '2022-12-15 13:56:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356264', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101089010', 'Lauren Ehlers', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking w/Jeffrey.  I will cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 13:45:01', '2022-12-15 13:45:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109359034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101089010', 'Lauren Ehlers', NULL, 'I spoke to Lauen, nice lady, her and her husband are going on an ACA plan because of testosterone treatments the husband needs. they are also getting a better rate. CXL form sent.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-15 13:43:15', '2022-12-15 13:43:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356254', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082322001', 'Robert Reece', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request after speaking w/Jeffrey.  I will cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 13:31:06', '2022-12-15 13:31:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109349132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045682035', 'Christy Curtis Buss', NULL, '12.15.2022 Christy called concerned about emails she is receiving from Sedera.
I shared with her the change Sedera is going through with their platform and suggested she speak to her advisor to complete any forms/signage/changes. 
Christy was happy with that, so I gave her Analisa Cleland''s number and I direct transferred her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-15 13:15:34', '2022-12-15 13:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356244', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715135', 'Sylvia Theisen', NULL, 'After speaking to Wendy this member submitted a cancellation request.  I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 13:13:03', '2022-12-15 13:13:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109389038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372147', 'Aimee Day', NULL, '12-15-22 She is enrolling directly with Sedera bc our prices are not even close to what she''s getting through Sedera and Cloud, plus we aren''t adding any new clients to Sedera. I couldn''t match the prices with Zion either. Cloud promotes Sedera and not Cloud as well. She chose $5000 IUA / $495 + $355 for Cloud = $850 EF. She''s choosing to start this Jan. 1st and will join Cloud starting Dec. 20th. She''ll get proof of DPC from Cloud and she should be all set. No referral fee collected, so none to pay out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-15 13:09:32', '2022-12-15 13:18:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109349127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063695002', 'Erika Joy', NULL, '12.15.2022 St. Thomas Med. called to clarify the process for Erika Joy in getting her procedure done tomorrow, shared.
I confirmed with Cari via teams, who already spoke with Jen earlier, and was aware of a medical need already open for Erika on this.
Given that hospital already called prior to this, she was advised to pay up to her IUA as a cash-pay pt &amp; request they bill her for the balance. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-15 12:55:39', '2022-12-15 18:01:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109387027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091190002', 'Robert Anderson', NULL, 'This member called in upset because he didn''t realize that Misty had taken him and his wife off of Medishare and put them on MPB. After calming Robert down, we decided that transferring him to Misty for explanation as to why she moved them. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-15 12:45:59', '2022-12-15 12:45:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109291135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401239', 'emmett murphy', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2599 Question : i am filling out a change of insurance on your website. what is iua?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-15 12:42:23', '2022-12-15 12:42:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109389033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715135', 'Sylvia Theisen', NULL, '12-15-22 She called to cancel bc she''s in a financial bind at the moment. She signed up with a RMHP via C4 with another broker, not realizing I can help with that too.  When she gets back on her feet she wants to re-enroll in Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-15 12:31:38', '2022-12-15 12:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356239', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842099', 'Abigail Amos', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation from this member eff 12/31/22.  She spoke w/Denny.  I will cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 12:27:24', '2022-12-15 12:27:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109349122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098327002', 'Cindy Gordon', NULL, '12.15.2022 Cindy called to receive guidance completing the Zion Medical Need form, and to retrieve her member ID number from them.
I sent her an email with the Zion link for medical need form and their number. Even though she went through the website to fill out the form. I wanted her to have it on file.
We stayed on the phone together, while she completed the form. When she was ready to speak to Zion to get her member ID, I direct transferred her. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-15 12:23:29', '2022-12-15 12:23:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109389028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109361026', 'Jake Klucewich', NULL, '12-15-22 Jake is Lauren Klucevich''s son but he''s 28 and needs his own plan. He chose CARE+ $2500/$165 for low cost. He''s healthy. He just gets hormone replacement (jokingly says Not for gender id issues). Otherwise, no issues, no tobacco. He successfully enrolled for Jan. 2023. All set and he knows to do Welcome Call and print Reference Guide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-15 12:23:12', '2022-12-15 12:23:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356229', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108214011', 'Chris Pilgrim', NULL, 'Chris called yesterday.  Returned his call.  Left Message', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-12-15 11:40:56', '2022-12-15 11:40:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109349114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '12.15.22 had a radiology mamm, and a mamm diagnostic.
Robin shared that she checked with the facility/provider where she had the above completed, if they were PHCS, and they confirmed that they are.
Jen confirmed with her that since it turned diagnostic, she does not have to worry about that anymore.
Biopsy is recommend, and will go under Zion''s support. Both Jen and I shared her responsibility IUA of $1000.
Robin was wondering if the provider/facility she already went to is in network.
Jen shared with the invoices that can be shared towards her IUA.
Jen offered to send her the email of how to open a medical need with Zion, as well as a list of gastroenterologists in her area. 
Transferred her over to Zion to retrieve her member ID for the medical need. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-15 11:37:56', '2022-12-15 11:54:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356224', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919591', 'James Jordan', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  Jeffrey ok''d cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 11:34:33', '2022-12-15 11:34:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109349109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, '12.15.2022 Ran 2 RX quotes for Kelly:
1-Rosuvastatin Calcium (generic) 10mg, 90qty
2-Ezetimibe (generic) 10mg, 90qty

Found the least cost to be at CostPlus for both quotes for $25.10 vs. the walk-in sites for $35.88
She gave us the green light to send her the CostPlus deals. Given the 10-14 days timeframe it takes to ship them to her, she requested the coupon from one of the walk-in Walmart Pharmacy. 
I sent her the email with the Cost Plus link and the coupons today, 12.15.2022. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-15 11:33:19', '2022-12-15 16:41:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109349104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101089010', 'Lauren Ehlers', NULL, '12.15.22 Laren called to cancel. I confirmed her account, offered her Jeffrey''s contact number, and forwarded her to his phone. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-15 11:28:23', '2022-12-15 11:28:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109356219', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372053', 'Tyler Caveness', 'Vetting Call Complete', 'Spoke with Tyler regarding Agent Onboarding.  Interested in products that would help with his 1099 clients.  Also, looking to set up as an Agency with all commissions being paid to the Agency.  Looking for an Corp to Corp Contract.  

Would like to start with initially going through the onboarding himself first and see what he can do and then move forward with the Agency Set Up.

