  ('zcrm_1579374000109356199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199001', 'Joseph Cozzoli', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation due to some information that he received from his Accountant re: having Tele Health negating eligibility for HSA membership.  Lou told me that there was no convincing member so he cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 10:30:08', '2022-12-15 10:30:08'),
