  ('zcrm_1579374000109356086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109362008', 'Jerry Southerland', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  Updated in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-15 07:37:25', '2022-12-15 07:37:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372147', 'Aimee Day', NULL, '12-13-22 Found notes. Cloud is holding her spot until Dec. 20th. She gets a 15% discount with Sedera and Cloud together. At the $5000 IUA level she will pay $495 for Sedera and $355 for Cloud for the entire family.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 23:09:33', '2022-12-14 23:09:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100614035', 'Judy Doherty', NULL, '12-14-22 She switched to Cigna Connect HSA Bronze 6500 Bronze/EPO $705.19, APTC $285.19. She decided to get the tax benefits and bank on not having any real health issues since she''s super healthy and never goes to the dr.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 23:07:17', '2022-12-14 23:07:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077830004', 'Angela Coy', NULL, '12-14-22 Dear Angela Coy,

Congratulations on purchasing a Direct Vision plan!

Please take the time to review your order details as well as our terms of service. If you have any questions, call us at 844-833-8440 or e-mail us at info@directbenefits.com.

Do not respond to this confirmation email. Allow 5-7 business days for your application to be processed. Your cards and plan information will be delivered electronically or mailed in 7 to 10 working days to the address you provided in the Primary Enrollment Information section.  

Plan includes a one-time non-refundable enrollment fee of $25. This charge will be made at the time of purchase and may appear as a separate transaction from your insurance as Direct Vision or Direct Benefits, Inc.

Your specific coverage information is as follows:

Plan Selected: VSP Choice Plan A
Who’s covered: Applicant
Effective Date: 12-15-2022
Carrier: Ameritas
Monthly Charge: $15.97

Reference Number: 300066448
Agent Info: Wendy Scipione (Phone : (720) 259-1555)', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 22:58:02', '2022-12-14 22:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354202', 'Louis Romero', NULL, '12-14-22 He wasn''t sure if his enrollment was complete or not. It''s RMHP Colorado Doctors Plan Gold ($0 Virtual Urgent Care + $0 Primary Care Visits, $3 T2 Preferred Rx Copay)
Gold/HMO $2,369.03,  APTC $1,268.84. But, he''s not sure he wants to keep this plan bc his drs. aren''t in it. He will be aging in to Medicare in May. I connected him with Andrea already.  His wife and child will need to stay on the plan. He''ll decide by tomorrow if he wants to change it. He also might cancel the dental bc it''s crappy. I let him know I have other options, which I think I shared already for him to review. He''ll talk it over with his wife and decide. But, everything looks the same tonight as it did today when we talked. No changes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 22:37:47', '2022-12-14 22:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, '12-14-22 Hi Wendy,
We''re getting health insurance through Joel''s employer starting in January. What do I need to do to cancel our plan with you?
Thanks,
Kimi

I let her know the PHCS network will be removed in case that changes her decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 22:09:00', '2022-12-14 22:09:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372147', 'Aimee Day', NULL, '12-14-22 I can''t find my original written notes. She has a family of 4, I believe. She was referred to me by a member. I need to find out who again. She wants to be a member of Cloud Medical. They were full but they are now holding a spot for them until late Dec. to join. She''s very eager to join Cloud Medical. I can''t beat the prices that Cloud is offering for including Sedera unless I go straight to Sedera. The prices became WAY too high with MPB''s DIRECT membership at $860 + $355. Sedera is going to be about $495 or so, plus $355 to equal $850 total for the whole family. She really wants Dr. Tusek bc her friends says he great for dealing with women''s hormone changes and does so more naturally. I just got the link to  have her join directly, otherwise she will just have to go through a Sedera Rep but she prefers to go through me since I''ve been so helpful and I''m local.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 21:09:47', '2022-12-14 21:09:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, '12-14-22 Mitch may get an insurance plan through one of his realtor associations as a group. He wasn''t sure but he saw something that looked too good to be true.  He will review that and decide if he wants to upgrade his membership and pay the slightly higher amount of $559.97 but going from $500 IUA to $1000 for this modest price increase.  He likes the idea of having it be easier as well. 
Also, Jennifer told him flu shots are covered as long as it''s in-network with Apex/RCI. He tried calling them and they were closed due to inclement weather.  I also read to him the differences in Access + vs Select + guidelines. That was helpful. He will keep me posted. He hasn''t upgraded yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 20:46:56', '2022-12-14 20:48:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354169', 'Daniel McMillan', NULL, '12-14-22 See notes from his cloned account since moving from CARE+ to Kaiser bc he doesn''t want to have to be involved in any aspect. He wants it super easy. Choice doesn''t seem to matter to him or cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 20:41:41', '2022-12-14 20:41:41'),
