  ('zcrm_1579374000109379021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082322001', 'Robert Reece', NULL, '12-14-2022:  Robert called.  He''s moving to his wife''s insurance.  I transferred him to Jeffrey Bursteen''s line.  He will LM if he doesn''t catch him.  He knows there will be a form form he must sign &amp; sub.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-14 17:49:06', '2022-12-14 17:59:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109354084', 'Ioanna Petropoulou', NULL, '12-14-22 Ioanna left me a vm and I called her back just now. Their account is under name Konstantinos Stamatiou, her husband.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 16:51:50', '2022-12-14 16:51:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109322208', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176105', 'Stephen Klein', NULL, '12-14-22 I double checked and I don''t have any missed calls, vms or emails from him. I worked hard for him with his specific needs. So, I have no idea what his problem is all of the sudden.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 16:40:19', '2022-12-14 16:40:19'),
