  ('zcrm_1579374000109322203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176105', 'Stephen Klein', NULL, '12-14-22 Stephen Klein removed me as his agent and said their new person was had more focus on detail and was more responsive. I apologized for not meeting his expectations and he appreciated that. I don''t have any calls that I haven''t returned or emails that I haven''t responded to. So, I am not sure what his problem is unless he didn''t leave me vms. Got a referral from his friend.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 16:26:42', '2022-12-14 16:26:42'),
