  ('zcrm_1579374000109379008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, '12-14-2022:  Ilan called.  His wife has employer provided healthcare that''s already active, so he wanted to know how to cancel.  It''s after FL hours, so I let him know I''m messaging Jeffrey Bursteen from our office & he may reach out to him, but there will be a form he''s required to sign & submit.  He was concerned about his monthly contribution pulling, so I made sure he knows it''s time sensitive, but if he signs & submits the form prior to 12/20/2022, that pymt should be halted.  He will let us know if for some reason he beats the deadline &  it still processes thru.  He was fine with that.  When I asked if he''d spoken to his adivsor & offered the number, it seemed like I heard frustration in his voice, "he can reach out to me if he wants".  He hasn''t heard from Darius since he enrolled, but he had positive things to say about MPB.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-14 16:08:21', '2022-12-14 17:51:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109372256', 'Daniel Biernat', NULL, '12-14-22 Dr. Jeffrey Lewis is showing up in Anthem Pathway X only, Cigna and Kaiser. I''m recommending the Cigna $0 Ded option for full cost. He might have APTC. But they want this Dr. 
