  ('zcrm_1579374000109349068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101025002', 'Michael Merritt', NULL, '12.14.2022 Mike''s daughter graduated college and has her own insurance now, and he wants to remove her from his plan. I pulled Cari in and she guided him through the process on line to complete the Add/Remove change form. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-14 12:23:57', '2022-12-14 12:23:57'),
