  ('zcrm_1579374000109349063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919591', 'James Jordan', NULL, '12.14.2022 James Jordan called to cancel. After confirming his account, I transferred him to Jeffrey Bursteen. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-14 12:07:24', '2022-12-14 12:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '12-14-22 Ryan is able to get onto his wife''s insurance policy now for 2023 with very good benefits. So, he is cancelling his membership. He was very nice and will let me know if he needs anything else.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 11:31:12', '2022-12-14 11:31:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109358021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815023', 'Andrew Vick', NULL, '12-14-22 Andrew lost his company ins benefits and is joining SECURE with his daughter at the $2500/$550 for Jan. 1st start date. He''s pleased to join and I explained the nuances between what he had before and what he will have now.  I didn''t go into the Redirect benefits bc he watched the video and was ready to roll.  I doubt he even remembers what was included in Redirect. They are super healthy and they don''t have any pre-x, meds or anything. I waived his enrollment fee since he was a member previously. Andrew''s 57 and his daughter is in her low 20''s. He''s all set and knows to complete Welcome Call and print Reference Guide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 11:25:45', '2022-12-14 11:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109359013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083832001', 'David Yonker', NULL, 'I received a call from this member. He is receiving employer benefits at no cost to him, with a low deductible. Wants to cancel, link emailed.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-14 11:18:05', '2022-12-14 11:18:05'),
