  ('zcrm_1579374000109359008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068022001', 'Justin Breaux', NULL, 'I spoke to Justin on Tuesday, 12/13/2022. I was sent a text in teams from John Troutman and Wendy, that this member wanted to cancel. I spoke with member, he was extremely upset that he wasn''t covered as he was told for mental health treatment. I told him I would try to find a solution, in doing so, I found out he is already cancelled. Spoke to John Kach about this this morning.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-14 09:36:12', '2022-12-14 09:36:12'),
