  ('zcrm_1579374000109358003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109087010', 'Broc Sheue', NULL, '12-14-22 Broc is enrolling now in CARE+. He doesn''t do his wellness visits and knows he will pay cash and not get reimbursed if he does.   Watched the video on his own.  He was well versed already. He said that was super helpful. He enrolled in Essentials and realized that''s not what he wanted. Then he was going to join SECURE but that wasn''t showing on the WWSRA site. John fixed it for me already. He wound up choosing CARE+ since he''s young and not needing expensive wellness items.  He enrolled and he knows to complete Welcome Call and save Reference Guide.  I also gave him the code for the $100 fee to be waived as a WWSRA member.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 09:09:32', '2022-12-14 09:11:35'),
