  ('zcrm_1579374000109322043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650083', 'Meghan Van Vleet', NULL, '12-14-22 Meghan called bc she''s struggling with the Apex portion and cash pay. BMC isn''t giving her a cash discount. They are just charging full price if she pays cash or the discounted ins amount if she gives them the card. They are forcing her to pay up front so there''s no negotiating either. It''s totally crappy. Her son was calling and she''ll call me back later to finish our discussion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-14 08:54:13', '2022-12-14 08:54:13'),
