  ('zcrm_1579374000109234044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, '12-13-2022:  Rebecca called.  She wanted to confirm a bunch of stuff:
     - Going to curr stay w/her 5k IUA.  Will consider lowering & knows we''ll need to conf, but will connect w/me early March if wants it to chg on her anniv date.  Knows we have deadline for chgs!
     - We discussed the diff between IUA, Ded, & Out of Pkt, IUAs not annual on an ongoing need, Max is per issue specific ''med need'', 3 IUAs per membership, & when they kick in.
     - I was able to conf we are going to RBP pricing on Planstin 1/1/2023 & went over what that looks like. Did let her know if get...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-14 02:45:37', '2022-12-14 18:12:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109283003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '12-13-22 I looked at Cigna Global and it doesn''t let me proceed if from US and then living in US, only if I select another country. So, that''s not an option for her son who needs surgery in Chicago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 18:12:46', '2022-12-13 18:12:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109234039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058401239', 'emmett murphy', NULL, '12-13-2022:  Emmett called.  His wife is not going to have cov thru her employer soon, so he wanted to know the cost for adding her &amp; their kids to his membership.  I let him know if he needs this for Jan 1,2023, it''s time sensitive.  It''s after FL hours though, so I put him thru to Patti''s VM so he can get pricing.  He will call me back if he doesn''t hear from her by the 15th.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-13 18:12:22', '2022-12-13 18:12:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109264078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088254024', 'Juana Rincon Barrios', NULL, '12-13-22 Juana called bc Cigna has been incredibly difficult to reach to figure out her payment. She set up on the initial payment which they charged her for already. Then it''s showing they will bill her again at the end of Dec. We are hoping this is an automatic system which will recognize she already made her payment for Jan. If not, they will need to apply the fee to Feb. She will keep an eye on her account to make sure she''s not billed twice. She will also be out of the country for Feb and March, so she needs to have this work automatically. She will check on it and feels calmer after talking to me. I let her know every company is buried right now during open enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 18:00:05', '2022-12-13 18:00:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109264070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725092', 'Mark Garcia', NULL, '12-13-22 Phone tag now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 17:37:49', '2022-12-13 17:38:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109268040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099842002', 'Kelly Kichler', NULL, '12.13.2022 Kelly wants to cancel her membership with us. I guided her through the site to reach the cancellation form. Did inquire about not getting charged for January. I reassured them they are well before the 12/20th billing date. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-13 17:14:10', '2022-12-13 17:17:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109234028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '12-13-2022:  Brandi called.  OMGosh, the ''medical need'' she opened on Thursday, 12/8/2022, was closed today by the Zion Advocacy Team.  They notified her today, that she hadn''t provided the ''treatment plan'' they requested & today = Tuesday, 12/13/2022 = 3 bus days after she sub the ''need'', they closed it because she hadn''t met their request.
     - She sent me their e-mail from the advocacy team saying they closed it.  I replied all & brought Jennifer & Joan into the loop by cc''ing them.  This is horrible, so we all need to be aware of the issue.
     - Sent FYI to John Kach that Brandi was inquiring re: fixing the IUA issue (Zion''s telling her $2500, we show $1000 in Admin123).
     - Brandi is trying to remain calm, but between them requiring/saying her IUA is $2500 vs the $1000 we show, & this snaffu on closing the med need 3-days post submittal, she''s struggling to appreciate anything Zion is doing!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-13 16:37:04', '2022-12-13 18:10:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109281003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273725', 'Denise Matouk', NULL, '12.13.22:  Called Denise.  She said she hadn''t read through all the notices from Sedera & us but she knows there needs to be a change.  I explained the situation with Sedera changing their admin. approach and plan change, etc. and described briefly her options with Sedera and Zion.   She said she doesn''t want to stay with Redirect as they are too difficult to deal with.  I agreed with her and reminded her that I tried to switch her to a new plan during the last conversation period becasue of Redirect and she wanted to stay with them.  She asked if I could send her some info. on our plans w/Zion which she would look at tonight and she will call me tomorrow to discuss.  I informed her she has to enroll by 12/20 to get a 1/1/23 start date.  I sent her my website.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-13 16:30:05', '2022-12-13 16:30:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109264059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608546', 'Paige Kaufmann', NULL, '12-13-22 Paige didn''t answer for our appt just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 16:11:25', '2022-12-13 16:11:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109264054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839097', 'Karla Pastore', NULL, '12-13-22 I talked with Karla Pastore since Patti told me she just cancelled. She called Apex and was told nothing is covered. So, she was mad! She has a screw that needs to be removed from her foot that will cost $5K. She said she lost my phone # and said I dropped off the earth. She believed she had no way to reach me. She never received any emails from me. She''s getting a subsidy now and working with someone else. She may come back down the road. She listened to all of the benefits that were included again. Took down the MPB Concierge Team''s #. After I re-explained the entire membership to her, she said she already had a new plan and was all set.  UGH! She did say if her new plan turns out to be bad, she will give me a call now that she has my number again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 15:38:58', '2022-12-13 15:38:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109264049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165320', 'Sherry Remick', NULL, '12-13-22 Sherry is very undecided about what she wants. She''s wavering between Cigna and Friday Bronze and Silver. We need to put her income at $33K as best guess and it will still give her a small CSR to help. At $34K she loses that CSR. We looked at Friday Bronze Copay for $0, Friday Bronze HSA for $14 (she doesn''t like that one) Cigna Connect Flex $3500 as best Silver plan or Friday Gold for $114.60. She has to decide what''s most important. If she wants to keep Cigna, then she should choose the Connect Flex 3500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 15:13:26', '2022-12-13 15:13:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109232201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109271002', 'Patricia Reuss', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-13 15:06:05', '2022-12-13 15:06:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109268029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571380', 'Barbara Young', NULL, '12.13.2022 Barbara wants to open a medical need.
-She started her treatment in 7/2022, and has all her paper work and wants to upload and open a need. She is cutting the 60 deadline close. She kept mentioning she connected with a lady named Rachel on various occasions. We concluded Rachel MUST be from Zion.
-She needed guidance on attaining the right page to do so, and filling it out.
-She needed to get her member ID from Zion to include it on the form.
-I needed to call Cari in, because it appears Barbara attended alternative medicine without approval to relieve her from frozen shoulder pain. I needed Cari to catch those details that might help her with the need , despite Barbara''s route on care for her shoulder.
-Cari explained in detail how to access the link by sending them an email with zion contact information and link to medical need application.
-After being on the phone for 50 or so minutes, Barbara felt comfortable to be transferred to Zion to retrieve her member ID # and complete the form to submit. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-13 15:05:44', '2022-12-13 16:34:21'),
