  ('zcrm_1579374000109264044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '12-13-22 Hi Wendy — I hope things are going well!

I am going full time at my job starting January 3, at which point I will have health, dental, and life insurance right away. Can you help me close/deactivate my current plans so that I don’t double pay for the month of January? And I’m not sure if I need to keep my health matching account.

Thank you!

Alicia', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 13:59:41', '2022-12-13 13:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109264033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109087010', 'Broc Sheue', NULL, '12-13-22 Broc and I talked and he realized he wants CARE+, not Essentials. He was in the car when we connected. We will talk tomorrow morning at 9:00 MST to enroll him! He''s a member with WWSRA, so make sure he gets the $100 fee waived and enroll through their site.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 13:46:26', '2022-12-13 13:48:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109268024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762047', 'David Holstein', NULL, '12.13.22 David called to receive help getting over to Sedera''s new platform, and to complete a prescription quote for Xerolto, 20mg, 60 for qty. I connected with Jen for help on this, and after discussing the matter, Jen connected with Sedera to help transfer David onto the new platform, but they were not going to talk to Jen about that. 
I contacted David back to have him call them and speak to another Jen there. They shared with him that they have technical issues and they''ll need to call him back Friday to transfer him.
After researching the pharm. website we use and coming up with nothing less than $1039~, I contacted Reid. He came back with Xarelto 20mg x 56tabs $151.66 + $9.95 shipping. I sent David an email with Reid''s contact information. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-13 13:34:07', '2022-12-13 13:34:07'),
