  ('zcrm_1579374000109270008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103065002', 'Lisa Dannen', NULL, 'Lisa called in and said she has a diagnostic type of appointment where a procedure is going to be done on this coming up Friday 12/16/22 and how to go about paying for what. I explained to her about she needs to meet her $1000 IUA first and foremost before Zion Health shares anything else. Once she pays that out of pocket, she is good to go with submitting her bills to Zion and starting a Need. I sent Lisa the email with Zion''s contact info at the bottom and the link on where she submits her bills and everything through Zion Health. I suggested she calls Zion as well to let them know what is going on and they can walk her through everything else. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-12-13 12:57:58', '2022-12-13 12:57:58'),
