  ('zcrm_1579374000109264023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '12-13-22 No for today but she may change her mind in a day. I let her know about the $100 ASHI member 1x discount. She now was thinking to possibly split up family. But she''s likely going with another option. If I don''t hear from her, assume they went to another solution. She was super appreciative of my help and answering all of her questions. She couldn''t get solid answers from other people she said. Perhaps she''ll be back down the road.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 12:37:33', '2022-12-13 12:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109270003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762047', 'David Holstein', NULL, 'David called and he asked to speak to either Jennifer or Nahla. I let him know they were both in a meeting, but I could help out as well. He said there is a case that has been being worked on for a while with Sedera that Jennifer & Nahla have been dealing with. It would be best to just leave a message for one of them instead since it seems to be a long ongoing case so it''s best not to get in the middle of that. I passed the message he left along to Jennifer through Teams and Jennifer said she will touch base with David after their meeting is over. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-12-13 12:25:18', '2022-12-13 12:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109264018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012301018', 'Melanie Steinway', NULL, '12-12-22 Got email from C4 that she removed me as her agent. I just called and left her a vm. I''m not sure what''s up.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-13 12:18:28', '2022-12-13 12:18:28'),
