  ('zcrm_1579374000109181087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '12-12-22 I sent this to Jennifer, "I "should" be able to cancel the current plan with both of you included. But, for some reason it won''t cancel out of the system. That means that you will need to call Connect for Health CO and ask them to do it manually. The new eligibility only includes you now. But, they need to fix the system to allow you to cancel the originl plan and re-enroll in the same plan solo. Call them at 855-752-6749 and let me know the outcome."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 21:19:26', '2022-12-12 21:19:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '12-12-22 "As per the email below I have uploaded my 2021 tax returns signed by a 3rd party (my accountant)."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 20:46:58', '2022-12-12 20:46:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109087010', 'Broc Sheue', NULL, '12-12-22 Broc reached out to cancel his Essentials membership already after just joining.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 20:43:42', '2022-12-12 20:43:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986163', 'Sylvie Bloch', NULL, '12-12-22 Email elibroker@yahoo.com, Phone 9179027168, Account # 3509406810, Plan Name - FRIDAY Bronze Copay: $0 Well Visit, up to $30 Preferred Generic Rx Plan ID - 63312CO0600083-01.  Premium $625.33, APTC $0.
Eli signed Sylvie up for the above for 2023. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 20:24:27', '2022-12-12 20:29:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608546', 'Paige Kaufmann', NULL, '12-12-22 Paige reached out bc their price is going up significantly. They are already at the $1500 IUA. The higher IUA''s barely help reduce the monthly. So, I suggested we talk.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 20:20:25', '2022-12-12 20:20:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '12-12-22 Tina and I talked for our scheduled appt to review her membership and she said she wanted to cancel with MPB bc she was going to do a group with Planstin and Zion. She spoke with Cesar Bautista when she called simply to understand how her membership works. He let her know that Planstin can do that for her. They can honor her small employer group of 5-6 members and include dental and vision. He quoted her $1890 for their monthly fee for the group for this new business account for employees. There are 3 married couples with the primary members ages 24, 26 and 51. One of the spouses may not join. She wants a Jan. 1st start date. I let her know that MPowering Benefits can do this for her. When she asked Cesar who MPowering Benefits is, he said it''s a partner of Planstin/Zion but her can help her with the group! I''ve alerted Rod and John T.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 20:10:27', '2022-12-12 20:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109174037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '12-12-2022:  Brandi called &amp; spoke to Jennifer.  Zion is telling her she has a $2500 IUA.  Jennifer, Patti, &amp; I have all ck''d &amp; our records show the 1k IUA, even in Admin123.  I contacted John Kach as we think there are several ''tape'' issues with Zion &amp; Planstin right now.  Brandi know Jennifer will let her know what we find out, but it will not be today, due to the time.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-12 17:29:32', '2022-12-12 17:29:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110552002', 'Sheryl Hadley', NULL, '12-12-22 Sheryl is in Costa Rica at the moment. She''s 56 and self-employed. She''s on Friday Health now and hates it because she paid $2000 for blood tests for her physical. I told her she has to talk with her doctor and make sure it''s coded as wellness not diagnostic, otherwise it''s no longer at no cost. She was exploring Freedom Life as well but now more interested in this bc of its flexibility. She travels a lot and wants to be protected.  She does have Lyme disease that went un-diagnosed for 20 years. She''s getting help by an osteopath and by Mary Shakelton. She Loves Mary and highly recommends her. She''s very expensive but worth it. She will look over this in the next few days and make a decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 17:25:48', '2022-12-12 17:25:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109165088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735002', 'Sean Reilly', NULL, 'I called and left another voicemail.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-12 17:13:16', '2022-12-12 17:13:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069438001', 'Beth Blacker', NULL, '12-12-22 December 2, 2022

