We are leaving this enrollment in place!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 17:12:57', '2022-12-12 17:12:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069438001', 'Beth Blacker', NULL, '12-12-22 We updated her income from $60K to $75K and back down to $61,740. But, C4 pushed it through at the $60K level with the Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 Rx Copay
Gold/EPO $896.24, APTC $446.53. Her cost is $449.71. When we updated the income the system showed a much smaller APTC of around $356. So, we will leave well enough alone. They already pushed it through at the higher APTC amount. I did not cancel the plan, therefore I didn''t disrupt anything. We only changed the income by $1,740 which should have minimal impact. She agreed that she wants to leave it alone!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 17:08:39', '2022-12-12 17:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109165073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111537001', 'Renee Chan', NULL, 'We have a call scheduled for Friday afternoon.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-12 17:02:58', '2022-12-12 17:02:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109165068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111537001', 'Renee Chan', NULL, 'Renee called in on monday at 5:30 pm. She is self employed and the plan is just for her. She is 57 years old and lives in cali. interested in hsa as well as the mec. She looks to start a plan for January and has no serious preex conditions.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-12 17:02:39', '2022-12-12 17:02:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109165063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, 'We have a call scheduled for Friday after 12 pm', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-12 17:00:42', '2022-12-12 17:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109165058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109742001', 'Abigail Chan', NULL, 'Abby is a very nice lady from colorado, she is self employed and her husband is 33, no serious preex. Potentially going to get her daughter on the plan eventually as well. She spoke with zion before but seems like she wants to go with us. She is into the telehealth and alternative medicine and also like the structure of the plan. She wants to start for January and will most likely enroll by Friday.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-12 17:00:20', '2022-12-12 17:00:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '12-12-22 See notes from other account. Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0
Bronze/EPO 	$554.90 	APTC $38.56. She chose this. She might need an eye surgery (I think) and this provides immediate co-insurance instead of paying full cost to ded. She also takes the generic version of Pristiq/desvanfalxine (sp?) looks to be $21-$25 cash and a generic. So, she should be fine with not falling into the preferred drug list. All set for 2023!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 15:40:42', '2022-12-12 17:20:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102198', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096906002', 'Kelda Toliver', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation received Employer Benefits I will cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 14:58:12', '2022-12-12 14:58:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109168010', 'Robert Robison', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 14:56:09', '2022-12-12 14:56:09'),
