  ('zcrm_1579374000109181028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, '12-12-22 Adriana is changing her last name from Godberg to Rojas Vargas and also change IUA from $500 to $1500 to bring her cost from $333 to $355.78.  She completed the Change Form and is completing Sedera''s conversion process now. All set and nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 14:45:40', '2022-12-12 14:45:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102178', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179009', 'Torey Gonzales', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 14:45:12', '2022-12-12 14:45:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081352008', 'Daniel McMillan', NULL, '12-12-22 Dan left me a vm letting me know he wants to change back to Kaiser and wants to help. I left him a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 14:29:45', '2022-12-12 14:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109183002', 'Joseph Szymanski', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 14:29:09', '2022-12-12 14:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059474061', 'James Pendleton', NULL, '12-12-22 Jim called to find out how to lower his monthly cost before moving to Medicare in May 2023. I suggested moving to CARE+ if he doesn''t plan to fund his HSA and/or increase the IUA to $2500 but less of a monthly impact and not really recommended. Also gave him the $5000 IUA price too. He will call me back when he decides the importance of funding the HSA for early 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 14:25:31', '2022-12-12 14:25:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109174029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082061010', 'Lauren Beattie', NULL, '12-12-2022:  Lauren called.  Planstin is declining a ''prev care'' claim saying she''s been cancelled.  I called &amp; tt Ember at Planstin.  According to Admin123, the change to age banded pricing is the cancellation date Ember''s seeing: 9/30/22.  She cannot see the new age banded plan (which is clear in Admin123 as eff 10/1/22).  I tt Jennifer &amp; I notified John Kach (along w/other tape issues.)  ILM for Lauren that we are working on &amp; I''ll get back to her, but it won''t be today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-12 14:06:14', '2022-12-14 02:46:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109179002', 'Corey Vincent', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 14:05:21', '2022-12-12 14:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109175019', 'Juliann Jordan', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 14:03:22', '2022-12-12 14:03:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109117023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, 'Brandi called in because when she spoke with Zion Healthshare earlier today she was told by their customer service rep that she has a $2,500 IUA amount. Brandi called MPB because she thought she had a $1k IUA amount (which is the accurate IUA). I have a call into Ashlee Williams at Planstin to get this corrected and I will be following up with Brandi once everything is done. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-12 13:53:32', '2022-12-12 13:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691226', 'Dolores Pope', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation due to new job w/benefits.  I will cancel billing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 13:45:17', '2022-12-12 13:45:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109165048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'cameron called in ready to buy today. anddd I''mmm Feeeling gooood. bum badump badump badadadadadump.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-12 13:34:38', '2022-12-12 13:34:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779108', 'Laura Laffoon', NULL, '12-12-22 Laura was frustrated with her Agent since he provided no thoughts on plans just confirmed everything she knew already. She''s considering Cigna only bc her drs are on the plans. She called and confirmed already. She''s looking at Cigna Connect Flex Bronze HSA,  Bronze $0  Ded, Bronze $7200 or Gold 2250. Leaning towards HSA for tax benefits and lowest MOP. She might need an ankle surgery this year which rules out MCS. I told her of removing current plan before selecting new one and making payment 7-10 biz days after enrollment. She''ll try to do it today or tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 13:34:01', '2022-12-12 13:34:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740154', 'Kevin DeVries', NULL, 'This member was part of the original Select Group but did not respond to any of the emails re; Conversion in 8/1/2020.  He remained on the Select group until it''s cancellation eff 4/22.  I enrolled him in the Apex HDHP MEC eff 10/22.  I will refund him six months of MEC portion ($89.78 x 6 mos = 538.68)  I will refund out of FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 13:31:30', '2022-12-12 13:31:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447370', 'Richard Watkins', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/23.  I will cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 13:14:25', '2022-12-12 13:14:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109174024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887044', 'Jack Pardo', NULL, '12-12-2022:  tt Sissy (pronounced: CeeCee) in the Zion ''Needs'' Dept.  Since son Jack is 18, she says they come move him onto his own plan & the parents can cancel their portion of the membership - make sure NO LAPSE in dates!  I verified w/Patti:  Have son re-enroll & on same day have parents sub the cancellation for the old membership.  Passed all this info along & reminded that: make sure son Jack keeps his memb at least thru the open need (I sugg extra time in case of issues on the backside).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-12 13:13:17', '2022-12-12 13:13:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109174019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '12-12-2022:  Cynthia called - she needs to sub further info for the need on Scott''s finger &amp; just wanted to make sure she''s doing it correctly.  They have the need going &amp; were given the e-mail add Zion sugg sub addl docs to.  I told her it couldn''t hurt to put this into the sub line:  Open Need - Scott Meyer &amp; memb #.  She''s sub the detailed inv &amp; thier pymt receipt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-12 13:09:28', '2022-12-12 13:09:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '12-12-22 She agreed to include her SS income to the equation since the Peak system is including it in spite of the Medicaid employees who keep telling her it''s not included. This will give her a $446.04 APTC instead of her being accepted to Medicaid and then paying full price of the plan she wants which was $800+.  Son Gavi needs a super unique surgery done by about 3 drs. nationwide. They need to go to Chicago, IL to get it done. The hospital doesn''t accept any marketplace plans. So, he will need his own plan and he also does not qualify for Medicaid bc Beth''s household income is about $49,983. They get some SS income for him too which seems strange as he''s 10. She will call the hospital to see what options they have to get him insurance that they will cover for individuals or some special solution for out of state patients.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 13:02:32', '2022-12-12 13:02:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486210', 'Todd Ackerman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/23  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI and cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 12:58:43', '2022-12-12 12:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162322', 'Esther Turner', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/23.  RCI &amp; Sedera notified.  Billing cancelled in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 12:50:24', '2022-12-12 12:50:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102133', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177103', 'John Urrutia', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/23.  I have notified RCI &amp; Sedera and will cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 12:39:06', '2022-12-12 12:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109181003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779108', 'Laura Laffoon', NULL, '12-12-22 Laura called and I called back and left vm. She''s debating about MCS still and wants me to help her answer questions with her current broker who knows nothing about MCS. I told her I will answer any and all questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 12:19:59', '2022-12-12 12:19:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109176026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584125', 'Brian Schiller', NULL, '12-12-22 Julie Wilson is Brian''s wife and she started a new job with 1% For the Planet, company of 45 people. They are getting incredible group ins with $0 ded and many benefits. They are paying for Brian''s as well. Julie has some open Needs, so she will wait to cancel her own membership until those are closed out. I showed her how to help Brian complete the cancellation form. Let her know he needs to sign it himself.  She''s all set for now and very appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 12:15:34', '2022-12-12 12:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108054002', 'Alan Rapoport', NULL, 'Member cancelled prior to start  due to the fact that daughters college would not take this membership.  I will refund $125.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 12:15:04', '2022-12-12 12:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109176021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486210', 'Todd Ackerman', NULL, '12-12-22 Todd''s wife''s company is paying for his plan in 2023 moving forward. I showed him how to complete the cancellation form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 12:04:09', '2022-12-12 12:04:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109176016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079849335', 'Brian Lorch', NULL, '12-12-22 Brian updated his acct for 2023. He''s now deciding between Bronze HSA for the tax benefits. His cost will be $164.91 for lowest HSA with Friday or Anthem Gold Mtn Enhanced Standard. He sees plenty of PCP and Orthos in the network for Anthem Gold Mtn Enhanced Standard.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-12 11:58:51', '2022-12-12 11:58:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109102123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109177011', 'Edali Blandino', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-12 11:56:51', '2022-12-12 11:56:51'),
