  ('zcrm_1579374000109084013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109664009', 'Lisa Cadiz', NULL, '12.11.22:  After several emails back and forth, Lisa said she would like to talk to me about a plan this weekend.  I told her I am available today all day.  She called and we discussed all three plans.  She feels the DIRECT plan would best suit her needs.  I emailed her my landing page and advised her of the deadline for enrolling for a Jan. 1, 2023 start date.  I asked her to call me with any further questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-11 16:27:29', '2022-12-11 16:27:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109084008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109664009', 'Lisa Cadiz', NULL, '11.30.22:  Met Lisa at a wine tasting dinner. I explained what my job is and she said she is looking for a better healthcare option than the insurance she now has.  She said she would like to talk with me further about the MPB plan options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-12-11 16:24:10', '2022-12-11 16:24:10'),
