  ('zcrm_1579374000109075091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027648080', 'Beth Lichtenstein', NULL, '12-9-22 Earned Income  is $11,583. Qualifies for Medicaid. Son is at the drs. now and will need a surgery that will keep him for 2 weeks. It''s rare situation and they want to go to Chicago, IL for the surgery. I told her to find out if they accept Anthem Pathway X HMO plans or what plans they accept from out of state for Individuals. I doubt any! They might have to get onto Medicaid in IL perhaps? I am not sure.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 16:38:00', '2022-12-09 16:38:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109075086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '12-9-22 Beth is trying to decide if she wants to switch for Jan 1st of March 1st bc she already has her payment for mammogram scheduled in Feb from Redirect. They''ve been really great lately and she has some other outstanding bills with them to be reimbursed. She will ponder over the weekend. Leaning towards switching for Jan. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 16:27:43', '2022-12-09 16:27:43'),
