  ('zcrm_1579374000109077065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650401', 'Frederic Besch', NULL, '12.09.2022 Fred called to change his payment information. I guided him to the MPB site Member Updates page and to the form below. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-09 16:05:51', '2022-12-09 16:05:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109077060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '12.0.2022 Steve wants to know when to open a medical need. 
-I reminded him that he can take care of his $1000 IUA, save his receipts (preferably in PDF form to upload) and to call us when he''s ready to open that Medical need. 
-he is also experiencing blood and they want to do an ultrasound and scope.
-he wants to know if they can do one on separate days, they said the insurance companies won''t let them do that, and that they have to be done in the same day. His question was, if Zion would care if he had them done on different days and not on the same day. I was unable to get clarification on this question, but gave him an educated response as to Zion not caring about that other than receiving the bills to make the payments. 
-I called him back to tell him what Cari guided me to do. Which is go ahead and open a medical need to get this going. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-09 15:58:16', '2022-12-09 16:15:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109075071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725092', 'Mark Garcia', NULL, '12-9-22 Mark is deciding between keeping PDHC $589.78/$1000 or switching to SECURE $325/$1000.  He turning 60 in Dec. hence part of the reason for the huge price jump. But, he crashed on his bike in 2020 and broke 10 ribs, scapula, etc. and he was blown away by how well Sedera and Redirect treated him! He also was shocked by getting a 45% discount as being a former NM resident bc he grew up in NM and the accident happened there. They finagled the payment so he got a huge discount. Sedera was thrilled and paid him right away. He also uses the chiro 1x per month for maintenance. He has high cholesterol and won''t go on statins bc he doesn''t believe in them. He''s had high cholesterol since in his 20s. So, well managed, no issues.  He will give Julie Klein my phone number to help with C4 as well. He''ll let me know next week if he wants to switch or not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 15:50:05', '2022-12-13 17:36:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109077055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442145', 'Suzanne Picard', NULL, '12.09.2022 Steve''s email: steve@steveellismusic.com', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-09 15:49:18', '2022-12-09 15:49:18'),
