  ('zcrm_1579374000109075056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050550098', 'Sarah Price', NULL, '12-9-22 Experience has been so GREAT! She had only one hiccup with getting reimbursed for one dr. visit. She forgot about the chiro care visits. I sent her refresher docs to show her all of her benefits. She''s super thrilled to keep her membership. She want vision, possibly HMA AND accident policy if I can find something to protect her daughter in case of drinking underage and gets into accident of any kind.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 15:12:37', '2022-12-09 15:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109075042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044466001', 'Brian Schey', NULL, '12-9-22 Brian is choosing Friday Health Bronze Copay Bronze/HMO $397.45 APTC $0. He wants to keep Jeffrey Stoll P.A. at Clinica Family Health.  But Dr. Ahmad Q at CO Heart and Vascular in Longmont, CO was not in network, so he''ll choose another dr. for that.  He''s also choosing the Delta Dental Clear Plan for $39 a month starting Jan. 1st. He will set a calendar reminder to make his payment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 14:49:23', '2022-12-09 15:00:11'),
