  ('zcrm_1579374000109052139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584056', 'Lynda Wright', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she had removed both her daughter from the plan months ago.  However I do not have any Change from from this member.  She told me that thiswas done via email.  I advised that we don''t do Changes via email.  She also expressed interest in cancelling.  Member not happy with all the changes.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-09 14:40:24', '2022-12-09 14:40:24'),
