  ('zcrm_1579374000109077034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740154', 'Kevin DeVries', NULL, '12.09.2022 Kevin called to cancel his plan with us. I gave him two options to cancel: via member update portal page, or to speak with Patti. He opted to speak to Patti. 
