  ('zcrm_1579374000109075037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000074947065', 'Andrew Evans', NULL, '12-9-22 Andrew called to discuss a potential group plan for likely April 1st start date. They are starting a new company called Hope Institute to help people with suicidal ideation using evidence based tools to help people immediately without delay. He''s in FL but they will be hiring in AZ and starting with 6 employees and growing to 20. All of the employees will vary in age and they are psychologists, psychiatrists or social workers. He knows of the 10th of the month deadline and 20th of the month for employees for the 1st of the next month start date. I sent him the video and email overview to share with his team.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 13:10:09', '2022-12-09 13:10:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109052108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109072001', 'Justin Mulholland', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-09 13:05:47', '2022-12-09 13:05:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109052103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109066002', 'Susan Schueman', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-09 13:02:26', '2022-12-09 13:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109075032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '12-9-22 Nathalie was completing the Sedera conversion process and wanted to know if she needed to add DPC or VPC or anything.  I left her a vm letting her know she doesn''t need to add anything at all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 12:49:47', '2022-12-09 12:49:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109075024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109410009', 'Craig Schkade', NULL, '12-9-22 Craig is 50, Julie 45 and 3 kids, 11, 8 and 8. Craig''s leaving corporate world and going to be self-employed starting Jan. 1st. The family is all healthy, no tobacco and no pre-x other than Craig. He buys albuterol inhaler just in case. He uses it possibly 1-2x per year if at all. He has not been to the hospital other than once when a kid. He take finesstride for hair loss and fluoxetine for anxiety. He also had an MRI on his back early in 2022. I explained the pre-x clause carefully and he understands. He''s not concerned. They didn''t find anything new to do anything about. The family does their wellness visits and they fund an HSA already. SECURE $1000/$915 or $2500/$765. He''s ready to pull the plug possibly on Monday and will call me. He had an appt and had to jump off the phone. Sending him write up of SECURE and will send video for wife to listen to. He received the written overview!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 12:41:52', '2022-12-09 12:45:54'),
