  ('zcrm_1579374000109075019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109410009', 'Craig Schkade', NULL, '12-8-22 Craig left me a vm. I called him back yesterday and again just now. He came to me via Janaan Cowden and he will become self-employed at the 1st of the year. So, he wants to explore his options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 11:42:46', '2022-12-09 11:42:46'),
