  ('zcrm_1579374000109075014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '12-9-22 Eric was pondering switching to regular ins bc he can get it for $600+ but then it''s limited for out of the country. His son might be out of the country for a bunch of months this year. I read him the out of country clause and sent him the guidelines to read for himself. It''s super flexible. I also sent him the Redirect information and Life Care information as a reminder. He will get way more benefits and be protected better with PDHC. All set. He''s competing the conversion process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-09 11:29:33', '2022-12-09 11:29:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000109077008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, '12.09.2022 Tee grabbed my call, thankfully. I refreshed his memory regarding Bill''s situation. I shared we took the time to resubmit another medical need and I''m just confirming you received it. 
