  ('zcrm_1579374000109016013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058906061', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Patrick called so that he could access his CirrusMD services. I sent him a password reset. Patrick also inquired about a preventative lab bill he received. I advised him to call the physicians office that ordered the labs to verify that everything was coded preventative. We also went over what labs are included in the preventative care services. Patrick was so satisfied with his service today that he would like his wife to work for MPB. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-09 09:24:16', '2022-12-09 09:24:16'),
