  ('zcrm_1579374000109016008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081704002', 'Carmen Davis', NULL, 'Carmen called because she would like to know what her coverage is for urgent care. I explained the self-pay process and advised Carmen that since she is cancelling as of December 31, 2022 that I am unsure of how opening a medical need with Zion would process if she were to open one. Carmen will call the concierge line if she needs to open a medical need. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-09 08:43:28', '2022-12-09 08:43:28'),
