  ('zcrm_1579374000108882029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106616001', 'Janet Banks', NULL, '12-8-2022:  I ran Janet''s RX Quotes late at night - need to ask her questions tomorrow.  Have it ready to go once I get details from her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-09 01:31:32', '2022-12-09 01:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108942032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413161', 'Wayne Marrs', NULL, '12-8-22 Gaia enrolled Wayne into Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 2800 $0 for $731.30 and $0 APTC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-08 22:22:59', '2022-12-08 22:23:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108882024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', NULL, '12-8-2022:  Nahla''s not feeling well, so I thought I''d note this for next time: Fluticason-Salmeteral 113mg Respiclick inhaler:  We asked Reid because these are so exp.  He cannot curr source "respiclick" inhlaers.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-08 18:17:03', '2022-12-08 18:17:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108882016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081869008', 'Frederick Koen', NULL, '12-8-2022:  Tina sub an RX Quote for a very exp drug.  We quoted it & ck''d w/Reid.  She placed 2 quote req showing same drug but wanting CVS or Walgreens.  The best option by far was at KS, regardless of the qty she wanted:  Famciclovir 500mg, #21 = $14.59 @ KS on RXGo.  
     - Her quote req was confusing, so I called her & she said she''d gotten so sick, she''d just grabbed the rx at CVS (w/a qty she hadn''t req''d anyway) #21.  She paid $68.  She was very kind about it.  I had priced up other qtys she''d req''d too (all were cheapest at KS on RXGo)  #30 = $18.70; #90 = $46.11.  To clarify for next time, she curr takes 1 tab 3x daily.
     - I encouraged her to call us if she needs urgently.  With us asking the int shopper, we would have skipped that step.  She''s using the drug for shingles, but it''s also for other items not as urgent: herpes & cold sores, so we didn''t realize the urgency.  Hopefully, next time she''ll call us to let us know the corr qty & urgency so she can save $.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-08 17:40:35', '2022-12-08 18:07:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108883070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104757002', 'Mary Johnson', NULL, '12.08.2022 With Cari''s guidance on generating a simple email to Planstin, I was able to communicate with Planstin and request a pdf and a tangible card sent to Mary''s email and home address. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-08 17:12:56', '2022-12-08 17:12:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108883064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '12.08.2022 Adam called wanting to make sure he''s covering all his basis for his PCP apt tomorrow morning. I''m not familiar with his plan CareZ, so I pulled Jenn in to coach the both of us.
- Adam has an older plan, he has not been to a PCP for about a couple or years, he said.
- He is going to see his PCP, who he vetted to be in network a while back, Jenn asked him to confirm that they still are part of the network.
- Jenn then proceeded to guide him on how to present himself. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-08 16:28:04', '2022-12-08 16:28:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108942027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '12-8-22 Andre got in a skiing accident a few days ago and he''s just trying to understand the timing of submitting the need and possible surgery. Wondering if there''s a time limit. I let him know the 6 month time limit to submit the need from the date of service. But, he''s considering waiting on surgery if need be. I suggested he speaks with the person managing his need if/when that becomes relevant.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-08 16:01:01', '2022-12-08 16:01:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108942022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '12-8-22 Ruth called to better understand small costs like Urgent Care if never reached IUA and understands it''s the cash price that she''s responsible for in that scenario. She''s deciding between all options and will let me know on Monday what they decide.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-08 15:52:47', '2022-12-08 15:52:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108883044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '12.08.2022 Brandi was able to see her PCP via UberDoc, which then they requested some tests and labs on Monday. 
- Brandi called to receive guidance on how to submit her forms. Because Cari has been working closely with her and I''m still feeling green about the plans, I pulled her in to clarify the process for Brandi. 
- Brandi has her Zion card, and she received Cari''s email on how to submit receipts to Zion. 
- Cari coached Brandi on uploading her forms on the medical need page, and specified what to share in the description box. 
- Cari emphasized on uploading the invoice with the receipt together would be extremely helpful.
- Cari shared the use of Healthcare BlueBook, a place where doctor''s are rated, and Brandi said she is familiar. Cari said she might not be able to find the functional medicine doctors on there. 
- Cari coached to use the Zion number to confirm using a specific doctor due to the doctor being in functional medicine. 
- Brandi does not believe she will have an issue being approved for a functional medicine, due to her past experiences being a cash-pay patient with functional doctors. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-08 15:27:46', '2022-12-08 15:48:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108942014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918010', 'Lauren Klucewich', NULL, '12-8-22 Jake went out to feed the cows and will be back shortly to complete his application with Lauren''s help. She will let me know when it''s done. He will choose CARE+ at $2500/$165.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-08 15:16:37', '2022-12-08 15:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108883039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100781002', 'Shannon McIlwaine', NULL, '12.08.2022 Shannon called requesting her member ID information off of her Zion card. I consulted Jen for clarification on the plan she is on, and confirmed I need to transfer her to Zion. I told Shannon that I''d be glad to transfer her and five', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-08 15:12:21', '2022-12-08 15:12:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108942006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918010', 'Lauren Klucewich', NULL, '12-8-22 Lauren is enrolling now for family including Jace, youngest. Jake, 20 will enroll separately. He has hormone replacement therapy and does labs on occasion to check his levels. I recommended he uses the MPB Concierge Team to help him access the labs at the best price. Some were $2500 and others were $450. I looked up there Full Testosterone Free Total Test for $50 Jason''s Health or $99 Walk-In Labs. Jason''s was showing a long distance to a Quest lab or Lab Corp for Walk-In Labs shows Lab Corp which is where he''s gone in the past. They are choosing SECURE $1000/$915.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-08 14:56:13', '2022-12-08 14:59:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108882011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107491002', 'Douglas Hollowell', NULL, 'Called Doug to do his welcome call, no answer, left a detailed vm and resent the welcome call scheduler. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-08 14:34:03', '2022-12-08 14:34:03'),
