  ('zcrm_1579374000108672113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104757002', 'Mary Johnson', NULL, '12.07.2022 Started an email with Jen to Planstin to request Mary another card. Will complete tomorrow with Jen.
Called Mary back to explain the let-go of the provider network, PHCS, guidelines AO January 01.2023, Did not catch her so I left a VM to call us back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 17:45:25', '2022-12-07 17:45:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '12-7-22 Lorie has chosen the Anthem Colorado Option Gold Mountain Enhanced Std $2625.87 76680CO0220078-01 and separate plan for son Stephen T bc turning 26 in March and best to have just one ded. for entire year for him with Plan ID same at 76680CO0220078-01,  $373.11.  We spent a very long time sorting out her account. Going direct to Anthem was Not cheaper. We were forced back to C4 which was strange. Not sure why. Perhaps that Gold plan is only offered via C4. Then we needed to separate out their son and system wouldn''t let us bc their addresses weren''t updated for the entire family.  They Lost their house in the Louisville fire!!! They had Progressive insurance which wasn''t good. It took them 7 months to get them to agree on a house that the ins would pay for to rent. Fortunately they have a house in Silverthorne as well but they couldn''t even stay there. She said State Farm was the worst. National and Chubb were the best.  We got C4 Susan to help us fix their account to proceed. Ref. # was 2211207-002595. Also enrolled in VSP Choice Plan A for entire family starting Dec. 8th. Also confirmed that Dr. Jonathan Godin was in the network. Dr. Abrahams is not, so they will look for a new cardiologist. All set for 2023! Super friendly and thankful!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 17:28:38', '2022-12-07 17:35:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', NULL, '12-7-2022;  Brittany called;
     - 11/15/2022:  Brittany sub her req to go from Sedera/RCI to Zion/Planstin eff 12/1/22.
     - Brittany''s son (?) ended-up in the ER & hosp 11/23 to 11/26.  She''s sub a ''need'' before & tried to go into her Sedera portal thinking she could send it since that memb was in effect during his issue, but it has her locked out since they changed.  That''s when she called the conc line.
     - I sent a Teams chat to Patti because I''m not sure how we handle this situation.  I also think we need to remember, whatever he was admitted for, is now a pre-x on the new Zion healthshare & at least tt Brittany about that.  Patti was already gone for the day, so I let Brittany know I''d get back to her tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 17:17:50', '2022-12-07 17:53:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, '12-7-2022:  tt Kelly, she hadn''t rec''d the VM, but when I pointed to it, she saw the info.  I let her know how sorry we are for any inconvenience, but she was super nice about it &amp; appreciated my calling her again (thanked me for being so nice).  She was resched when we talked &amp; know whatever phone number she lists in the scheduler, is the ph # they will call to do the call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 16:51:59', '2022-12-07 16:51:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105234001', 'Brianna Krampetz', 'Brianna pronounced:  Bri-on-a', '12-7-2022:  Got to tt Brianna.  We went over a lot:
     - Showed her how to use HCBB.  She''s having trouble w/finding a doc to help w/hernia repair.  She said she didn''t receive Jennifer''s e-mail, so we just went thru the HCBB tool together, using HealthGrades.com, google reviews, etc.  She appreciated the guidance & liked having HCBB instruction.
     - Brianna wanted to get a ''med need'' going as well.  Sent her the temp & walked thru how to sub, what to expect etc.  Meant to trans her to Zion, but made sure she had the # in the temp in case we forgot by the end of the call (which we did).     - CA

Brianna called again.  She wasn''t sure how to ans the "other ins" question.  After talking she realized "None" is the appropriate answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 16:47:38', '2022-12-07 16:50:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', NULL, '12.07.2022 Called Lauri to call her back as promised to discuss her RX requests on fluticasone Salmeteral, 113mg in respicklick and albuterol. A gentleman answered the phone, but seemed he got interrupted, and thought I was soliciting and hung up after he finished his last statement. 
