Him: "I don''t know what that is and she is not here. Have a good day."  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 16:46:16', '2022-12-08 11:17:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, '12-7-2022:  Wendy Weiner called.  She wanted to discuss her self-emp status &amp; what she''d have to prove that.  Her scenario is very diff, so I let her know our Ben Admin, Patti Baron would be the one who could help her, but it''s after hours in FL.  Wendy''s going to LM for Patti &amp; knows it today that Patti can call her back.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 16:45:24', '2022-12-07 16:45:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, '12.07.2022 Called Bill and left a VM about beginning a medical need with Zion. Called him back to remind him of the time sensitivity on his situation. Bill will call back when he is not driving. 
Bill called back, I explained the Zion number and the medical need link from the email, we began the medical need process, then he shared THAT''s the form he filled out and Zion rejected. I relayed the information we, Cari and I, learned from Zion''s call yesterday, and that worst case scenario Zion would either consider it a duplicate (which questions not finding it in the system yesterday), or be able to connect the already submitted bills to this newly submitted medical need.
Bill said he was confident in completing the rest of the form on his own. 
He also shared that he has not received a bill from MPB in a while, I kindly shared Pati''s contact and transferred him to her line and offered to email him her number. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 16:39:57', '2022-12-07 17:11:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '12-7-22 Suzanne wanted to know if her Cigna plan includes mental health counseling and it does not. I told her she can switch to Friday Health which includes mental health. She will look to see what doctors she wants in the future. She''s not tied to one now, so she might be open to moving to Friday Health. She also asked about vision plans and dental. She was hoping they were included in her Cigna plan which they are not. I explained the HMA to her and she''s not interested in that either. She did need 2-3 crowns 5 years ago and went down to Cozumel to get them done. She may go to Costco to get her new glasses. She''ll let me now if she wants to look at Friday Health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 16:04:20', '2022-12-07 16:04:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658008', 'Wendy Weiner', NULL, '12-7-22 Wendy is 63 and lives in Salida. She has US Health with Cigna and she''s paying $450 and hates it. She didn''t even get her annual wellness visit included. She''s retired but earns money for real estate to show proof of self employment. She''s super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She might like to fund an HSA. She enrolled in SECURE on first call for $1000/$325. Susan McCausland referred her. Wendy is thrilled to save money and join the membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 15:35:07', '2022-12-07 15:35:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, '12-7-22 Susan''s friend Wendy Weiner said Susan''s plan cost went down and asked why. I reviewed Susan''s account here and it went from $322 to $319.47+$15 Admin Fee = $334.47. So, it went up just barely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 15:30:03', '2022-12-07 15:30:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165399', 'Kelly & Kevin Anderson', NULL, '12-7-22 Kelly and Kevin just learned that they can qualify for a APTC with about $156K income est. for 2023. They are getting about $450+ APTC and choosing a Kaiser plan.  I helped her through the financial portion of the app and she''s going to choose a plan now. They love Kaiser bc of how integrated all of the care is and how easy it is.  I will check back to see what she chose. All set and knows to pay to lock in plan and then set up ongoing payments with Kaiser. She''ll pay today if it gives her the opportunity to do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 15:27:11', '2022-12-07 15:27:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 14:56:49', '2022-12-07 14:56:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108651002', 'Jason Pellegrin', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 14:53:39', '2022-12-07 14:53:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885255', 'Azucena Soto', NULL, 'Member cancelled eff 1/1/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 14:49:05', '2022-12-07 14:49:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105234001', 'Brianna Krampetz', NULL, '12.07.2022 Brianna did call us back and I answered. I know that Cari had specific guidance for her and wanted me to listen in, so I shared that part with her and that I''m new to the concierge line, and if it''s ok that we contact her later. Brianna was ok with that, and if we couldn''t catch her anymore today, to try first thing tomorrow at 12:00 EST. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 14:40:25', '2022-12-07 14:40:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040874041', 'Robert McCord', NULL, '12.07.2022 Rob called regarding an email of changes with Sedera. I explained that Sedera is changing platforms for compliance reasons and that he should contact his adviser Guy Travis to walk him through the process and signage. I explained if he were to talk to Sedera directly, to not feel that he needs to add any more charges (like telehealth), cause it''s already part of his present plan. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 14:36:42', '2022-12-07 14:36:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101089010', 'Lauren Ehlers', NULL, '12.07.2022 Lauren called back, cause she said she had to jump off the phone earlier. She wanted guidance on making an appointment with a PCP and an OBGYN, and asked for in network provider lists for both.
I pulled up both lists and emailed them to her.
I asked her about her Planstin card, but she only shared she received the MPB card with a QR code. I offered to contact Planstin to have another card sent to her, and told her she will also receive on via email as a PDF file.
Lauren inquired about benefits for any dental services, but I was unclear on how those services work, so I told her I would call her back. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 14:33:51', '2022-12-07 14:33:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', NULL, '12.07.2022 Hillary called asking if she needs an OBGYN referral in order to have a mammogram done. I told her we do not request it, but the facility she goes to might ask for a referral.
-She shared the Imagery place she usually goes to is no longer in network and if we could check if this NEW Imagery place is in network. I shared with her that we are moving away from the bind of being in network providers starting January 1, 2023. If she is not in a rush, she could wait till then and use the one she has been using. Hillary agreed on the latter, and decided to go ahead and make an appointment with the Imagery she has been using. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 14:30:14', '2022-12-07 14:30:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108729003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106616001', 'Janet Banks', NULL, 'Janet does not let you get a word in edge wise when you are trying to explain information to her. Be warned that you will have to be firm with your answers with Janet and ask her politely to let you finish explaining things to her when walking her through any process for her plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-07 14:22:02', '2022-12-07 14:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265152', 'Jared Volkers', 'Membership eff 1/1/23', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 14:21:23', '2022-12-07 14:21:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265152', 'Jared Volkers', NULL, 'Member sent in cancellation to cancel Sedera &amp; has re-enrolled w/Zion eff 1/1/23.  Sedera cancelled.  Member from 12/1/2019 -12/31/22', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 14:20:15', '2022-12-07 14:20:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108728003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108245009', 'Catherine Surdoval', NULL, 'I spoke to Catherine, welcomed her to our family, very nice lady, she said she''s entering tax season, and will be recommending us to her clients. So far, she is pleased with how we handled her. She has my direct number to call any time she needs anything.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-07 14:16:35', '2022-12-07 14:16:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Member submitted address update.  I will update address in A123 CRM &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 13:54:55', '2022-12-07 13:54:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108658001', 'John Richardson', NULL, 'Called in while doing his application &amp; I walked him through.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-12-07 13:49:08', '2022-12-07 13:49:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108719001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676955', 'Hillary Harris', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Leonardo Moraes', 'Visit ID : 2566 Question : Hi - Do I need a doctor''s referral or request to schedule a mammogram? And I need to find an imaging center in network.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-07 13:44:29', '2022-12-07 13:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105234001', 'Brianna Krampetz', NULL, '12-7-2022:  Brianna called when we were having issues with internet, to find a doc.  I asked if I could call her back, but by the time I could do that 70-minutes later, I had to LM.  Asked her to plez try us again &amp; gave our # &amp; hours.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 13:42:16', '2022-12-07 13:42:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', 'Membership eff 1/1/23', 'Member &amp; CH $2500 Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 13:38:44', '2022-12-07 13:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091292', 'Carl Cheetham', NULL, 'Member submitted Change for to remove spouse from membership and change to the Direct  plan.  I will update in file and notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 13:36:08', '2022-12-07 13:36:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081152001', 'Marilyn Arnold', NULL, '12-7-2022:  Marilyn called - she''s wanting to find a doc for a Jan appt = no ntwk req''d any longer per JKach.  
     - We went over HCBB & healthcare.gov.  Calling ''P''lanstin (= ''P''rev ONLY) if needs clarification on what is/is not cov.  
     - Once she selects doc, call & sched appt letting them know her Planstin ''prev only'' plan needs them to call to work out pymt before she gets there & she should have no copay.   At that point she will call us so we can go over guidelines to keep w/in ''prev'' care for proper pymt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 13:35:51', '2022-12-07 17:59:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108663013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, '12.07.2022- Called Kelly McKinney  to reschedule  her Welcome Call... Left a msg and sent an email.', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-07 13:24:40', '2022-12-07 13:24:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108663008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106615002', 'Kristian Terrell', NULL, '12.07.2022- Welcome call rescheduled. Email sent.. Member was fine with the change ..', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-07 13:16:36', '2022-12-07 13:16:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081135010', 'Quentyn Luna', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add children to membership.  I will update in CRM &amp; A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 13:06:24', '2022-12-07 13:06:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to add spouse Michael to her membership.  Sedera already aware of this and I left Michael on his own membership w/Redirect.   Pricing update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 13:01:30', '2022-12-07 13:01:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108672003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '12.07.2022 Ryan was trying to be proactive in response to an email her received about changes to his plan. Per Jen''s coaching, left a vm with the answer to what he needs to do about the email her received regarding changes with Sedera. After talking with Cari about Ryan''s concern, she guided me to call him back and advise him that he does not need to sign up fo r anything extra with Sedera, because he already has it in his plan with us. I called Ryan and left him a VM. Ryan also needed to change his address and I walked him through the process of finding the form and submitting it. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 12:53:13', '2022-12-07 14:38:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108524001', 'Megan Land', NULL, 'Member''s Enrollment fee was declined she called in and gave me update acct #.  I reran', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 12:51:08', '2022-12-07 12:51:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108663003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106211002', 'Colin Stroumpis', 'WELCOME CALL CANCELED AND TO BE RESCHEDULED : internet issues related', '12.07.2022- Called Colin to cancel welcome call today. She was ok with the fact that Jennifer internet connection is down due to weather issues.  Sent her an email and confirmed that she had received it....', 'Rosana Bowman', 'Rosana Bowman', '2022-12-07 12:47:12', '2022-12-07 12:47:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885255', 'Azucena Soto', NULL, '12-7-22 Azucena and Juan were facing a HUGE price jump. Azucena was born in Chile and lived in Peru. They are healthy. Azucena has high blood pressure and hypothyroid. Takes meds for both. Does her annual skin check every year and pays on her own. No problems and fine paying cash. She''s also working on decreasing her stress with meditation and such. Juan has cataracts but had surgeries on both eyes previously. He takes a medication now and gets a check up every 6 months to check pressure.  Has glaucoma on left eye and understands it''s pre-x and will pay 100% if issues in year one, etc...
The water had arsenic in it when growing up for Azucena in Chile. They pumped water in and it was contaminated.  Now all family members have thyroid issues from the poisoning. She still has her thyroid but it doesn''t work well. Some woman from Europe died from heart attack after visiting her town from the arsenic poisoning. The woman''s husband was then blamed for poisoning her until they discovered it was from their recent trip to Chile! Insane.
Their son Daniel Soto is turning 26 in Jan. Working for Georgia Tech and not sure if he''ll have ins through them. He takes Adderall for ADHD since age 3. She wants him to become member once he knows if he''s not getting ins through work. He comes home Dec. 21-Jan 2. She will talk with him and reach out to me to connect with him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 12:45:49', '2022-12-07 12:56:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107483002', 'Mario Perkins', NULL, '12.07.2022 Mario called to learn how to open an HSA and was wondering if he needs to open it as an umbrella for the entire company or should each individual set up their own. I forwarded him to Sally Thomsen, his advisor. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 12:35:05', '2022-12-07 12:35:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596166', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '12.07.2022 Andre had an accident and injured his knee. Although injured, Andre was in great spirits. He shared about his injury, needing an MRI TOMORROW, wanting guidance on how to start a Medical Need request, and how to get reimbursed and submit his receipts. I brought Cari in, at first cause I could not find his profile, and she shared the process on submitting a need, the receipts and how to get reimbursed. I sent Andre an email on How To Submit a Medical Need with Zion. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 12:12:37', '2022-12-07 13:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596161', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104757002', 'Mary Johnson', NULL, '12.07.2022 Mary called for educational purposes, searching for a PCP in network and inquiring about her Planstin card. I was able to independently search for an internal medicine provider in network in her area 30607, downloaded and sent it via email from CRM. She shared she has not received her cards for Planstin and MPB. I asked Kelly and she said the fulfillment packages when out Friday and Monday last week, and members should receive OUR cards early next week. I proceeded, with Jen''s coaching, to send Planstin a Membership Card Request email. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 12:00:22', '2022-12-07 13:00:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108606138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '12-7-22 Cecelia is enrolling now for her whole family of 4. Choosing SECURE for the well baby visits $715/$1000. Her legal name is Stephany so she put Stephany Cecelia on the application. Husband is a farmer!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 11:49:48', '2022-12-07 11:53:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108563142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106216002', 'Jarrod Hunt', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-07 11:20:18', '2022-12-07 11:20:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '12.07.2022 Alison ''s maiden name is Reti, but under her husband''s plan Benjamin Lampert II. She called wanting clarification on how being in network is beneficial. She was confused as to how the IUA gets involved. I brought Cari in, who then started the guidance with education. Offered examples and scenarios that compartmentalized services for Alison: Preventative, Health Sharing, and Network. Cari guided Alison to contact her providers and request a treatment plan from them to get it pre-approved from Zion through a medical need, in order to get covered. Explained how EACH NEED=1 IUA and all that is involved with the injury/ailment. Guided Alison to save all her receipts from all the providers via pdf''s, and reminded her that she needs to present herself as a cash-pay patient, as well as responsible to cover her IUA $1000. Cari continued to compartmentalize the preventative from Zion, and shed light on how we are bound, presently, to the government issued guidelines ACA. Alison paraphrased in summary the clarification Cari offered, and Cari agreed with her comprehension. Cari let Alison know to call us once she is ready to submit a need, has the treatment plan(s) and we would walk her through the process. She did shed light on opening an HSA and the benefits of when to use it.  Alison seemed to feel better educated and supported by the end of the call. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-07 11:19:59', '2022-12-07 11:40:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108606130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165429', 'Jodie Brenner', NULL, '12-7-22 Jodie called and has moved to TX from MT. Sounds like she prefers MT and CO over TX. She doesn''t like the ACA and doesn''t feel good about Medicaid. She estimated her income at $7K which puts her into Medicaid. She can possibly qualify for medicaid and use it for her pre-x which is vestibular migraines. She''s had them for a few years and it might be from shingles and/or an undiagnosed concussion. She sees a neurologist online and pays cash. She loves her new PCP Dr. in TX. He has her on a free medication that is actually working! They gave her a 1 year supply!  She will review the CARE+ option since she wanted the most affordable option. She''s considering perhaps the $240/$2500 IUA. She will ponder. She''s hoping to be able to work more this year. She also may not remain in TX.  She will call me before the 15th deadline once she decides what she wants to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 11:19:06', '2022-12-07 11:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101089010', 'Lauren Ehlers', NULL, '12-7-2022:  Lauren called.  She wanted to setup her ''Primary Care'' doc &amp; wanted help.  When we started discussing Planstin, she had no idea what that was.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 10:48:46', '2022-12-07 10:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108606125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779011', 'Elizabeth Wolfson', NULL, '12-7-22 Liz agrees they aren''t good candidates for MCS.  I explained how the APTC works on sliding scale and based on 2nd lowest silver plan which changes each year. She thought it was some other reason why her plan cost went down. She wanted to review other options. But, once she understood the Bronze and HSA plans cover next to nothing until you reach ded and mop she thinks she prefers her Cigna Gold $900 plan instead since paying $7K would break her. She thought I''d know how much she spent in 2022 or 2021 with Cigna. I let her know I don''t have access to that information. She will login to her Cigna account to review her money spent on ded and mop, if they show that. She was a bit frustrated with me in explaining stuff, but seemed to understand and appreciate my thoughts by the end. She and her girls also take the generic versions of Adderall and Wellbutrin.  She might keep the auto renewed Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 Rx Copay Gold/EPO $1,272.71, APTC $659.20. We discussed HSA plans and gave her a sense of the Bronze plans as well. After pondering, she prefers to keep the ded down she thinks. She''s in no position to pay the crazy high deds and mops.  She was in NYC and had to find a quiet spot to talk which was likely stressful.  Liz was thankful and will ponder over the next bunch of days. She knows the deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-07 10:42:26', '2022-12-07 11:25:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108606120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108301001', 'Catina Lewis', NULL, 'Member''s enrollment fee declined I email PU link &amp; left VM for member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-07 10:39:24', '2022-12-07 10:39:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '12-6-2022:  Chris & I called Zion & spoke to Sissy (pronounced: CeeCee) in the ''Med Needs'' dept.  She basically will NOT give a definitive answer.  She did agree after much prodding, to fwd an e-mail w/the details to Zion''s Med Dir. Chris is going to write up & e-mail and send it to: member@zionhealth.org
        His FlowMax RX is for a cathater from a back injury.  This is the first I''ve heard of this info.  This new drug is for a mis-diagnosis that caused and .  
     - He had a colonoscopy & pharmacy bill that have gone thru his BCBS.  He wanted to submit the rest.  They pulled a polyp, so if he decides to sub a ''med need'' he knows he''s resp for the first 1k IUA & there''s a 6mo deadline to sub.  He''ll find the EOB to see how much is left & will call if he decides we should sub.
     -

12-9-2022:  Chris sent over his portion of the letter we are sending to Sissy at Zion to fwd to the Med Dir to see if we can get better guidance twds his med cond.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-07 10:38:08', '2022-12-21 18:10:14'),
