  ('zcrm_1579374000108607008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106616001', 'Janet Banks', NULL, 'Janet seems a bit confused that her optometrist appoints are not something that is included in her preventative care. I tried to explain to Janet several times that if her vision problems were a result of an injury she had an open medical need for that it would then count, but just vision checks are not a part of her plan. Janet will need a lot of hand holding and perhaps Robin should reach out to explain that vision is not included in her plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-07 09:40:02', '2022-12-07 09:40:02'),
