  ('zcrm_1579374000108596102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092335002', 'Sharon Kolodney', NULL, '12-6-2022:  Sharon called.  She has a mammogram sched for tomorrow & was under the impression she present as a ''cash-pay'' pt.  We disc ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative ONLY.  How to present, they must bill, must be in ntwk right now, etc.  (she had a hard time getting past "I was told to present as ''cash-pay'' & turn in my receipts".  Tried to explain that the diff components have diff rules.  She said Jennifer told her this provider was in ntwk, but I couldn''t find it.  Jennifer was available & sometimes she finds things I don''t.  I know they talked & Jennifer said she couldn''t find the provider any more either, but I''m not sure what was decided.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 23:32:23', '2022-12-06 23:32:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '12-6-2022:  Kathryn called:
     - Planstin = Prev ONLY.  She has her well woman w/pap later this mo & the doc is showing as in ntwk: reminded her conf when she gets there.  She has a mamm in Jan, so we went over the new proc w/RBP.  She seems ready to go.
     - Kathryn McGaughey & Frederick Besch are married now & Kathryn asked about them combining their accts.  She said she will get with us if they become ready.  Their plans look the same, but I told her Patti would need to discuss this when she''s ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 20:53:16', '2022-12-06 23:15:46');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108056002', 'George League', NULL, '12-6-2022:  George called,  He wanted to go over some general items.  Diff names of things, etc: 
     - He''s eff 1/1/2023:  I sugg he sched his ''Welcome Call'' after that eff date, because it will give him a good foundation for how this healthcare works.  Made sure he knows how to sched that.
     - He had general questions re: IUAs.  We went over he pays up to 5k on up to 3 issues per year.  [Did not get the chance to discuss that may mean you pay everything if no exp is above the 5k, so, not 100% on that. ]  He''s definitely mo contribution concious & happy right now w/the high IUA.  It seems like he understands.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 17:36:37', '2022-12-06 17:36:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108604051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '12.06.2022 Angela call to get clarification on  the MAP program. She''s aware of the MAP 12 per year, with 2 months gap space in between.  
-She changed therapists. Wants to know if she still needs to wait for that 2 months, or can she schedule an appointment now.
-She called M&S to get clarification, but they said they cant answer her question regarding changing therapists and not violating the 2 month space gap, and to call MPB.
-Cari and I will call them tomorrow to learn more and call Angela back.
-She also inquired about needing an OBGYN to receive a  mammogram. I told her (based on Cari''s coaching) that we don''t require it, but it would depend on the facility if they want a referral. 
- sent Angela the Post Welcome Call email with all the resources for the Secure plan.  Angela also inquired about pre-existing conditions and what the process is. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-06 17:31:07', '2022-12-09 17:31:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '12-6-22 Keila, Mara and I had a great meeting. Mara showed high level the options and benefits of indexed accounts. Keila was very appreciative. Mara will send her Steve Jobist''s and Russ (?) her stock broker''s name and numbers. She will figure out how much she wants to put in indexed accounts while minimizing tax implications. She wants to have a set income flow for retirement that she can count on and also wants to invest some money in video gaming companies, energy companies, etc. Her brother is 2 years older and managed to double his money in 2 years while the market was hot! She wants to keep some money available for down payment on home or land. Wants some money for health purposes bc she has endometriosis. She is passionate about becoming an esthetician and helping folks with wellness. She wants a brick and mortar location as well as a traveling option. She will let us know when she''s ready for our next discussion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-06 16:45:51', '2022-12-06 16:45:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108604040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066049', 'Malinda Van Dyke', NULL, '12.06.2022 Malinda called asking when her services begin. When I searched for her multiple accounts appeared. I consulted with Cari on this and while she was coaching me, she put in a request to merge the accounts and remedy the situation.  Malinda wants to make an appointment for a mammography. She wanted to know if she needed to see an OBGYN prior, and I told her only if the facility she''s going to requests a referral. Malinda needed her card, but has not received it. That might be because of the multiple addresses showing on their multiple account. I did call Planstin, spoke with Kaden1262022, and requested her a new card, which he sent while we were on the phone. Malinda does need to change her address with them so I will contact her tomorrow to let her know. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-06 16:42:39', '2022-12-06 17:53:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060066049', 'Malinda Van Dyke', 'Now on husband, Steve Ramona''s membership, eff 9/1/22 per Admin123', '12-6-2022:  **  NOTE:  Per Admin123 - Malinda is now on her husband, Steve Ramona''s membership, eff: 9/1/22  &amp; under the name Malinda Ramona.  Have req''d CRM corr to show accurately on Steve''s membership (he has 2 active CRM files) thru Patti.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 16:35:18', '2022-12-06 16:36:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089685024', 'Brent Skinner', NULL, '12-6-22 Brent might need a back surgery. He''s in serious pain and has been seeing a chiropractor names Dr. Hightender Sabharwal at Denver Chiropractic Rehab. He''s doing some shock wave treatement (10) to help him heal. He''s checking on 3 different doctors who might do his surgery and he hasn''t decided yet. He''s considering Dr. Peter James Lennarson, Dr. (Brent?) Kimball or a 3rd guy.  He needs to set up a C4 account first. He will set his income at whatever it needs to be for 2023. He''s thinking perhaps $25K is a safe number. He''s a contractor and has plenty of expenses. DOB 11/4/1968, 80237.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-06 16:34:32', '2022-12-06 16:34:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060961051', 'Steve Ramona', NULL, '12-6-2022:  Steve Ramona has 2 active files in the CRM &amp; I don''t see Malinda listed except in the notes &amp; Admin123.  Did send Patti a req to corr the CRM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 16:17:08', '2022-12-06 16:17:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108560065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084641002', 'Rebecca Shelton', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2559 Question : Would you please provide the link to the provider director?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-06 15:45:39', '2022-12-06 15:45:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132226', 'Maria Borden', NULL, '12-6-2022:  Maria called back.  She has everything from her diagnostic colonoscopy in pdf format, so we walked thru exactly how to sub the ''med need'', what to expect, etc.  She''s aware she now pays the 1k IUA (she''s pd everything, so it''ll be a reim situation it sounds like).  She sb all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 15:36:19', '2022-12-06 15:45:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108604035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106936002', 'Amy Larsen', NULL, '12.06.2022 Amy called to connect with Jennifer. Left a message for Jennifer to call her back tomorrow. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-06 15:14:06', '2022-12-06 15:14:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '12-6-22 Hi Christopher [with Sedera] and John,

Emily Kloser just completed the conversion process through Sedera. She also completed the cancellation of Mike Kloser''s plan and added him to her membership through MPB''s forms. Please make sure to keep Mike''s original start date of 1/1/2020. We are just simply combining the family into one membership, instead of two separate memberships. Please let me know if there''s anything else I need to do.

Thanks,

Wendy Scipione', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-06 14:49:28', '2022-12-06 14:49:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108563097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108535002', 'Malisa Formanek', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-06 14:48:46', '2022-12-06 14:48:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '12-6-22 We just cancelled Mike''s account simply to be put onto Emily''s family account. There''s no benefit in keeping them separate anymore. She also just completed the Add Family Member form to add him to her account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-06 14:36:01', '2022-12-06 14:36:01'),
