  ('zcrm_1579374000108587028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108524001', 'Megan Land', NULL, 'Megan called just to verify that her start date is Jan.1, 2023 so she could schedule her welcome call accordingly. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-06 14:06:05', '2022-12-06 14:06:05'),
