  ('zcrm_1579374000108579008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105462086', 'Eric Patti', 'Deactivate as per John Troutman', 'Agent will be deactivated as per John Troutman due to his non-compliance toward company processes and attitude about the company as a whole.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-12-06 13:59:52', '2022-12-06 13:59:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108604024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106616001', 'Janet Banks', NULL, '12.05.2022 Janet called to have her welcome call today, but unfortunately the Internet was down and Jennifer was unable to make her welcome calls. I am glad I got to speak with Janet and reassured her that Vanessa will contact her shortly. I was able to reciprocate with Vanessa, even though it was during her off hours, and she offered to have her welcome call today. I did get disconnected from Janet before I could relay the last part to her.  Vanessa was able to connect with Janet for 35 minutes and coached her from traditional insurance to OUR medical cost sharing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-06 13:35:19', '2022-12-06 15:04:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108604019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081135010', 'Quentyn Luna', NULL, '12.06.2022 Due to  the Internet going down in the east coast region, Jennifer was unable to complete the welcome calls. I called Madison on the number in her profile, and left her a detailed voice message, explaining the situation and to look for an email from MPB to reschedule. I sent Madison an email with the link to reschedule.', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-06 13:32:29', '2022-12-06 13:32:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108563077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108524001', 'Megan Land', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-06 13:31:24', '2022-12-06 13:31:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, '12-6-2022:  I stepped in to help Nahla.  She''s totally understanding the situation, but hadn''t dealt w/calling Zion before, so she listened in.
     - I tt Tee in Zion''s ''Med Need'' Dept.  He said there is no ''need'' on record.  As best we can see, Bill has just been sending in the bills, but didn''t understand he must start a need.  Bill''s been receiving e-mails from  Shennel Smith (who works in the Medical Records Dept, not the ''Needs'' Dept), so for whatever reason she replied in unhelpful ways [ie: not cov because it''s prev, which it''s not since they pulled polyps (did the doc''s off mis-code?).  Although, we do not know how it''s showing on the medical billing.].  
        Nahla (& I?) will call to go over how to sub a ''med need''.  Tee said to go ahead & upload all the docs to the ''need'' even though they may have already been submitted, so they know what docs go to this colonoscopy.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 13:30:13', '2022-12-07 16:58:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108563072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108523001', 'Charles Holliday', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-06 13:29:23', '2022-12-06 13:29:23'),
