  ('zcrm_1579374000108563062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108521002', 'Moria Hinton', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-06 13:24:12', '2022-12-06 13:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092255002', 'Lafi Abdeljaber', NULL, '12-6-2022:  Lafi called.  They have mental health concerns about their 6 yr old.  
      - They found a doc that specializes in children''s issues & have pd the $100 dwn pymt for an appt at the end of Dec.  I let him know mental health (even for a child) may NOT be something healthsharing will help w/but, it''s worth trying.  I showed him how to sub a ''med need'' w/Zion & he had submitted it by the time we were off the phone.  At least they have several weeks to process the req so maybe before the appt they will at least know.
     - We disc the MAP prog, but getting mental health care for a child can be super challenging, so he''s going to try Zion first.
     - He knows this may be outside the scope of our program(s).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 13:23:48', '2022-12-06 13:23:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108563057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108464020', 'Paul Mata Gutierrez', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-06 13:07:57', '2022-12-06 13:07:57'),
