  ('zcrm_1579374000108581062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810174', 'Margaret Zachary', NULL, 'I spoke to Margaret, she needs to cancel because she had to buy insurance for her employees, and could only use Blue Cross. But based on her agent Jill Clark, just sending her the cancellation form, there was nowhere for me to go with trying to save her.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-06 13:04:33', '2022-12-06 13:04:33'),
