  ('zcrm_1579374000108596023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061092044', 'Charles Kinne', NULL, '12-6-22 Charles'' account was not working properly, so we called C4 and spoke to Sarah who told us we had to cancel his auto renewed plans for 2023 in order for the account to function properly. Then we had to push through the eligibility again to get it to calculate the APTC correctly. Charles wants UC Health and is frustrated that I can''t just tell him which plans that ALL docs at UC Health will accept. His PA Anna Miller is not showing up in any network possibly bc she''s a PA. He did have an Anthem plan last year that worked which was Anthem Bronze Pathway X HMO 7050 for HSA Bronze/HMO. So, he can likely choose a Pathway X plan to best serve him. He''s calling UC Health now to find out what they will accept.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-06 12:38:11', '2022-12-06 12:38:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108563019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044764041', 'Ryne Cooper', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  Member getting new job. RCi &amp; Sedera notified.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-06 12:33:53', '2022-12-06 12:34:51'),
