  ('zcrm_1579374000108604014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899232', 'Donald Marshall', NULL, '12.06.2022 Donald called concerned about receiving the older rates on his bills for his employees. So I transferred him to Pati. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-06 12:01:38', '2022-12-06 12:01:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108564032', 'Simone Fohrman', NULL, '12-6-22 Simone needed help with her APTC to show up. She has been on Medicaid but her income is above $24K and has been for at least 7-9 months it sounds like. She had selected that she''s on Medicaid so the system wouldn''t give her a tax credit. I unchecked that box to force the system to give her a tax credit since she earns too much for Medicaid. Her APTC is now $246.05 and she chose Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver Silver/EPO	$308.13 APTC $246.05 her cost is $62.08. For dental she chose Delta Dental of Colorado Foothills Plan High/EPO $20.25 APTC $0.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-06 11:51:18', '2022-12-06 11:51:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107480019', 'Bruce Newman', NULL, '12-6-2022:  Bruce called.  He needed help w/several items:
     - He needed to reschedule his ''Welcome Call''.  I notified Vanessa of his CE''d time & she''s able to see his new time, which is earlier the same day.
     - He couldn''t figure out how to login to his MPB.Health Memb Portal to upload his proof of self-emp.  I got him into that system & also showed him the Memb Updates sec for future ref.
     - He was trying to understand all the various names, so we did a bit of educ on the pkg concept.  
     - I encouraged him to use the concierge line as traffic directors as he''s learning how to best use his healthcare.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-06 11:27:09', '2022-12-06 11:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108604003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085464111', 'William Vanderwall', NULL, '12.06.2022
