  ('zcrm_1579374000108581039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887044', 'Jack Pardo', NULL, 'Karen called to say they want to cancel the plan. I asked if we could do a side by side comparison, and she agreed, but was driving. I emailed her my direct number and she will contact me tomorrow morning to discuss. Nice lady', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-06 10:45:59', '2022-12-06 10:45:59'),
