  ('zcrm_1579374000108581029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442408', 'Jacquelynn Mariest', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-06 10:20:17', '2022-12-06 10:20:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108596003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109658034', 'Dawn Dines', NULL, 'First attempt no answer vm left', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-12-06 10:03:52', '2022-12-06 10:03:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108587018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842382', 'Amy Tuttle', NULL, 'Robert called in upset because he would like the MPB concierge team to sit with the hospital financial department where Amy is currently at to discuss the billing. I advised Robert that the concierge team is not able to do that, but perhaps Sedera would be able to assist in this aspect. Robert then got even more frustrated because he doesn''t understand why MPB is the gatekeeper and why don''t we allow people to directly call the different vendors. I advised Robert that we do not prevent anyone from calling directly to Sedera but we always advise our members to start with the concierge team at MPB because we can warm transfer the members without them having to repeat themselves. Robert then asked for me to transfer him and he hung up. I redialed Robert, got Jenn from Sedera on the line and warm transferred him over to Sedera. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-06 09:51:20', '2022-12-06 09:51:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108581021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-12-06 09:41:18', '2022-12-06 09:41:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108587013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080945002', 'Macay Hunter', NULL, 'Macay called because he wasn''t sure if his payment was taken from his bank account. After going through a few steps, we found out that his payment was taken. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-06 09:35:14', '2022-12-06 09:35:14'),
