  ('zcrm_1579374000108562001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108597002', 'Scott Bearon', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 2554 Question : interested in finding out ore about MPB healthshare plan.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-12-06 07:01:01', '2022-12-06 07:01:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108494057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '12-5-22 From Christopher with Sedera, "We will have to cancel Mike''s membership and add him to Emily''s membership. If Emily is completing the conversion, it would be easiest to add him when she does the conversion and we can cancel him at the same time he goes active on her membership. Please let us know when we can cancel Mike''s membership."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 23:05:18', '2022-12-05 23:05:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108494049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '12-5-2022:  Matt called today, ready to learn how to submit the ''med need''.  We went over all details.  He had a bad experience w/Liberty - I assured him our exp w/Zion has been much better & members are telling us that.  Did remind him this will be slightly more extensive because of the other ins that cancels on 12/20/22 from his son''s missionary service, so to call if he needs help.  Asked him to keep me in the loop.  His son''s already had a kidney rem''d, etc., which is all zero $ on his other ins, plus his first round of chemo begins on 12/15/22, but the ins exp 12/20/22.   Matt knows they will be resp still for their $2500 IUA.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-05 22:54:20', '2022-12-05 22:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108494044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885255', 'Azucena Soto', NULL, '12-5-22 Price at $500 IUA is going up to $1113.28 total from $725 which already includes the Admin Fee. We can discuss change of IUA or complete change of membership to SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 22:17:48', '2022-12-05 22:17:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108494039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061092044', 'Charles Kinne', NULL, '12-5-22 I updated his account with Linda''s Medicare information. The system shows a $784 APTC but is showing a much higher # when you shop for plans. Something is wrong with his account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 21:47:02', '2022-12-05 21:47:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779011', 'Elizabeth Wolfson', NULL, '12-5-22 Liz was referred by Laura Lafoon. Liz has 2 kids, 16 and 12. Liz is self-employed. Maybe will have full-time job by summer. Not sure. She had surgery in May 2022 for hemorrhoids and fissure (?) that is not yet taken care of. 16 year old has birth control implant in arm. One kid had covid. 12 year old has allergies which they are testing and might need allergy shots. They currently have a C4 plan with Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 RX for $613 a Jan. 2023. But, she''s expecting to earn $140K-$180K. She doesn''t realize she''s getting a huge subsidy for the low income she input years ago.  Income is showing at $79K right now for this price to be $613. We will need to revisit it on Wed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 17:19:07', '2022-12-05 17:19:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, '12-5-22 Holly is 51 and called to understand how to upgrade her PDHC membership. Her current price is $350 and new price will be $419. I explained what she loses from eliminating Redirect - PCP and chiro and what she gains is HSA and keeping ACA wellness. Also explained easier process for a Need and more open to alternative measures in sharing guidelines. I let her know there''s no network for ACA wellness moving forward. She likes things to be simple. So, adding the Welcome Call to her To Do list felt like too much for today. But, she will read everything tomorrow regarding showing proof of self-employment, welcome call scheduler and reference guide download. She''s thrilled to save money and to have a slightly simpler membership than before. She says she refers many people to me and gives my phone number. But, nobody ever calls. I suggested she connects us via email and she will try that moving forward. All set with cancellation of PDHC and to new SECURE $1000 / $325.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 16:40:34', '2022-12-05 16:40:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108518013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108043002', 'Parker Foy', NULL, '12.05.2022 Parker called to get assistance in submitting a requested form to confirm he''s an independent contractor. I brought Cari in for assistance. She guided him through the MPB member portal and how to submit the form from there. Cari was able to check the admin123 platform and confirm they did receive the form he is sending. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-05 16:20:45', '2022-12-05 16:32:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108494031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810174', 'Margaret Zachary', NULL, '12-5-2022:  Margaret called.  She/they had to buy ins for all of their employees, so she wanted to cancel.  (It''s after hours in FL.)  Margaret is traveling so I asked if she''d spoken to Jill (she got snippy & said she didn''t need to), but I explained Jeffrey Bursteen or Jill Clark would normally help her with the signature form.  (Sounded like she might be driving?)  She had me trans her to Jill, but I also let her know Jeffrey Bursteen from our main office in FL may connect with her regarding the cancellation & sent him a Teams chat.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-05 15:53:32', '2022-12-05 15:57:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089685024', 'Brent Skinner', NULL, '12-5-22 They''ve been texting with me and wanted to meet Monday afternoon. She called me back and we are talking tomorrow at 4:00.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 15:37:36', '2022-12-05 15:37:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108494026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093072002', 'Richard Brodeur', NULL, '12-5-2022:  Melissa called.  Their cc was compromised.  I walked her thru finding &amp; completing the pymt update form.  She''ll get it sub.  She is aware of the proc fee for cc &amp; debit cards.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-05 15:30:33', '2022-12-05 15:30:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108518008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842382', 'Amy Tuttle', NULL, '12.05.2022 Robert called to get clarification on how his plan with Sedera works to cover hospitalization bills. Amy has been in the hospital since Saturday 12.3.2022. Robert feels uneasy with how the hospital conducts business, so he called the concierge line to get guidance. Given the the newly changed guidelines, Jen suggested to take care of his $1500 IUA, and we can walk him through the process of opening a need with Sedera. Robert was adamant about not paying a penny to the hospital, until he know Sedera is covering what it needs to cover. Jen then requested that they not worry about any of it then, and when they get back home and feel settled to go ahead and give us a call and we will walk them through it from there (Robert shared that they might discharge Amy today from the hospital). NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-05 14:59:21', '2022-12-05 14:59:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108486095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056653025', 'Sara Bollmann', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-05 14:51:16', '2022-12-05 14:51:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904552', 'Mariah Ahumada', NULL, '12-5-22 Mariah called to cancel bc her friend has set her up with a PPO at same price. She feels like it will be easier bc she won''t have to wait for reimbursement. The plan is through US Health. I told her to be careful and make sure she reads the fine print bc there are limitations that aren''t always clear at first glance. She was super nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 14:34:25', '2022-12-05 14:34:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108486087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095949002', 'Delana Winslow', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/23.  I reached out to Zach who thought she had already cancelled.  He OK''d cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-05 14:34:06', '2022-12-05 14:34:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779071', 'Ruth Glas', NULL, '12-5-22 Ruth is turning 56 in Jan. 2023, Husband is 57 and an ASHI member. Son is 32 with downs syndrome and thyroid issue which he takes meds for. Son is on Medicaid now but she''d like to include him if possible. He''s considered a dependent.  She was hoping to have it as primary but not allowed. Medicaid is primary and MCS is secondary. She understands pre-x clause and also exemptions. She has high blood pressure well managed with meds. Husband has gout and takes alipurinol. Husband is having a eye lid surgery this week which should resolve drooping lid. Ruth had a total hysterectomy a long time ago. Otherwise healthy. They live in OH and know of Christian Healthshare Ministry.  She''s looking at ACA and had considered short-term and now committed to deciding in next week or so. We have follow up appt. She was shocked by the $7K ded for indiv, $14K group, and $18K mop! Definitely interested in SECURE $915/$1000 EF or $625/$1000 ES.  Also, they currently fund an HSA so can continue to do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 14:19:49', '2022-12-05 14:19:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108486082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation as she now has employer benefits I will cancel with Sedera &amp; RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-05 14:19:29', '2022-12-05 14:19:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061092044', 'Charles Kinne', NULL, '12-5-22 I left a vm for Charles to help him update his account. Looks like C4 pushed through some new enrollment for him which is a bit strange. I let him know we can still change it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 13:30:06', '2022-12-05 13:30:06'),
