  ('zcrm_1579374000108494018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '12-5-2022:  Cynthia called &amp; Scott cut his finger really bad.  She wanted to know what to do.  Nahla answered originally, but she pulled me in because it was sensitive.  
     - Went over get Scott taken care of: Urg Care, ER, but it sounded really bad from what I was hearing.  She''s going to present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a disc, will pay 1k IUA, etc.  Then she''ll call us once they get home &amp; settled to start a ''med need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-05 12:51:28', '2022-12-05 12:51:28'),
