  ('zcrm_1579374000108494013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', NULL, '12-5-2022:  Nahla caught this call & Lauri needed a lot, so she brought me in.
     - Lauri called very frustrated because she updated her Sedera today & from the price they are showing, she''s barely paying them anything & we are charging huge sums.  I  let her know that # is misleading.  She hasn''t spoken to her advisor Wendy Scipione yet, so at the end of the call Nahla is trans her to Wendy''s #.
