  ('zcrm_1579374000108461027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050550098', 'Sarah Price', NULL, '12-5-22 Left vm to review her membership and possibly consider moving to SECURE.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 12:27:28', '2022-12-05 12:27:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '12-5-22 Mary called to understand implications of moving to SECURE. I let her know about the new pre-x clause that would be relevant to anything Auggie is going to the chiropractor for. Not other health issues for anyone. I recommended she tries to get reimbursed for chiro visits he''s been doing at $50-$70 a visit. He''s been 4-5 times. They are considering moving to SECURE to save $272.28 a month ($1187.28 new price with combined family membership with Sedera) for a $915 month at lower $1000 IUA. She and Auggie have $1500 IUA and Doug has $1000 IUA currently. Doug will be turning 65 in Sept. 2023. Auggie may get a new job with own ins sometime in 2023. She''s ok giving up the unlimited in person PCP visits since they never used those. She''s also willing to continue paying cash for chiro since the savings will still be far greater per month if they switch. She''ll decide in the next few days and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 12:23:53', '2022-12-05 12:23:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108461017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', NULL, '12-5-22 Lauri called to better understand her membership. She''s converting her membership and sees Sedera''s sharing cost and wants to understand her full cost. I explained virtual healthcare, Life Care, MPB Concierge Team, WHLC, etc. I recommended to do another Welcome Call which she agreed to. I reached out to Vanessa to send scheduler. She has DPC membership with Dr. Jennifer McCabe Lentz. Lauri has never used her membership, she''s just been paying for 2 years. She''s been getting meds on own. I told her to contact Concierge Team for that moving forward. She opened a new need for sleep apnea bc she got a new c-pap machine since it was from 2015. She was told she''ll be reimbursed $20 for the machine. She wants to go to a pulmonologist to get it all checked related to the sleep apnea. She found her Needs Coordinator, Brent. I recommended she reach out to him for assistance with any further help with her Open Need. She also asked about WHLC which I explained and also told her to get help from Concierge to tap into this benefit. She feels more comfortable and knows to contact MPB Concierge as a starting place if/when in doubt.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-05 12:15:48', '2022-12-05 12:15:48'),
