  ('zcrm_1579374000108405085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106616001', 'Janet Banks', NULL, '12-2-2022:  Janet called, her phone died this morning, so she didn''t make her ''Welcome Call'' &amp; she wanted to apologize.  She just got home w/a new phone (hours later than her call).   I sent a chat to Vanessa so she''s aware of Janet''s circumstance.  Janet will go in &amp; resched.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-02 13:37:57', '2022-12-02 13:37:57'),
