  ('zcrm_1579374000108394023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, 'Dylan emailed me today and called me regarding what we talked about yesterday. He sent me the pricing from Sedera, but it doesn''t reflect the $15.00 fee is included, he said they told him it is. I explained, if he goes through them directly, he will lose his MEC and HSA. He didn''t seem bothered by that. I sent him the CXL form at his request, in case he still wants to cancel. He will think about it over thee weekend.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-02 13:05:34', '2022-12-02 13:05:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108394018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, '12/1/2022, spoke with Dylan, he went online and went to the Sedera site. Then he called them and spoke to an advisor there that gave him a quote for less than he''s paying with us. He has to show proof of association with a DPC in order to get 14% discount with Sedera. They quoted him $326.00 all in a month. After speaking with John K and Patti, if he provides that to us as well, his premium comes down to $368.78 all in. I asked him to send me anything he has from Sedera with pricing.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-02 13:02:16', '2022-12-02 13:02:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108419018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108399107', 'James Leo Durocher', NULL, '12-2-22 Leo called and he had not enrolled yet. I was looking at 2022 by accident. We updated his income from $44K to $36K. He chose Friday Silver CO Option for 2023. Friday Colorado Option Silver
