  ('zcrm_1579374000108419013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105661034', 'Aaron Ingalls', NULL, '12-2-22 Aaron chose Friday Bronze Copay + Vision Exam Bronze/HMO $321.80, APTC $277.87. He will do his surgery this year and be done with it. He will cancel payment for previous plan and call Friday to set up new payment for 2023. I also recommended he speak with an accountant about any tax implications of the divorce and timing of tax credits and such since they are separated but not yet legally divorced. But, both are in agreement to be on own plans for 2023 onward.  But, we had to put current date to be allowed to separate their memberships. Couldn''t put a future date.  He understood. He and Juana are all set for 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-02 11:10:21', '2022-12-02 11:10:21'),
