  ('zcrm_1579374000108372096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108590009', 'Loni Oliver', NULL, 'Lonni is mostly concerned with an HSA plan. She currently pays around 240 per month for anthem. She is looking to start for january and will have a decision by next week. She is 62 years old and married but wants the plan for member only. She is someone who does not go to the doctor often and has no serious preex. She also has been reading the zion member guidelines and I took her to the overview page of the secure plan. I''ll call her next week.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-02 11:03:30', '2022-12-02 11:03:30'),
