  ('zcrm_1579374000108383018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086528002', 'Cynthia Colandrea', NULL, 'Cynthia is having routine lab work done and going to see the Gastro for some heartburn issues. We went through the self-pay process, when she will contact us to open a need in case her Gastro visit goes above her IUA amount, verified that the Labcorp in her area is in the network, and went over which labs are covered by Planstin. Cynthia will call with any other questions or issues. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-02 08:04:20', '2022-12-02 08:04:20'),
