  ('zcrm_1579374000108402059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091055002', 'Steven Meath', NULL, '12-1-2022:  Dawn called.  To answer her questions, I resent Vanesa''s post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail for 5/3/22.  She wanted to know what was fair price for a mamm in her area.  She could get online, but we walked thru what I found on HCBB.  Her facility (at least the location she goes to) wasn''t listed, but 3 other branch type locations were.  She''s gone there for years & they were offering her a price that was $7 more than the listed fair price, so we discussed how that seemed like a fair offer (although, she wasn''t 100% sure which type of mamm they were doing, so that could be a variable we weren''t able to be sure of).  She seemed to appreciate the help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-02 01:06:11', '2022-12-02 01:07:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108402045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '12-1-2022:  Aine called - she wanted to know why going thru "whatever MPB is", is better than going direct thru Zion.  I tried to give her my opinion, but she sounds unconvinced.  I recommended she tt her advisor Wendy Scipione, because I know Aine likes working with her & Wendy should be able to help her.  She liked that idea & will call her tomorrow because she needs to go for now.  Sent Wendy a Teams chat to give her a heads up.
     - Aine''s partner (male) is also looking at joining whatever membership Aine decides upon.  I let her know that Patti will be the best person to quote her the new price, but I''d expect it to be approx $300 more - made sure she knew that is a GUESS.  She laughed.  Also, discussed that if ACH no fees, but after the call I looked deeper & it looks like she''s already on ACH.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-01 17:45:39', '2022-12-01 17:45:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108402040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380018', 'Daniel Cardoza', NULL, '12-1-2022:  Daniel called.  I sent him the temp for sub a ''med need'' to Zion.  We tried everything to get past his security blocks.  Link, cut &amp; paste, diff browsers, manual, etc.  He says his computer is really old.  I can''t get him past it, so after making sure he has their ph #, I trans him directly to Zion to see if they can help.  He''ll call if he needs further assistance from us.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-01 17:29:24', '2022-12-01 17:29:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108399107', 'James Leo Durocher', NULL, '12-1-22 James Leo Durocher goes by Leo! He''s 60. He wants to go to Panorama Eye (place) with Dr. Ronald Hugate. He only shows up in Friday and RMHP networks. But, I see Leo chose a Cigna plan for medical and $0 ped dental.   Looks like had $44K income in 2022 est and $28K for 2023.

