  ('zcrm_1579374000108398050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '12.01.2022 Ella, 10 YO, hit by a skier from behind. AVSC Aspen Valley  Ski Club, broken collar bone, filed police report - with no help. According to doctor''s visit, no surgery is needed. Invoice request at the doctor''s office have been presented as self pay. Stedmond clinic. ER has not returned calls. She paid bill of $500 out of pocket.
Cari offered to open a medical need with Zion. Confirmed email and sent her steps to submitting a medical need.  She reminded her to save all her receipts and start uploading them to her portal. Shared she would need to probably call them around two times, showed her where their number is. Guided her to find her Zion to attain her member number with them, and how to retrieve it if at one point lost. Cari coached Valerie on being specific in describing the incident, what doctor visits or treatments were involved thus far and how to submit it.  Cari carried on to remind the member to call Zion to confirm they received her paperwork, and that they will connect with her and assign a medical need specialist. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-01 16:03:31', '2022-12-01 16:26:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108399027', 'Doris Medina', NULL, '12-1-22 Doris chose Anthem Colorado Option Gold Mountain Enhanced Std Gold/HMO $1,964.01 APTC $1,497.44. This is for 2023. Their cost is $466.57. She will make the payment in 7-10 bus days and send me proof of SEP for 2022. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 15:48:00', '2022-12-01 15:48:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108402029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024844090', 'Valerie Yaw', NULL, '12-1-2022:  Valerie called.  This was a lot for Nahla at this time, so she brought me into the call.       
     - 11/23/2022: 10-yr old Ella hit by skier from behind & got hurt pretty badly.  They''ve filed police reports and are trying to tt the other kids parents, but nothing on that side seems to be moving.  Ella went to the ER Wed & they''ve realized she has a broken collar bone.  Mon 11/26/2022 they learned at least no surgery req''d.  So far all she''s pd is ~$500 to the Stedman Clinic.  She''s done a good job of presenting as ''cash-pay'' & asking for disc.  I sent her the temp on how to sub a ''med need'' & walked her thru it.  She knows she has the 1k IUA & we talked about options on paying the bal of her IUA, what to upload, etc.  She seems to have a good grasp on how it works.
          I did warn her that I have not had they type of situation she''s dealing with (where there could be legal/financial help from the at fault party), but that Zion would be able to walk her thru what will be necessary.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-01 15:46:06', '2022-12-01 18:03:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108402024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083937002', 'Benjamin Lee', NULL, '12-1-2022:  Ora called.  Benjamin saw his general practitioner & they recommended he see an ortho surg re: his hip.  About 1 yr prior to becoming members, the doc told Benjamin "you are so young, you won''t need to worry for quite some time", so they thought this wouldn''t be an issue.  I asked Ora if they''d discussed pre-x & I think she just thought it wouldn''t be an issue, but also couldn''t tell if she understood what is/is not a pre-x issue?  Just not sure.
     - We went over 2nd yr of memb will gain 25k twds a pre-x issue (& discussed what happens 3rd, 4th & bey years too).  Looked up Total Hip Replacement in their area on HCBB to get an idea of what fair price is = $41,145.  We talked about her getting w/her advisor Misty Berryman.  This could still be the way to go depending on what the prem, ded, etc., would be for an ACA plan.  That they are almost to yr 2 w/25k sharing.  BUT, they''d need to look in detail.  Poss see what type of negotiation Zion could get.  However, time sensitive due to Open Enrollment.  She seemed to understand & took the # we have on file for Misty.  She''ll call her to go over.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-01 15:44:00', '2022-12-01 17:52:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108402013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083937002', 'Benjamin Lee', 'Permission to Discuss w/Ora Lee Form Rec''d 11-9-2022:', 'Benjamin sub:  "Permission to Discuss the MPB.Health Membership Plan" = gives his wife, Ora Lee  permission to discuss everything.    11/9/2022', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-01 15:28:57', '2022-12-01 15:38:32'),
