  ('zcrm_1579374000108367144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Raissa Wilkes', NULL, 'Former name Raissa Wohlgemuth.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-01 14:41:49', '2022-12-01 14:41:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108367139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Raissa Wilkes', NULL, 'Member submitted Change from to Change name &amp; update address eff 12/1.  I will notify Planstin', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-01 14:37:59', '2022-12-01 14:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '12-1-22 Multiple email communications with Chuck to help him with the new transition. He might choose Medicaid since he hasn''t had income for 8 years or possibly move to DIRECT as of March 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 14:37:44', '2022-12-01 14:37:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108367134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', 'New Plan eff 1/1/23', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-01 14:27:37', '2022-12-01 14:27:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '12-1-22 Hilary emailed and asked if RMHP are better. I reviewed her options again and those aren''t any better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 14:24:23', '2022-12-01 14:24:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108367129', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change to the Secure plan eff 1/1/23.  I will change in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-01 14:22:03', '2022-12-01 14:22:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108398042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103458001', 'Jason Morton', NULL, '12.01.2022 Jason''s PCP is recommending a Colorectal surgery. Jason wants to open a medical need. I brought Jen in to make sure the process is all covered, and I don''t miss anything. Jason thinks he might need surgery. Jen said he would need to open a surgical need and that she will send him a step-by-step to opening a need. Jen offered to also check on healthcare bluebook for colorectal surgery. She recommended he start uploading receipts/invoices that are connected to this specific need he is going to open. She reminded him not to pay anymore than his IUA, $2500, and that when he gets his medical need open, Zion will reach out to him. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-01 14:18:36', '2022-12-01 14:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108372053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110864002', 'Lauren Tinnes', NULL, 'I CALLED AND LEFT A VOICEMAIL, LETS GOO!', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-12-01 14:18:29', '2022-12-01 14:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108367124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-01 14:16:25', '2022-12-01 14:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100614035', 'Judy Doherty', NULL, '12-1-22 Her account still looks broken on C4 for plans for 2022. Shows 2 plans. 2023 looks right. But, no plans show when reviewing plans on that page. Overview page at least shows them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 14:15:06', '2022-12-01 14:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002095005', 'Dustin Spencer', NULL, '12-1-22  I can''t get past the Medicaid app site at the Address page. It just goes to error page. Dustin can''t login with his password. So, he can''t try. He called C4 and got his password fixed but he''s having the same technical difficulty. He''s calling them back now. OK, it''s fixed. He had to change "Road" to "Rd" on the application. He will put income at $19K for best guess at income. He''s updating Airstreams for his income now. He''s investing $ in them and it takes time to get the money back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 14:10:04', '2022-12-01 14:55:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067333056', 'Joe Werne', NULL, '12-2-22 Joe is currently on Medicaid. He may have some projects coming in the next 6-12 months working on the ionosphere. Also, possibly some work with the fire mitigation but not certain of that. He might get offered ins through his work when the funding comes in but he also might consider MCS to have more freedom with work, hours, etc. He''ll let me know when the time comes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 13:42:37', '2022-12-01 13:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '12-1-22 Sally and Pete are in their 60''s. Sally had a miserable time getting her mammogram paid. I sent a note to Redirect''s Escalations Team and it was finally paid 20 min. before our call. It was from back in March for $210. It was a maddening experience. However, she''s had great success using the app for her chiropractic care visits. That''s been as easy as possible. They are considering switching from PDHC to SECURE for ease of wellness visits with insurance card and large price savings per month. It will go from $970 to $625. Pete is on a statin and sinopril for high cholesterol and blood pressure. But, he''s on a rigid treatment plan with diet and exercise with help of his dr. His Dr. has him come in every 6 months to check his blood pressure and cholesterol strictly as a preventative measure. He''s been doing well and lowering his dosage and added fish oil to the mix. They will get a letter from his dr. stating it''s well managed. They live in Santa Fe, NM now and went skiing at Toas already this season! They are both self-employed with rental properties.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 13:38:16', '2022-12-01 13:38:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108394013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081704002', 'Carmen Davis', NULL, 'Third attempt to reach Carmen,  got voicemail, tried to leave message, her voicemail wouldn''t let me record.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-01 13:36:03', '2022-12-01 13:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108402008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106211002', 'Colin Stroumpis', NULL, '12-1-2022:  Chris called.  Her son Grayson just came home & it looks like he''s broken his nose.  I encouraged her to go to an Urg Care (or Emerg Room), or their reg doc or and ENT if they can get in right now, because my exp is this needs to be adjusted or looked at while the injury is fresh.  She knows to present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a disc, pay her $2500 IUA for this issue (we went over 3 IUAs/yr), save det inv & receipts.  Then call us in the next few days & we''ll show her how to get a ''med need'' going.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-01 13:05:56', '2022-12-01 13:05:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108398032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088951002', 'Kevin Rose', NULL, '12.01.2022 Jackie called inquiring about mental health services with CirrusMD, in search of psychologists and psychiatrists and cost. I brought Jenn in for a more detailed guidance. Jenn took the time to share how CirrusMD works, what they can offer and how they deviate from anything connected to controlled substances, including diagnosis. Jenn then took the time show me how to research the stated lists, save them and email them to our member, Jackie. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-01 12:48:53', '2022-12-01 12:48:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108402003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082410002', 'Nicholas Burdick', NULL, '12-1-2022:  Nicholas called & there was a lot, so Nahla brought me into the call:
     - PT:  His son has been referred for PT for a gape issue.  I went over 1k IUA, PT must be pre-approved.  He will get treatment plan & call us so we can help him w/the process to sub a med need.  No expenses yet.
     - Influenza:  Nicholas & his 2 kids were at Rite-Aid for their influenza shots.  Rite-Aid called Planstin who said they''d pay for Nicholas'', but not his kids'' - I see influenza listed on the healthcare.gov site for children as well.  Jennifer is going to ck w/Ashley, why this was not pd for him - then I can call him back.  Lately, it feels like people calling Planstin are getting inaccurate info.
     - Home Covid tests:  He just heard the ACA is now requiring Covid tests be reimb.  Jennifer''s also including req for verification on this w/Ashley at Planstin too. 
     - Chg pymt: took Nicholas to the form & walked him thru.  He was hitting sub during our call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-12-01 12:01:26', '2022-12-01 12:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108401003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '12-1-22 Kristen completed the Change Form to upgrade to SECURE to add wellness now that the network is removed! She''s thrilled. I''ve asked Vanessa to send her the Welcome Call scheduler so she can understand how to use it and what''s included.  She''s considering adding her daughter as well. She''s super happy. Also she paid for laser skin treatment to remove possible problem spots but didn''t run it through Zion since it was a cosmetology place in Denver instead of having to go to dermatologist and have them run a biopsy and all that process. She paid $2K on her own to keep it simple. She asked about eye exams which isn''t included either.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-12-01 11:54:31', '2022-12-01 11:54:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108398018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108245009', 'Catherine Surdoval', NULL, '12.01.2022 Catherine was having a hard time logging into her member portal, to upload her Self-Employed documents. Cari walked her through MPB site, and corrected how she was reading the password (lower case l not capital i). Went over necessary documents for proof of self employment. Catherine will call back to speak to Patti, if she has anymore questions.  NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-01 11:34:02', '2022-12-01 11:45:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108367101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032134045', 'Jane Koerbel', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  I will process', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-01 11:19:58', '2022-12-01 11:19:58'),
