  ('zcrm_1579374000108398008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106317002', 'Kathryn Reishus', NULL, '12.01.2022 Kathryn Called to get assistance in logging into her portal to prepare for her welcome call on 12.05.2022. I pulled Jen in to solidify the process of helping members log in and what might be the reasons that they can''t. In Kathryn''s situation, she was entering the wrong lettering/numbers. Her generated password is confusing. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-01 10:56:59', '2022-12-01 10:56:59'),
