  ('zcrm_1579374000108398003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026874248', 'Dylan Thomas', NULL, '12.1.2022 Dylan Thomas called to cancel. I inquired about the reason, and he shared that it''s simpler to just be with Sedera directly and it''s less expensive. Per Jennifer''s coaching, I transferred him to Jeffrey B. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-12-01 10:33:35', '2022-12-01 10:33:35'),
