  ('zcrm_1579374000108394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479026', 'Jaclyn Peters', NULL, 'I called and spoke to Jaclyn. I informed her that we needed her children''s SS #''s. she is hesitant to provide them. I told her it''s a requirement, she said she will discuss with her husband and get back to me. Then she said maybe she will take her children off and just leave her and her husband. I told her if that is what they want to do, it''s their choice, just let us know so we can make the changes. I mentioned that she could either email the SS#''s or call us back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-12-01 09:19:42', '2022-12-01 09:19:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108367028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086830002', 'Tau Braun', 'New Plan eff 1/1/2023', 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-12-01 09:12:41', '2022-12-01 09:12:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108383003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032445', 'David Hammer', NULL, 'David was having issues with uploading a file to Zion Healthshare for a need. The website kept telling him that the file was too large. I warm transferred David over to Grace at Zion Healthshare for assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-12-01 08:56:47', '2022-12-01 08:56:47'),
