  ('zcrm_1579374000108300008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212091', 'Michelle Schusterman', NULL, '11-30-2022:  Michelle called.  She''s trying to find a new gen prac doc &amp; had HCBB up, but wanted instructions.  We walked thru how it works, what to look for, &amp; other places for doc reviews.  She''ll call if she needs further help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-30 13:31:48', '2022-11-30 13:31:48'),
