  ('zcrm_1579374000108287013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080233002', 'Rebecca Renner', NULL, 'I finally spoke to Rebecca, nice lady. Her business hasn''t made money this year based on Covid . She now qualifies for the subsidy on ACA. I did a side by side with her, and mentioned possibly increasing her IUA to $2,500, the premium difference is only $25.00 per month. She will think it over, and might stay with us based on the numbers I gave her.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-30 11:40:28', '2022-11-30 11:40:28'),
