  ('zcrm_1579374000108243003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521331', 'Vickie Peterson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form due to the fact that they will be facing some Heath Issues that will be Pre-Ex.  enrolled in ACA.  I will process. Verification sent via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-30 07:35:36', '2022-11-30 07:51:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108231003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071780031', 'Kora Gilbert', NULL, 'Kora called because they are needing mental health services for the son. I explained what the MAP program provides and transferred Kora over. I advised Kora to give us a call if she needs anything else. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-30 07:18:47', '2022-11-30 07:18:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108214011', 'Chris Pilgrim', NULL, 'Received joinmympb request on 11.29.22
Sent out Getting Started email', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-11-30 06:52:21', '2022-11-30 06:52:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779108', 'Laura Laffoon', NULL, '11-29-22 Laura was referred by Dorian Merrill.  Laura lives in Denver and is 55. She''s retired and lives off of a pension. She has ankle reconstruction 4 years ago. She also sees a PT regularly for 2 back fusions (in 2000 and 2011) and for her ankle. She doesn''t believe she''ll ever have two years without any ongoing issues. Therefore, reg ins is best for her.  She was already talking with someone at Sedera and didn''t realize they had a pre-x clause. She has a C4 account and has talked with a number of agents already. I told her if she wants to work with me to let me know, but I don''t want to step on toes if she''s loyal to someone already. She will ponder and let me know. She also takes acyclovir occasionally and it''s not too expensive. No tobacco. No other employment for self-employment. Not sure if I''ll hear from her again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 21:47:00', '2022-12-12 20:51:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779146', 'Shana Larsen', NULL, '11-29-22 Hi Wendy,

I''m sorry for the late notice today. I appreciate all you''re doing! We''ll move forward with the plan as
long as nothing changes with our Sedera plan. Which it sounds like it''s not going to. 

I feel like it just gets a little confusing with the mammogram stuff because it''s not actually covered by Sedera. But I guess if something were really abnormal the claim would end up with Sedera in the end. 

Thank you!

Shana', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 21:37:25', '2022-11-29 21:37:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918010', 'Lauren Klucewich', NULL, '11-29-22 Lauren is 56, Josh 59 and Jake 20. They live in MT. Lauren watched the video and is super interested. They used to have LHS and then had Pacific Source. They realize LHS is a bit of a mess. Family has no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Both are self-employed with ranching business and a rental business. Yes, they are proactive on their annual wellness visits, yes on mammo, yes on pap. Husband did his colonoscopy recently and no problems. They like acupuncture and chiropractic care! ACA their cost will be $1600+ month and $7K ded.  They also have a 26 year old son getting married this year. He''s more holistic and may want this too.  She will review the information and call me tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 20:43:21', '2022-12-08 14:43:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757021', 'David Mellinger', NULL, '11-29-22 Dave called to understand the changes with Sedera. He also expressed concern about the guidelines limiting any illegal behaviors such as drinking and driving bc they have young adult children. He refers to himself as a fiscal conservative Libertarian. So, the likes these memberships for what they are about. But he also wants to protect his assets ($2M) and doesn''t want to be financially stupid. But, he will review the changes and proceed through the conversion process most likely. His wife wants to keep this membership for another year at least. They used it already and it worked. He had a surgery and they got reimbursed successfully. At the $1500 IUA the fee is $760.97.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 20:36:12', '2022-11-29 20:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108399027', 'Doris Medina', NULL, '11-28-22 Doris is 56 and husband Moises is 63. He retired early already. She''s working and earns about $62,400 and he gets SS for about $21,600 to = $84K. Doris is healthy. Husband has asthma and sleep apnea. He uses C-pap machine and oxygen. He was hospitalized for asthma 10-15 years ago. Her insurance ends Nov. 30th with Vail Valley Partnership. She needs a Dec. 1st start date. MCS isn''t a good choice for them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 20:30:18', '2022-11-29 20:30:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '11-29-22 Sally is still getting a bill for her mammogram for $210! I forwarded it to Christian and he was in meetings all day. So, I sent it to their escalations team to address immediately. She''s open to looking at other options. I am sending her the video now. Possibly SECURE which we discussed in the past.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 20:10:03', '2022-11-29 20:10:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064227248', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '11-29-22 Chose Anthem Silver Mountain Enhanced X HMO 5000 $0 Select Drugs
Silver/HMO for $1,088.21	APTC $1,061.43 and her cost $26.78. All set and happy to pay even less than last year! Income remaining the same. All set for 2023!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 18:20:14', '2022-11-29 18:20:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108176036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107787002', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, '11/29/2022:  Welcomed Nathan &amp; sent him the 10/2022 Memb &amp; Maternity Guidelines just since they are the most curr.  Reminded him to sched his ''Welcome Call'' for after their 1/1/23 eff date &amp; ideally include his wife &amp; oldest daughter if poss.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-29 17:48:32', '2022-11-29 17:48:32'),
