  ('zcrm_1579374000108176026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, '11-29-2022:  Megan called.  Her son has an appt w/Walgreens on McCaslin Blvd in about 45-min.  She wondered if that would be pd for.  Let her know we just found out:  Call Planstin (gave her their #), they will conf pharm is in their ntwk (I see it listed), then they will tell her how to get it pd for if it is.  Her son doesn''t have his Planstin card on him, so she''ll mention that when she talks with them as well.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-29 17:10:31', '2022-11-29 17:10:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108176021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091198002', 'Robyn Hallet', NULL, '11-29-2022:  Robyn was trying to get into her Memb Portal & Nahla was trying to figure out how to help her.  It turns out she just wants to update her e-mail address.  I walked her thru:
     - got her into her memb portal online & made sure she was able to get in.
     - then, showed her the Memb Updates section & how to update her e-mail address.  She had questions about calling the various component to update w/them & I explained that''s why having us do the update is required.  That our Ben Admin will update with the various components.  I wasn''t sure however, if they update her user name for the MPB Memb Port?  So she put that question into the comments section of her chg form.
     - She''s going to call us in a week or so to see if she how it works w/her new e-mail address & CirrusMD, etc.  By then, hopefully we''ve notified those companies?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-29 17:08:16', '2022-11-29 17:08:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, '11-29-22 Tom was not pleased by the price increase from $333 to $448.78. He''s used it only once for a physical. He needs another physical/wellness visit soon. I recommended he gets that done and makes sure he doesn''t have any health issues. I gave him Concierge # for help to get pre-approval for well check. Once that''s complete, he will contact me to potentially move to CARE+. He is W2 employee without any self-employment income. Price with CARE+ at $1000 IUA is $240. If he needs to remain on plan if he has a bad well check he can change IUA to $1000 and lower his monthly cost to $359.78 + $15 = $374.78 or $1500 IUA is $355.78. He''s 41.  I called him back and let him know about possibly raising the IUA as well. He''s good with it all and will work on getting his wellness visit done and keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 16:58:58', '2022-11-29 17:02:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108176013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '11-29-2022:  This was a lot for Nahla, so she 3-way''d me into the conv.  Brandi is frustrated because her in ntwk prim care phy off will NOT allow her to pay cash because they have her ''ins'' on file.  It''s her ''prev care'' Planstin!  Even when she tells them it''s not for anything except ''prev care'' they tell her they must have it declined by Planstin & there is no way for her to pay cash.
     - Because of this issue she started calling around to see if since she''s moved she can find a new doc''s off.  Consistently, she''s being told they are looking at next March for new pts appts.  I took her online to UberDoc & we found a doc in Arvada that she''s going to try to get an appt with.  She''s going to make the appt for next week to give the doc time to respond & we walked thru how UberDoc works.
     - We then disc her calling us w/receipts, det inv, so we can help her learn how to sub a ''med need'' w/her healthsharing comp.  She knows she is resp for the 1k IUA & to call us right after her appt, so we can get the ''med need'' going, because this lump in her stomach area looks like something that is going to be ongoing.  
     - She had questions about waiting for her anniv date, because she was thinking of annual maximums, but it doesn''t sound like this is pre-x & we discussed that whether it''s now or after 12/1/22 anniv, the exp will go twds her IUA.
      - I assured her, that since this is not her ''prev care'' thru Planstin, she does not have the ntwk concerns.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-29 16:58:47', '2022-11-29 17:01:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000067089037', 'Doug Durgee', NULL, '11-29-22 Doug will review their income and it will likely be over the threshold for a subsidy for 2023. Dominic got a new job  and it will be for the full year hopefully, so probably over $100K for household income. At $85K they were showing a $60 APTC. He''ll update his income tonight or tomorrow morning when the system is working again.  He wants an HSA plan and already has Dr. Stefano Lee for the small stuff.  He chose Friday Health Bronze HSA for $801.60 with $7K ded and mop. He also wants to review the HMA which I''ll send again now. They lives in Adams County.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 16:24:49', '2022-11-29 21:48:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108176008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289481', 'Sheila Clark', NULL, '11-29-2022:  Sheila called.  Her advisor Leslie Jablonski has moved her to another insurance company.  So Leslie asked her to call us to find the form to cancel.  I helped her locate it.  Because our Ind Advisor is the one who is moving the member, I did not transfer her to Jeffrey Bursteen in this instance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-29 15:44:22', '2022-11-29 15:44:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '11-29-22 Jennifer is choosing Anthem Colorado Option Gold Pathway Standard for $896.50. She is calling Andrea to determine if/when to remove Gregg since he''s Medicare age but hasn''t moved over yet. She knows to call C4 to have him removed before she tells me to enroll her in the above plan. She just lost 2 family members within months and has been dealing with probate and such. So brutal!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 15:34:46', '2022-11-29 15:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108206008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, '11-29-22 Suzanne was with Bright Health and all her drs. left the network. But, she did use them and was happy otherwise. She decided to keep her income at $24,400 with hopes of earning up to $30K. I told her to contact me to update her income if/when she knows she will exceed this amount, so she doesn''t have to pay anything more in taxes. She chose Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5500 Silver/EPO and will find new doctors or see if hers are in this network. She was paying $64 and this year she will pay $75+.	Premium is $843.78 and APTC is $768.21. All set for 2023. MOP is $3K and co-pays for dr. visits since income is within CSR threshold.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 15:00:22', '2022-11-29 15:01:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108186033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084741002', 'Kathleen Benning', NULL, 'Left voicemail message for Kathleen to call me back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-29 14:53:31', '2022-11-29 14:53:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108186028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289481', 'Sheila Clark', NULL, 'I spoke to Sheila, Leslie Jablonski sold her a traditional ACA plan based on adjusted gross income as well as the fact they are selling their business. Cxl form was received.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-29 14:48:45', '2022-11-29 14:48:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108208003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098248002', 'Marcus Alig', NULL, 'Marcus called in about Covid testing. I explained that it is an out-of-pocket expense until these are put on the ACA list. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-29 14:30:30', '2022-11-29 14:30:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108162094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079686002', 'Ronald Flake', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove dependent Caleb since he will be turning 26.  I will notify Planstin. No Change in plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-29 14:29:12', '2022-11-29 14:29:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108162089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887102', 'Shelley Sanner', NULL, 'Member submitted PU form.  I will update', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-29 14:05:10', '2022-11-29 14:05:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108186018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521331', 'Vickie Peterson', NULL, 'I spoke to the Petersons, Vickie needs open heart surgery in January, Zion will not cover, only $50k. They needed to go with an ACA plan to cover the entire surgery. They were very happy with us and the plan, but need the full coverage of an ACA plan. CXL form was previously sent by Kevin Michaels (agent)', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-29 14:00:26', '2022-11-29 14:00:26'),
