  ('zcrm_1579374000108206003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, '11-29-22 I called her to let her know the full cost will be $776.28 charged on Dec. 20th for Jan. 1st, 2023. She''s had abnormal mammograms sometime in 2020 and she''s having the lesions monitored every 6 months to make sure there are no changes. None so far. But, it''s all part of the same Need with Sedera. That''s opened and ongoing. She has a Needs Coordinator now which has been super helpful after she talked with 6 different people initially to understand the correct path.  She is pleased with things now once she got it figured out. All set for 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-29 13:35:23', '2022-11-29 15:05:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108162076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Update form. I will update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-29 13:30:53', '2022-11-29 13:30:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091198002', 'Robyn Hallet', NULL, '11.29.2022 Robyn called to learn how to reset her password, because she was not able to access her account, since she set up her profiles after her welcome call. I brought Cari in, and she guided Robyn to access the page on MPB.Health Member portals to make any changes, as well as monitoring the response and completion. Cari was detailed to explain any quirks in the process and how to avoid them by communicating in the form itself before submission. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-29 13:24:44', '2022-11-29 13:24:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108162068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065153641', 'Garner Sorrell', NULL, 'After speaking with Jeffrey I will cancel these members.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-29 13:24:32', '2022-11-29 13:24:32'),
