  ('zcrm_1579374000108199003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000071712208', 'Earl Walker', NULL, 'Barbara called in and needed to know the process of making an appointment for getting her preventative Pap Smear & Colonoscopy. I explained everything and found 2 providers that are in the PHCS Network at the facility she normally goes to. I then explained to her what she will need to do if any sort of pullup is found during her colonoscopy. I sent her a few emails that pertain to what we spoke about, and she feels a lot better & more comfortable now utilizing everything with her plan. This is her 1st time needing to go to the doctor while having the plan with us. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-11-29 12:52:24', '2022-11-29 12:52:24'),
