  ('zcrm_1579374000108131003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, '11-29-2022:  Julie called.  She was getting a message from CirrusMD they would not do a referral for a derm appt.  I helped her reword it: "I have a rash &amp; need guidance as to whether I need to see a doctor, or?" and she was on w/a doc before we got off the phone.  I reminded her that if they prescribe something we can help her look for the best price in her area.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-29 10:13:06', '2022-11-29 10:13:06'),
