  ('zcrm_1579374000108127003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080233002', 'Rebecca Renner', NULL, 'Rebecca reached out in response to my greeting on SalesIQ earlier this morning and she is looking to cancel her plan. I asked her if she has spoken to Karen Torsoe her Healthcare Advisor first. Rebecca said she has not. I told her that that is the first thing that we ask to happen before sending the cancellation form her way. So, instead of having her do that first, since the cancellation process has changed, I got her contact info and gave it over to Jeffrey who will be giving her a call to see what the deal is. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-11-29 10:06:48', '2022-11-29 10:06:48'),
