  ('zcrm_1579374000108091003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106400002', 'Tatiana Kuzhanova', NULL, 'Per note below this enrollee had to move back to her home country for an extended period of time.  I will refund her the Enrollment &amp; 1st months Share Amount. Cancellation verification sent via outlook', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-29 07:21:59', '2022-11-29 07:28:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108002104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '11-28-22 Lester just learned his company is putting a freeze on increased wages in 2023. So, his income will be $75K not $85K. I updated it in C4 and now he will get a $64.25 APTC. His cost is $389.72. He''s all set for 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 21:12:29', '2022-11-28 21:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108002099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521119', 'Kallie Carpenter', NULL, '11-28-22 Kallie sent email bc her son broke his collarbone on Sunday and they wanted to know what to do. I suggested she contact the MPB Concierge Team in the morning ASAP. She is trying to do the right thing and went to Urgent Care instead of the ER and couldn''t see his own dr. since it was Sunday. She seems savvy already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 20:28:25', '2022-11-28 20:28:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108038049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-28-2022:  Robin called again re: prev care labs.  She has a glucose serum lab order as well as her lipids.  I told her we were recently told screening tests for cholesterol, diab, &amp; high bp are covered, so I''d sugg turning those in w/her Planstin care @ an in ntwk lab.  Worst case scenario, if something isn''t cov, it will come back at the disc ntwk price.  She seemed good w/that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-28 17:26:12', '2022-11-28 18:21:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108002094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986163', 'Sylvie Bloch', NULL, '11-28-22 Sylvie is enrolled in Friday Bronze Copay for $625.33. Her Dr. Jennifer Tamblyn is showing up in Friday''s network and not in Cigna''s network. She wanted Cigna bc she knows it but then can''t keep her dr. They had a terrible experience with Bright Health, so she was nervous about using another unknown company. But all set now for 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 17:15:20', '2022-11-28 17:15:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108051026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11.28.2022 Carolyn called inquiring about what is included in the lab requests for her preventative with Secure. I shared that labs have to be processed in a specific way, given the preventative included the lipid panels. I asked Cari to confirm, and as usual Cari offered a detailed response to Carolyn via 3-way call. Carlolyn wanted specification on what exactly would they test in the lipid panel. She included types of labs to use, and which ones we''ve had issues with (Quest). Cari proceeded to guide Carolyn to "walk-in labs" on line.  She found a lab that would not require our member to be poked twice. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-28 16:53:34', '2022-11-28 16:53:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108002083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986127', 'Alfons Reinig', NULL, '11-28-22 I was able to select his plan finally for Anthem Colorado Option Silver Mountain Enhanced Std  Silver/HMO Premium $1,059.03, APTC $1,053.25 and his cost $5.78. I told him to set up his payment with Anthem in 7-10 biz days via email. He should be all set now. Acct #6507050066.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 16:24:30', '2022-11-28 16:28:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108038041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001837009', 'Andrea Hinman', NULL, '11-28-2022:  Andrea called.  Her husb had his wellness visit &amp; for some reason the in ntwk doc has billed them twice.  She''s called &amp; is not rec''ing calls back from the doctor''s off.  She wondered if there''s another route.  I sugg trying the billing off first.  Or call Planstin with the bill &amp; ask if she can submit that invoice to them &amp; then they could pay the doctor?  [I did let her know they may not be willing to do that, but since they are not paying the patient, worth a try.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-28 16:20:36', '2022-11-28 16:20:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108002078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108918010', 'Lauren Klucewich', NULL, '11-28-22 Lauren will contact me via phone this week. She was referred to me by Kristy Tripp. We were connected just before Thanksgiving. I sent her the video link.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 16:13:04', '2022-11-28 16:13:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108051021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380018', 'Daniel Cardoza', NULL, '11.28.2022 Leah Garcia called to get clarification on the process for post hospitalization for Daniel Cardoza. I asked Cari, and added her to our line. She then explained the steps to submitting a claim, and that it would be best for him to collect his invoices and images via PDF, call the concierge line (request Cari if possible) and we will guide him to completing the first steps and what to expect afterwards. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-28 16:12:00', '2022-11-28 16:12:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108051016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583239', 'Robert Beutler', NULL, '11.28.2022 Bob called inquiring about a charge that took place, but says he requested a cancellation three weeks ago. I reached out to Cari, who then did a bit of digging. She shares that she saw his cancellation request was submitted on the 17th. I needed to call him back to get him the answer, and when I did, I transferred him to Pati to leave a message and remedy the situation. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-28 16:08:49', '2022-11-28 16:08:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108038036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106400002', 'Tatiana Kuzhanova', NULL, '11-28-2022:  Tatiana''s daugher-in-law called.  They signed up her mother-in-law Tatiana for an eff date of 12/1/22, but she''s had to move home (to her country).  They expect it to be for an extended time period, so need to cancel.  We talked about if short term, good to stay enrolled so no new pre-x, &amp; if emerg there might have help.  But they expect it to be long term, so they need to cancel.  She''s going to let Zach know &amp; knows a formal signed form is req''d.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-28 15:28:22', '2022-11-28 15:28:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108051008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105872022', 'David Wyatt', NULL, '11.28.2022 Katrina called to gain clarification on how to use CirrusMD, and the coupons for their weekly chiropractic adjustments/visits. I asked if they had their welcome call scheduled, since their plan kicks in on 12/1,  she said no. I explained to her  how both platforms (CirrusMD and WHL) works, then let her know that she would gain more details during the welcome call, including the links shared post welcome call. I sent her an initial email to schedule her call with the concierge team. I informed Katrina that her links/services won''t work until her their plan is active. Katrina schedule her welcome call for 12/1. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-28 15:28:19', '2022-11-28 15:35:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108051003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104971002', 'Judith Rudin', NULL, '11-23-2022 Judith requested BRAND Tobradex 0.3%/0.1% x (3) 5ml bottle. I emailed her options from our international shopper, Reid and from our site research (Brand and Generic):
The BRAND Tobradex average price in your area is ~$212.11.
Tobradex 5ml: CVS = $148.20
The GENERIC Tobradex average price in your area is ~$95
Tobramycin / Dexamethasone 5ml HEB = $21.75-$24.2 - NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-28 15:13:37', '2022-11-28 15:13:37'),
