  ('zcrm_1579374000108002053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '11-28-22 Lester is choosing Friday Bronze Copay for $453.97 for him only, not Makenzie. His employer will pay $500 post-tax dollars towards his plan. His income increased from $70K to $85K for 2023. The system froze many times and we couldn''t complete the enrollment. I will complete it later tonight when the site works again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 15:01:11', '2022-11-28 15:08:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108038031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089798002', 'Kyle Hartung', NULL, '11-28-2022:  Susan called in very upset ''cuz you know "the last person made her cry", so she''s sure this will be another horrible experience.  By the end of the call, she was at least not as upset at us, but maybe realized it''s Cleveland clinic that has made having our healthcare so diff.  They won''t work with her until she sits (for hours) and waits for the finance dept, even though she''s explained she''s paying the first 1k & if it get expensive she''ll have help, they will not proceed.  [Not the first time I''ve heard of issues w/Cleveland clinic.]  
     - I also ran a quick quote for her daughter''s medicine (she''s one of those people that does not allow you to finish telling her things before she interrupts, so does not completely hear what is being said.  It turns out this is what she needed (getting this info was difficult):  Methylphenidate ER 20mg, #30 (generic for Metadate CD = extended release, also SR).  I called her back about 70 minutes later, she said the pharmacy called her with the same price ($40) I was finding since she didn''t know when I''d call her back.  (I''d told her I''d work on it & get back to her shortly...)  Anyway, today''s best prices were on WellRX = $48.60 & RXSaver = $48 at CVS inside Targets in her area.  
        We went over the process of what to do next time.  However, she never could her me discuss the form she could submit - she''s just going to call as best I can tell & she''s anything but patient.  This is a controlled substance, so it could be problematic anyway.
     - Just for the record:  something is happening in 6-months & from today''s conversation, they will be changing at that time.  A new job?  Or?     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-28 14:08:13', '2022-11-28 18:18:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108038026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088967001', 'Kristen Victor', NULL, '11-28-2022:  Kristen called back w/a ton of questions.  She wanted to go over lab work details, how to have the orders submitted, etc.  Went over in ntwk labs, &amp; we disc online labs for pre-pd work too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-28 13:57:05', '2022-11-28 21:58:34'),
