  ('zcrm_1579374000108002048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108048002', 'Joshua Stein', NULL, '11-28-22 Josh is 34 and wife is 30. They want an HSA compatible plan and they joined Sovereign Nations Insurance for $380 medical + $100 for dental and vision - $480.  He signed up in Oct 2022 but he just learned their plan isn''t HSA compliant even though they were told that it is. He wants to fund the HSA for 2022! They are both healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. John is willing to push it to a Dec. 1st start date. He chose SECURE $2500/$425 and $125/$25. He''s my referral from Big Wave Lead system. All set. He also wants vision. I''m sending him the email for VSP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 13:27:42', '2022-11-28 13:27:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108020046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088336002', 'David Vollmer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation citing cost as the reason.  I will cancel &amp; refund the 12/22 Share amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-28 13:26:09', '2022-11-28 13:26:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108044008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094005002', 'Randall Kinzel', NULL, 'I called Randall after Jennifer told me about his experience with Justin Garrett. He sent a few emails to Justin requesting a cancellation form, Justin told him he didn''t have any form. Justin also told Randall, he never received any emails from him. Then Justin said he did have a form, but he had other customers to speak with, and Justin hung up on Randall.  Randall is close to aging out, and just wants to cancel. I checked with Patti, and we received his cxl.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-28 13:20:13', '2022-11-28 13:20:13'),
