  ('zcrm_1579374000108044003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106694002', 'Renee Hornor', NULL, 'I called Renee to check in on them, she was happy I called her. I asked how everything is going so far, any questions or concerns. She told me so far so good. I asked if she''d done her welcome call as of yet, she indicated no. I had her click on the link and schedule that to be done. She is scheduled for this Wednesday, Nov. 11, 2022, and I verified that with Jennifer in concierge', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-28 12:54:46', '2022-11-28 12:54:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108020031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105831009', 'Dariusz Szteborowski', NULL, 'Member''s 12/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM-11/28 11/30-Member submitted PU form I will rerun.  Payment verification sent via Outlook.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-28 12:49:49', '2022-11-30 08:51:59'),
