  ('zcrm_1579374000108038018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811278', 'Sheri Bowes', NULL, '11/28/2022:  Sheri e-mailed because she has a Jan 2022 medical expense she presented her Planstin card on & they did not respond until May 2022.  She now wants to submit it to Zion for sharing & wondered which date, Jan or May, is the 6-month deadline connected to.  Sent her a ton of explanation.       
     - Diff comp w/diff help for diff healthcare issues:
     - ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev Care ONLY.  All prov/srvcs must curr stay in ntwk, don''t use for anything except ''prev care'', only MEC items cov & prov gvmt link to see what''s cov.  Gave Planstin & PHCS #s & times open to conf items cov/ntwk.  
     - Zion:  Healthshare IUAs & how they wk.  She''s selected a higher IUA of $2500, so no sharing prior to that amt per issue. Deadline is from DOS, could req one-time exception if declined.  Sugg calling Conc Line for guidance to see if even an elig ''med need''.
     - Encouraged to always call Concierge Line before non-emerg issues to get guidance on how to present so can get most out of her healthcare, know the guidelines of the approp comp, etc. 
     - Went over why we offer ''Welcome Call'' & sent her the link to sched one. = foundation to build understanding of how to utilize this ''package'' of healthcare prod.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-28 12:42:10', '2022-11-28 12:47:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108020018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105905002', 'Stephanie Mundy', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-28 12:41:26', '2022-11-28 12:41:26'),
