  ('zcrm_1579374000108002043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410541', 'Lori Streim', NULL, '11-28-22 David called again bc he wants to know what to do if she needs medical care before it''s all sorted out. I told him again that they will honor her plan since there are tickets in the system working on it. He plan shows as active through the end of the year now. The problem is duplicate plans. Anthem shows her end date is sooner but that''s because C4 hasn''t completed the communication with Anthem yet. He has to be patient.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 12:29:13', '2022-11-28 12:29:13'),
