  ('zcrm_1579374000108002030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779146', 'Shana Larsen', NULL, '11-28-22 Talked with Patti and she can add Shana and husband to Apex. Waiting to talk with John K to confirm again that he''s able to add them on our end, per our discussion last week.  UPDATE - Yes, John K can add Shana and husband to MPB''s system no problem. I just have to get response from Sedera and inform John to make sure they get a Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 12:10:18', '2022-11-28 12:13:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108002025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779146', 'Shana Larsen', NULL, '11-22-22 Shana called back and wants to keep Sedera for a Jan. 1st start date. Her employer has her paid through then. Sedera has agreed to transition her to MPB and I just have to notify Sedera which I did already. She has the $500 IUA and is paying $804. With the $500 IUA through us it''s $795.97 for ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 12:01:26', '2022-11-28 12:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108020013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093504012', 'Ramona Brown', NULL, 'After speaking to Jeffery this member was sent back to advisor Karen Torsoe to handle.  Apparently there was no follow up on the advisors part so member never filled out the cancellation.  I will process the cancellation', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-28 11:59:49', '2022-11-28 11:59:49'),
