  ('zcrm_1579374000108038003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '11-28-2022:  Matt called &amp; wanted to know why we hadn''t send over the list of counselors we said we would.  I let him know that would have been thru the MAP Prog (which he realized was accurate).  I made sure he has their ph # &amp; trans him for his conv.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-28 11:42:31', '2022-11-28 11:42:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000108002008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098951004', 'Sam Simonds', NULL, '11-28-22 Sam chose Anthem Silver Mountain Enhanced HMO 5000 35% $0 Select Drugs - 6RWQ.  Also chose Blue View Vision Enhanced - 2SUJ.  This is OFF-Marketplace!  It was cheaper than the marketplace place plans.  His full premium with medical, dental and vision is $487.95 and his company will pay for it. The medical portion is $441.39 and dental and vision is the rest.  Dental is Essential Choice Select - 5SFR.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 11:19:03', '2022-11-28 11:26:14'),
