  ('zcrm_1579374000108002003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '11-28-22 Figge started his own business 2 years ago as a Homeowner''s Advocate to help owners with small and large projects, often less than needs for a general contractor.  So, it''s a way to help homeowners who may spend too much or get lost in the system with a contractor. He will find the partners and manage the project start to finish.  He has many contacts from many years in the industry.

He originally called to get his tax form. After reviewing his account he no longer has a MEC since about Nov. 2020. He''s still with Sedera without the MEC once they removed the MEC. He wil share with his accountant after I explained to him he doesn''t need it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-28 10:22:58', '2022-11-28 10:22:58'),
