  ('zcrm_1579374000107940003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094005002', 'Randall Kinzel', NULL, '11.28.22  - Randall called because he has been trying to cancel his plan for 10 months due to going on an employer plan.  He stated that his advisor, Justin Garrette, had no idea what to do and how to cancel his MPB plan. I confirmed with Randall that we did receive his cancellation form and that I would check in on this tomorrow to make sure his plan is cancelled. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-28 08:11:22', '2022-11-28 08:11:22'),
