  ('zcrm_1579374000107799003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089233002', 'Alexander Myers', NULL, '11.23.2022 Shannon requested 2 RX quotes: ALBUTEROL SULFATE HFA (Generic for PROAIR HFA) and Airduo Digihaler 113/14 BRAND. Completed. I let her know that the AirDuo is extremely expensive and offered her coupons for two pharmacies. I emailed her to 2 different emails and called her to inform of them, due to the out of office message. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-23 15:20:35', '2022-11-23 15:20:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107753127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102816002', 'Buffy Lloyd-Krejci', NULL, 'Brian called in to use his MAP services; when I transferred Brian over to MAP, the person on the other end of the line told Brian that he does not receive services through MAP. I then called with Brian on the other line and spoke with Nick. Nick wasn''t sure why Brian was told that he has no services but had me transfer Brian to him. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-23 14:36:42', '2022-11-23 14:36:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107753122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887102', 'Shelley Sanner', NULL, 'Shelley called to update her payment info, I sent her a member payment update form. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-23 14:17:56', '2022-11-23 14:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107796003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088254024', 'Juana Rincon Barrios', NULL, '11-23-22 Juana is separating/divorcing from Aaron Ingalls and now needs her own plan for insurance. She was frustrated bc her dental ins didn''t work well. She got a bill for her cleaning after making 100% certain she wouldn''t be billed and then she got some bills for the visit. She''s submitting a complain to Ameritas/Spirit Dental. 
Now updating her C4 account with $33K income for 2023. Putting divorce as today''s date since can''t put future date. They also filed on Nov. 10th. That could be a date to use. But, Aaron used the date he was applying. So, for consistency she used today''s date. They don''t want to mess up their plan for 2022. Just want to be separate for 2023. She chose Cigna Connect Flex Silver 4100, Silver/EPO. Premium $412.79, APTC $306.07 and her cost $106.72. Gives her co-pays for the small items and she says she never sees docs. She uses her docs back in Colombia. She wants this more for emergencies. She''s all set. She knows to call Cigna in 7-10 days to set up her ongoing payments. She understands and I gave her the phone number. All set for 2023.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-23 13:37:36', '2022-11-23 13:53:25'),
