  ('zcrm_1579374000107789016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, '11-23-2022:  Catherine called.  She has the hosp est (does not include anesthesiologist, etc).  Had her x-rays &amp; pd for that as ''cash-pay'' = $452, Ortho doc appt $189.  Still has $359 twds IUA.  Needs to get labs done, so that may take care of that.  She''s going to go ahead &amp; start a ''med need'' w/Zion &amp; is aware of the process.  She''ll let us know if she needs anything further.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-23 12:04:16', '2022-11-23 12:04:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107763049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026291119', 'Lesley Erb', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to cancel Sedera plan and has re-enrolled in the Secure.  I will notify RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; cancel in A123.  I will refund 11/28', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-23 12:02:09', '2022-11-23 12:02:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107792003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070161001', 'Douglas Brenteson', NULL, 'Douglas responded back to my greeting on SalesIQ asking if he could speak to a doctor on the phone about a possible UTI, he thinks he has. I responded asked for his name or the primary members name on the active account to look and see what plan he has and if he has and is registered for CirrusMD, which yes, Douglas is registered with CirrusMD as of 7/1/21. I took a screen capture of the profile showing the date he registered with CirrusMD. I explained to him what he needs to do and how CirrusMD works after he signs in with the email address we have on file and whatever password he created at the time of registering. I told Douglas there is the CirrusMD app he can download or use the web browser, which I send him the link to the sign in page. I also let Douglas know I sent him an email explaining how CirrusMD works, a CirrusMD flyer attached to the email, and it also has the link for him to click and get to the website. I told him how to start a chat on both the app & website whichever he chooses to use. I never got responses back to anything I sent after confirming he has CirrusMD the virtual Telehealth free of any extra charges. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-11-23 11:34:02', '2022-11-23 11:34:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107790008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063695002', 'Erika Joy', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-23 11:22:09', '2022-11-23 11:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107790003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084457009', 'Eugena Bring', NULL, '2nd welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-23 11:15:57', '2022-11-23 11:15:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107789008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081704002', 'Carmen Davis', NULL, '11-23-2022:  Carmen called.  She wants to cancel because she needs to save money.  We talked a little about how the IUA is diff than a ded & that this may actually save her depending on what happens.  That seemed to intrigue her.  I let her know Jeffrey Bursteen will be happy to go over that with her.  She''s also planning to let her advisor Leah Garcia know.  She know''s she''ll need to sign a document to make it official.  I made sure she has Leah''s ph # & trans her to Jeffrey''s line (she''ll LM if she doesn''t catch him).  She was concerned about being contacted today.  I reminded her that the draw for the month went through on the 20th, so even if they talk early next week (after the holiday), it will have the same result - she seemed to understand that.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-23 11:15:31', '2022-11-23 12:01:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107789003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152460072', 'Nathan Smith', NULL, '11/23/2022:  Nathan LM &amp; sent me an e-mail.  They would like to proceed.  He provided me with his new phone number:  727-424-3733  ILM &amp; responded to his e-mail.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-23 11:05:16', '2022-11-23 11:05:16'),
