  ('zcrm_1579374000107753016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', '11.23.22 Ticket Response', 'Spoke with Allison who was able to add her daughter onto her CirrusMD account as a minor and is talking to a doc now. I advised Allison to call us back with any scripts or questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-23 07:31:22', '2022-11-23 07:31:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107753008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089798002', 'Kyle Hartung', '11.23.22 Ticket Response', 'I called Susan, who let me know that she is VERY upset because we are not here 24 hours a day. She has no understanding of her plan and thought that she did not have to put any work into this. Susan and I did have a disagreement because as I was trying to assist her, she let me know that there was nothing that I could do and this call was pointless. I let Susan know that we are open from 9 A-8 P EST but that I was trying to assist her and taking her frustration out on me was not going to help. Susan got very upset, and I apologized for upsetting her as it was not my intention. I truly believe that Susan has not been educated about her plan because she seemed to have no idea that this is a plan that requires work on her end as well as ours. Susan hung up on me but I will have Cari follow up with her later on today because I do not like leaving members upset.  Louis'' members need to be more educated about their plans. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-23 07:25:39', '2022-11-23 07:34:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096566002', 'Joan Rizza', NULL, '11-22-2022:  Joan called.  She had her mamm &amp; wanted to know who to send the receipt to.  This is a Direct Memb attached to OPD.  With the Zion Prev Care it''s been my experience these are not done thru ''med needs'', so I made sure she had Zion''s ph # &amp; trans her there.  She knows what to ask them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-22 18:07:47', '2022-11-23 13:41:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, '11-22-2022: Chris (= Ernest) called.  He had questions about getting the bal of his colonoscopy paid for.  He thinks they billed his BCBS & the balance is $600+ (down for the BCBS disc from $800+).  He does not know anything about ''P''lanstin (=''P''rev ONLY).  I tt Desiree @ Planstin & she e-mailed a pdf to the above conf''d eccurry@aol.com (Chris can see it).  She''s also sending hard copies to the above PO Box 477 Black Mtn, NC 28711, but they won''t go our until at least next wk.  
     - Chris mentioned he''s taking FlowMax (RX Medication =) for his enlarged prostate.  When I tried to discuss it, he became very frustrated & upset because he''s already tt Jeffrey Bursteen & his advisor Louis Spatafore re this and he''s been assured in writing this is not pre-x.  He is NOT okay w/the phase in period.  Told him I will dig into this [I''m not seeing any documentation].  I called (w/Jennifer on the conf call) & tt Tee (male) in the Zion Med Needs dept.  He conf:  anything that has had an exam, been diagnosted, they take medications for, have symptoms of, or had any medical treatment of (ie:  medications) = pre-x.  Chris is the one that told me:  orig 4 yrs ago his prostate was larger.  They treated it & it has gone down, but now doc monitoring annually, have him taking FlowMax to relax him so he has less issues, and although his PSA levels are still higher, they are better and doc says he''s ok.  This will all be in the doc''s notes that they are still treating this w/the FlowMax = pre-x.
        Because I don''t want to go against what he''s been told I brought Jennifer into the loop.  She''s going to help dig into this so we can get back to Chris.  Thanksgiving is in 2 days & w/people out I let Chris know it will be early next week while we dig into this.  He appreciated that.     - CA

11-23-2022:  Sent e-mail to Chris to get more info so we can piece together this situation.     - CA

12-2-2022:  Chris & I setup a call today to clarify w/Zion, but he was upset again saying how Jeffrey had all his documentation & assured him this is not an issue (taking RX for enlarged prostate).  I explained that we are not the final determination, Zion has that distinction.  He said he''s not upset at me, just needs to do this a diff day.  He''ll call back next week.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-22 15:37:33', '2022-12-02 12:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107638224', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'left another voicemail', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-11-22 14:51:48', '2022-11-22 14:51:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101089010', 'Lauren Ehlers', NULL, '11/22/2022 Lauren called because she received a payment declined email, and wanted to have her payment run again. I reached out to Jen who then guided me to let Patti know, so I transferred her there. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-22 14:39:13', '2022-11-22 14:39:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '11-22-22 Bobbi wants Dr. Michael Drewek and/or Dr. Adair Prall.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 14:39:11', '2022-11-22 14:39:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075338242', 'Cathy Watson', NULL, 'Earl called in because he needs to use his CirrusMD services but cannot log in. I could not get Earl into his account either so I sent CirrusMD a support email and tagged Earl in it as well. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-22 14:34:46', '2022-11-22 14:34:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107705023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107684002', 'John Newton', NULL, '11-16-22 John 56, wife 41 and daughter 16. Live in Boulder county. No tobacco, no meds. Has Cigna for $1200 and $5K ded. CARE+ $780/$1000. He enrolled on his own. He had trouble adding the kids and then figured it out. I sent him an email to make sure to complete his Welcome Call and keep Quick Ref Guide handy. Seems like he''s all set. Enrolled on 11-22-22.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 14:26:52', '2022-11-22 14:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107483010', 'Lori Meyer', NULL, 'Received email from Planstin letting me know that this member wants to stay on the plan with her present group.  Mike gave me the impression that she wanted to join the MPB group.  When she submits Cancellation I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 14:25:08', '2022-11-22 14:25:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107705018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502073', 'Bruce Wildman', NULL, '11-22-22 John Kach was never able to determine where Sedera came up with the $185 price that was showing in his account. His price will be going up to $464.78 as of Jan. 1st. So, he might still want to move to DIRECT to bring his cost back down to $295 plus his DPC cost. I spoke with Rhonda and asked her to tell him to call me after Thanksgiving and we can finalize his decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 13:55:50', '2022-11-22 13:55:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107705013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502023', 'Rhonda Wildman', NULL, '11-22-22 Talked with Rhonda since she answered and not Bruce. She asked what she''s supposed to do for Dec. 1st. I realized it must be submitting her cancellation of her membership since she goes onto Medicare Jan. 1st 2023. She said she''ll find the email and follow through.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 13:54:07', '2022-11-22 13:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107712002', 'Nicki Dembeck', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 13:37:23', '2022-11-22 13:37:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-22-2022 Robin reached out for assistance on the process of lab requests and coverage. I was able to answer her first question, but as the conversation grew, I decided I needed Cari''s expertise and guidance. During their conversation, Cari went over how to handle labs & we sent PHCS ntwk search of labs near 80027. I called Planstin and  ordered her new cards (hard copy and digital for her appointment tomorrow morning. I spoke with Melissa from Planstin and she sent the pdf while we were on the phone to the conf e-mail above. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-22 13:08:19', '2022-11-22 13:08:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165453', 'Alison Burchell', NULL, '11-22-22 Alison finally got her accounts sorted out. She now qualifies for Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 12:47:51', '2022-11-22 12:47:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107710002', 'Jana Baldwin', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 12:47:30', '2022-11-22 12:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106317002', 'Kathryn Reishus', NULL, 'Member''s 11/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM 11/22 Member will be updating 11/22- Member submitted updated Banking info I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 12:34:41', '2022-11-22 14:14:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171479', 'John Raker', NULL, '11-22-22 John called bc of the Sedera email asking him to convert. He wanted to understand what it''s about. I explained and he feels better. I gave him pricing for $500, $1000 and $1500 IUA change to keep his cost down because going up about $120 at his current $500 IUA level. He also did colonoscopy this summer and got it all pre-approved. He wanted to understand how to handle the bill he just received from anasthesiologist. I let him know that needs to go to Redirect and to call Concierge Team for assistance to make sure he has the most current app as well. He uses the wellness, PCP and chiro care with Redirect, so best to keep him on his current membership.  Thankful for my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 12:30:51', '2022-11-22 12:30:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050584001', 'Christopher Mortensen', NULL, 'This CC has declined 2 mos (10/22 &amp; 11/22) in a row.  This is Rick Willard''s stepson &amp; Rick is paying for it.  Rick to email me new CC information.  2nd notice sent 11/23 11/30- left VM for Rick re; 2 mos owed for Essentials.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 12:30:11', '2022-11-30 10:20:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, 'Member''s 12/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email.  I spoke to member and he will let me know when to rerun.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 12:01:56', '2022-11-22 12:01:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810440', 'Erin Nissen', NULL, 'Members 12/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM 11/22 2nd notice sent via outlook - 11/23 12/9-member submitted new CC info I will rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 11:52:40', '2022-12-08 13:46:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107622002', 'Roy Bryhn', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to change IUA from $5000 to $2500.  Adjusted in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 11:46:28', '2022-11-22 11:46:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '11-22-22 Cathy called bc she''s being asked for a code to complete her re-enrollment right now. I''ve never heard about any code that''s needed. She can call the number on the screen to ask Sedera. She hasn''t received her email from MPB yet telling her the new price.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 11:35:35', '2022-11-22 11:35:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062570050', 'Silvina Irimia', NULL, '11-22-22 Silvina talked with me bc her colleagues are telling her she should qualify for a subsidy. She has 2 kids and her elder mom that she''s caring for and reporting on her taxes. She earns about $80K and isn''t sure if that includes her rental property income or not. She''ll ask her accountant and then we can run a test to see if it''s worth making a change or not. Her kids get insurance through their dad and she pays part of it too. Her mom just has a plan with Denver Health in case something happens but not really insurance and not Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 11:20:03', '2022-11-22 11:20:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107705008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881315', 'Allisyn Martin', NULL, '11-22-22 I left a vm for Allisyn regarding her payment for 2023. She will have to pay monthly at this time. That may change in the future. But, system isn''t set up now to do so. I asked her to call me back and I will show her how to update her payment method.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 11:07:29', '2022-11-22 11:07:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107673023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106958002', 'Rebecca Brubaker', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of December 1, 2022.  Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-22 11:05:22', '2022-11-22 11:05:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107705003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105661034', 'Aaron Ingalls', NULL, '11-22-22 Aaron removed Juana with help of C4 Rep 40 min ago. When we went to update his income from $33K to $45K it sent us in circles asking for relationship to Juana. Called C4 and Amanda let us know it will take 24 hrs for system to catch up to reflect that she was removed. It also won''t affect 2022 since only choosing Apply for 2023.  He''s active and does risky sports. But, healthy, did free well check this summer, no meds. But, has a trigger finger problem he wants surgery on which costs $1200 and he will pay full cost towards his ded. Not sure if he wants to do it this year and be done or get a better plan for 2023 to deal with it. We have an appt set to complete the process on 11/30/22.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 11:03:15', '2022-11-22 11:03:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083485002', 'Carol Power', NULL, 'Member called an left a VM wanting to cancel.  I directed her to speak with Zac.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 10:40:36', '2022-11-22 10:40:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107673018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106964002', 'Cynthia Unger', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online welcome call after start date of December 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-22 10:39:50', '2022-11-22 10:39:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059526010', 'Robin Brenneise', NULL, '11-22-22 Robin wanted some help with doing her annual wellness visits for pap screening, mammo and colonoscopy, plus labs. I coached her about the fact that it Must be coded as wellness/preventative screening. If not, then do the labs separately with the help of the MPB Concierge Team. Also ask for advice on good docs/pricing for colonoscopies, mammos, etc. She will call them next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-22 10:03:53', '2022-11-22 10:03:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107673013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128020', 'Tessa Bergman', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call after start date of December 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-22 09:52:23', '2022-11-22 09:52:23'),
