  ('zcrm_1579374000107654052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107622002', 'Roy Bryhn', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 09:25:20', '2022-11-22 11:45:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104964002', 'Sandra Erickson', NULL, '11.22.22 - Sandra called in looking for Cari. I advised Sandra that Cari does not come onto shift until 12 PM EST and Sandra didn''t realize that Cari was in MST. I sent Cari a message via teams with Sandra''s info and the best time to call her MST. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-22 09:17:34', '2022-11-22 09:17:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103737002', 'Matthew Hatcher', NULL, 'Member''s 12/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM-11/22 Spoke to member he will be updating to a Bank Acct. 11/22-received PU form I will update &amp; Rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 09:12:16', '2022-11-22 13:15:31'),
