  ('zcrm_1579374000107654031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103639001', 'Jared Toldo', NULL, 'Member''s 12/22 payment declined 1st notice sent via email &amp; VM 11/22  11/22-Spoke to member and he directed me to rerun tomorrow 11/23 11/23-Reran pmt &amp; it declined again, I left VM for member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 08:58:10', '2022-11-23 07:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762047', 'David Holstein', NULL, '11.22.22 - CirrusMD told David that he needed to get to an ER due to his symptoms. David was diagnosed with blood clots in his legs and is currently admitted to UC Hospital. I explained that once he is home and situated to give us a call and we will assist him with opening a medical need with Sedera. David then said that they may do surgery so I warm transferred him to Sedera so he could speak with them about surgery. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-22 08:51:33', '2022-11-22 08:51:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107468010', 'Troy Wolfe', NULL, 'I refunded the Enrollment fee charged due to the fact that they will be going on a List Bill eff 1/1/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 08:51:12', '2022-11-22 08:51:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107639016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447189', 'David Naber', NULL, '11.22.22 - Dave called because him and his wife are trying to use CirrusMD but they were unable to log into their accounts. I sent each of them a password reset and advised to call me back if they have any further issues and I will reach out to CirrusMD for support. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-22 08:49:56', '2022-11-22 08:49:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107654021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003197067', 'Sandra Terenzi Lavoie', NULL, 'Member called in and had some questions around needs.  She has had some Kidney issues this year.  I explained how to present and not to say she had "Zion".  Told her to contact Zion and open a need ASAP.  She also had not had a Welcome call so I sent her the Scheduler.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-22 08:49:15', '2022-11-22 08:49:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107673003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099203002', 'Todd Muffley', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-22 08:34:39', '2022-11-22 08:34:39'),
