  ('zcrm_1579374000107649003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089444002', 'Cassandra Taylor', NULL, 'Spoke to Cassandra, she was adamant about cancelling her plan. I suggested she speak to Whitney Kline and discuss possible options. She doesn''t want to hear about options, just wants to cancel the plan. I sent cancellation form.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-22 07:57:31', '2022-11-22 07:57:31'),
