  ('zcrm_1579374000107620049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104964002', 'Sandra Erickson', NULL, '11-21-2022:  Jennifer mentioned Sandra called &amp; asked for me before my shift today.  Since I did not hear from her, ILM nearer the end of my shift to see if I could ans questions.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-21 19:06:32', '2022-11-21 19:06:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107620044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104964002', 'Sandra Erickson', NULL, '11-16-2022:  Sandra needed RX Coupons.  We''ve been struggling w/certain pharmacies accepting anything except GoodRX, so I sent three coupons for the same item:
     - Armout Thyroid BRAND 15mg., #180 (takes 2q am) #180 =
               $34.26 Sngl Care (no sgn up)
               $39.73 RXGo
               $53.38 GoodRX
        Even the most expensive is significantly less exp than her curr:  CareMart in the mail = ~$40/mo or $114 for 3 mos.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-21 19:05:04', '2022-11-21 19:05:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107627008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, '11/21/2002 Sarah called inquiring about any increases in 2023, and how much her plan is costing. Given this is a sales question, I forwarded her to contact Jill Clark. I had a hard time transferring her, but she was kind and patient, and offered to call her with the number that she has for Jill. NT', 'Nahla Tebcherany', 'Nahla Tebcherany', '2022-11-21 17:58:00', '2022-11-21 17:58:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107620039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '11-21-2022: Paul called &amp; realized he meant to be calling Mizz &amp; Sull.  He verified their # w/me and hurried off the ph.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-21 17:53:04', '2022-11-21 17:53:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447370', 'Richard Watkins', NULL, '11-21-22 Called to cancel bc he''s getting new ins through his company Jan. 1st, 2023. I sent him instructions to cancel. He will be out of the country until Dec. 10th. But, he has the form to complete anytime on or after Dec. 1-20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 16:40:09', '2022-11-21 16:40:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106890013', 'Alex Shinkle', NULL, '11-21-22 Talking with Dion at C4 and I''m still seeing the duplicate dental plan. She fixed it! It''s all set now with one medical and one dental plan. Phew!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 16:24:12', '2022-11-21 16:24:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106731013', 'Lori Miller', NULL, '11-21-22 Duplicate plan has been removed. Her account looks good now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 16:09:04', '2022-11-21 16:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410541', 'Lori Streim', NULL, '11-21-22 C4 Dion is looking at fixing Lori''s account. Now it''s showing 2 plans for the rest of the year 2022, one includes David and the other excludes David. David was trying to remove himself since he just turned 65 and it''s messed up her account multiple times. At least the plan is now slated to end at the end of the year, not one month early. But Dion is working to remove the extra plan showing in the Enrollments.  She came back and said they are still working on it and it can take up to 21 days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 15:57:08', '2022-11-21 16:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082413161', 'Wayne Marrs', NULL, '11-21-22 We cancelled the Anthem Colorado Option Gold Pathway Std for Monthly Premium $638.93 to reapply for the correct Pathway X plan. Contact Gaia!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 15:51:43', '2022-11-21 15:51:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986127', 'Alfons Reinig', NULL, '11-21-22 Alfons chose Anthem Colorado Option Silver Mountain Enhanced Standard for approximately $5.78 a month. APTC is huge $1053 or close. System won''t allow me or C4 Rep Dion to get past the Financial Agreement page. She''s submitting a tkt bc she''s getting an error page. Mine just won''t proceed. TKT - 221121-002111.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 15:44:30', '2022-11-21 15:44:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104398007', 'Estefania Luna', NULL, '11-21-22 Estefania and Connor chose the Friday Bronze Copay Plan for 2023. Total cost is $461.10, her cost per paycheck is $121.00 and cost per month is $262.17. Jennifer''s cost is $198.93. We''ve put the enrollment through on the IC Quotes platform. Next step is for me to put it through on Friday Health''s site once Estefania confirms 100%.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 15:22:59', '2022-11-21 15:22:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107613137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107250002', 'Denise Frank', NULL, 'Member called in and said that she put in error start date of 12/1/2022.  I changed in A123 &amp; CRM and since she had already been billed on 11/20, I scheduled next pmt date for 1/20/23.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-21 14:57:25', '2022-11-21 14:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107608028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109491027', 'Allison McFee', NULL, '11-21-22 Allie is 34 and living in HA now but lives a nomadic lifestyle and travels a bunch. She''s self-employed with Modern Goddess Lifestyle teaching women to empower themselves in many realms. She''s super healthy and prefers acupuncture, massage, etc. Doesn''t take any meds and never sees regular doctors for anything other than a physical. She got a clean pap recently. She''s planning to be in MI, Costa Rica, HA and Guatemala in the next year. So, this will work really well for her. She''s not sure if the network of alternative practitioners will be beneficial or not since most are through her own networks of people. She had a hard time understanding how everything works but seems to have gotten it by the end. She used to have a Kaiser plan for about $300 month with a $7K ded. I explained if she wants wellness visit it will likely be more affordable to pay cash than to go with the SECURE membership.  We have a follow up appt set for Dec. 16th at 11:00 am.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-21 14:54:53', '2022-11-21 14:54:53'),
