  ('zcrm_1579374000107620031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098500002', 'Shelley McLaughlin', NULL, '11-21-2022:  Shelley called, they are having to cancel due to finances.  They are going to have to go to super inexpensive coverage (prob w/subsidies).  She''s the only one working right now. & the new cov for the 4 of them is about 1/4 the exp they curr pay for the 2 of them.  (The new healthcare will cover them & her 2 kids, one w/autism & a grad stud?).  She had questions about the money that came out this month - I did not guide her on this in anyway.  She''s planning to call her advisor Zach Masters.  Trans her to Jeffrey Bursteen & she knows she''ll need to sign a form before it''s official.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-21 14:43:00', '2022-11-21 14:45:12'),
