  ('zcrm_1579374000107441172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361480', 'Michelle Crissey', NULL, '11-18-2022:  Michelle called.  She had her annual appt &amp; the doc''s off is billing her.  She has her RCI card and is going to call the doc to make sure they bill RCI directly.  She says the doc was in ntwk in the past (I did not mention recking to make sure they still are ea yr.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-18 15:42:44', '2022-11-18 15:42:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107482026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '11-18-22 Keila is happy with her current plan and we were able to renew it for $152.82 her cost. Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO. She also will be getting a large inheritance after she turns 35 on Feb. 7th, 2023 for $1.8M. She looking at some energy investments and video gaming investments and has talked with a financial advisor or two already. But, she''s asking and open to other ways to prepare for retirement with tax advantages, etc. She will meet with Mara and I in early Dec.  Just waiting to hear back from Mara if she''s available.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-18 15:41:04', '2022-11-18 15:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053968006', 'Michael Jones', NULL, 'Spoke to Mike, he is aging out as of Jan 2023. he will be covered until end of December.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-18 15:07:15', '2022-11-18 15:07:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107488003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '11.18.22:  Called and spoke w/Daryl.  Explained the Care+ and Direct plans.  Reviewed some of the newer services with which she is not familiar. Daryl is leaning toward the Direct plan.  May want to add a DPC.  Asked us to research integrative providers and primary care providers in her area (West Palm Beach, Palm Beach Gardens and Jupiter, FL).  Told her I will send her my website for her to review the plans and to contact me with any further questions and explained next steps. She said she will enroll in the new plan before Christmas.  Sent Daryl my website and Zion Guidelines.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-11-18 15:01:23', '2022-11-18 15:01:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857185', 'Molly Palmer', NULL, 'After speaking to Wendy member submitted cancellation.  Employer offering HI.  I will let RCI &amp; Sedera know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-18 14:52:11', '2022-11-18 14:52:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107482018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857185', 'Molly Palmer', NULL, '11-18-22 Molly''s company that she works for is offering health ins for the first time. So, she''s moving onto that as of Dec. 1st. I just helped her submit the cancellation form.  She was super nice and apologized for last time we talked she may have been short bc she had giardia from camping. But, she''s better now and was super appreciative of my help all along!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-18 14:50:15', '2022-11-18 15:01:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441157', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583239', 'Robert Beutler', NULL, 'Left another message for Robert. Told him today is the cutoff, and he will be billed for December, unless he calls before day''s end.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-18 14:49:12', '2022-11-18 14:49:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, 'Spoke to this guy, Pace. He''s isn''t truthful. He''s a business owner of a tech company with employees that he''s paying, and he''s trying to claim poverty. He thinks he''s going to get medicaid, good luck. Cancel his plan.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-18 14:42:48', '2022-11-18 14:42:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441147', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, 'After speaking with Jeffrey &amp; Tupac member elected to cancel.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-18 14:42:37', '2022-11-18 14:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745013', 'Dustin Boone', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Karen.  I will cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-18 14:36:51', '2022-11-18 14:36:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107477065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, '11-18-22 Adriana wanted to understand the upgrade and new price. She''s paying $333 now and to keep $500 IUA it will be $433.78. If changes to $1000 IUA then it''s $359.78. No open needs or health issues, but she doesn''t have any form of self-employment to show. He husband is self-employed and he pays but he''s not on the membership. So, we can''t easily switch to SECURE. She also uses the Chiropractic care with Redirect. So, she''s getting value out of that and it''s been working well on that front.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-18 14:35:34', '2022-11-18 14:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107472043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110735002', 'Sean Reilly', NULL, 'I spoke to sean today and did the overview of the secure plan, the plan is for him and his wife. he found us through self research.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-11-18 14:23:20', '2022-11-18 14:23:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107477060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '11-18-22 Thomas completed the conversion he believes. I gave him new price of $404.78. He mentioned making 3-4 calls previously, so I made sure I hadn''t missed any vm''s or emails. He said No. Looking at above notes, sounds like he called other people before he called me and was frustrated at that point. He was cool today and happy with everything.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-18 14:22:25', '2022-11-18 14:22:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107486002', 'Julia Mickelson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-18 14:17:13', '2022-11-18 14:17:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107477055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002887157', 'Trevor Mickelson', NULL, '11-18-22 Julia completed the new app for DIRECT which needs to be backdated to Oct. 2020.  She included both Levi and Dean. For some reason I don''t see Levi on the original account. He should have been included all along. The cost is the same. There was some oversight there. Patti said the app only showed Dean. It''s very bizarre. Either way, both will be included as of Dec. 1st onward. $480/$1000. They have a DPC as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-18 14:13:08', '2022-11-18 14:13:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107482013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053968006', 'Michael Jones', NULL, '11.18.22 - Mike called back because he never received a return call. I let Jeffrey know and he will be calling him back today. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-18 14:11:01', '2022-11-18 14:11:01'),
