  ('zcrm_1579374000107441122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068994062', 'Sean Herrin', NULL, 'Spoke to Sean, he''s going on an ACA plan starting January 2023. He will be paying $36.00 per month premium, with a $3,000.00 deductible. Doesn''t want to continue with this after December. Cxl form emailed.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-18 13:47:03', '2022-11-18 13:47:03'),
