  ('zcrm_1579374000107482008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105311002', 'Sandra Ganas', NULL, '11.18.22 -  Welcome call complete! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-18 13:17:14', '2022-11-18 13:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107477050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107471065', 'Rebecca Bradford', NULL, '11-18-22 Rebecca called back and felt bad bc she has a broker she''s been working with for years and feels bad about removing him. If she was a good candidate for MCS, then I could have helped her. But, she was actually getting bad information about needing to use income for 2021 and 2022. But, since she''s losing spousal support, she needs her best est for 2023. She will go back to her guy to keep the integrity of working with him for so long. She feels terrible, but it is what it is.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-18 13:12:48', '2022-11-18 13:12:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107477045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108418013', 'Lori Sadar', NULL, '11-18-22 Lori is 59 and wants to retire in the next year or so. She''s self-employed appears to be a dentist with DDS title. She has an HSA and will fund it to max. She''s currently paying $676 with a $7K ded. She had a hysterectomy in April. She had gone into menopause early because of her hormone levels with no period for 7 years and then she started spotting. Doctors panicked thinking maybe she had cancer or something and did hysterectomy only to find absolutely nothing wrong! They took everything out except her ovaries. So, she doesn''t believe there can be any further problems and docs are happy with finding nothing. She has ALL vaccines and says the next one she wants if for a pneumonia (I think she said). I''m not even aware those exist. The only ongoing issue is hot flashes. I asked if she''s ever gone to an acupuncturist and she absolutely not and she won''t see a chiro either. Bottom line she prefer not to see anybody and doesn''t sound open to alternative care. She healthy and exercises 4x week, runs, etc. She does her annual mammo and physical and wants to see Dr. Heidi Muncy PA in Wheatridge. She lives in Westminster, CO. She wants a Jan. 1st start date. We have an enrollment appt set for after Thanksgiving.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-18 13:01:40', '2022-11-18 13:01:40'),
