  ('zcrm_1579374000107477003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479002', 'Kylle Knudsen', NULL, '11-18-22 Kylle is enrolling in SECURE $1000 IUA / $325 for Dec. 1st, 2022 start date. He''s doing it from his phone bc his internet is down today.
