  ('zcrm_1579374000107464018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105906002', 'Derick Brooks', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call after start date of December 1, 2022. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-18 09:44:21', '2022-11-18 09:44:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107441038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101113002', 'Bradley Plummer', NULL, 'Bradley called to cancel their plan, wife Jessica will start receiving benefits from her job, employer contributing. I told Brad I wanted to do a side by side comparison, he gave me Jessica''s number. I called her and did a side by side, this is a better plan and she''s convinced so far to stay with us. she also is going to refer a  friend,', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-18 09:39:30', '2022-11-18 09:39:30'),
