  ('zcrm_1579374000107332058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, 'Melinda called in because she recently went to the doc for a respiratory virus and was wondering if she could submit the $95 bill towards her deductible. I explained to her how the IUA works and she said "so this is basically pointless when it comes to colds, flu, etc"? I explained that the preventative care benefits and that if she were to get sicker from this incident and it were to go above her IUA amount, then Zion would pay for anything above her IUA. She sounded pretty disappointed by this.
