  ('zcrm_1579374000107392016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '11-17-22 Hilary likely will need another hip surgery on her other hip this coming year. So, she will likely hit MOP. Friday Bronze HSA for $445.55 is really the best value. But, CU Sports Medicine is no going to take Friday Health in 2023. But, she will call around to make sure they accept her surgeon still and other doctors. She''s open to doing PT at a new location. She does PRP therapy already but has to pay cash for that anyhow. So, she will decide. We looked at Cigna Connect Bronze HSA as 2nd choice and Cigna Connect Flex Bronze 0 for $530.17 as 3rd choice.  She will let me know or just enroll and will do so before Dec. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-17 13:50:47', '2022-11-17 13:50:47'),
