  ('zcrm_1579374000107270069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091836', 'Amber Donnell', NULL, '11-16-2022:  Amber called trying to find a gyno in Montrose that is in ntwk for her ''Well Woman'' visit.  She live in a very remote area of CO so I gave her the two females listed.  However, we were notified yesterday that the RBP pricing (& no ntwk req''d) should take eff 1-1-23.  I let her know if she''s in a hurry to let me know if she needs further asst on finding an in ntwk doc, we are here.  But, it''s poss starting 1/1/23 the ntwk will not longer be req''d & described how the new RBP pricing will work.  She has what she needs if she wants to see a doc sooner, but may call us to conf the chg is happening if she decides she is ok w/waiting until next yr for her appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-16 18:23:52', '2022-11-16 18:23:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107270064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104534011', 'Yu Deng', NULL, '11-16-2022:  Ruby sent me a super long e-mail over the weekend with a ton of questions.  I asked her to call the Concierge Line because it needed so many details.  Today she called.  The second language comprehension was challenging, but I think we ended up with her understanding everything.
     She''s looking at ''prev care'' for herself and a potential member.  We discussed the NPI# & confirming w/PHCS, but that confirmation is for that day.  You have to reconfirm at the time of ea new appt in case the prov''s status chgs.  Yesterday, we were notified that starting 1-1-23, we will move the to RBP pricing.  Ruby was really struggling with the ntwk thing, so I mentioned this might chg on 1-1-23 & if it does, she may not have to worry about the ntwk - if she''s not in a hurry.
     Orig she felt like she pd for this year & she''d be missing out, but eventaully she seemed to understand it''s only going to be about a 6-wk difference & she''s not really losing anything.  She will call us nearer the end of Dec to confirm the chg & will go from there.  Part of the prob was the lack of available prov near her, so this is the perfect example of why we need the new RBP prices.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-16 18:18:12', '2022-11-16 18:18:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107270059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, '11-16-2022:  Matt called for several items:
     - Matt''s son''s was diagnosed w/a super rare type of kidney(?) cancer in Oct.  His son was a missionary & they prov ins that cov everything, yet ends soon.  He wanted to know how it will work, but was super emotional.  We decided Matt will call us back early December so we can walk him thru how to sub a ''med need'' and what the steps will look like for treatment that starts near Christmas.  I notified him of the $2500 IUA they will be responsible for & went over how that''s not annual with ongoing care & no 12-mo periods without any treatment, etc., where the ''med need'' would close.
     - Planstin for visual:  Let him know the plan does not include dental, vision, or derm prevention.  Zion has a new phrase in the newest Guidelines about "optometry" possibly being cov, but let him know I would not expect that in his situation.  He''s going to keep his pymt rec & det inv though.  Hopefully, when we talk in Dec we will have further clarification on what this new phrase refers to.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-16 18:10:38', '2022-11-16 18:10:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107270045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '11-16-2022:  Thomas called very frustrated.  He rec''d the chg e-mail from Sedera.  He called them as instructed in the e-mail only to be told to call us.  &amp; of course I had to get him to his advisor, which at first he was upset about another trans, but was far calmer once I told him I could trans him &amp; gave him inst on how Wendy would be able to help.  He was much less frustrated by the end of the call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-16 16:29:43', '2022-11-16 16:29:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107270040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088570001', 'Nicholas Baciu', NULL, '11-16-2022:  Nicholas called.  He was trying to figure out how to get into his memb portal.  I was able to help him do that.  He was concerned because he submitted a change of address & added his wife (I can see the Cognito form from June w/an eff date of 7/1/2022), but hasn''t seen an increase of mo contribution and isn''t sure he rec''d his ID card(s).  He knew he''d rec''d the links from Jennifer in Oct and hadn''t had time to work on those, so he was calling.
     - I showed him how to see all the comp of his Secure plan (via MPB.Health).  
     - I also showed him the updates section so he can resub the req to update his address ANDmake sure his wife was added to his plan properly.  [I cannot see her in either the CRM or Admin123, although I can see her on the req form he sub back in June.]
     - He mentioned wanting to discuss his ID cards, but had to get off the phone before we could complete  that portion of the conversation.  As he got off the phone, he mentioned calling us back.  We went over our hours.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-16 16:22:55', '2022-11-16 16:22:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107270035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462222', 'Ann Apfelbeck', NULL, '11-16-2022:  Ann called very upset.  She says she purchased this plan because she was told she could get an annual mamm & now it''s been denied because it''s every 2 years.  She says we should have told her.  How was she supposed to know.
     She''s been a member longer than I''ve been working on the conc line, so I let her know Jane might be able to speak to whether the gvmt MEC items chg''d since she joined.  She no longer has Jane''s contact info so I sent her that and the link to the gvmt site showing what is & is not on the list of ''prev care'' with the RCI ''prev care'' component.  She''s called RCI, Sedera, etc & is frustrated that she keeps being told to call someone else.   She had a ''Welcome Call'', but I don''t see she''s reached out to us since 8/2020.  I let her know the Conciege Line is always a good place to start.  Then we can guide her in the appropriate place to call & what to ask.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-16 15:21:36', '2022-11-16 17:14:46'),
