  ('zcrm_1579374000107132023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109002', 'Anil Gupta', NULL, '11-15-2022:  Anil called.  Anita had an emerg last week &amp; he wanted helpsub the ''med need'', so I walked him thru the process again.  He hasn''t pd anything yet, but had questions about her follow-up visits.  We went over everything.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-16 00:20:58', '2022-11-16 00:20:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107132018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '11-15-2022:  Martha called.  She asked about lowering their IUA.  We discussed it could be an option, although there is a 60-day waiting period, and she''s worried about some issues right now.  I showed her how to req the chg, but she''s going to think about it.
