     - After talking, he thinks he wants the 1k IUA.  I sent Patti a Teams chat for tomorrow:  "What''s the best way for us to do this?  Cancel that first application?  Req a change?  What will happen with his payment?  I told Preston I''d talk to you and  call him tomorrow w/details.  Let me know your thoughts Wednesday."  Once I hear back, I''ll reach out & guide Preston.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-15 17:28:35', '2022-11-15 17:28:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107132008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079147245', 'Ekaterina Feldman', NULL, '11-15-2022:  Ekaterina called.  She was trying to find a way to see everything she has in her Secure plan online.  I got her to the MPB.Health site &amp; showed her where they list all the components.
