  ('zcrm_1579374000107112049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '11-15-22 Formerly on PDHC and then on x-husbands employer plan and now on own per above.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-15 16:05:52', '2022-11-15 16:05:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107112041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '11-15-22 Jenny chose RMHP Colorado Doctors Plan Bronze $6,500 ($0 Virtual Urgent Care + $0 Primary Care Visits, $3 T2 Preferred Rx) Bronze/HMO, Premium $695.71 	APTC $544.04 and her cost $151.67. She wants to keep Dr. Marcie Lavigne and RMHP is the only network that shows up. Dr. Christopher Fox is an endocrinologist and isn''t showing in any network at the moment. She says they are working to accept possibly Cigna and maybe others. She''s all set for 2023 and she knows to contact RMHP in 7-10 biz days to make her initial and ongoing payments.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-15 16:02:28', '2022-11-15 16:03:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107065028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097349002', 'William Edwards', NULL, 'Script quote for Estradiol and Citalopram completed. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-15 14:11:23', '2022-11-15 14:11:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107113008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094737002', 'Faviola Meschi', NULL, 'I spoke to Faviola, per John K, we are having her send over the bill and EOB. Member is satisfied.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-15 14:08:16', '2022-11-15 14:08:16');
