  ('zcrm_1579374000107118093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107133002', 'Preston Jones', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 13:54:39', '2022-11-15 13:54:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107132003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094737002', 'Faviola Meschi', NULL, '11-15-2022:  Natalie from Zion''s Advocacy Team called.  She''s going to see if they can help Faviola with this bill.  I let Natalie know that Faviola was amazing in how hard she tried to follow the in ntwk guidelines and to make sure she didn''t end up in this very situation.  ILM for Faviola, so she knows Natalie will be reaching out to her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-15 13:45:35', '2022-11-15 13:45:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107128012', 'Lynn Ward', NULL, 'Member &amp; Ch $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 13:39:57', '2022-11-15 13:39:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107085058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107281002', 'Devorrah Moss', NULL, 'I spoke to debbie today and she let me know that she was on liberty plan 2 years ago and is now looking to swtich back to a healthshare from her overpriced insurance plan. She considers bloodworkd and preventative care alongside HSA to be important. She said she''s looking to start for january but possibly november. She has no preex and is a hairdresser with a business license. She wants to know about the phcs network in her area and also about the preventative healthcare.gov. Now she said she''ll call me soon but I will call her anyways on friday.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-11-15 12:50:12', '2022-11-15 12:50:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107065023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, 'James called to get the price change for his individual plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-15 12:38:48', '2022-11-15 12:38:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', 'New Plan eff 12/1/2022', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 12:37:20', '2022-11-15 12:37:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation to cancel Sedera Membership eff 12/1/2022.  Sedera &amp; RCI have been notified.  Billing cancelled in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 12:33:53', '2022-11-15 12:33:53'),
