  ('zcrm_1579374000107065018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073887102', 'Shelley Sanner', NULL, 'Shelley called in with some preventative care questions. We talked about preventative items turning into diagnostic items, opening a medical need with Zion, and Shelley will call back if she has any other questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-15 12:23:41', '2022-11-15 12:23:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107124002', 'Julie Booras', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 12:20:49', '2022-11-15 12:20:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048010', 'Leanne Claxton', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 12:16:15', '2022-11-15 12:16:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107048002', 'Peter Coddington', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 12:14:22', '2022-11-15 12:14:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026335249', 'Terrie Parrott', NULL, 'I will leave this member as is, because I have not received any cancellation for member''s previous Sedera membership.  I left VM for Leslie re:double billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 12:12:03', '2022-11-15 12:12:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107065013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088734001', 'Matthew Larson', NULL, 'Matt called because he wanted to understand the pre-x clause better. He was not quite understanding that since his son was diagnosed with cancer AFTER the Larson''s start date it will not be subject to the pre-x clause. Hopefully we got it all straightened out and he is more understanding. We also went over the MSEAP program and I sent Matt the info via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-15 12:08:32', '2022-11-15 12:08:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106964002', 'Cynthia Unger', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 12:05:46', '2022-11-15 12:05:46'),
