  ('zcrm_1579374000107118023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924192', 'Juzef Klim', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to increase IUA to $5000.  I will adjust in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 11:42:40', '2022-11-15 11:42:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107112036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107123084', 'Andy Hilton', NULL, '11-15-22 Andy is 63 and wife is 63.  He''s an ASHI member in NC. His wife retired from a bank back in March. Their cost will be $1700 month and Cobra runs out at the end of the year. But, they''re allowed to keep that plan, if need be.  He takes Humira bi-monthly injections that work really well for arthritis. They cost $4K through World MedRX. So, it''s a no go for him. His wife has Crohn''s Disease and takes mercapturine 50mg 1x daily and it''s about $100 per month. But, their insurance is through his wife, so she can''t cancel bc then he wouldn''t have access to it. This Humira may be a huge limiting factor for him. He''s able to get it now affordably with their current plan. I told him if he ever changes his medication then I could possibly help him at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-15 11:36:02', '2022-11-15 11:36:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107109047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103921002', 'John Greene', NULL, 'Member sent me an email that he doesn''t  feel the need of a welcome call. He understands services and he will figure out anything else when the time comes. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-15 11:20:40', '2022-11-15 11:20:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107112031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107123046', 'Bradford Little', NULL, '11-15-22 Brad is trying to quit smoking. He was on Bright Health and needed to find a new plan. He was not picky at all. He just wanted the price in the $300-$400 range. The 2nd lowest Anthem plan was the one he chose at $391.90 Anthem Bronze Mountain Enhanced X HMO 6000 $0 Select Drugs
Bronze/HMO. He''s not worried about keeping any doctors. He never goes to the doctor. He said he had worked with a broker in the past but there wasn''t any broker connected to his account, so he was able to easily choose me now. I completed his enrollment for him. I told him he will have to set up ongoing payments with Anthem. We couldn''t submit a cc, only ACH withdrawal, so he''ll do it directly with Anthem. He''s all set for 2023.  He earns too much for APTC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-15 11:01:20', '2022-11-15 11:01:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107109042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103737002', 'Matthew Hatcher', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-15 10:50:13', '2022-11-15 10:50:13'),
