  ('zcrm_1579374000107109032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104626002', 'Matt Wohlgemuth', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-15 10:35:16', '2022-11-15 10:35:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107085053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094737002', 'Faviola Meschi', NULL, 'Spoke with Cari about this issue.  I will be addressing this with Jeffrey Burnsteen to discuss with Tony, the agent for future reference.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-11-15 10:18:19', '2022-11-15 10:18:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107112023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107123011', 'Ranjani Reddy', NULL, '11-15-22 We connected via Big Wave Lead. She was persistent. She chose Anthem Bronze Pathway X Essentials 6000 HMO for Dec. 2022 for $721 and same for Jan. 2023 Anthem Bronze Pathway X Essentials 6000 HMO $0 Drug for $753. No APTC bc earns too much. We checked and Dr. Rebecca Juliar is showing in the network.  She''s all set for Dec 2022 onward. I told her to contact Anthem in 7-10 biz days to make her payment. She will send me her Cobra letter to upload into C4. I let her know she might have to show that to Anthem as well. She understands.  All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-15 10:09:27', '2022-11-15 10:10:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107109027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104642002', 'Sarah Battista', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-15 09:56:48', '2022-11-15 09:56:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107085038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106009041', 'Joan Badzik', NULL, 'Sent out follow up email regarding missing documentation.  Set another reminder for Nov 18,', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-11-15 09:56:16', '2022-11-15 09:56:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107085033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104789002', 'Brady Kumpula', 'Member has found Solution to high cost medication', 'Spoke with Cari about the alternatives with this member.  Emailed Jane Kassel regarding the situation.  Jane returned our email to let us know that the Member has found a solution to the high cost of the medication.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-11-15 09:52:44', '2022-11-15 09:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy member submitted Cancellation form  I will cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 09:51:35', '2022-11-15 09:51:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107118008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, 'Member asked for a breakdown of the costs of her new Select + membership.  I explained the following - Sedera $541.65  Redirect $365 MPB 110.35  Grand total $1017.28', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 09:48:42', '2022-11-15 09:48:42'),
