  ('zcrm_1579374000107118003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106024002', 'Douglas Miller', NULL, 'Members need to push membership out as he is looking into a possible surgery that would be Pre-Ex. Per Leo he wants to start 2/1/23', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-15 09:33:05', '2022-11-15 09:33:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107065008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693017', 'Deirdre Bingman', NULL, 'Member called because she could not find the email that Patti sent her to change her payment info. I resent the email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-15 09:32:42', '2022-11-15 09:32:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107113003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088869002', 'Dale Brom', NULL, 'Spoke with Dale Brom this morning, very nice man. He bought the plan from Mike Montes, (Wiley Long''s group).. Dale said he was misinformed by Mike Montes, and has tried to reach him several times. Mike Montes has not responded to him. He wants to continue with the plan, but may want to change if possible to include preventative. Dale indicated that he no longer wants to work with Mike Montes. I reached out and left a message for Montes to call me.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-15 09:19:51', '2022-11-15 09:19:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107109008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105086002', 'Mana Siu', NULL, 'Spoke to Mana will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-15 09:07:52', '2022-11-15 09:28:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107109003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103906002', 'Rodrigo Torres', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-15 08:59:39', '2022-11-15 08:59:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107085008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107281002', 'Devorrah Moss', NULL, 'devorrah is in nevada and is 3 hours behind florida time.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-11-15 07:41:47', '2022-11-15 07:41:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107065003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086855002', 'Vikram Kumar', NULL, 'See ticket from 11.15.22 - JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-15 07:12:01', '2022-11-15 07:12:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107032196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529495', 'Keith Purcell', NULL, '11-14-2022:  Susan called.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-14 19:23:43', '2022-11-14 19:23:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107032185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102604002', 'Cynthia Shelden', NULL, '11-14-2022:  Cynthia called & had questions about getting her annual appts taken care of.  Today, when I look up Direct Care in the online Zion Guidelines, it does not stipulate a 6-mo waiting period for mamm in one area, but does in another.  We also went over this is designed to go w/a DPC so that''s why they offer the 1 off visit up to $250 (we disc that limitation as well).  She''s rethinking that maybe Secure is a better option, so is going to tt her advisor Karen Torsoe again.  The whole family is going to need quite a bit of ''prev care'' in the next yr.  If they decide to stay on Direct, I told her I can call to confirm the inconsistencies on mamm, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-14 19:10:17', '2022-11-14 19:10:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107032177', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788057', 'Jean Thompson', NULL, '11-14-2022:  Jean is having trouble utilizing her RCI card for her mamm & wants to get a bone density test on her ''prev care''.  The mamm cntr is telling her the memb id is invalid.  We decided she''s going to tt RCI directly to ck:
     - her memb id # & will req a new card if needed
     - will ck if the issue is just that the cntr she''s trying to utilize is not in ntwk
     - will ask if her ''prev care'' pays for bone density testing
She was good with doing that herself & will call us if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-14 19:05:09', '2022-11-14 19:05:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107040036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084651019', 'Nicole Sylvestre', NULL, '11-14-22 Nicole called to cancel. She was very elusive as to why. She said Yes, to getting a new job but had no knowledge of when her coverage would begin but said she''s all set. It didn''t sound like she was providing honest answers. But, she completed the form I believe for Dec. 1st end.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-14 17:37:28', '2022-11-14 17:37:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107032163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107047011', 'Kim DiGiacomo', NULL, 'Spoke to Kim regarding selling in NJ.  She is familiar with healthshare and is looking for a company that will be compliant with NJ mandate.

Sent Join My TEAM email.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-11-14 15:44:36', '2022-11-14 15:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107032148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000084737002', 'Chad Petherick', NULL, '11-14-2022:  Chad called.  He''s been trying to confirm his cancellation has been processed, but hadn''t heard back from Patti on his VM.  I sent him a copy of the e-mail confirmation &amp; let him know his file shows it''s cancelled in case the prev went to his spam folder.  His biggest concern seems to be whether he''ll be chg''d again.  I let him know it looks like it''s all set &amp; he should not see any further montly contribution draws.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-14 14:51:39', '2022-11-14 19:06:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107040023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, '11-14-22 Aubrey watched the video for DIRECT and sees it''s super similar to their current membership. They are open to it. Only pre-x is youngest that was born in 7/2021 had an enlarged kidney. No treatment was needed and 80% of time it gets resolved on its own. Only possible negative is possible UTIs. Those can be handled by Dr. Lee at Harmony Health. But, they haven''t ever even had that happen. So, she''s not really worried since the doctors aren''t concerned at all. MPB Direct went up to about $937.28 at $500 IUA. Now they want to know the price for $1000 IUA. I''m waiting for price sheet from John. DIRECT is $660 / $1000, so it will be much more affordable. She understands the pre-x clause in relation to her son, if they switch. They will discuss it and let me know once I have the other IUA price.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-14 14:21:32', '2022-11-14 14:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107037038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061091646', 'Carol Lovejoy', NULL, 'Member updated her address.  I will update in Planstin &amp; in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-14 14:15:17', '2022-11-14 14:15:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107045013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, '11.14.22 - I briefly walked Amy through opening a need via the Zion website. She needed to be transferred to Zion for her member number and she will call us back if she needs further assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-14 14:03:16', '2022-11-14 14:03:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107037033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811318', 'Dylan Songer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking w/Jeffery.  He now has coverage on spouses plan.  I will cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-14 14:01:27', '2022-11-14 14:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107038013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811318', 'Dylan Songer', NULL, 'Dylan called back, he just got married and went on his wife''s plan through her job. Much less money for them. Cancel his plan.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-14 13:55:56', '2022-11-14 13:55:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107038008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075811318', 'Dylan Songer', NULL, 'I called Dylan again today to speak to him about his possible cancellation. I got his voicemail, this time,  I was able to leave a message for him to call me back before the 20th.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-14 13:44:20', '2022-11-14 13:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000107037028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', 'New Plan eff 12/1/22', 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-14 13:21:18', '2022-11-14 13:21:18'),
