  ('zcrm_1579374000107040013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107479002', 'Kylle Knudsen', NULL, '11-14-22 Kylle is my direct client. He doesn''t have health ins at the moment bc he got swindled by someone and got a plan where he didn''t have surgery coverage. He cancelled it and has been without ins ever since for about 4 years. Kaiser at the time cost about $850 with $6K ded and $14K mop. I explained SECURE and he is super interested! He will read my email and watch the video. He has slightly high blood pressure and takes amlodepine and losartin. It''s well managed. He''s borderline diabetic but that''s related to his weight which he working on improving now. Yes, he thinks he should do his wellness visit and doesn''t currently have an HSA but understands the benefit. SECURE $1000/$325. We will connect on Friday to do enrollment for Dec. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-14 12:24:26', '2022-11-14 12:24:26'),
