  ('zcrm_1579374000107027016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088568002', 'Thomas Parsons', NULL, 'Thomas responded to my greeting message on SalesIQ earlier this morning asking where he can find the cancellation form on our website. I pulled him up in the CRM here and asked if he has spoken to Jeff Kanter his healthcare advisor about this yet. Thomas said that he not only spoke to Jeff Kanter, but also spoke to Jeffery Burnstein here about cancelling his plan. Thomas mentioned that he has not heard back from Jeff with sending him the cancellation form. I was able to email him the link to the online form for him to fill out. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-11-14 08:54:49', '2022-11-14 08:54:49'),
