  ('zcrm_1579374000106951073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109943001', 'Paul Vanslyke', NULL, '11-11-22 Came to me via Shannon Cleary. He doesn''t have any insurance at the moment. His company will pay $250 towards his plan as W2 employee. But, he has an LLC on the side that up to date as well. He''s healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Lives in Lyons. Traditional ins starts at $551.34 and goes up from there. Once I shared SECURE with him, he was pumped and ready to enroll but no access to computer at the moment. We are meeting on Monday to enroll and slated 15 minutes to get it done. He works 7:00-7:00.  SECURE $325/$1000.  Realizes should do wellness soon too and explained HSA also. He wants dental too!  I forgot to address this part. Teach him about HMA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-11 17:08:34', '2022-11-11 17:08:56'),
