  ('zcrm_1579374000106955020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059281121', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '11-11-2022:  Laura called re: a bill for the labwork on her ''Well Women'' visit on 11/25/2019!  She just rec''d a bill saying her ''ins'' declined payment.  She has no idea what ''ins'' they billed, in her mind it was Liberty, but I''m going to have to look into it.  The Sedera plan that started in 2020 is too recent.  We are going to talk again on Monday after I can dig into it &amp; she can get what ''ins'' comp they billed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-11 15:48:25', '2022-11-11 17:37:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106955012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104457002', 'Normandie Rainwater', NULL, '11-11-2022:  Normandie called to see if her daughter''s doc was in ntwk.  We went over ''prev care'' component only time need to worry about ntwk, but it is for her ''Well Woman'' visit.  We got online together &amp; did not find the doc in the PHCS ntwk search.  So, we went over looking at who is in ntwk, HCBB, etc., so they can decide what they''d like to do.  She may wait to see if ntwk still req''d after 1/1/23, in case the ntwk is no longer req''d.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-11 15:21:11', '2022-11-11 15:21:11'),
