  ('zcrm_1579374000106951048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004455005', 'Carleen Andersen', NULL, '11-11-22 Carleen signed up for Friday Bronze Copay Bronze/HMO 719-589-3696 for $266.25 APTC $184.10 and her cost is $82.15. She knows to contact them in 7-10 days to set up payment. She went with this one bc it has free PCP visit and mental health.  Those are the two things she will actually use. She understands if something bad happens she will have to pay up to $9100 and I suggested she saves at least the monthly savings from last year to this year as a backup fund. She understands. She''s all set for 2023 and super appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-11 14:34:17', '2022-11-11 14:34:17'),
