  ('zcrm_1579374000106951038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078963251', 'Denise Schulz', NULL, '11-11-22 She chose the Friday Bronze Copay Bronze/HMO for $0!  Full APTC  is used $585.85. She understands if something big happens she still has a $9100 ded and mop. But she has copays for small stuff. She''s thrilled to save $200  a month in 2023 because she''s paying $200+ now. Alimony is $3000 per month but her rent is $3100. So, she may need to get some work sometime soon.  She takes asthma meds and estrogen ring which now costs $460 for 3 months. The Friday plan for Preferred Brand is $160. So, this might help her or she will continue to use GoodRX. She knows to call Friday Health in 7-10 days to make sure she doesn''t need to submit any payment, even though it''s a $0. It''s better to be safe than sorry! She will do that. All set otherwise.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-11 12:46:08', '2022-11-11 12:46:08'),
