  ('zcrm_1579374000106951011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165420', 'Jennifer Shedd', NULL, '11-11-22 Jennifer Shedd is on her x-husband''s plan right now at around $300+ with their son. But, once he turns 18 (this week) they are on their own. So, she''s looking for something perhaps Dec. or Jan. 1st. She''s open to MCS again and compare to C4 options. Income around $65K she thinks. She''ll login to her C4 account and select me as her agent this weekend and watch the video. We will reconnect on Tuesday at 3:30. She is self-employed with own biz.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-11 11:33:47', '2022-11-11 11:34:32'),
