  ('zcrm_1579374000106951003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106890013', 'Alex Shinkle', NULL, '11-11-22 Alex is on Medicaid now but will be bumped off anytime. She''s earning about $40K as her best guess. Earning about $25K as an independent contractor for a company and about $15K from investments. She will update this as she had a clearer picture. She wants mental health therapy and takes lexipro and larin for that. DOB 6/26/93. We looked at Friday Health for the free mental health visits and she likes that. She chose Friday Bronze Copay Bronze/HMO. Premium $249.02  APTC $134.21. Her cost $114.81.   She also wanted Dental and wants a new dentist. The plans on C4 are much cheaper than anything else and she only wants it for cleaning at this point. Anthem Dental Family Low/PPO for $14.01. System is showing duplicates of plan in account. She will call to have it removed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-11 10:51:22', '2022-11-11 10:56:56'),
