  ('zcrm_1579374000106908005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152005', 'Krista Barker', NULL, 'Krista messaged me on SalesIQ after I greeted her, and she said all she had was a few questions about her plan to get a little "Refresher" about her plan. I replied letting her know that I will send her an email with a link to our Welcome Call Scheduler where she picks a day and time that works best for her and is available on the calendar to pick. One of our Welcome Call Coordinators will call her on that day & time she chooses, and sit down with her for about 15-20 mins explaining how everything works with her plan, what to do during certain situations, who she would need to contact and when, etc. Along with any questions Krista might have as things come up. I sent her the email and let her know it was sent to her accordingly. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-11-11 08:23:55', '2022-11-11 08:24:19'),
