  ('zcrm_1579374000106860013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380465', 'Kelly Green', NULL, '11-10-2022:  Kelly called.  Back in March her gastro doc had her gets some tests, but it wasn''t really over her IUA so she drug her feet.  She finally sub those 2 items & was at the deadline.  
     - 1st = 3/3/22 dos; sub 9/8/22
     - 2nd = 3/9/22 dos; sub 9/8/22  [these 2 items are ~$900 & she pd them]
     So, one was 1 day prior to the 6mos deadline, while the other was 5 days past.  Both were declined as past the 6-mo deadline.
     - Then in Aug 2022 she ended-up in the ER for the same issue.  This is what sparked her sub the first 2 items.  This was declined as being pre-x & said she had no help since it was her first year of service. (which she was not, she was in her 2nd yr).
       I''ve advised her to put together an appeal packet:  All detailed invoices w/med codes, payment receipts to show what she''s paid = ~$900; a letter with the details she gave me above, but to get it done right away!  Like yesterday!  I sugg sending it all to the appeal e-mail address in her denial e-mails, but Jennifer Thorin may have other sugg, so Kelly may call once she has it ready to see if that''s the best way to go.
     - The doctor now thinks dietary guidance might help w/the issue.  She''s going to get a letter from the doc showing her referral & knows this would req prior appr if they would share it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-10 18:00:25', '2022-11-11 15:26:28'),
