  ('zcrm_1579374000106860003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406017', 'Patricia Nard', NULL, '11-10-2022:  Patricia''s husb called re: update to new Sedera format.  I gave him the # we have on file for Wiley Long.  If he has any issues getting ahold of Wiley, he will call back &amp; we can defer him to Patti (he has questions about pricing, etc.).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-10 17:11:21', '2022-11-10 17:11:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106837042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120921091', 'Melanie Goble', NULL, '11-10-22 Melanie is healthy, but takes ADHD meds which are controlled substances but not that expensive on GoodRX about $25. Methylphenidate HCL.  We couldn''t get her to show up in my C4 portal. She selected me as her broker twice and sees me in her account, but I can''t see her. I tried calling C4 and was on hold for 15 min. Then other client called me and I hung up. I''ll try tomorrow.  She is with Bright Health now and needs to find a new plan. She was laid off on Oct. 31st and wants a plan for Dec. 1st and ideally one that will continue onward to 2023. We could pick Bright Health $0 for 1 month and then pick Cigna $0 for 2023 maybe.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-10 17:10:32', '2022-11-10 17:12:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106837037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042857185', 'Molly Palmer', NULL, '11-10-22 Left vm for Molly bc she''s asking for help with conversion. I let her know price isn''t accurate in that system and she will receive correct price in emails to come.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-10 17:01:59', '2022-11-10 17:01:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106837032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098951004', 'Sam Simonds', NULL, '11-10-22 I spent a long time educating Sandy about how the insurance plans work and she sees how bad they are.  She is now more open minded to MCS. She''s thinking perhaps waiting 1 more year to allow the 24 months to pass for his vax injury which was diagnosed as Prudenda Neuralgia which manifested as extremely painful testicles. All drs. denied or wouldn''t acknowledge that it was related to vax even though it happened in conjunction with the vax. I let her know I like Friday Health and network is growing around CO. Anthem you have to check the doctor bc multiple networks and same for RMHP. She will review and ponder further. She will also watch the video.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-10 16:59:12', '2022-11-10 16:59:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106837024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094176160', 'Kari Mitchell', NULL, '11-10-22 Kari called me and we completed her enrollment. She has a cold and is feeling out of whack. But, she wanted to keep Dr. Marilyn Dougherty for an eye issue and I found her showing up for Friday and Anthem Pathway X plans. She''s part of UC Health. Kari chose Friday Silver Zero Deductible for $610.05 and APTC $521.36. I completed the app for her. I made sure she knows to call Friday after 7-10 biz days to make her payment and let her know if not, they will cancel her plan. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-10 16:05:38', '2022-11-10 16:07:11'),
