  ('zcrm_1579374000106698042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106712011', 'Thomas Lash', NULL, 'Agent found us through Web Search.  He is looking into expanding into the DPC market. After the initial vetting phone call, Agent stated that he is currently working with Planstin and Zion and has around 20 memberships with them directly.

