  ('zcrm_1579374000106700026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502073', 'Bruce Wildman', NULL, '11-9-22 Bruce was pleased that I returned his call. He was just asking if he should complete the Sedera conversion process. I said yes, but in the meantime he will look at our newer DIRECT membership to help keep his cost down. It''s going from $245 to $464.78 which makes no sense! He doesn''t have any pre-x, just borderline high cholesterol that he''s managing with Dr. Flanagan. No further issues. Only Need was with Rhonda and she has her own account and turns 65 in Jan. 2023. So, that''s irrelevant. He doesn''t understand why Sedera''s site is showing a $185 cost vs the $464.78! I don''t have an answer for that! It''s bizarre. He will review the new DIRECT and let me know what he wants to do.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-09 16:16:52', '2022-11-09 16:16:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106698034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083937002', 'Benjamin Lee', NULL, '11-9-2022:  Benjamin''s wife called, but she''s not on the membership, so she got Benjamin on the phone & we went over some info.  (I sent the link for the form to authorize her tt us re: his info.)
     - I ck''d both the CRM & Admin123 & both show his memb w/us & Zion started on 2/1/22.  They felt it started further back then that.  At the end of our conversation I tried warm trans them to Patti''s line, but either I accidentally cut them off, or they hung up.  I called back & left Patti''s # so they can confirm the corr eff date.
     - Ben went to the doc recently & they feel it''s time to have his hip replaced.  We talked about when this first became an issue & that seems "years ago", but they cannot be certain re: pre-x?  Not?  I went over both scenarios w/them.  1) First: Is pre-x = 1st yr waiting per; 2nd 25k (gave example if date I see is somehow accurate, 2/23 they are in their 2nd yr & would have 25k available for qualified pre-x med need, etc.  2) tt doc years ago & with no symp, treatment, monitoring, mention,  during the 24-mos prior to his memb. = not pre-x & they are resp for 1k IUA and once qualified & approved healthsharing community will share.  I told them it all depends on what is in the doc''s records.  They seemed to understand.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-09 15:51:21', '2022-11-09 16:03:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106698029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055771107', 'Marcy Oppenheimer', NULL, '11-9-2022:  Marcy got into the PHCS Ntwk search &amp; is struggling to clearly understand who is cov.  She thinks this off was cov in the past &amp; asked if I could see if they were pd.  I let her know Planstin (her prev care comp company) would be the ones that can see &amp; guide her (we can''t see that info).  Made sure she has both Planstin &amp; PHCS''s ph #''s &amp; trans her to Planstin.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-09 15:39:53', '2022-11-09 15:39:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106698024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091091002', 'Christian Tonsberg', NULL, '11-9-2022:  Christian called wanting a replacement EOB on his shingles shot.  I let him know Planstin (= his prev care) would be the comp that can help him w/that.  Made sure he has their # &amp; trans him to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-09 15:37:49', '2022-11-09 15:37:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106698019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022839060', 'Peyton Bell', NULL, '11-9-2022:  Peyton called asking for help on her acct.  It''s after hours so I trans her to Patti''s line &amp; she will LM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-09 15:36:29', '2022-11-09 15:36:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106700021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026502073', 'Bruce Wildman', NULL, '11-9-22 Per John Kach, Bruce''s new cost will be - Wildman - 449.78 + 15 = 464.78.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-09 15:26:24', '2022-11-09 15:26:24'),
