  ('zcrm_1579374000106707023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106693010', 'William Gogarty', NULL, 'Member $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-09 15:20:13', '2022-11-09 15:20:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106707018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106699002', 'Kelly McKinney', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-09 15:18:15', '2022-11-09 15:18:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106700016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073598040', 'Jennifer Hushka', NULL, '11-9-22 Jennifer is a former Kaiser client she said and she hates them now. She has some health issues going on with her gall bladder. They wouldn''t refer her to a gastro. So, she thinks she wants Cigna or Anthem until I showed her Friday Health that is including all of her doctors. Anthem excludes UC Health and Cigna excludes Sherrie Balantine. Friday includes all of the following: Dr. Felicia Longnecker, Dr. Heather Banks, Dr. Sherrie Lynn Ballantine-Talmadge, Dr. Charles Graham Jones, Dr., Emily Kay Ward, and Dr. Jeffrey Bryan King. She also gene for EDS and one child has it now, so she wants to be careful in case it shows up. Gregg is working with Andrea on Medicare now. Jennifer created her own new C4 account thinking each family member needed an account. So, she''s going to call C4 and ask them to remove her new account and leave the original one intact. She will ponder the 6 options I provided to her over the weekend and we''ll talk on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-09 15:17:21', '2022-11-09 15:17:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106710003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '11.09.22:  Karen informed me she asked Rick/Michelle to do a video.  They said they would think about it so she asked me to call Michelle and persuade them to do it.  Karen also mentioned they want information about changing their IUA amount to a lower amount.  I told Karen they can do this once per year and must wait 60 days to use it for a medical need.  I called Michelle today and left a message for her to call with any questions, that I''d be happy to help her further if she needs it.  I also asked if she or Rick would do a video.  I left my number for her to call back or text.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-11-09 14:47:17', '2022-11-09 14:47:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106678028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055771107', 'Marcy Oppenheimer', NULL, '11.9.22 - Marcy requested that I email her the instructions on how to find a provider in the PHCS network. I emailed them to her. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-09 14:32:17', '2022-11-09 14:32:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106707013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155119', 'Timothy Cook', NULL, 'Member emailed me that he did the Sedera transition and he changed his IUA to $1000.  I will change in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-09 14:25:09', '2022-11-09 14:25:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106707008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054188', 'Chris Larson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking to Jeffery.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; cancel billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-09 14:15:16', '2022-11-09 14:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106707003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155119', 'Timothy Cook', NULL, 'I spoke to this member re: Sedera transition.  Gave him new pricing that went up considerably since he has the $500 IUA.  I also gave him pricing for then$1k &amp; $1500 options.  I explained that nothing would change that we would still be billing him, however he would get an invoice from Sedera every month and to disregard.  I also suggested that he speak to Analisa about Zion options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-09 14:13:10', '2022-11-09 14:13:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106698008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093922012', 'Jennifer Letz', NULL, '11-9-2022:  Jennifer called again looking for fair pricing.  We walked thru finding the 3 items in HCBB (she has the link in her post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail).  Talked about how to use the information & that we are always here to help, but at least this way she can see & adjust it easily.     - CA

Jennifer called back trying to decide if the ''Fair Price'' was all inclusive (ie: image & reading).  We found some items (tried knee repl & can see a breakdown), but not on her items.  The HCBB chat was offline, so we couldn''t ask them either.  But, we both agreed, we think it will be for the full "Chest CT Scan (no contrast)" , etc...  We decided she''ll look at the prices they come back with and that may help us know.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-09 13:33:47', '2022-11-09 15:10:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106678023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212091', 'Michelle Schusterman', NULL, '11.9.22 - Welcome call completed~ JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-09 13:12:09', '2022-11-09 13:12:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106700008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986127', 'Alfons Reinig', NULL, '11-9-22 Alfons is in Costa Rica near Tamarindo at the moment on vacation until Dec. 3rd. He has Bright Health, 60, self-employed and PT W2 and possible small subsidy the past 2 years. He''s a Big Wave Lead and interested in MCS as well. He couldn''t get logged into C4. I sent him instructions to select me as his Broker and I sent him the MCS video. He''s not readily available via phone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-09 12:25:07', '2022-11-09 12:25:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106704003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054188', 'Chris Larson', NULL, 'I believe it was Susan and if not then it was Chris, who reached out to me via SalesIQ after I greeted them upon popping up on the website. They responded back saying they spoke to Jeff on the phone about cancelling their plan with us and that Jeff told them to find the Cancellation form on our website. They stated they could not find it and needed some help. I told them that I could send them the cancellation link to click, and it will bring them straight to the Cancellation Cognito form to fill out via email. I asked for the primary members first and last name to pull up their account here in the CRM, after I find them, I will send them the Cancellation link email template, and I will message them as soon as I click send. I confirmed their email address, everything was correct, sent the email and let them know I sent it. The confirmed they got it, so everything is all set. Lastly, I let them know after they fill it out to sign and click submit, the form will go to Patti Baron who handles billing, enrollment, and cancellations. I will tell her to be on the lookout, after Patti cancels everything out, an email will be sent to Chris & Susan confirming so. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-11-09 12:17:14', '2022-11-09 12:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106631093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082602001', 'Maria Quezada', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation after speaking with Diane.  Receiving Employer Coverage.  I will cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-09 11:54:13', '2022-11-09 11:54:13'),
