  ('zcrm_1579374000106678013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104973012', 'Lynne Howard', NULL, '11.9.22 - Lynne Howard called in because she submitted a change of address form but accidentally entered herself as a new spouse on the form. She just wanted me to let Patti Baron know that she does not have a new spouse with her same name. Sent Patti a Teams message with this info. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-09 09:31:05', '2022-11-09 09:31:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106678008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '11.9.22 - Jerry called because he is trying to get a flu shot but none of the in-network providers in his area will just give him a vaccine without being an established patient. I am going to see if Zion will cover Lori''s flu vaccine since her oncologist will give it to her in his office. I am also going to speak with Ashlee Williams tomorrow to see if there is another option for Jerry. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-09 09:29:04', '2022-11-09 09:29:04'),
