  ('zcrm_1579374000106656003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106618002', 'Simon Dullingham', NULL, 'Received an email from Simon, he completed and submitted the enrollment, but needed to change the start date from Dec 1, 2022 to Jan 1, 2023. I informed Patti, change was made. I sent an email  letting Simon know the change was made. I cc''d Leo.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-09 08:03:20', '2022-11-09 08:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106631003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088430002', 'David Schmidgall', NULL, 'Member contacted me via email and requested cancellation.  I responded to him and told him to speak with Christine &amp; copied her on the email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-09 07:20:46', '2022-11-09 07:20:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106540023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078485100', 'Jeanne Klimowski', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2435 Question : Hello, I have a policy with you that I''ve never used, but just notice that the premium took a big jump 2 months ago with zero notice. Since notice should be required I assume it is a mistake? I need someone to fix this. Also I never received login info for your site and when I try to login I get an error code....so please contact me by email. Thank you.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-11-08 21:03:33', '2022-11-08 21:03:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106594018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, '11-8-2022:  Catherine called back.  The doc does see spurs & no cartilage, so they are looking at knee replacement surgery.  The docs off is curr pricing up everything for her since she''s a ''cash-pay'' pt & think they will have that for her this week.  I sent her the temp for sub a ''med need'' to Zion and we walked thru the entire process.  She will probably wait until early next week to sub the need so she has the pricing from above, so she doesn''t confuse the doc''s off should Zion call them prior to the ''cash-pay'' pricing being ready.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-08 18:15:10', '2022-11-09 13:35:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106594013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105087002', 'Paul Snyder', NULL, '11-8-2022:  Romy called - she wanted to conf how to present should they have an emergency or something outside the ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative care ONLY.  Went over ''cash-pay'' to her $2500 IUA, ask for disc, get det inv & receipt, deadline, etc.  She said she was told to keep all her receipts in a file to sub all at once, like she did w/Liberty, during her ''Welcome Call''.  We talked about how the Zion IUA is diff than the old AUA from Liberty, 3 of them (which she seemed to understand now, but orig it seemed like she was confused).  I think she understood at the end, but can tell the chg from an AUA to an IUA may take a bit.  I made sure she knows of the deadline & went over our getting a ''med need'' going - to call us once she''s a few days past so we can discuss.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-08 18:14:59', '2022-11-08 23:16:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106555033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107986163', 'Sylvie Bloch', NULL, '11-8-22 We looked at MCS and Cigna Connect Flex $0 Bronze $798.81 or Friday Bronze Copay + Vision Exam $626.22. He watched the video and will discuss all options with Sylvie. He thinks he wants Cigna over Friday, but is still pondering MCS since she''s healthy and it''s way more economical. But, he''s nervous about something new.  He really wanted to understand EPO and if they Must go to PCP for referral. But, it''s not clear from what I''ve learned over the years. It''s more recommended but not required. He will call Cigna and ask and find out if his wife''s drs. are in the network. He''ll call me in the next few days to finalize.  Appreciated my time and wants to make sure I get paid. :-)  Thought he could do it on his own at first and thought it would only take 5 minutes, not 45 min. plus another call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-08 16:21:37', '2022-11-08 16:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106602023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '11.8.22 - Walked Kristen through how to sign up for WHLC. She does not have any patience when she is being instructed on how to do something. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-08 14:29:48', '2022-11-08 14:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106555023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '11-8-22 Kristen called to find out about upgrading to SECURE to remove the network limitations. She just did her pap and some blood work. But, she still needs to do her mammogram and possibly a colonoscopy in the near future. She will wait until Jan. 1st for the RBP model with SECURE. She can easily hold off until then for her mammogram. She was never contacted by MPB Concierge Team on the WHLC platform was fixed. So, I told her to call them now and they will help her to login and review the discounts for chiro, acupuncture and any other natural healing modalities.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-08 14:14:54', '2022-11-08 14:14:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106597048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919652', 'Chris Nielsen', 'New Plan eff 12/1/22', 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-08 14:06:19', '2022-11-08 14:06:19'),
