  ('zcrm_1579374000106602018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102816002', 'Buffy Lloyd-Krejci', NULL, '11.8.22 - Welcome call completed! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-08 13:15:31', '2022-11-08 13:15:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106594008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212091', 'Michelle Schusterman', NULL, '11-8-2022:  Michelle called asking about a list of doc for Zion.  She never had her ''Welcome Call'' &amp; said she should be able to get it done in the next day or two.  So, she''ll call back once she''s had that so I can walk her thru how to find a high quality, fair priced PCP.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-08 13:02:42', '2022-11-08 13:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106597038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106578002', 'Howard Schmidt', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-08 12:50:28', '2022-11-08 12:50:28'),
