  ('zcrm_1579374000106602008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496017', 'Asiye Erdilek', NULL, '11.8.22 - Asiye called because she has a script she needs priced. She is asking for Hyroxyzine HCL 75 mg. 90 pills. I could not find 75 mg. as one pill so I did have to send 2 separate coupons: one for 50 mg. and one for 25 mg. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-08 12:28:16', '2022-11-08 12:28:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106597018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106420002', 'Dianna Bush', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-08 12:23:05', '2022-11-08 12:23:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106602003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, '11.8.22 - Ryan called because he is attempting to use his CirrusMD services but was unable to log in. I sent CirrusMD support an email on behalf of Ryan and tagged Ryan in it so that he can get assistance logging in. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-08 12:20:47', '2022-11-08 12:20:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106597013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043541176', 'Megan Bush', NULL, 'Member has cancelled Sedera plan &amp; re-enrolled in Zion.  Sedera &amp; RCI have been cancelled I will cancel old plan in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-08 12:14:57', '2022-11-08 12:14:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106597008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491714', 'Douglas Bush', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation Sedera &amp; RCI have been notified.  I will cancel billing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-08 12:05:21', '2022-11-08 12:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106597003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756108', 'William Cranney', NULL, 'After speaking with Wendy this member submitted cancellation request.  I have cancelled w/Sedera &amp; RCI and will cancel billing in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-08 11:52:32', '2022-11-08 11:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106594003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100500002', 'Robin Rudy', NULL, '11-8-2022:  Robin is headed to the derm for a skin ck today &amp; wanted to learn how to handle.  She''ll present as ''cash-pay'', ask for a disc, keep all receipts &amp; inv, then let us know if anything comes up in the ck (knows about 6 mo deadline).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-08 11:44:58', '2022-11-08 11:44:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106555018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075870001', 'Paula Peck', NULL, '11-8-22 Anthony and I talked and he already got the payment updated with Patti this morning. They had about 5 days where they had overdrawn the account. It''s all fixed now, but he chose to pay with CC instead and I let him know about the 3% per month processing fee. He was VERY appreciative that I reached him since I couldn''t reach Paula at all. But, he''s been taking care of her account. They definitely want her membership to continue on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-08 10:50:02', '2022-11-08 10:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106507038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571018', 'Randy Sherer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation, I will process &amp; cancel in A123 &amp; CRM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-08 10:45:16', '2022-11-08 10:45:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106555013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756108', 'William Cranney', NULL, '11-4-22 Dale wants to cancel bc he has new employer coverage.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-08 10:44:38', '2022-11-08 10:44:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106555008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '11-8-22 I looked at the account again and it''s showing the new plan for 2023. I put in under Lori Streim in CRM since it will be her own policy in 2023. I told David it all looked good but when we got off the phone it''s still showing plan cancellation date of 11/30/22.  David just called me back and will call them today to rectify the end date and make sure his name is no longer showing up as well. He will keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-08 10:39:46', '2022-11-08 10:39:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064410541', 'Lori Streim', NULL, '11-8-22 Ilyse (Lori) was able to enroll in Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5000 $0 Select Drugs for Individual Deductible$5,000
