  ('zcrm_1579374000106505033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082496002', 'Ryan Murphy', NULL, '11.8.22 - Ryan called to verify how he presents himself at his preventative colonoscopy. His wife already verified that everything is in the network so we went over presenting his Planstin card and what happens if it turns into a diagnostic test. Ryan will call if he has anymore questions. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-08 09:36:05', '2022-11-08 09:36:05'),
