  ('zcrm_1579374000106404011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165320', 'Sherry Remick', NULL, '11-7-22 Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5500 for 2022! I don''t see her on my commission sheet. UGH. Reaching out to Cigna now. Her Plan ID is 49375CO0060019-06. Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5500. Acct # 9088117085. Premium $456.51. $385.47 is APTC, her cost is $71.04.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-07 12:20:50', '2022-11-07 12:20:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106324058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '11-7-2022:  Cathy called, she''s been using the ''Spruce'' app & wondered if there is a more up-to-date app.  She''s on Redirect & when I mentioned that she realized she has a ''Redirect'' app, so she''ll assume that is the one.
     Her call was difficult because she was doing something in the background that kept overriding her voice.  Then she kept referring to her "Rep" in Ft Collins.  So, it took me a bit to get to the right file as she introduces herself as: Cathy Young & we do have another member w/that name under Kathy Young.  Hopefully, in the future, she will realize it helps us find her info if she lets us know it''s under Catherine.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-07 12:08:19', '2022-11-07 12:09:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106404006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '11-7-22 She got Sedera''s conversion email and wanted to understand what that''s about. I explained why and that she will be receiving many more communications about the changes and what to do. She''s struggling with Redirect but still using Spruce app which I think it the old one. So, I told her to call the MPB Concierge Team to help with that. She will. She paid cash for wellness visit and then got a radiology bill later as well that she needs to be reimbursed for. I told her if she still has trouble getting reimbursed to let me know and I''ll reach out to my contact. She will. It looks like her price is going down to $836.28 but I told her I wasn''t confident in that since it''s a decline. The correct price will be sent in an email soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-07 12:01:11', '2022-11-07 12:01:11'),
