  ('zcrm_1579374000106369008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089109010', 'Rick Sanders', NULL, '11.7.22 - Rick called because he did not receive my email regarding the EKG his doc is requiring him to have for his colonoscopy. I advised Rick that this would be an out of pocket expense to him as it is not part of the preventative care services. Rick did not realize that he had to stick with an in-network provider for his colonoscopy, so I am sending him a list in his area of in-network providers. I will also be requesting a new MPB membership card as well. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-07 09:09:28', '2022-11-07 09:11:24'),
