  ('zcrm_1579374000106289046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286167', 'Catherine McGee', NULL, '11-4-2022:  Catherine called.  This last month her knee has been bothering her.  She had an x-ray &amp; there are spurs on her knee.  She wanted to know what the next steps are because she''s planning to see a specialist next Tues.  She''s going to see what happens Tues, &amp; will prob call to get help sub a ''med need''.  She knows to present as ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA, ask for a discount &amp; have the detailed inv &amp; receipts ready when she calls.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 19:37:35', '2022-11-04 19:44:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106308023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '11-04-22 I looked at Lori Streim''s account and it''s showing the plan is slated to be cancelled on 11/30/22 which is NOT what David asked for. He''s asking for him to be removed only and for Lori to remain on the plan moving forward. I told him to get the time, date, person and tkt # to track his call when he calls them on Monday to resolve and keep their plan active for Dec. 2022. He will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-04 16:46:12', '2022-11-04 16:46:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106289041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000070370117', 'James Batch', NULL, '11-4-2022:  James called.  He had hernia surgery recently &amp; then complication &amp; wondered how to sub a need (I did let him know of the deadline, but he just had the surgery about a week or two ago).  Sent him the temp &amp; walked him thru the process.  He''ll get it sent right away.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 16:42:36', '2022-11-04 16:42:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106309036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100614035', 'Judy Doherty', NULL, '11-4-22 Judy was able to make her payment finally with Don in IT still helping her. She logged into Cigna and made the payment at the correct amount. But, her account is still not showing accurately on the C4 site yet. They are still working to correct it. She thinks she connected with him via the Feedback button on the site somewhere. She''s had direct line of communication with him which has been super helpful! She chose the same Cigna Connect Flex Gold 2250 for Jan. 1st 2023. I told her to make sure to call in 7-10 business days to set up her payment again, just to be safe! She will. Her plan in 2023 is $823.04 with APTC of $285.19 and her cost $537.85.  She all set for now and hoping 2022 will continue to be corrected. She just wants to be protected in case something bad happens.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-04 16:15:36', '2022-11-04 16:15:36'),
