  ('zcrm_1579374000106289036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092335002', 'Sharon Kolodney', NULL, '11-4-2022:  Sharon called, she''s going to resched.  She got off work late &amp; was very apologetic.      - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 14:07:56', '2022-11-04 14:07:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106248071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation them Wendy reached out to him.  He is on an Employer plan.  I will notify Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-04 13:46:27', '2022-11-04 13:46:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106308013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '11-4-22 Julie is completing the conversion now and I had previously given her the new pricing. She will likely cancel for Jan. 1st 2023 bc will have new employer coverage that pays for everything including the deductible. I told her to make sure she submits everything for the need immediately and closes it out as best as possible before cancelling. She will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-04 13:45:26', '2022-11-04 13:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106268013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105142001', 'David Peel', NULL, '11.4.22 - Welcome call completed~ JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-04 13:43:28', '2022-11-04 13:43:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106308008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, '11-4-22 James got a new job with benefits that started about Oct. 17th. He knows he paid through the month and he''s not worried about it. He''s not looking for a refund. He was super nice and will call me if he needs anything down the road.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-04 13:38:13', '2022-11-04 13:38:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106308003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063253037', 'Bobbi Georgeton', NULL, '11-3-22 Bobbi wants to stick with Cigna so I pushed through her auto renewal. Price is going up a bit for just the two of them. Cigna Connect Flex Gold 900 Rx Copay $1561.70 with APTC of  $80.36 and her cost is $1,481.34/mo. All set for 2023. Super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-04 13:15:40', '2022-11-04 13:15:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106289028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, '11-4-2022:  James called.  He now has employer provided benefits &amp; needed to cancel.  (They tried to get the employer to allow them to keep MPB w/Sedera &amp; were told that wasn''t an available option.)  Since he''s cancelling due to having other provided benefits, I showed him the CE Form, then sent Wendy a Teams chat w/what I did (rather than having her tt him).  Hopefully, that''s ok.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 13:11:36', '2022-11-04 13:11:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106268008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092335002', 'Sharon Kolodney', NULL, '11.4.22 - Attempted to do Sharon''s welcome call but there was no answer. I left her a vm and sent another welcome call scheduler via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-04 13:07:32', '2022-11-04 13:07:32'),
