  ('zcrm_1579374000106289023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078316052', 'Cary Jerdine', NULL, '11-3-2022:  RX Quote Info - sent the following to both of his e-mail addresses per his req = cjerdine3@gmail.com & cjerdine@yahoo.com:
     - Nifedipine ER 90mg tabs, #90 = $24.58 at Jewel-Osco on RXSaver
