  ('zcrm_1579374000106248053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098380002', 'Elaine Reynolds', NULL, 'Spouse will be aging into Medicare eff 1/1/2023.  1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor - 11/4 (sent via outlook)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-04 12:53:07', '2022-11-04 12:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106289018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104048', 'Lori Goldman', NULL, '11-4-2022:  Lori called about sub a ''med need'' for a cardiac type event she''s been going thru since Sept.  They''ve tested her for many things & even thought it might be sleep apnea related, which it turns out it is not.  (I mentioned sleep apnea is NOT a shareable item.  She can include those receipts, however, the may not include them.  She seemed ok w/that.)  Sent her the temp & pointed out Zion''s ph #.  She was not easy to engage, kept getting ahead of me, didn''t seem to hear me, kept talking over me, and then would ask the same question I just answered.  I think we have her set, but if she remembers nothing I won''t be surprised.  I pointed out Zion''s ph # in the e-mail when we opened it together saying "I want to make sure you see Zion''s ph # here"...  Then at the end of the call 5 minutes later, she asked how she gets Zion''s ph #.  I tried.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 12:42:59', '2022-11-04 12:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106248048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077866084', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, 'Spouse will be aging into Medicare eff 1/1/23.  1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-04 12:41:12', '2022-11-04 12:41:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106248043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077866084', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, 'Member''s spouse will be aging out of plan eff 1/1/23.  I will send 1st notice to member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-04 12:36:24', '2022-11-04 12:36:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106248038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, 'Member was transferred to me to talk about adjusting his IUA in light of price increase.  I explained the 3 IUA rule and gave him pricing for the $2500 &amp; $5k memberships.  Member decided to go with the $2500 and will submit the Change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-11-04 12:33:52', '2022-11-04 12:33:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106289013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939033', 'Tal Diamant', NULL, '11-4-2022:  Tal called wanting to increase his IUA.  We got online together &amp; he''s got the chg form up.  He has questions about pricing.  To make sure he get accurate info, I trans him to Patti.  He''ll LM if she can''t answer.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 12:27:20', '2022-11-04 12:27:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106262023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100463001', 'Teresa McMahon', NULL, 'Tried to reach Teresa, she has Google assistant on her phone, wouldn''t put the call through. Try again', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-11-04 12:15:12', '2022-11-04 12:15:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106289008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '11-4-2022:  Carolyn called upset she doesn''t know if "we" are paying for her emerg surgery Monday. 
That "we" haven''t told her anything.  We did a little education re: diff components & what we can help with.  Plus she was upset she''s never rec''d an ins card (we disc why & how to present.  & went over ''Planstin = Preventative Care ONLY''.  Then I asked about Zion.   She "thinks" she signed the HIPPA release form, so I told her that''s great because it means it is in process.  Then, I made sure she has Zion''s ph # and trans her to them, telling her to tt the ''med need'' dept (#5 in the menu).  She''ll call back if she needs further guidance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 11:21:14', '2022-11-04 11:21:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106262018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105145002', 'Jack Gilliland', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-11-04 11:16:44', '2022-11-04 11:16:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106289003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098027002', 'Melinda Ferris', NULL, '11-4-2022:  Melinda had a few questions:
     - She headed into the derm office to have a back piercing she''s had for ~10 yrs, but they are having to do a small surgical procedure to remove it.  It sounds like it will be <1k, but I told her if it is not, we can try sub a ''med need'' to see if they''d share in something like that.  I warned her that I''m unsure if it will be shareable, but it cannot hurt to try.
     - IUD:  She has an IUD she got about a year ago & it''s causing her lots of trouble.  We talked about having it rem''d and going to another form of bc.  She will call when she has time and we can go over all the guidelines for her ''prev care''.  Once we do that, I sugg she conf w/Planstin, but that I thought they might include this as part of that healthcare benefit.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-04 10:57:45', '2022-11-04 10:57:45'),
