  ('zcrm_1579374000106207067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504120', 'William Madsen', NULL, '11-3-2022:  Sophia needs to have an MRI &amp; the place they''ve chosen is requiring a referral.  Wendy asked me to tt her mother Deborah, but Deborah said they are working to get the referral &amp; seemed to have it all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-03 20:35:21', '2022-11-03 20:35:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106207050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081352008', 'Daniel McMillan', NULL, '11-3-2022:  Dan called.  He just spoke to CirrusMD doc who sugg he try accupuncture for neck pain.  He wasn''t at a computer, but I walked him thru how to get to WHLC, register, & what to look for.  He''s curr staying in Breck @ his girl friend''s & there were 2 accup up there, but ~10 near his place in Bldr = 10-20% discounts.  He wondered if this would be cov on his healthsharing.  I told him alternative treatments need to be part of a larger need & pre-approved.
     - He may find a PCP or specialist first because he thinks it''s getting worse.  I mentioned his post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail & how to find HCBB info to get ratings, etc, while shopping for a doc.  Then, we can sub a ''med need'' (mentioned he has a 1k IUA he''s resp for first).  Did not go into details/deadlines!
     - If he decides to look for a PCP, mentioned he could start a relationship w/an in ntwk doc for when he''s ready to have his ''prev care'' done & instructed him how to find the ntwk search in the e-mail.  Was clear for his neck pain no ntwk is req''d though.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-03 17:44:10', '2022-11-03 17:45:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106202011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695264', 'Lorie Moreno-Roch', NULL, '11-3-22 "Hi Wendy,

Lorie Moreno Roch here.

We need to sign up for a new insurance plan for 2023. Our plan with Anthem BC/BS is being discontinued.

Steve would still like to be able to see his Cardiologist. Dr. Barbara Abrahams. She is with CU Health.

Thank you,
Lorie"

I did a search for Dr. Abrahams and it''s showing Anthem and Friday Health as the only carriers that accepts this doctor. I told Lorie to call the doctor''s office to double check that''s true going into 2023. Then we can pick a plan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-03 16:52:30', '2022-11-03 16:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106207045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '11-3-2022:  Michael called.  He said we were asking for an IPN # &amp; started discussing his ColoGuard test.  It sounds like Planstin was working w/him.  I explained they administer that component &amp; would be able to help answer his question about how soon would they then pay for a colonoscopy (annually, or? - when does the availability reset).  Made sure he has their # &amp; trans him to Planstin.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-03 16:50:01', '2022-11-03 20:38:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106167052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106218014', 'Alexander Tocco', NULL, '11-3-22 Alexander enrolled in Cigna Connect Colorado Option Silver for $357.27 with APTC of $322.61.  His cost is $34.66. He''s still having gastro issues and is supposed to follow up with Dr. Nathan Jeremy Susnow in a week. He may wait until his insurance starts. But, he might also get approved for Medicaid for the rest of the year.  When he submitted his application to Medicaid he has a $300 paystub and another small amount, not the $1201.22. So, he may be approved and can make use of that for Nov and Dec. Then Jan. we are showing a $22K income as best  guess. Annualized it looks like $31,231.72 but he takes time off and doesn''t get full hours all of the time. She''s we completed his app for 2023 and he knows to call Cigna to make his payment in about 10 days.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-03 16:21:04', '2022-11-03 16:21:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106207040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060583361', 'Renee Rowe', NULL, '11-3-2022:  Renee called;
     - Had a great experience w/Zion recently with her surgery.  The hosp/surg/providers were req pymt immed & Zion stepped-up & got it done is quick order!  She''s thrilled.  I asked if she''d be interested in doing a video for the newsletter.  She''ll think about it (her daughter may help her).
     - Her doc is calling in the order for a bone density test.  She wasn''t at a computer so we went over what the fair price in her area = $110 & which facilities near her are fair priced vs the high priced facilities.  She''s going to call around, but seemed to appreciate the help.
     - She mentioned a prescription, so I sent over the following:
               Anastrozole 1mg tab, #90 = $14.52 at Meijer on RXGo which was considerably cheaper than all the other sites.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-11-03 16:05:25', '2022-11-04 13:13:31'),
