  ('zcrm_1579374000106146003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '11.03.22:  Recvd. email from Liz.  Doesn''t want to go w/HMA, as they saw poor reviews about the program due to refusal to reimburse. (?)  She checked Zion''s plans and found that for a M&F in the 50-64 age range, both the Essentials (DPC) plan ($650 @ $1000 IUA) and the Zion DIRECT plan ($790 @ $1000 IUA)  is cheaper than our DIRECT plan ($860 @ $1000 IUA).  She thinks we made a mistake in our price!  
