  ('zcrm_1579374000106004066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101128002', 'Christine Altamuro', NULL, '11.2.22 - Christine called because she is in the Virgin Islands visiting a friend and needs chiropractic care. I explained the self-pay process but she doesn''t believe she''ll have to open a Need for her back injury so she will just pay out of pocket for everything. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-02 07:37:15', '2022-11-02 07:37:15'),
