  ('zcrm_1579374000105988124', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104633001', 'Cathy Gibbons', NULL, '11-1-2022:  Cathy called.  She hasn''t had her ''Welcome Call'', but needed to get her ''prev'' going.  We talked all details around ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev ONLY.  She lives in TX & is dealing with an office that gives almost no discount to ''cash-pay'' pts, so she may see if putting it thru Planstin for ntwk disc  is better, but she knows once that happens we cannot undo that & their price = the amt req''d for pymt. 
     She has very dense breasts and wanted to know if both a mamm & the accompanying ultra sound would be covered.  I''m having her call Planstin since they determine what is & is not part of the plan.  Her Mom had breast cancer, but she''s never experienced any issues.
     - Briefly went over presenting as ''cash-pay'' for non-prev items, but told her this, her cards & what they are for, etc., will all be something they go over in the ''Welcome Call''.
