  ('zcrm_1579374000106018064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060163125', 'Sharon Linnebur', NULL, '11-1-22 Called to see if there''s a way to lower her cost since she hasn''t used her membership at all. I shared the price for the $2500 IUA and she realizes that doesn''t make sense. She also asked about the debt solution and she''s interested in learning more bc she has about $18K in credit card debt and she''s really not making much progress on it. I explained it will take 3-4 years and damage then repair credit. She has been just moving the balances to new 0% cards or low rates but she''s really not making any progress on them and at this rate it will take forever. Next appt we can call the debt 877-676-9375.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-01 16:39:35', '2022-11-01 16:39:35'),
