  ('zcrm_1579374000105988086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080095009', 'Robert Martines', NULL, '11.1.22 - Robert called about a Dexa scan for himself. We found an imaging center near him and we went over the self-pay process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-01 09:36:33', '2022-11-01 09:36:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000106018018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083756038', 'Lisa Birkhofer', NULL, '11-1-22 She will need to make a change to her plan since Oscar''s leaving state. So, I sent her a time to possibly talk. She thinks her income might be $15K this year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-01 09:18:02', '2022-11-01 09:20:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105988081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105234001', 'Brianna Krampetz', NULL, '11.1.22 - Brianna called in with MANY questions regarding her plan. She doesn''t quite understand how to use her benefits so we went over quite a few things. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-01 09:17:25', '2022-11-01 09:17:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105988076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090502002', 'Rita Pate', NULL, '11.1.22 - Rita called wanting to know about other options for plans that include preventative care. We spoke briefly about Secure and Direct, I advised her to speak with Mike Montes more about these 2 plans. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-11-01 09:06:27', '2022-11-01 09:06:27'),
