  ('zcrm_1579374000106018013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715135', 'Sylvia Theisen', NULL, '11-1-22 Talked with Sylvia and helped her access the form online to update her payment which she''s doing right now. I let her know about the cc fee and she will choose ACH instead.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-11-01 08:56:08', '2022-11-01 08:56:08'),
