  ('zcrm_1579374000105988029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522022', 'Matthew DePofi', NULL, '10-31-2022:  Matthew DePofi called extremely agitated re: a wrong address.  He''s worried his bills aren''t being paid because we didn''t have the correct address & we screwed-up because he fixed that.  But both the CRM & Admin123 look correct.  I don''t see any note(s) we updated it recently.  In looking at prev comments, his aggresive, unfriendly, upset behavior seems the norm - he''s very angry, frustrated, and really not very nice.
     - He''s sure the address is our issue because he rec''d an e-mail from Kelly F regarding a bunch of mail for him?  Sent Kelly F a Teams chat: "Maybe we can talk tomorrow so I know what mail we have.  I''m trying to figure out what''s going on.
     - In his mind the unpaid bills he is receiving for his colonoscopy are because we have the wrong address & he''s about to go to Collections.   I''m assuming you corrected for him?) have nothing to do with each other.  So, talking to RCI tomorrow is on my list as well.  They were already closed tonight.]
     - Matthew does NOT understand this plan, the different components, who is responsible, and is very angry.  Without his help, this plan is difficult.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 20:19:13', '2022-10-31 20:21:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105988021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132196', 'Laura Lee Pier', NULL, 'Today, she said best ph #: 209-431-9976

10-31-22: Laura Lee called. Hasn''t seen any pymt go thru & is super concerned about it. Trans her to Patti''s line to LM. - CA

She also wanted to talk about a lot of other items:
     Laura Lee is frustrated because she has our healthcare & "nothing gets pd for."
     - Her doc''s off cannot seem to handle having the ''Planstin Prev Care ONLY'' card.  They tell her "you either have ins or you don''t" & do not work with her on NOT billing her other items or working w/her on ''cash-pay   After talking, we disc getting another doc for her ''prev care'', maybe a gynocologist & having both.
     - She''s corn, gluten, etc, sensitive & has to have her RXs compounded for her, so we of course do not have a good source.  I told her I''ve seen a source in TX that specializes in compounded prescriptions & they offer decent prices - maybe an option?  Let her know how our prescription price quotes work.
     - She was under the impression that her hashimotos thyroiditis was pre-x & she had to wait  a full 2 years for any sharing.  I called Zion & conf, to see if anything for this condition is shareable, she just needs to sub a ''need''.  Curr she already has the 25k & after her anniv: 2/1/23 that will inc to 50k.  ILM for her re: this & asked her to call us so we can help her learn how to sub a ''med need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 19:45:09', '2022-10-31 20:10:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105988016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089152002', 'Patrick McLaren', NULL, '10/31/2022:  LM for Patrick on how to cancel at: 954-961-6072.  Re-fwd''d the e-mail for his aging into Medicare from my notification.  Let him know his wife must re-apply if she wishes to cont no later thatn 15th of Nov!  Asked him to plez call my off #.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 18:18:19', '2022-10-31 18:18:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105988008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056556027', 'Rikki Mor', NULL, '10-31-2022:  Rikki called asking about  going down to the 1k IUA for the price diff.  It''s an old plan so I helped her fill out Patti''s Chg form &amp; sent Patti a Teams chat because I realized after Rikki submitted the form that the first poss eff date is 12/1/22 (not 11/1/22) but Rikki knows that.  I let her know Patti would have to conf the price diff &amp; that there is a 60-day wait for the new IUA on new issues past the wait.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 17:54:04', '2022-10-31 18:11:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105988003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104640002', 'Jenna Sampaio', NULL, '10-31-2022:  To Vanessa via Teams Chat:  "Hi Vanessa,  Jenna Sampaio called trying to sched her ''Welcome Call'' for Wed, saying she was having trouble.  We got her sched &amp; when I looked at your Wed calendar, she was on there twice!  She would like to KEEP the LATER appointment, which if I''m converting properly is 1pm your time."', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 17:41:14', '2022-10-31 17:41:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105946008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062132196', 'Laura Lee Pier', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she hadn''t been charged for 11/1 share amount.  I realized that she also hadn''t been charged for 9/22 as well.  She had a change f routing #.  I reran.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-31 16:44:00', '2022-10-31 16:44:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090966002', 'Angela Bryan', NULL, '10.31.22 - Angela called and requested to be transferred to the MAP program. I sent her the email and direct transferred her via phone. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-31 14:00:07', '2022-10-31 14:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105930025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '10-31-2022:  Terri from MAP called to confirm Sara is a member (they couldn''t find her).  Let Terri know she''s on Paul''s memb &amp; active.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 13:42:59', '2022-10-31 13:42:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105930014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103567009', 'Melissa McDowell', NULL, '10-31-2022:  Terry started a need (last week he thinks?) &amp; has already signed the HIPPA form.  The surgeon for his knee is asking about ''ins'', so I made sure he has Zion''s ph # &amp; trans him directly.  He''ll go to the ''med need'' dept to see if they can help guide him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 13:33:31', '2022-10-31 13:33:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105874131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100614035', 'Judy Doherty', NULL, '10-31-22 Talked with Judy bc I rec''d cancellation notice form Cigna for non payment. But, she''s still working with C4 to get their site and information they are passing on to Cigna corrected. She''s getting billed for double or for no APTC and she can''t afford it! So, she submitted a complaint on C4''s site and got a quick response from the IT team who is still helping her. She will get back on this and pressure them and upload her proof of SEP yet again. It''s not showing up on their end even though she submitted initially.  She was super appreciative of my call and will press on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-31 13:17:38', '2022-10-31 13:17:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105856084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093898002', 'Matthew Hoit', NULL, 'Member submitted PU for I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-31 13:08:41', '2022-10-31 13:08:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105856079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098605011', 'Matthew Walker', NULL, 'Address updated per Change request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-31 13:06:09', '2022-10-31 13:06:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105815257', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105971010', 'Laura Claire', NULL, 'theya tooka my deal ?', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-31 12:57:42', '2022-11-01 12:36:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105930008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081762001', 'Michael Gaffey', NULL, '10-31-2022:  After Renee got Covid, she started having odd symptoms (June-ish?, she''ll ck date).  After sending her to a variety of doctors, they''ve determined she has a rare blood disorder diagnosis: Mass Cell (It''s something about the while blood cells & I couldn''t quite tell what she was saying was the name of the disorder).  There are only a few specialists in the country & the closest to her is in NY.  But, because she has hydrocephalus, she  has a neurosurgeon in TX the curr plan is for her to see that doc since they knew her before the current issues.
     - I sent her the temp for sub a ''med need'' Zion & we went over the details of how to handle.  Due to her diagnosis, she has concerns that they''ll think it''s diff issues.  Told her to include explanation in the submissi, submit all paperwork towards a sngl issue, then if nec her neurosurgeon (or even the NY specialist down the road) can write a letter she can submit (as an appeal or prev) if needed.
     - They are prescribing things for her quite often, so I went over our RX Quote service.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 12:55:59', '2022-11-02 17:01:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881022', 'Carolyn Tabak', NULL, '10.31.22 - Carolyn called in to verify that she does not have to be in-network for an orthopedic walk-in clinic she needs to be seen at for a broken bone(s) in her hand. We went over the self-pay process and that she does not need to present any type of card for this visit. I also advised that if Carolyn needs to open a medical need with Zion to give us a call and we would walk her through doing so. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-31 12:40:35', '2022-10-31 12:40:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093328002', 'Craig Anderson', NULL, '10.31.22 - Craig called regarding using MAP services. I sent him the email template but I also transferred him directly to the MAP program per his request. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-31 12:14:40', '2022-10-31 12:14:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105915018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, 'I spoke to Ernest, we went over all his stats, he''s fine. He can maintain his plan with us. He also has a Blue Cross plan in addition to his Secure Plan with us.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-31 12:09:02', '2022-10-31 12:09:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062929191', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, '10.31.22 - Jerry called in because Lori now has a mass on her spine from her breast cancer. He wanted to make sure that he could talk to Zion about some scripts that Lori needs filled that pertains to her treatment and I assured him that his Needs coordinator, Alyah, will be happy to assist him with this item. He is very thankful to have Zion and MPB Health in their corner. I told Jerry to give us a call anytime he needs anything. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-31 11:56:37', '2022-10-31 11:56:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105890149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101118002', 'David Cavazos', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-31 11:24:41', '2022-10-31 11:24:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105890144', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101193002', 'Cheri Nichols', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-31 11:21:25', '2022-10-31 11:21:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105890139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101203001', 'KERRY SAYLES', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-31 11:18:24', '2022-10-31 11:18:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105890134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000101333010', 'Christapher Cogswell', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-31 11:10:21', '2022-10-31 11:10:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105930003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080864013', 'Marian Townsend', NULL, '10-31-2022:  Marian called very frustrated.  She''s called ''JC'' = her advisor Jill Clark multiple times and gets no response.   She''s feeling like JC sold her something that is not useable near them in Durango.  I looked up various things together online (PHCS, HCBB, etc.) and she took a ton of notes.  Her curr doc used to do colonoscopies & she thought she had no good options.  Her friend had a colonoscopy at the hosp we show as in ntwk, they ripped her colon, & now that friend has issues, so she''s very concerned.  We found one doc in particular & she''s going to look into because he might be a good option: Todd A Sheer (it looks like father & son are at this hops, but I only see the father listed in PHCS).  I think our finding options for her near her really helped.  There are not a lot, but she how knows how to proceed.  We talked a ton of details too. She was very grateful for the help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-31 10:51:37', '2022-11-02 17:51:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '10.31.22 - Sara called regarding chosing a MAP program therapist. I got her over to the MAP program so that they could get her set up with the therapist that she chose from their list. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-31 09:48:30', '2022-10-31 09:48:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105856068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, 'After Jeffery left a number of VMs I will go ahead and cancel this member due to Pre-Ex issues.  I will cancel in A123. UPDATE Jeffery able to save member I will reinstate.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-31 09:34:38', '2022-10-31 11:49:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076016', 'Mark Caprio', NULL, '10.31.22 - Mark called because he had some issues from his recent surgery and had to be seen in the ER this weekend. Mark did everything correctly and even called Zion to inform them that he would have more bills to submit for his surgical need. Mark is an exemplary member. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-31 09:23:38', '2022-10-31 09:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105856060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442408', 'Jacquelynn Mariest', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-31 09:16:04', '2022-10-31 09:16:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105915013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088568002', 'Thomas Parsons', NULL, 'I received the notice from Vanessa. I reached out to Jeff Kanter to introduce myself and ask him how he wants to proceed with contacting this member. I left a message on Jeff''s voicemail to call me.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-31 09:12:21', '2022-10-31 09:12:21'),
