  ('zcrm_1579374000105863038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '10.28.22:  Called Lisa.  Answered all the questions she had about her HSA and taxes (see 10.26.22 notes below).  Apprised her of our error in not charging her the $50 surcharge for smoking when we changed their monthly fee.  She was fine with the additional fee.  I told her I would let her know when I heard back from the admin. team on their decision how to handle this error.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-28 13:54:02', '2022-10-28 13:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105913027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221180', 'Lisa Watson', NULL, '10-28-2022:  Lisa called.  She hasn''t been using her healthcare & had a ton of questions.  In her mind when she had to revamp her Sedera, she thought her plan completely chg''d:
     - Started w/explaining the Sedera chg was for financial compliance, but her healthcare option remains the same.
     - She started by calling Sedera & asking them questions about ''prev care''.  So we discussed, best to start w/us & why.
     - I helped her login to her MPB.Health memb portal & we went over what is there.  She wanted to confirm her payment info.
     - Went over what''s avail on the ''Memb Updates'' link:  RX Quotes, chg address, chg to your plan, etc.
     - Went over everything RCI:  Sent her prev care temp & walked thru to find her NP: Stephanie Santos, always confirm, all entities must be in ntwk, doc off must bill, etc.  She thinks she threw out her RCI card when she thought her plan had completely chg''d.  She was open to requesting the new card on her own, so I made sure she has RCI''s ph # & trans her there.
     - We quickly discussed how to present in case of emerg or for non-preventative: ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA, keep receipts, if qual issue call us & we''ll help her sub a ''need'', talked about deadline too.
     - Encouraged her to use us as a first stop so we can help her utilize this properly. 
     She was very nice - she does medical billing, so I think she will eventually know how to use this.  She mentioned she hasn''t been using it so she was thinking of switching back to trad ins.  When we got done, I think things were better.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-28 13:37:41', '2022-10-28 13:46:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105915008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937155', 'Edwin Horney', NULL, 'Spoke to Wiley Long. He informed me that this member was opened by Misty Berryman. I called her directly and left a message for her to call me back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-28 13:02:14', '2022-10-28 13:02:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105912008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904073', 'Andrew Culbertson', NULL, '10.28.22 - April and Andrew called in because the facility she chose to have her preventative colonoscopy done at and the provider told her they were in network. When April went for her consultation, the office staff told her that she would have to pay out of pocket because they do not bill insurance (??). I warm transferred April over to RCI to see if they could assist with prepayment for this colonoscopy. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-28 12:37:02', '2022-10-28 12:37:02'),
