  ('zcrm_1579374000105913013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '10-28-2022:  Jessica Schneck from Mazz & Sull LM w/Back Off Betties.  I called & spoke to her for details.  She LM at about 6am CA time for John on both #s in this file & has not heard back.  I went over details from our end, even reminding her he''s in CA so only 6 visits & about the time difference.  Ethan on their team started a counseling referral on Oct 7th.  Tried to fill her in a bit on what we tell people (sm ntwk, high qual, telehealth can expand list of avail).  She''s going to see what she can find out & will contact John.  Plus she''ll keep me in the loop.    - CA

Jessica called back.  She tt her coworker, & was able to tt John.  According to John, the only close referral (& he wants to see someone in person) was 1 of the couns on the list.  He also says when he called some of the others they had no idea who MSEAP was.  She thinks he''s run into some roadblocks & that''s causing frustration.  She''s going to see what she can find closer to him & they are going to keep us in the loop.  John''s in Passadena & where he wants to see someone in person.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-28 11:09:07', '2022-10-28 11:14:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105913008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093632002', 'Adrian Piazza', NULL, '10-28-2022:  Corinee called.  In July her husb Adrian went to the ER after cutting his hand on a knife.  They just got a bill &amp; she wondered what to do.  I sent her the temp for sub a ''med need'' to Zion &amp; let her know it needs to be done right away because they have a 6mo deadline.  She''s not able to walk thru it with me right now, but will call if she has questions on how to proceed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-28 10:59:19', '2022-10-28 10:59:19'),
