  ('zcrm_1579374000105874116', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102741002', 'Vincent Martinez', NULL, '10-27-2022:  Megan called.  They are running a series of tests because their child thinking seizures are occuring.  The next item is an EKG (I think she said).  We went over how to present as ''cash-pay'', pay to their 1k IUA for this issue, keep receipts, etc.   I sent her the temp to sub a ''med need'' to Zion & went over everything to include.  I mentioned pre-x since their membership just started this mo.  She asked how that works & I showed her the info at the bottom of Zion''s ''med need'' form.  She will call if she needs more assistance.
     - I also mentioned having their ''Welcome Call'' because it will help her understand the components of their healthcare.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-27 19:03:54', '2022-10-27 19:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105903011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079912009', 'Stephen Wetterling', NULL, '10.27.22:  Recvd. an email and phone call from Liz.  Wants information on the SECURE plan.  Called Liz and discussed SECURE.  They aren''t eligible at this time for the HSA as they''re W-2. I mentioned the HMA program and said I''ll look into it and discuss it further with her next Monday or Tuesday.  Since they already have DIRECT, I asked Liz why should they pay extra for a MEC just for the HSA when they could put that extra money toward an HMA.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-27 16:09:24', '2022-10-27 16:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105874111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081460002', 'Hollie Snow', NULL, '10-27-2022:  Hollie called, her husb is at the Urg Care for blood in his urine &amp; pain in the front.  She wanted to conf how to present.  We went over details incl ''cash-pay'' to their 5k IUA, deadline for sub (6mos, but do not wait, let''s get it going sooner), what to do if he''s admitted to the hosp, etc.  She will call so I can walk her thru how to sub a ''med need'' if necessary.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-27 15:37:32', '2022-10-27 15:37:32'),
