  ('zcrm_1579374000105874098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '10-27-2022:  Called Janet &amp; she tt Noa (female) from Zion yesterday re: her ''need(s)''.  She was told the guy who orig denied the ''need'' is no longer w/Zion &amp; to give her (Noa) a few days to gather more info.  The conv gave Janet hope.  She felt like Noa really cared &amp; that meant a lot to her.  She knows we are here to poke &amp; prod again if necessary.  Janet said she''ll let us know how it turns out if nothing else.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-27 12:30:52', '2022-10-27 12:31:19'),
