  ('zcrm_1579374000105901006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '10.27.22:  I called Zion. Spoke w/Noa. Explained situation. She said she spoke w/Janet yesterday. Since Zion is lacking some medical info., they are now trying to procure what they need to come to a determination about Janet''s medical need.  Noa is going to contact their Medical Advocacy dept. to research fairest cash pay pricing for Janet and help her navigate this need.  I asked Noa to inform us of their progress. Noa said Janet seemed to be satisfied with Zion''s efforts on her behalf.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-27 11:41:44', '2022-10-27 11:41:44'),
