  ('zcrm_1579374000105889016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650401', 'Frederic Besch', NULL, '10-27-22 Fred via Kath McGaughey has serious tax debt they are trying to handle before they get married soon. Fred has caught up on filing taxes and now owes about $44K to Fed and $14K to County. Meredith with Debt Specialists has passed them off to Community Tax who are employed by Enrolled Agents, US Tax Attorneys and CPA''s. Community Tax has an A+ rating with BBB. There''s a $325 flat fee to get started if it makes sense for him to move forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-27 10:06:13', '2022-10-27 10:06:13'),
