  ('zcrm_1579374000105874021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104534011', 'Yu Deng', NULL, '10-26-2022:  Jennifer talked w/Ruby right before the end of her shift &amp; asked me to send the following:  Sent PHCS Ntwk lists of prov near her zip 77054 for: gynocologists, mammography center, &amp; radiologists.  Mentioned keeping all entities in ntwk, reconfirming, etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-26 18:08:20', '2022-10-26 18:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105863018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000122049065', 'KC Steury', NULL, '10-26-22 KC has his own shipping and container business which was challenged by covid. It still grew but he had significant delays with the supply chain issues. He also had about 6 months where he couldn''t access used shipping containers and instead had to use new ones at double the cost. So, he had major price increases and delays. He''s on Medicaid now with his family because he only shows $12K income and they rest is plowed back into the business. But, his biz can likely qualify for ERC of up to $46,500,  I entered his email address wrong. So, I''m waiting for that to get fixed and them I will instruct him to read the email that I forwarded and upload the requested docs. Wade says he will only need to show his detailed Payroll and 941 forms for each of the requested quarters to start with. He also said the proof of receipts showing past used containers vs forced new containers should be sufficient to show the supply chain issues. He also had one really terrible month in May 2020 where sales pretty much stopped bc of the supply issues when all containers were sitting on the ships and not getting moved.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-26 17:03:31', '2022-10-26 17:03:31'),
