Direct: 561-621-7099
Concierge Services: 800-519-2969', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-10-26 14:28:55', '2022-10-26 14:28:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105856003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086318002', 'Zachary Weaver', 'Member upset due to Preventative not being paid.', 'Received an email from Traci, the agent that the member was upset because she was responsible for her preventative care visit.  Traci sent copies of the bills to confirm what the member was saying. See attachments.', 'Michele Rebal', 'Michele Rebal', '2022-10-26 14:27:44', '2022-10-26 14:27:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095065002', 'Patti Chambers', NULL, '10.26.22 - Patti called in very frustrated because she has not heard anything back from Zion about her open Medical Need regarding her emergency hernia surgery she had on 10/3/22. Patti stated that she had faxed all of her information to Zion for the open Medical Need and feels that this is a scam because she has not heard anything about the status of her need. I reassured Patti that this is not a scam and that I have not had any issues with Zion in the past paying for ER surgeries. I let Patti vent without interruption for 10+ minutes. I finally let Patti know that I would reach out to Zion to see if they would speak with me about the status of her need. I called Zion and Kate stated that they did receive all of her faxed documents and that there were a few things that they needed to go over with Patti. I called Patti back, gave her Zion''s number and directly transferred her over so she could speak with Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-26 14:14:36', '2022-10-26 14:14:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105834003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093504012', 'Ramona Brown', NULL, '10.26.22 - I listened to this call that Cari had with this member. Cari did not do anything out of the ordinary and spoke to this agitated member with kindness and understanding. I am not sure why she would alert Jeffrey to anything negatively about this conversation. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-26 13:51:38', '2022-10-26 13:51:38'),
