  ('zcrm_1579374000105798036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093504012', 'Ramona Brown', NULL, '10-26-2022:  Ramona called again today quite angry.  She''s upset that she''s paying $250 a month & from what I can gather, she has no idea what she''s purchased.  Kept saying she had no idea her "ded" was so high. That we don''t "guarantee" we''ll pay, we just arbitrarily decide after the fact.  When I tried to ask questions, she angrily told me she''d already talked to her bank, she''s just done.   From what she''s saying, I just don''t think she understood what she was purchasing and she was definitely too angry to discuss during our call.  I sent a Teams chat to Jeffrey Bursteen asking him to connect with her - maybe she''ll be a bit calmer by the time he can call her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-26 12:30:41', '2022-10-26 12:30:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105807003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093504012', 'Ramona Brown', NULL, 'I spoke to Ramona, she was upset about the way she was spoken to by concierge. She is also now going to receive benefits through her job at zero cost to her. She realizes she will not be refunded for November. She also contacted her bank to inform them that she doesn''t want autopay to continue. She wants to cancel, and not listen to anything else.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-26 12:00:06', '2022-10-26 12:00:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105797013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364085', 'Kristy Tripp', NULL, '10-26-22 Kristy will talk with her accountant to see if they have proof of supply disruptions and for which quarters or 50% in 2020 in 20% in 2021 of loss of revenue. She Might qualify for about $42,650 if she finds docs to support out answers. I didn''t proceed on the app since she wants to make sure it''s relevant. She''ll let me know in the next few days what she''s able to gather from her accountant. Company name is Framework and Family and Kristy is 50% owner and her husband Ben is 49% owner. They had possibly 2 employees in Q4 2020 and 3-4 employees in Q1-Q3 of 2021. They had supply chain issues that likely slowed work down by more than 10% gross revenue, but that''s really hard to quantify. They had issues getting kitchen cabinets, wiring, etc. They were resourceful to find other solutions but sometimes it was just a significant delay in project completion. It''s hard to prove since each project is very different, especially between different years.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-26 11:55:08', '2022-10-26 12:16:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105798028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003401007', 'Benjamin Lampert II', NULL, '10-26-2022:  Ben called AFTER he submitted a ''med need'' to Zion, used the wrong memb # from his Planstin card, and I have no idea what he submitted because he''s now working to correct his sub.  I encouraged him to always call us first and we''ll guide him.  Then made sure he has Zion''s ph #; told him to tt Cust Srvc to get his accurate Zion Member #; then asked to be trans to the ''med need'' dept to ask them to update his submission.  Then I trans him over.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-26 11:39:44', '2022-10-26 11:39:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105798008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745013', 'Dustin Boone', NULL, '10-26-2022:  Dustin called while he was driving.  They had a new baby on Oct 12.  I sent him Patti''s Memb Chg form link and told him it''s super imp we get this done right away as it must be done within the first 30-days.  He knows to look for the link in his e-mail because it requires his signature.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-26 11:10:45', '2022-10-26 11:10:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105797008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105664002', 'Samuel Fredricksmeyer', NULL, '10-26-22 I left a vm for Beth (Sam''s mom) to let them know he has a Nov. 1st start date and will be billed immediately. This is what they wanted since he loses his ins as of Nov. 1st due to turning 26. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-26 11:09:35', '2022-10-26 11:09:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105798003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575167', 'Peggy Neises', NULL, '10-26-2022:  Peggy called.  She''s headed to the derm for an annual ck up.  We went over how derm appt (unless there are issues) are not incl in her healthcare.  (Co-pay plan is old enough, Jennifer &amp; I confered and ILM for Peggy afterwards confirming the info I''d given her was accurate.)  IF there are any issues, something they will be monitoring, etc, that might make this elig, she will call us to start a ''med need'' within the next 2 mos.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-26 11:09:26', '2022-10-26 11:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105780006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '10.26.22:  Spoke w/Patti re: Lisa''s questions:  1)  They can deduct $105/mo. for the MEC on their taxes.
2) Any document re: HSA should come from their HSA source.  Ask their accountant if any document is required for tax purposes.  3)  The $50 tobacco charge was erroneously omitted on their new plan rate.  I  will call Lisa tomorrow.  Patti said to tell Lisa to call her.  I will give Lisa Patti''s number (561-922-9648) to call Patti, if she feels she needs to.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-26 11:09:13', '2022-10-26 11:09:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105797003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076713079', 'Staci Wiley', NULL, '10-26-22 Staci is not interested in the debt programs bc it will damage their credit score for a few years and she''s spent many years rebuilding it since a bankruptcy in 2008. She depends on her good credit for work purposes and believes she''ll be able to pay off the debt on her own. She bought a property and home which put them into big debt but will refinance to solve the problem. Connected with Meredith at MPA and she let her know that it sounds like we don''t have an option that will suit her needs/desires.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-26 11:07:53', '2022-10-26 11:07:53'),
