  ('zcrm_1579374000105684020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106816002', 'Jessica Ullman', NULL, 'Jessica reaching out to me on SalesIQ today, Wednesday October 26th, 2022, around 10am est. She stated that she is interested in how everything works with our Plans that we offer here. I responded with letting her know that we are more than happy to help and asked for her name and phone number so that one of our Trusted In-House Healthcare Advisors can call her right then and there to answer all and any of her questions. Along with walking her through the website to figure out which plan best suites her Healthcare Needs and her Ideal Healthcare Plan. Jessica replied saying she would love to have a phone call but asked if she could schedule it for Friday October 28th at 11am EST. I let Jessica know that would be no problem at all and I will pass her contact info along to one of the Advisors and put it in our Calendar. Tupac (Tony) will be the one to call her on that day and time scheduled. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-26 08:20:57', '2022-10-26 08:20:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105708013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601222', 'Ashley Markison', NULL, 'Ashley emailed me asking about her Pmt info.  Also she wanted to talk about the upcoming transition to Select +.  I emailed back the link and copied Wendy on the email for her to reach out to her to go over options.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-26 08:03:41', '2022-10-26 08:03:41'),
