  ('zcrm_1579374000105648066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080099002', 'Michelle Stevens', NULL, '10-25-2022:  Rick''s RX Quote - sent the following:
     - Novolog Flexpen BRAND 3ml/pen, 5 pens = $85.88 at Walmart on Jackson Creek Pkwy on WellRX.  It looks like this is accurate, but it''s way better than other sites.  Because I''m afraid it''s too good to be real, I also attached as a backup:
