  ('zcrm_1579374000105648056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, '10-25-2022:  tt Amy &amp; Kenneth, got an invite sent over from CirrusMD.  Helped her get the app setup w/pw, code, etc.  When we got off the phone they were starting a text to get help w/Kenneth''s rash.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 17:47:20', '2022-10-25 17:47:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105648051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675060', 'Quentin Green', NULL, '10-25-2022:  Quentin is needing his colonoscopy & wondered how he goes about getting it & the guidelines around them w/this plan.  I sent him the curr Zion Prev Med Sharing since the DIRECT plan is part of the OPD prog.  His girlfriend went to a doctor & he thinks he''ll just go there.
     - He also asked about labs for his annual appt.  We disc options incl ''cash-pay'', cking if doc''s off wks w/anyone for specified rates, JasonHealth.com, or maybe Walk-in Labs?  Shopping is a good way to get best price, not just having doc''s office submit.
     - He asked what the doc''s off provides w/OPD.  I went over the basics, his annual appt, but told him the contract the dr has w/the program states all items cov.  [I no longer have that list, since my comp crashed.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 17:08:21', '2022-10-25 17:08:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105648046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085054002', 'PAUL Finkelstein', NULL, '10-25-2022:  Sara called. She was presenting to Mazz &amp; Sull as a ''Planstin'' employee.  She hadn''t heard Jennifer tell her to tell them she''s w/MPB, MPowering Benefits.  She''ll call them again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 17:03:47', '2022-10-25 17:03:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105648038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '10-25-2022:  Paul called.  He missed his sched ''Welcome Call'' w/Jennifer & wondered if he could still do it, but it was almost 20-minutes late.  Sent him the link to resched & mentioned Vanessa had done his wife''s ''Welcome Call''.  
     - He''s out-of-town & having trouble w/his vision.  Wondered what he does.  Went over vision & dental are not a part of his healthcare option, but if he sees an opthomologist & it is a ''medical'' vs vision item, to call & we can see if he''d have help thru his sharing (mentioned ex: cataract(s) - shareable after waiting period).     - CA

Paul called back.  He tt his old doc who thinks he needs to go to the ER (double vision, dizzy, etc.), so I walked thru presenting as ''cash-pay'', asking for a disc, pay your 1k IUA and ask them to bill him for the bal.  He will then call us so we can help him learn how to sub a ''med need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 16:54:37', '2022-10-25 17:01:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105661034', 'Aaron Ingalls', NULL, '10-25-22 RMHP/UHC paid me for Oct commissions according to Karina. I''m working to get the other statements for the rest of the year. They chose Colorado Doctors Plan Silver 3 Free Visits 4000 $3 Walgreens Silver/HMO. APTC $580.19 and full cost is $718.12. Plan ID 97879CO0420015-04. Acct # 2862005665.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-25 16:17:08', '2022-10-25 16:28:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105664002', 'Samuel Fredricksmeyer', NULL, '10-25-22 After much phone tag and back and forth they decided to go with CARE+. I just sent this to Patti, "Any chance we can get Sam Fredricksmeyer a Nov. 1st start date? He''s aging off his parents plan and they were planning to go with regular insurance where the deadline is the end of the month. But, they just changed their mind and want CARE+. He loses his ins for Nov. 1st. Can we give him a Nov. 1st start date? He just turned 26 on 10/18/96. Thanks!!"  Also, C4 is closed starting tomorrow until the end of the month. That''s a moot point since they don''t want C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-25 16:12:01', '2022-10-25 16:12:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105648033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '10-25-2022:  Janet called to see what we learned.  I sent reminder to Joan to see if she ever tt anyone & that Janet''s getting worried because her issues are becoming more severe & it''s becoming time sensitive.  Made sure Janet has Zion''s ph # & trans her.  She''s going to ask if they have any ''special needs'' funds available.  This was declined because she miscalculated when she signed up (by one month).  She thought it was > 24 mos since anything on this issue, but she was at 23 months.   She will also see if they could help her advocate for her to help bring down the price if nothing else.  She''d still like to know what Joan finds out (she was checking to see if Care Connect could work w/Janet even though it''s been declined, because that''s how Care Connect gets paid).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 15:25:35', '2022-10-25 15:25:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105663003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '10.25.22:  Lisa called.  Wants to know if she needs any documentation for having an MEC w/HSA for tax purposes and how much of a deduction can they take for medical care.  I told her I would call Patti and find out and get back with her or have Patti give her a call.  She told me to text her and let her know if Patti will be calling her.  She prefers to be called this coming Thursday or Friday instead of tomorrow.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-25 15:21:23', '2022-10-25 15:21:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090406002', 'Solina Kennedy', NULL, '10-25-22 Solina called me back and she got a new job with health insurance starting on Nov. 1st and employer is paying for all or part of plan. So, she''s all set and was super sweet and thankful.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-25 14:35:39', '2022-10-25 14:35:39'),
