  ('zcrm_1579374000105640103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003321085', 'Kerie Hagler', NULL, 'Spoke to Kerie, she needs minimum coverage, mostly access to a telehealth dr. I emailed her the info on the Essentials plan yesterday, 10-24-2022. I called to follow up with her today and get her enrolled, I left a voicemail for her to call me back.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-25 14:23:49', '2022-10-25 14:23:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011193', 'Andre Mpitsos', NULL, '10-25-22 Andre called to better understand ERC since he''s Business Owner and W2 himself. But that won''t qualify since purpose it to keep employees and not for actual biz owner. Also asked about debt solution since he has $20K pers and $30K bus cc debt where the interest rate just increased drastically. But, he believes an investment he made with it will pay off and he doesn''t want to close cards. He''s fine and will share the ERC with his friends. I explained it a little bit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-25 14:18:49', '2022-10-25 14:18:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105648028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093504012', 'Ramona Brown', NULL, '10-25-2022:  Ramona called, she''s headed to the emergency room because she thinks she broke her foot.  She wanted to know about her ins card.  We went over presenting as ''cash-pay'', asking for a discount, paying her IUA $2500 & asking them to bill her the bal.  She says she cannot pay $2500, so I told her she will be resp for that amt, but to pay what she can.  Then call us in the next few days so we can show her how to get a ''med need'' submitted.  Also, told her how to get an RX Quote if she needs to pickup something.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 13:51:37', '2022-10-26 11:54:49'),
