  ('zcrm_1579374000105648023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062289777', 'David Ferrero', NULL, '10-25-2022:  David called, Kelly OD''d & was taken to the ER.  She did this a year ago & in his mind it''s not pre-x because they used her CU Gold Ins to pay for that issue.  But, now she''s thinking they are going to put her into a mental hosp.  She says it made it worse last time, so she doesn''t want to do that.  I mentioned it could feel worse because it could be bringing up the underlying issues?  Here is his plan of action:  He has Zion''s ph # & I trans him to them (he''ll touch base w/the ''med need'' dept).  May call CirrusMD to talk to their experts if he need guidance.  Last:  Mazz & Sull counseling.  She Kelly told her dad it''s only 4 visits, so we went over the actual structure & that it may not be  enough for this circumstance.  But they could pay during the waiting periods?  Just not sure it''ll be enough for the situation, not structured for crisis level help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 13:03:21', '2022-10-25 13:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105648018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, '10-25-2022:  Ashley called.  She wants to see what pricing would look like if the went from their curr Memb + family, to just her husb &amp; the kids.  Sent Teams chat to Jeffrey Bursteen to call her when he''s available.  Mentioned in my chat:  Ashley is primary on this old acct, so it would req a whole new application.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-25 12:36:31', '2022-10-25 12:36:31'),
