  ('zcrm_1579374000105622119', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097349002', 'William Edwards', NULL, '10.25.22 - Kelly called in extremely rude stating that the lady that helped her before had no idea what she was talking about when it came to finding some mental health assistance for her son (that was me). I explained that the person she spoke with before gave her best advise for finding assistance for her son.  I sent her a list of HCBB psychiatrists along with the fair pricing for a psych appointment in her area. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-25 08:17:45', '2022-10-25 08:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105622114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091383002', 'Scott Meyer', NULL, '10.25.22 - Scott called in with several questions regarding his preventative care and shingles vaccination. Scott does not seem to grasp the concept of cost sharing and continues to call it insurance and that he wants the best insurance he can get. I tried to explain to Scott that this is not like traditional insurance and went through several scenarios with Scott. He also does not grasp having to stay within the PHCS network for his preventative care. I have concerns with this member as I believe he may start receiving bills from his physical because he does not know if that provider was in the network. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-25 07:59:13', '2022-10-25 07:59:13'),
