  ('zcrm_1579374000105622101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081205002', 'Tessa Tarr', NULL, '10.25.22 - Tessa''s daughter fell on the wet tile floor in their bathroom Friday evening. She waited to go to the ER until Saturday but ended up needing treatment for the injuries. I sent Tessa the instructions on how to open a Need with Zion. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-25 07:29:12', '2022-10-25 07:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088509010', 'Scott Blossom', NULL, '10-24-2022:  RX Quote:  the info seems incomplete, but he''s a doctor, so maybe I''m missing something.  Here''s what I sent him (per Jennifer, this is for his son):
     - Clindamycin Phosphate 0.1% Lotion, 60ml = $23.50 at Costco on GoodRX.  He does not list a pharmacy, so I went w/cheapest pharmacy showing a logo.  (60ml Solution is also showing as available.)  He says they were paying $80 on ins, so he''s very pleased.  - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-24 18:16:18', '2022-10-24 19:23:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '10-24-2022:  Reid cannot source the super expensive Imvexxy (it sounded like a convenience thing, rather than truly necessary?).  Sent Martha info.  She wasn''t needing anything right now, just pricing for future.  Also let her know the Costco price on her Estradiol Cr seems good at $26.99: Estradiol Vag Cr, 0.1mg, 42.5gm.  Could not for the life of me find that to reprice today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-24 17:51:20', '2022-10-24 17:51:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076016', 'Mark Caprio', NULL, '10-24-2022:  Mark called. He has surg this Fri ~ 10am.  Zion has him paying ahead to get the 40-50% discounts.  Total for surgery = $12554.66 (Surgeon $767.40, Anesthesiologist $517.50, &amp; Facility $11,269.76 = 40-50% off each entity).  I let him know Zion no longer has discount since we''d discussed that before &amp; he took it well.  He''s feeling much better because he''s realized he needs this done &amp; the quickness Zion finally provided means a lot to him.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-24 17:17:12', '2022-10-24 17:17:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069994428', 'Kelly Snider', NULL, '10-24-2022:  Kelly called in while I was on the ph.  I called her back.  The ph system is still just dead air & people have no idea they''ve caught us.  She was glad I called back.
     - Kelly wants to utilize her ''prev care''.  We went over ''P''lanstin = ''Prev Care ONLY''.  All entities must curr be in ntwk.  She wants to utilize a ''Functional Med'' doctor & I do not see them listed as in ntwk.  No one she brought up was.  It sounds like she lives in a diff area, so she was looking further out 30-50 miles from her.  We walked thru using the PHCS Search tool.  Then went over healthcare.gov.
     - She''s frustrated because she''s spending all this money & the one time she wants to use it...  
     - At the end, it was like nothing I was saying mattered & she couldn''t get off the ph fast enough.  Although, it also sounded like there was something going on in the background.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-24 16:43:26', '2022-10-24 16:43:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '10-24-22 Kath and Fredric Besch are getting married very soon! They are leaving to 2 weeks to get married in Australia!  Kath has some tax and credit card debt totaling about $8K. She''s paying it off successfully but they don''t have more money beyond that. Fred has 5 years of not filing taxes for a total of $24K and another $14K debt that he''s delinquent on. They want to figure out how to handle it all in the best way and separately or together. She''ll email me tomorrow with times to talk.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-24 15:11:04', '2022-10-24 15:11:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105588093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000094340002', 'Homer Savard', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2382 Question : I''m trying to find our my account number to set up my on line access. We have been members since July 1st. My wife Julie would like to schedule a Dr appointment because she need to renew a medication RX', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-24 15:08:17', '2022-10-24 15:08:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105648003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085553002', 'Georgina Worley', NULL, 'Spoke with Georgina about her newborn daughter, She asked what was shareable in so far as her daughters well child and tounge-ties, Surgical intervention is required. I told her to contact Zion directly about the surgeries. Helped her with her questions.', 'Angela Brocious', 'Angela Brocious', '2022-10-24 15:06:18', '2022-10-24 15:06:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095912017', 'Alicia Hutchens', NULL, '10-24-2022:  Alicia called.  She''s been diagnosed w/ADHD & needed pricing for her new RX.  I showed her how to sub RX Quote requests for the future, however did send her the following from our ph call:
     - Generic Adderall XR 5mg, #10 caps = $14.54 at King Soopers on GoodRX
King Soopers is her favorite & right now it''s showing a contract w/GoodRX.  Cheapest was thru Safeway & CVS/CVS Target.  For the $1.50 diff though, Alicia decided on KS for now.  W/refills & lgr qtys she may rethink that.
     - She asked about submitting the psycologist invoices, etc, for her ADHD diag.  Zion''s curr Memb Guidelines list one exclusion on ADHD = they do not pay for the prescriptions.  Told her I''m not aware of help with mental health, but she may try to see if they will help share this expense.  [She says she will have to see the psycologist monthly to get her refills.]
     - She''s very confused about the IUA & thought it was a deductible: "Can all of this go towards my annual ded?"  We went over in depth: issue specific, deadline is 6 mos for sub, no issue to sub if you think it''s ongoing & haven''t met IUA, 3x/yr & how 4th  & beyond ea yr are handled.     - CA

For some reason, even though I told Alicia she did NOT need to submit an RX Quote request this time, she did anyway.  This was already taken care of.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-24 15:01:05', '2022-10-24 17:34:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076002', 'Ernest Curry', NULL, 'I tried to reach Ernest, to discuss his concerns. Got his voicemail, left message for him to call me back. I will follow up tomorrow 10-25-2022', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-24 14:56:49', '2022-10-24 14:56:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '10-24-22 Kath is interested in debt solutions. I just left her a vm to call me back to discuss.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-24 14:56:01', '2022-10-24 14:56:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555113', 'Angela Boyd', NULL, 'Angela Boyd is a cancel. She''s getting coverage through her job Piedmont insurance. $106.00 monthly premium, ER $225.00 per day for 5 days. $450 ED.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-24 14:55:13', '2022-10-24 14:55:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076713079', 'Staci Wiley', NULL, '10-24-22 Staci is looking to refinance possibly in the next month and half. She doesn''t want her credit pulled to mess with the refi. But, curious about debt solutions. They have $70-$75K in debt with taxes, line of credit and credit card right now. We will chat on Wednesday at 10:00.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-24 14:51:55', '2022-10-24 14:51:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105571051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, 'Pam chatted with me on SalesIQ after I sent her a greeting message, stating that during her Annual Mammogram Screening, there was something found. She has been told that she needs to go for a follow-up Mammogram & Ultrasound to figure out what was found. She was at first asking for her member ID # to change her password for the MPB.Health Member Portal login. I looked her up and found her, but I asked if there was something specific that she was trying to do. She explained she wanted to sign onto her member portal and then explained her situation. She asked what she is to do and if she goes through Zion or Planstin. I explained to her this would be considered Diagnostic in nature, and this would be through Zion Health. She is responsible to pay out of pocket for her appointments related to her situation, up to her $1000 IUA. Anything more than that she is to submit the bills and proof of payment of her IUA, into Zion Health and start a Need. I provided her Zion''s customer service phone number and suggested she call Zion right away and explain everything that happened. Zion can start and walk her through the whole process of a Need and get it all started early. I also emailed her over the template that explains how to start a need with Zion as well. Lastly, I provided her with the username and password to get into her member portal with MPB. She is all set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-24 14:38:44', '2022-10-24 14:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105639038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, '10.24.22 - Ashley called because she had some questions regarding her pregnancy. We went over the $5k out of pocket cost, and she also had a question about genetic testing which I could not find an answer for in the Sedera guidelines so I transferred Ashley to Sedera for that answer. I also sent the instructions on how to open a Need with Sedera. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-24 14:18:51', '2022-10-24 14:18:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105622078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, 'I called and left a voicemail oct 24th', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-24 14:13:00', '2022-10-24 14:13:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817010', 'Erik Guevara', NULL, 'I called Erik to speak to him about cancellation. He was busy on the road and couldn''t speak. Set appointment with him to call tomorrow 10-25-2022 @ 2:00 pm.', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', 'Jeffrey Bursteen', '2022-10-24 13:52:56', '2022-10-24 13:52:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089447002', 'Rebecca Gradler', NULL, '10-24-2022:  Rebecca called asking about submitting receipts.  It sounds like a good portion of them are ''prev care'', so we went over basics on ''P''lanstin = ''P''rev care ONLY, doc''s off must bill, every entity must curr be in ntwk, cov labs & how to hndl, & e-mail she rec''d in 3/22 has link to the healthcare.gov site that tells what is considered ''prev''.  If need clarification on cov, like how often on a pap smear, she''ll call Planstin.  
     - She has ''concierge doc'' according to her, but it sounds like a DPC?  
     - Disc presenting as ''cash-pay'' to the 5k IUA, 3 IUAs per year, & how 4th & beyond work.  Deadline of 6mos, don''t have to be over IUA, but imp to know there is a deadline.  Discussed pre-x items & phase in level at anniv: 4/1/23 = 25k for qualified pre-x ''med need'' items.
     She seems to understand & will go over details w/her family.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-24 13:12:04', '2022-10-24 13:13:40'),
