  ('zcrm_1579374000105622063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105971010', 'Laura Claire', NULL, 'thyroid condition she takes medication for. She is a 63 year old real estate agent living in Las Vegas. She heard about us through a doctors podcast and while listening about hsa''s and healthshares we were the first to pop up on google. She wanted to know about the PHCS network and also if she could get thermoscans. she is looking for a start date of january 1st.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-24 12:56:08', '2022-10-24 12:56:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105646003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '10-24-22 Cecelia and family all got covid all of the sudden.  We are rescheduling.
