  ('zcrm_1579374000105640016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095065002', 'Patti Chambers', NULL, '10-24-2022:  Patti called, Zion has not responded to her open ''med need'' from July.  Says she has done everything she''s been told to do, but hasn''t heard anything.  tt Rebecca in Zion ''med need''.  Her ''need'' processor: Christina will give her a call.  Gave Rebecca the # Patti gave me:  303-513-0914, but Rebecca was hesitant to tt me at all...     Let Patti know to expect a call from her processor.
