  ('zcrm_1579374000105639013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088509010', 'Scott Blossom', NULL, '10.24.22 - Scott called because he wanted to know if prescription acne meds are a shareable expense. I explained the prescription process and he will be submitting a quote form soon. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-24 10:22:20', '2022-10-24 10:22:20'),
