  ('zcrm_1579374000105639008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005667061', 'orpheo mccord', NULL, '10.24.22 - Orpheo called because his wife could not access her CirrusMD services. I sent her a request after receiving her email address from Orpheo. 

Orpheo''s wife called back in, the CirrusMD doc told her to go see someone in person. I explained the cash-pay process. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-24 09:05:57', '2022-10-24 09:05:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105631019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082772001', 'Michael Radlovic', NULL, 'called Mike to remind him to update his payment method I remined him that 11/25 he would be charged a $25 late fee', 'Kevin Rebal', 'Kevin Rebal', '2022-10-24 09:05:48', '2022-10-24 09:05:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105640006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000090686002', 'Brandee Poland', NULL, '10-21-2022:  Cole Poland RX Quotes.  Their favorite pharmacy = Boyd''s, but they were open to Walgreens because they were cheapest. E-mailed the following coupons:
     - Diazepam 10mg tab, #1 = $2.54 on RXGo
     - Hydrocodone/Acetaminophen 5mg/325mg tabs, #12 = $8.16 on GoodRX', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-24 08:55:06', '2022-10-24 08:55:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105639003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089437001', 'Tracey Rominger', NULL, '10.24.22 - Tracey called to remove her husband from her membership. I sent her the member change form link via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-24 07:49:33', '2022-10-24 07:49:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105631014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919232', 'gary kintz', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-24 07:40:58', '2022-10-24 07:40:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105632015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088818002', 'Shane Simmons', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2377 Question : I’m needing a telegraphy visit today and I need help on how to reach the on call team', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-23 08:41:14', '2022-10-23 08:41:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105571039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078467032', 'James Fontenot', NULL, '10-21-2022:  tt James & Sadie late Wed, they knew because the prices I was finding were so high (~$950-1k/180days) I approached our worldwide shopper.  Reid''s quote was great: Depakote ER BRAND 500mg, #180 (1bid) = $189.38 + $9.95 shipping = $199.33.  Sent them this info & his contact info via e-mail today.
     - I conf their renewal date & entering their 2nd yr = 12/1/2022, so they are looking at what type of help w/her epilepsy they would have.  We talked about the phase in levels.  Also told them IF they decide to keep her here, they really should tt Zion to confirm everything so they can make an educated decision.  The first step was to get pricing on her RX which I sent them today.
     - Their daughter Halie has epilespsy & they are trying to decide whether to keep the kids on this plan.  It sounds like they can possibly keep/put her/the kids onto an employer sponsored plan if necessary?  With open enrollment coming, they are doing their homework.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-21 16:56:49', '2022-10-21 16:56:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105571034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060480210', 'Rick Graham', NULL, '10-21-2022:  Kate called.  She needs to have the batteries in her pacemaker rep''d in the next few months.  Sent her the temp for sub a ''med need'' w/Zion &amp; walked her thru the steps.  Made sure she has Zion''s ph # &amp; trans her to Zion @ end of the call to get her memb #.  [I do not know whether this will be a pre-x item &amp; did not go there w/her.  Her eff date is 1/1/2021, so at least she''ll enter her 3rd yr of her membership &amp; be at the 50k pre-x level on 1/1/2023.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-21 16:53:40', '2022-10-21 16:53:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105571026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073555113', 'Angela Boyd', NULL, '10-21-2022:  Angela called to cancel.  She''s gotten a job w/benefits.  Made sure she has her advisor Zach Masters'' ph # &amp; trans her there, told her to LM if she doesn''t catch him.  Told her how to sign the cancellation form as well.  [Did not mention the deadline &amp; stopping the draw date.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-21 15:42:53', '2022-10-21 15:42:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105571021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '10-21-2022:  Alex (female) @ Mizz &amp; Sull is going to present this situation to the Admin team on Mon to see if there''s anything that can be done.  They will try to straighten out the situation &amp; call him directly on Monday.   I tt John &amp; let him know .     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-21 15:26:46', '2022-10-21 15:49:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105631006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089144002', 'Sarita Yeldandi', NULL, '10-21-22 Sarita had any questions about HSA, HMA, DPC, wellness visits etc. She''s already used the HMA in about month 6 for kids dentist visits. I told her to let the account grow again for at least 6-12 months more before she uses it again. I suggested she set up a HSA and use that for any immediate needs. She''s pondering joining Forward Health which is DPC and accepts payment via HSA. It''s $149 a month membership fee. I didn''t broach our DIRECT membership bc the HSA and tax benefits will likely outweigh the slightly lower monthly cost of $55. She''s also looking at Radiant Functional Medicine who doesn''t accept insurance but dr is an MD. Let her know the labs can be shared and alternative must be pre-approved. I explained Planstin to her as well as far as only wellness portion of visit will be at no cost. If discuss any health concerns, it''s no longer a preventive screening and she might have to pay for that portion of the visit. Let her know the mammogram needs to remain in the PHCS/Multi-Plan network too. Then for all other dr visits, it''s best to remove the Planstin card from the account and pay as cash pay patient. She''s a bit overwhelmed but feeling better. Her husband also wants to see a specialist and he now understands he doesn''t have to go to primary care first, he can go direct. But, he can call Concierge Team for highest quality care at best price in local area. She might call for that and may other reasons. 
I also learned from Geoff Kirk that yes she can pay a monthly DPC fee from the HMA. Forward Health is showing that she can pay with an HSA for her monthly fee for that as well. So, both are viable options for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-21 15:13:45', '2022-10-21 15:14:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105571016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076016', 'Mark Caprio', NULL, '10-21-2022:  Mark called, he''s extremely grateful for my help in getting w/Bella @ Zion.  He''s thrilled, she walked him thru step-by-step what he needs to do &amp; thinks he can have surgery next Wed.  He couldn''t thank me enough for stepping-in &amp; helping.  He will call if he needs anything further, but right now he is thrilled!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-21 14:48:52', '2022-10-21 14:48:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105622018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, 'She also was interested in the alternative health discounts for chiropractors and wants a dental plan as well.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-21 14:46:26', '2022-10-21 14:46:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105622013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105652002', 'Anthony Jogoleff', NULL, 'Ashley learned of us through HSA for america but never spoke to any advisors for our products. She is married and 42, her husband is 46 and they are both smokers. They have 2 children who are on a plan with keiser through their grandfather. She said her employer will wage up and help pay for some of her plan. She is mostly interested in having  2,500 IUA and using an HSA. She said she is willing to buy right away after I walked her through the website.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-21 14:46:03', '2022-10-21 14:46:03'),
