  ('zcrm_1579374000105571011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076016', 'Mark Caprio', NULL, '10-21-2022:  Mark called.  He''s frustrated that Zion is saying it will take a few weeks to approve his ''need''.  They told him they are short.  Called doc & req''d treatment plan & estimated costs.  Called to get more info.  tt Bella in Zion''s ''med need'' dept: they have everything they need.  The req for sharing was sent on 10-18-2022 to DA for review/approval, however, that takes ~2wk.  She says by 11/3/22 they should have appr.  She''s going to call him & encourage him to get the surg sched!  Hernias are not something to wait on.  They no longer offer the IUA discount, even though he''s gotten them to do a 40% ''cash-pay'' discount, she''ll let him know they''ve discontinued that prog too.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-21 13:43:50', '2022-10-21 13:43:50'),
