  ('zcrm_1579374000105494003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077745035', 'Deborah Stoffel', NULL, 'Member called in and told me she had some questions and no one had gotten back with her.  She asked if her plan would work since she just moved from WI to SC.  Also asked about the price increase.  She asked about a "network" I told he that only preventative had a network.  Asked where she could get that info.  I realized she never had a Welcome call and told me she bought our plan online.  I sent her the Welcome call scheduler and since she has n=moved will send her the link to the PU form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-21 07:32:37', '2022-10-21 07:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105459040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000093277002', 'Grant Meeker', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Healthcare Advisor', 'Visit ID : 2372 Question : How do I access the Lifecare and telehealth portions of my SECURE plan? I can''t quite seem to figure out the system yet. Also - I''d love to see if you have any recommended providers in my area. Thanks!', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-21 06:23:03', '2022-10-21 06:23:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105479031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '10-20-2022:  Paul called - he has a ''Welcome Call'' next week.  He is wondering if he has to chg doctors, so he''ll get the names to discuss during that call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-20 17:48:33', '2022-10-20 17:48:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105479026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, '10-20-2022:  John called &amp; is extremely frustrated.  He wants reimb on his counseling because Mizz &amp; Sull MAP don''t have "anyone in his area" &amp; the 5 they suggested do not include his doc...  He was super upset when I wouldn''t tell him who to send his invoices to for reimb.  Finally, we agreed:  I am to escalate his call to my supervisor.  Sent his info &amp; req to Joan via Teams chat.  He apologized to me for being so angry &amp; it''s nothing personal, but he''s paying us a lot of money.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-20 17:46:23', '2022-10-20 17:46:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105465038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000692001', 'Veronica Precella', NULL, '10-20-22 Veronica said they''ve merged with Longmont now to create BOLO from BARA. So, they have a new look and feel. They are only doing Zoom meetings now since everyone loves it for ease of access. I''m working to have 2 meetings about the newest options in 2022-2023. I think BOLO stands for Boulder and Longmont.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-20 17:11:29', '2022-10-20 17:13:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105479021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103906009', 'Mario Serrano', NULL, '10-20-2022:  Leah Garcia was on SalesIQ to find a cancellation form.  We talked on the concierge line &amp; I showed her how to find it.  I reminded her to notify Patti via e-mail that she''s talked to Mario about the cancellation already, but she''s already tt Patti about this cancellation.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-20 16:06:43', '2022-10-20 16:06:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105421026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049011710', 'Leah Garcia', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Cari', 'Visit ID : 2371 Question : I need the form to cancel a policy that has just been issued.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-20 15:58:48', '2022-10-20 15:58:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105456028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103472001', 'Jorge Trejo', NULL, 'Called secondary phone number received by Vanessa.....Called second number and had to leave another voicemail.   Vanessa is trying secondary phone number as well to try and speak to client....Waiting on call back from client or Vanessa...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-10-20 15:15:51', '2022-10-20 15:15:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105456023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103472001', 'Jorge Trejo', NULL, 'called again was sent to voicemail...waiting on call back.  Per Patti Baron, now the want to cancel....waiting on client to call back', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-10-20 14:58:00', '2022-10-20 14:58:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105446084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000056140001', 'Betsy Green', NULL, 'Per note below, Member ignored me and sent check in.  I left VM for her and she did not return my call.  I put pmt information into A123 and will run with the billing.   Since ex spouse does not want to be billed for membership.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-20 14:32:38', '2022-10-20 14:32:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105446079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563065', 'Petrus Timmermans', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as he is now eligible for Medicaid I spoke to Misty and she was aware of this.  I will process ahead of billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-20 14:08:23', '2022-10-20 14:08:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105479016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162382', 'Juan Rosas', NULL, '10-20-2022:  Celeste & Juan called in together.  Juan''s doctor mentioned a colonoscopy when he went in for his prev care appt.
     - Sent them a list of gastro docs near their pref Tacoma, WA zip: 98405
     - Went over ColoGuard & or a stool sample  vs  colonoscopy.  Was very clear, that RCI only pays for one.  If he chooses either of these and it''s inconclusive, the colonoscopy is not paid for even though it may still be considered a ''prev screening''.  Celeste asked if they could pay for the stool sample & have RCI pay for the colonoscopy if needed.  I had her speak to RCI directly because I wasn''t sure how it worked.  But, she called back & had forgotten to get that ans.
     - Their PCP ran a bunch of lab work & she wondered how that would be handled.  Let her know IF w/an in ntwk lab, the lipid panel will be cov.  The balance of the tests she already sent thru ins, so I let her know even if they decline payment & it''s in ntwk, it will kick back as their responsibility at the ntwk disc price.  Went over how to handle next time: in ntwk, 2 orders (cov & not cov items) so she can ask for ''cash-pay'' price on uncov tests.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-20 13:45:35', '2022-10-20 17:55:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105465033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106218014', 'Alexander Tocco', NULL, '10-20-22 Alexander came via Big Wave Lead. He''s a bit panicked bc he''s "shitting blood all day" and thinks he may have an ulcer. He wants to make sure he "doesn''t die." He doesn''t have a life change event. He used to have Medicaid but no longer. He didn''t understand about the open enrollment period. I explained. He seems to be feeling more optimistic knowing he can get on a plan for Jan. 2023. I also suggested DPC for now to check into his health status immediately. He mentioned he might need a colonoscopy which Nexterra has a partner to get that for $1200. Once her heard that number, he wants to wait until Jan. most likely. I''m sending him instructions to add me as his agent in C4.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-20 13:24:51', '2022-10-20 13:24:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105446074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103922002', 'Gary Zoz II', 'New plan eff 11/1/2022', 'Member &amp; Spouse $1000 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-20 13:18:52', '2022-10-20 13:18:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105446069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103922002', 'Gary Zoz II', NULL, 'Spoke to Lou after which member submitted Change form to change their plan as they will not qualify for the Secure membership.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-20 13:05:52', '2022-10-20 13:05:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105481003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411262', 'Michael Hicks', 'Contacted Michael', 'Reached out to Michael by phone (Left Message) and email.  Had to send it out of Outlook.  Email I sent from CRM got bounced.  His MEC was inadvertently cancelled by us.  He has preventative bills I told him we would pay.  
Asked that he forward his bills to me.

Hi Michael,

I received a message that you called.   Just left you a VM.  
If you could, either scan, or take a picture of your bills and attach them with a reply.
I''ll get them processed and paid for you.

Let me know if you have any questions.

Best regards,


 John Kach
 Operations Manager
 Direct: (561) 922-9647', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2022-10-20 12:33:09', '2022-10-20 12:33:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105422010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092228002', 'David Bradley', NULL, 'David reached out on SalesIQ earlier and requested a breakdown of his coverage to compare to what his company is offering. I pulled him up here in the CRM and see that Leonardo is his Advisor. I asked Bradly if it would be ok for Leonardo to give him a call due to the fact that a breakdown of his coverage would be a LOT of info to type out for him to read. Bradley responded that it is not a good time as he is at work and has terrible phone reception being in the mountains. I let Lenardo know this and mentioned to Bradley that Leo can email him over what he is looking for. Bradley said that would be great and Leo immediately sent Bradley an email with info. I also emailed Bradley the Zion Health Guidelines for him to have handy, as it is pretty much exactly what Bradley is looking for in terms of Zion Health and that portion of his plan with us here. All set for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-20 12:19:18', '2022-10-20 12:19:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105479011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474377', 'Lynette (Lynn) Arena', NULL, '10-20-2022:  Lynn called asking how she can get the $100 ref fee for a friend''s son if we call &amp; sell him.  Told her,  her advisor Wendy Scipione, likes a three-way e-mail: E-mail your friend introducing Wendy &amp; supplying him with her name, e-mail, &amp; ph #, but also cc Wendy on the e-mail.  Then also let her know if the deadline is the 20th of each month, for the next mos healthcare.  She seemed to totally get it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-20 12:19:00', '2022-10-20 12:19:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105465028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109180012', 'Cameron Sutter', NULL, 'called him on oct 20th, 2022 and left a voicemail.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-20 12:04:29', '2022-10-20 12:04:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105465023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779277', 'Amy Giggey', NULL, '10-20-22 I presented to Amy''s team today. About 6-7 people joined the Zoom call and asked good questions. They are looking at this for their own team and possibly for the employer groups they work with who are all around the country.  I just sent Amy the written overview and forwarded the video email again. I don''t have her phone number. I''ll have to check in via email.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-20 12:03:18', '2022-10-20 12:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105465018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109779277', 'Amy Giggey', NULL, '10-7-22 Amy game via Shelley! They have an hourly work force. Some are on spouses ins and others need ins or more affordable ins. Amy likes alternative care but doesn''t use it at this point. Their Talent Team offers/connects fractional HR workers to HR jobs. Most are in their 30''s and 40''s. Oldest is close to 50 but not yet. Amy is paying $1600 for EF now. She is taking some meds. I think sirtroline and gabapentin. Husband may have some health issues that she''s reviewing as well. They have employees around the country, but more specifically WA, PA, TX, NC, NM. WA is an issue now. PA OK, for the moment and the rest are fine.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-20 11:56:30', '2022-10-20 11:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105432038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099851002', 'Ronald Guerra', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-20 11:10:54', '2022-10-20 11:10:54'),
