  ('zcrm_1579374000105315026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '10-19-2022:  When Michael saw the doc, they disc either a colonoscopy or ColoGuard.  We talked about it''s one or the other, so if he does the ColoGuard &amp; needs a colonoscopy after the fact, the colonoscopy will NOT be pd for.  He seems to understand, but wanted to tt Planstin to conf.  Made sure he has their ph #, then trans him to them.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-19 12:25:37', '2022-10-19 12:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105309013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105478001', 'Sean Little', NULL, 'I explained to him on oct 19th, 2022, that even though his bank will allow him to have access to an HSA without a qualified health plan. the IRS will tax his contributions if they audit him and find out his HSA is not associated with a qualified high deductible health plan.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-19 12:24:52', '2022-10-19 12:24:52'),
