  ('zcrm_1579374000105315003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105311002', 'Sandra Ganas', NULL, '10-19-2022:  Sandra called.  She couldn''t get into her Memb Portal Login (she was seeing the lower case ''l'' as a 1).  Got her in &amp; she uploaded the req''d info.
