  ('zcrm_1579374000105282028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', 'Email from member on 10/19', 'I have not been refunded any of this
Sent from my iPhone

I responded in Outlook due to some of my emails not going through the following:
Dear Jeff,

After speaking with your Agent, Jonathan, we realized that there is a misunderstanding of what you are expecting the HMA card to cover.

While MPB Health is not affiliated with the HMA, (Individual Agents are appointed with them) and is not listed as one of our Healthcare Services, I will be happy to send the link for you to review what HMA covers and what it does not.  This way there is no confusion.

As a company, MPB Health cannot refund any of the itemized receipts.  Health Matching Accounts are additional items you purchased from your Agent, not from MBP Health.

Here is the link for you to review what HMA covers for your convivence.  Again, I researched and found this on their website and am not sure this is exactly what is accurate.  

The best solution would be to reach out to your HMA agent to determine if the itemized receipts fall into any of the categories listed.

https://www.healthmatchingaccounts.com/what-does-the-hma-card-cover/

What Medical Services Does The HMA ® Cover?
The Health Matching Account (HMA ®) is a non-qualified, medical benefit savings plan that pays for most out-of-pocket, medical expenses that your health insurance and Medicare does not cover.You can access your HMA ® plan benefits at qualified medical providers by swiping your HMA ® Medical Reimbursement Visa ® Prepaid Cards.. Any purchases at grocery store pharmacies or for other ...
