  ('zcrm_1579374000105283003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096786002', 'Jonathan Lampert-Hiller', NULL, 'I was copied on a request from this member dated 10/5 for a copy of the member''s 1095A.  I responded to the email and let the member know that since he has only been on the plan since 8/22 Planstin would be sending out forms next year.  I explained what a 1095A was and that it would be issued by the Marketplace if he was on the ACA at any time in 2022.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-19 08:24:11', '2022-10-19 08:24:11'),
