  ('zcrm_1579374000105273003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103472001', 'Jorge Trejo', NULL, 'Called for 2nd time to discuss specifics of MPB Health and confirm selection.   Waiting on call back.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2022-10-19 07:43:22', '2022-10-19 07:43:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762047', 'David Holstein', NULL, '10-18-2022:  David submitted an RX Quote.  He''s been using Costco, but is open to another pharmacy if cheaper.  He says he been paying $20 tot for the 2 RXs.  If that''s corr, this may not be helpful.  But, here''s what I sent:
     - Lisinopril 20mg tabs, #90 = $7.74 at Safeway on RXGo  [Costo''s retail price is listed on GoodRX as $12.48 on 10/17/2022, then $16.70 on 10/18/2022.  No coupon necessary.]
     - Amlodipine 10mg tabs, #90 = $9.68 at Safeway on RXGo.  [I also sent the Costco coupon = $14.99 in case it''s helpful.]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-19 01:26:37', '2022-10-19 01:37:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, '10-18-22 Schaana is aware of the price change and asking if any changes to membership. No. She also wants better prescription plan. I recommended she call MPB Concierge for best options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-18 21:09:23', '2022-10-18 21:09:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '10-18-2022:  Nathalie called after speaking to Wendy.  The bill is something that just showed up &amp; Redirect had told Nathalie was already pd.  Nathalie is going to touch base w/Redirect to see if maybe the payment and bill did not link.  IF she needs us to submit a support/rush, she will call us back.  She thought her touching base w/them prior to us submitting the req was a good idea.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-18 17:44:39', '2022-10-18 17:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '10-18-22 Nathalie called to find out how to get reimbursed for her wellness visit. I told her that''s through Redirect and she should call MPB Concierge for assistance. I gave her the # and let her know to call MPB Concierge for all other things to help her know what path to choose for services and benefits. She will put the # in her phone. She will call them now. She''s super sweet and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-18 17:30:35', '2022-10-18 17:30:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '10-18-2022:  Paul called to get an invite to sched a ''Welcome Call''.  His wife has one sched for this Thurs w/Vanessa &amp; wants her call to be private &amp; not include him.  So, I resent him an invite so he can sched.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-18 17:00:38', '2022-10-18 17:02:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098026002', 'Jessica Hamilton', NULL, '10-18-22 Jessica is moving back to NY suddenly bc of some recent mental health episodes. So, will need to cancel her membership. She wasn''t happy with it either. I called her back and helped walk her through the cancellation process. I let her know that her membership will still work in NY but she didn''t want it. I think she gets a subsidy and perhaps better plans in NY. This is where she just moved from recently and will go back to. Unexpected turn of events bc of her mental health events. She was super nice and appreciative of my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-18 16:32:09', '2022-10-18 20:36:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '10-14-22 David called wanting to know new price with just Ilyse on plan. I don''t know new number bc it will be calculated when he''s removed. I let him know the est income for 2022 which he wanted to verify as well. Left vm for him now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-18 16:27:10', '2022-10-18 16:27:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '10-18-2022:  Julie''s ''med need'' is for chiropractic.  W/in last 6 mos. she''s been having chiro care &amp; rolfing.  His advisor Wendy Scipione mentioned this might be shared.  I sent Randall the temp for sub a ''need'' to Zion.  We walked thru how to sub the ''need'' and what to expect &amp; look for.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-18 15:46:40', '2022-10-18 16:23:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059112004', 'Salt Garrison', NULL, '10-18-22 Salt called and was very angry that he had to repeat what he wanted. He expected me to send him some new insurance options. But, those aren''t available yet for 2023. He was yelling at me, so I was flustered. He said I failed to send him new options and therefore, I don''t care about him or his needs. Per the notes above, he had a bad experience with Zion and also has Bright Health.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-18 15:11:20', '2022-10-18 15:11:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059112004', 'Salt Garrison', NULL, '10-18-2022:  Salt called - he spoke to someone who was going to get back to him about cancelling his plan, but had not heard back.  When I mentioned it looked like he''d spoken to Wendy, he said that sounded right.  I made sure he has her #, then trans him over to her line.  He is aware that if he cancels, there''s a form he''ll need to sign.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-18 14:53:18', '2022-10-18 14:53:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105229010', 'Michael LeWinter', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 14:43:32', '2022-10-18 14:43:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105229002', 'Lisa Slivka', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 14:38:43', '2022-10-18 14:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079574001', 'ronald rawdon', NULL, 'Member Only Essentials', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 14:35:05', '2022-10-18 14:35:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079574001', 'ronald rawdon', NULL, 'Secure membership cancelled eff 9/30/22 due to Non Payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 14:34:52', '2022-10-18 14:34:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105664002', 'Samuel Fredricksmeyer', NULL, '10-18-22 IS covered through the end of Oct. So, we may explore other options than Bright Health since they are leaving the state as of 2023. She''ll call me back shortly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-18 14:21:38', '2022-10-18 14:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001413013', 'Aaron Weiner', NULL, '10-18-22 Randall is aware that $915 a month is steal super affordable. But, he asked about his wife''s newest medical incident where she fell off a dock and need some chiropractic care and rolfing. They''ve spent about $1500 so far. I let him know chiro will likely be shared but rolfing needs pre-approval. I also told him of the 6 month time limit and it''s definitely within the 6 months. I recommended he call the MPB Concierge Team which he will do to start a new Need and potential try to get pre-approval for any remaining rolfing work on her hip (I think). Super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-18 14:20:45', '2022-10-18 14:20:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904178', 'Gerald Roper', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove spouse from membership due to divorce.  I will notify RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; update in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 13:59:45', '2022-10-18 14:05:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083353002', 'Maribeth Liska', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  Was unable to reach Mike to speak about cancellation.  I will cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 13:34:15', '2022-10-18 13:34:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380127', 'Bryan Snyder', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation as they are now on spouses employer benefits.  I will cancel in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 13:28:45', '2022-10-18 13:28:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099851002', 'Ronald Guerra', NULL, '10-18-2022:  Ron called back.  He had questions on sub the ''med need'', who he could see (in ntwk), etc.
     - This is due to an accident (I think he said he was stepping onto a boat on 10/2/22 & hurt his knee).  He thought it would heal on it''s own, so he gave it a few weeks to heal & when it wasn''t getting better went to see his PCP.  His doc had him get an MRI & doc thinks he will need to have surgery, but results are out on the MRI still.
     - He was unaware that he has an IUA (not ded), so we discussed issue spec, save all receipts, inv for this issue - all will be sub twds his IUA.
     - Since he''s looking for a good surgeon, showed him HCBB & how to use.
     - Ron hadn''t had his ''Welcome Call'' yet either.  Is open to getting that done, so I sent him another invite     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-18 13:26:25', '2022-10-18 17:19:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105191058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081778002', 'Patrick Neary', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation.  Mike has been unavailable I will cancel in A123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-18 13:21:56', '2022-10-18 13:21:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099851002', 'Ronald Guerra', NULL, '10.18.22 - Ronald may be having surgery on his meniscus. I walked him through how to open a need and advised Ronald to give us a call on the concierge team if he needs any further assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-18 12:45:41', '2022-10-18 12:45:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083353002', 'Maribeth Liska', NULL, '10.18.22 - Spoke with Charles Liska who wanted to cancel. They have been trying to reach Mike Montes since last week but unfortunately Mike had a family emergency he had to tend to.  Patti Baron gave the approval to send Charles the cancelation form so I sent it via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-18 11:58:09', '2022-10-18 11:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098564012', 'Michael Stephens', NULL, '10-18-2022:  Michael called.  His daughter has a dental appt today &amp; Leo mentioned the disc program.  Got him to WHLC &amp; sent a link for his Dr Snodgrass, Aetna, &amp; 20% off one day sale.  He''s going to call &amp; get the actual price from DentalPlans.com.  Knows to ask about early cancellations since he only wants thru end of yr.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-18 11:50:00', '2022-10-18 11:50:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058195001', 'Steve Ramona', NULL, '10.18.22 - Sent Steve another welcome call scheduler so that he could schedule his call. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-18 11:41:13', '2022-10-18 11:41:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105223003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083233002', 'Heidi Holliday', NULL, '10-18-2022:  Heidi called.  She''s been working w/CirrusMD on her sons illness (he was exposed at daycare).  But, with his symptoms, the doc rec seeing a pediatrician.  We tried locating on in the PHCS ntwk so they would have the relationship once she''s ready for ''prev care'' and she has that list.  Next we tried HCBB but the pediatricians weren''t helpful, nor was pricing.  Uber Doc brought up places 150 miles from her...  We disc Urg Care being a good option since he''s sick now & there are 3 w/good ratings near her.  Disc pres as ''cash-pay'', keeping receipt, det inv, and calling us if it looks like it will be ongoing (did tell her about 6mos deadline & not to wait that long).  She was very nice & did great considering how poorly her son feels in the background.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-18 11:19:11', '2022-10-18 11:19:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105160013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103810012', 'Paul Dagnese', NULL, '10.18.22 - Paula called in with questions on how to register for CirrusMD and how to schedule her welcome call. I walked her through both and she was happy! ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-18 11:07:12', '2022-10-18 11:07:12'),
