  ('zcrm_1579374000105216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097831124', 'Colleen Clark', NULL, 'I spoke to Colleen on oct 18th about the difference between her plan and her employers aetna plan and the fact the her coworker is paying 125 a month for preventative and dental included when she only pays 50 a month for essentials and justified the plan she''s with by explaining that she would be prepaying for preventative services about 900 a year extra if she switched over. I also explained that she currently does not have catastrophic coverage and should consider it but she she said she would wait 1 more year before switching to a plan with catastrophic coverage. She also said she got my 1DENTAL plan link and will be purchasing the 99 per year discount plan. I told her I will call her a year from now to followup about catastrophic coverage.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-18 10:09:44', '2022-10-18 10:09:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105166040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104188170', 'Avshalom Blum', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book welcome call after his start date of November 1, 2022. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-18 09:58:43', '2022-10-18 09:58:43'),
