  ('zcrm_1579374000105000190', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Lynn is going in to have a varicose vein rem''d & she wanted to know the process.  Because I wasn''t sure how they look at this, I told her she is corr: IF this is something they consider shareable, present as ''cash-pay'' to the 1k IUA, then sub a ''med need'' which she says she''s done before.  However, she''s wanting to conf this will be cov, after we disc how to present IF it''s shareable, I made sure she has Zion''s ph # & trans her so she can conf w/the ''med need'' dept.  It was 10-minutes until 6:00pm, so I let her know I was rushing more than normal to make sure she can get there help before they close.    - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 17:53:54', '2022-10-17 18:03:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000185', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Shelly e-mailed to get her RX Quote, replied w/this coupon:
