  ('zcrm_1579374000105000180', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '10-17-2022:  When I signed out on Fri 10/15/2022 there were no missed, when I came in on Monday it said I''d missed her call!  Call &amp; LM to see if we can help.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 17:07:22', '2022-10-17 17:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080106002', 'Trish Dew', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Trish called to get help in learning about the counseling for her son.  I had 2 people on the line, so I was less detailed w/her than I normally am.  I got her to the MAP site.  Let her know the assistance # will help her find an in ntwk counselor in their area; will go over how the sessions are structured; they can choose to pay during the waiting period; etc.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 16:36:19', '2022-10-17 16:36:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079059075', 'Jon Hancock', NULL, '10-17-2022: Jon called.  He''s going to the derm for a ck up.  We disc how that''s not a benefit on his ''prev care'', then went over how to present as ''cash-pay'' for the 2500 IUA.  If it should start adding up because there is an issue &amp; it''s not just maint, or it looks like he''ll be going for contuing care on this, he''ll call us to learn how to sub a ''med need'' to the healthsharing comp.  Let him know that would be unusual.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 15:56:44', '2022-10-17 15:56:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089999002', 'Sean Covel', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Sean called back again to see if chiro adj are cov on his plan.  I let him know that unless it''s a part of a larger need, no maint chiro is available on this plan.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 15:51:55', '2022-10-17 15:51:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380127', 'Bryan Snyder', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Bryan called - his wife just got a teaching job &amp; they are now getting benfits thru that job (ben are already eff).  He''s going to fill out the cancellation for &amp; sub before the 20th, so they won''t be billed for Nov mo cont.  He knows our plan will still go thru 10/31/22.  Since it''s ben thru an employer, I did not mention their advisor Michael Montes.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 15:36:13', '2022-10-17 15:36:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000146', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081778002', 'Patrick Neary', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Patrick Neary called to cancel.  I asked if he''s tt Michael Montes yet &amp; he has not.  He''s going to sub the cancellation form because he doesn''t want to get charged for his mo cont on the 20th.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 15:01:19', '2022-10-17 15:01:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257159', 'Michele Schwadron', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Michele called.  She fell playing tennis this weekend &amp; thinks she fractured her wrist.  She had questions on Urg Care, how to present as ''cash-pay'' for the 1k IUA, etc.  She''s going to go to the Urg Care &amp; see what they think.  She knows we need to start a ''med need'' asap if it looks like it''ll be ongoing (&amp; the dedline for sub is 6 mos).', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 14:51:52', '2022-10-17 15:41:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000127', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Michael called trying to understand what labs he can get (he''s curr in the doc''s off for his prev appt).  His PA is listed as in ntwk, but he totally doesn''t understand in ntwk.  We went over it and over it... and over it again.  He says he tt someone earlier (Jennifer).  For as much as we''ve gone over, I''m concerned because he is not grasping it!
     - Finally suggested he call Planstin, because he was struggling to understand all srvcs incl labs need to be in ntwk (plus I do not see any labs listed w/in 20 miles & it will not adj to 50 miles).  
     - Let him know lipid panel def cov @ in ntwk lab & while he''s tt Planstin he should confirm STD panel, but all other labs are his resp.  He got angry at this point saying what am I paying for then?  Let him know the gvmt determines what is & is not cov on the ACA MEC.  I''m not really sure this plan fits for him.   - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 14:20:20', '2022-10-17 15:07:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '10.17.22 - Michael has called in several times regarding his preventative care visit that he is currently at the doctors office for. I gave him the information regarding what he needs to say in order to keep this as a preventative care visit. Michael seems very uncertain about what he needs to do and the coverage his plan has. Cari and I have both held his hand through several scenarios but he just does not seem like he is grasping what his plan entails. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-17 14:20:00', '2022-10-17 14:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105092025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '10-17-22 Cecelia is 38 and husband is 42. They live on Beals Island!! She knows of the Great Wahs Island hike we do and lives right near another shorter, 1 mile hike that we should try. She is self-employed but on pseudo maternity leave now. She wants the wellness visits for her baby, so SECURE is best. They are all super healthy, no health issues, no meds, no tobacco. They are considering a possible 3rd child. I told her to wait the 60 days after their effective date if they choose to have another child. It''s no problem. She totally "gets it."  I mentioned that often times meds are cheaper by paying cash that what a co-pay often is. She said she always suspected and wondered that. Their Ped. Dr. Alf Wakeman is in the network. I suggested that she double check first. But, also the network is hopefully getting removed very soon anyhow. She''s willing to go to the other doctors in that same practice for her own wellness visit, if need be. She''s totally flexible and easy going.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-17 13:55:30', '2022-11-07 11:25:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105062092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086960002', 'Thomas Worley', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to add spouse &amp; newborn.  Member''s spouse had to cancel her enrollment due to the fact that she was pregnant prior to enrollment.  Per Zion guideline newborn will be effective 7 days after birth if not part of a need.  Spouse will be effective 11/1/22.  I will notify Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-17 13:30:16', '2022-10-17 13:30:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075077302', 'Sharon Duclos', NULL, '10.17.22 - Sharon called to update her payment information. I sent her the member payment update form and sent Patti a note that Sharon is updating her info. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-17 13:21:50', '2022-10-17 13:21:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103037010', 'Genelle Davis', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Andy called for information on their plan.  They never completed their ''Welcome Call'', so I sent them a link to resched per his req.  
     - 
     - CA

As I was logging-out of GoTo, their ph # showed up as an incoming call.  I did not answer since it was already 6pm on my computer clock.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 13:03:58', '2022-10-17 18:02:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073820032', 'Ottis Fausett', NULL, '10-17-2022:  This ph # shows up as missed from Friday (which it did NOT show when I signed-up off).  I called the # back &amp; Suzanne she tt someone (Jennifer mayber per her?).  Says she''s frustrated about already having her colonoscopy sched &amp; now w/price inc is looking at going to Direct from Secure...  She seemed okay &amp; just trying to figure out what to do.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 13:03:39', '2022-10-17 13:03:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080584001', 'Zubair Niazi', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Zubair called to get info on how to update his address.  Walked him to the ''Memb Updates'' section & how to sub.  Can see the form came in.
     - His wife needs endoscopy, but it''s on a pre-x issue.  We talked about this is the waiting period year and if it''s a qualified ''med need'' on a pre''x item, they will have up to 25k help in the second year.  If she needs to do it now, it will be their rep, but if she can wait until 12/2/22, they will move into the 2nd yr.  He''ll call if they need to sub a ''med need'' down the road.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 13:02:50', '2022-10-17 15:59:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061691127', 'Stephen Scharf', NULL, '10.17.22 - Script quote from 10/17/22 Alprazolam completed. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-17 12:44:45', '2022-10-17 12:44:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105039061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105478001', 'Sean Little', NULL, 'Tupac has been in communication with Sean since Sean sent in a chat on SalesIQ over the weekend on Saturday Oct. 15th. Tupac has answered and explained what Sean inquired about on Saturday 10/15/22. Sean is all set for now with further communication through Tupac. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2022-10-17 12:42:27', '2022-10-17 12:42:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '10/17/2022:  Trans this to Wendy.', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 12:37:32', '2022-10-17 12:37:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105062087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, 'Received a cancellation request from this member.  Per Joan''s note below she has already spoke to member I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-17 12:29:57', '2022-10-17 12:29:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089999002', 'Sean Covel', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Sean called to get help w/getting into CirrusMD.  Once I pointed him in the right direction, he realized he already has the app on his ph &amp; was all set.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 12:09:41', '2022-10-17 12:09:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105092020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108605009', 'Stephany Cecelia Mandryk', NULL, '10-12-22 "Hi Wendy-

We spoke at the beginning of the year about MPB but I was newly pregnant and so had a ''preexisting conditioning''. Now we have a healthy baby boy on the outside and we''re in the market for something different than is on offer through traditional insurance. 

I have some questions about what care looks like for a toddler and an infant (are there in person visits possible for well child visits?). 

I''m happy to connect through email or phone. 

Thanks, 
Cecelia"

This lead clearly came from my client as it''s showing Jaime Boswell as the Referring Member.  This never should have been passed off to anyone else. Fortunately, Cecelia reached out to me directly again to follow through, per our initial discussion about her pregnancy at the time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-17 12:07:03', '2022-10-17 12:07:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105092012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105143014', 'Susan Morrison', NULL, '10-14-22 Susan needs financial assistance with 6 credit card debts and others. She''s working on her own business with very spotty income. I connected her with MPowering America via Matt Lovelady.  Here are the notes from the MPA Rep.

Entered By: Aja Rosehill - aja@mpoweringamerica.com
Notified: mlawler@mpoweringamerica.com, wendys@mympb.com

Wendy called our 877-LINE to connect MPower with her client, Susan Morrison. Wendy did not make an appointment online, so we continued the call using our phone system versus Google Meet. This was the longest Q.S. appointment I have ever sat through - 1 hour and 26 minutes. Although this is not a guaranteed enrollment, MPower successfully provided Susan with some suggestions/financial food for thought. Susan has her own business (she is the sole proprietor), so her income fluctuates - daily and weekly income. After 38 minutes, I invited Meredith to assist me with answering Susan''s questions. Susan was difficult to work with as she kept talking over Meredith and me, asking the same questions we were attempting to answer. Meredith was great with Susan on the phone, especially when Susan started crying. Meredith swooped in and comforted her, talked her down, and provided her with positive thoughts and affirmations. She has a unique debt scenario comprised of unsecured debt, an SBA loan, and IRS tax debt. Our meeting this morning was to address her credit card debt. Susan runs her own business, so she wants to keep 1 personal credit card and 1 business credit card. She wants to keep her Citi Costco credit card (business card) and American Airlines Mastercard (personal card). The analysis/quote we offered her included both of these cards. Susan is still undecided about enrolling - she will do some more research this weekend and continue discussing her finances with other debt companies. We gave her some homework - Susan will need to look into opening a new bank account, a transfer balance or personal loan for her personal credit card account, and a new business card for her business credit card account. Meredith recommended that she open a new account at an FCU. Susan has her homework to complete before her E.S. Appointment with Meredith on Monday, 10-17-22.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-17 11:51:59', '2022-10-17 11:53:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '10-17-2022:  Christopher called to find out how to sub a ''med need''.  He''s have a bunch of warts take care of & it will be > his 1k IUA!  I sent him the temp & walked thru how to do.  He''s already spent ~$700 & the next treatment should take him past the 1k IUA mark.  He knows to try to hit as close as possible, just so the $ isn''t out of his pkt longer than nec.
     - He said he gave them his ''card'' & they were billing, but when I asked what card, first he said his MPB.Health, then he said his RCI card (?  sb a Planstin card) so we went over diff comp for diff things.  ''P''lanstin = ''P''reventative only.  If billed to those companies, won''t matter, it''ll just be declined.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 11:43:39', '2022-10-17 11:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762047', 'David Holstein', NULL, '10-17-2022:  David called back.  He wanted to figure out how to get into his different  components and make sure they rec''d the new address he sub.
     - Told him I can see our Ben Admin rec''d his form & are working to update.
     - Gave him his user name & PW to access his MPB.Health Memb Port & showed him what is avail there.
     - Helped him sign-in and see what''s avail in MAP & WHLC
     - He had questions about chg to a diff plan due to cheaper prices.  Sugg tt his advisor Misty Berryman would be the best way to make sure that''s a good choice.  Says his only pre-x is well maint HBP,
     - Got him to CirrusMD, but it''s saying they don''t recog him.  Sen', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-17 11:13:15', '2022-10-17 11:13:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105062082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075077302', 'Sharon Duclos', NULL, 'Member called and she had her account hacked and needs to update her card.  I will send her out PU link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-17 10:38:24', '2022-10-17 10:38:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105075091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100703002', 'Justin McKinley', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-17 10:05:09', '2022-10-17 10:05:09'),
