  ('zcrm_1579374000105000053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083478001', 'Kimberly McClure', NULL, '10.17.22 - Kimberly called about her CirrusMD services but realized she had found the app on her phone. She no longer needed assistance. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-17 07:13:27', '2022-10-17 07:13:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096344002', 'Mark Leubscher', NULL, '10-16-2022:  Sabrina sent e-mail requesting a form for their emplyer (St of FL): "completed HIS-IP-2 form or letter of coverage from our insurance company."  Sent Teams for Monday to Patti to find out if this is a form we can supply.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-16 12:59:57', '2022-10-16 12:59:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105033148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105478001', 'Sean Little', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2356 Question : Can you help me understand the difference between the CARE PLUS and SECURE plans/', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-15 15:09:09', '2022-10-15 15:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103167002', 'Teresa Broaddus', NULL, '10-14-2022:  Teresa sub an RX Quote req at 5:29pm on a Friday evening.  I went ahead and sent her two coupons for the items she requested.  She''s a diabetic and her glucose monitor system is super expensive.  Since it was so late in the day I only ran GoodRX & RXGo, both were cheaper at RXGo and her pharmacy of choice was one of the lowest.  Here are the coupons I sent:
     - Levothyroxine (says she wants ''Brand'', so asked her if there is a spec ''Brand'' she wants, like: Synthroid, or?  Levothyroxine is the generic name) 50mcg tabs #90 = $10.31 at Fry''s on RXGo
     - FreeStyle Libre 2 Sensor (as best I can tell 1 kit = 28 day supply & that''s the day supp she req''d = $128.72 @ Fry''s on RXGo  [req in to Reid, but I do not believe he can do diabetic supplies]     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-14 23:10:42', '2022-10-14 23:10:42');
