  ('zcrm_1579374000105060171', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, 'Member requested a letter from me to Blue Cross Blue Shield Community Health Plan letting them know that they do not have any coverage for Maintenance Meds.  They need this because there is some sort of medication that daughter Olive needs.  I emailed out of the CRM.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-14 14:36:48', '2022-10-14 14:36:48'),
