  ('zcrm_1579374000105060131', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081119010', 'Christian Perry', NULL, 'Member called in and said that he was not aware of the price increase.  I advised that email &amp; hard mailer went out to him.  He asked if we had notified his employer of price increase.  I told him no, that he was the one that paid us and we had no agreement with his employer.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-14 13:31:59', '2022-10-14 13:31:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062935002', 'Bonnie Geier', NULL, '10-14-2022:  Bonnie needed to chg her address.  She was driving so I sent her Patti''s Memb Chg Form.  She''ll complete &amp; submit later.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-14 13:06:03', '2022-10-14 13:06:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078032261', 'Janet Winkelman', NULL, '10-14-2022:  Janet called, she had shingles last yr that attacked her eye.  Everything else has healed.  She says she has a bunch of invoices and receipts she now wants to submit.  According to her most of them are recent (I let her know they have a deadline for submission of 6mos &amp; that seemed okay, but she''d said "from last yr", so at least she knows now).  Walked her thru how to sub the ''med need''.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-14 13:05:40', '2022-10-14 18:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004762035', 'Traci Hoops', NULL, '10-14-2022:  Traci called looking for ENTs near her daughter who is curr living in Chicago: 60611.  Sent her the 4 that come up as Fair Priced on HCBB.  Also went over ''cash-pay'' to 1k IUA &amp; to call us to sub ''med need'' (6mos deadline, so call right away &amp; we''ll help if looks like it will be ongoing or over the 1k IUA).     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-14 13:04:22', '2022-10-14 13:04:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199001', 'Joseph Cozzoli', NULL, '10-14-2022:  Joe called for several items:
     - Had questions on what labs are cov, when to use Planstin (lipid panels), & when to use his Walk-in labs.
     - He had questions about what is and is not shared on Zion.  I sent him the curr 10/1/2022 Memb Guidelines.  Let him know to the ''Prev Care'' section does not apply to his membership (he has Planstin instead) and to be aware of the section headings & that these can be updated quartly.
     - Wanted to know exact amt in writing for taxes on the Planstin portion of his membership.  Trans him to Patti''s line.  He''ll LM if he doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-14 12:31:53', '2022-10-14 13:26:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, 'Wendy let me know that spouse has to stay on the plan after William ages into Medicare 12/1.  Since we are not able to enroll in that plan any more Melissa @Planstin has told me to change Primary to spouse delete spouse information and then change plans.  I will set a task as a reminder to be looking for Change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-14 11:41:15', '2022-10-14 11:41:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055019', 'Tim Sessler', NULL, '10-14-2022:  Autumn called.  She is going for her ''Well Woman'' visit, knew they''d chg''d plans & wondered if she had cov.  She asked about Planstin & I let her know that was only w/their old SECURE plan.  We disc price diff = $525 vs $420 = $105/mo x12mos = $1260 & how paying out of pckt for her ''prev care'' may be less?  She''s going to consider & will get back to us.
     - We went over getting asst from the MAP prog for counseling.  I gave her their asst ph #, went over the appt patterns, etc.  She may give them a call.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-14 11:29:12', '2022-10-14 11:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105083078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003268005', 'Tijana Coso', NULL, '10.14.22 - Tijana called for a list of MRI facilities in her area; I sent her that list along with the fair pricing from HCBB for a knee MRI with and w/o contrast. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-14 09:44:26', '2022-10-14 09:44:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, 'Joan reached out to me about this member.  Issue was that plan was input incorrectly in the transition to the Age banded pricing.  I will speak to Ashlee to get her to fix this on their end and fix in A123.  Michele to reach out to member and will email Mike to get with member to give him some options  as he will be aging into Medicare 3/23.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-14 09:11:52', '2022-10-14 09:11:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105083073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083353002', 'Maribeth Liska', NULL, '10.14.22 - Maribeth called to cancel so I direct transferred her to her advisor, Mike Montes. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-14 08:53:57', '2022-10-14 08:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105057125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061571018', 'Randy Sherer', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Member Assistant', 'Visit ID : 2353 Question : I was chatting with Kelly but got kicked off my chat. My wife and I are looking to have our health and wellness blood work done, like CMP and Lipid Panel. Trying to find closest lab to have that done.', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-14 08:53:00', '2022-10-14 08:53:00'),
