  ('zcrm_1579374000105075053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000106045002', 'Lance Simonson', NULL, 'Care+: For Individuals and Families - $1,000 I.U.A. - She is from Arizona, She is 47 years old, She has 8 children.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-14 07:33:42', '2022-10-14 07:33:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105096028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '10-13-2022:  Shawna called for help:
     - WHLC - we got her reg''d, but she was disappointed that the chiro disc in her area are not the 50% she''d hoped for from the e-mail she rec''d.
     - We also disc finding a PCP in ntwk, creating a relationship so she can use them for illness visits too.  She wants to see a gyno as well & I let her know she can have both well visits on Planstin.  Made sure she has the ''Summary of Care'' post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail (resent it to her because she couldn''t find it), so she can go into healthcare.gov to conf what is & is not cov on her ''prev'' care Planstin.  She says she already knows how to use the PHCS search.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-13 18:04:06', '2022-10-13 18:06:39'),
