  ('zcrm_1579374000105042085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092843002', 'Madison Yount', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 2348 Question : I would like to discuss an individual that called me on a service call', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2022-10-13 16:57:35', '2022-10-13 16:57:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356696', 'Shawna Rohrbach', NULL, '10-13-22 Shawna called bc she wants to find discounts for chiro/acu/alternative etc. But, she couldn''t remember how to access it and couldn''t find my email. I gave her the MPB Concierge # and she found her card. It sounds like an old card. I told her to ask Concierge when she calls. She had also asked Planstin about the other benefits and they had no idea, of course. So, now she better understands MPB''s role and will utilize MPB Team now. She feels better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-13 16:26:23', '2022-10-13 16:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105096023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060578451', 'Wil Bowers', NULL, '10-13-2022:  Wil called because he wants to have a colonoscopy. We walked thru the PHCS MultiPlan search; HCBB; and how it works on both Planstin (all rules - incl going from screening to diagnostic & on his healthshare) and his healthshare.  We also went over finding a PCP in case the gastroenterolgist req an order from his "doc".  He moved to CA right before the pandemic & is now trying to get established in the area.  He took in a lot of info, so he may call back as he moves thru the proc.  I told him we''d be glad to talk again.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-13 15:56:52', '2022-10-13 15:56:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105096018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103641001', 'Peter Reimer', NULL, '10-13-2022: Peter called.  They just found out his wife is expecting, so he wanted to see how maternity would work.  Sadly, it''s too soon for cov due to the ''waiting period''.
     We talked about options:  ACA Plan w/open enrollment or Spec Enrollment Period (since he was changing jobs)?  I looked in depth for a good ND site & sent him a link to one that show a subsidy calculator, but am not sure of the best way to go on this.  It''s only been 13-days, he could approach his old employer?  He was grateful for the guidance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-13 15:53:46', '2022-10-13 15:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091124009', 'Sara Forrest', NULL, '10-13-22 Sara has new employer coverage at about $300 per paycheck and paid twice a month or semi monthly. It is affordable for her portion. It''s about $600 a month. Not sure she''ll do any better on C4 for husband and child. Left vm for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-13 15:20:14', '2022-10-13 15:20:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105070043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, '10-13-22 Meghan removed herself from the membership bc her employer has decided to add benefits. So, she''s all set, but Jay needs to keep his membership. She completed the form online with my help. She reached the confirmation page to remove herself. All set for Nov. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-13 14:54:42', '2022-10-13 14:54:42'),
