  ('zcrm_1579374000105075043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105478001', 'Sean Little', NULL, 'I spoke to him Tuesday, oct 13th 2022. in the afternoon. He''s going through a divorce. He has two kids one daughter aged 6, one son age 3. his wife is 37 and he is 38. They have no preexisting and he wants the cheapest care plus plan.', 'Tony Manzanarez', 'Tony Manzanarez', '2022-10-13 13:27:57', '2022-10-13 13:27:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105096008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000092843002', 'Madison Yount', NULL, '10-13-2022:  Madison called orig to update her DOB.  Somehow it is completely inaccurate.  It sb: 8/30/1994.  I had her sub a ''chg form'' & let her know the Ben Admin may need a copy of her driver''s lic or something.
