         Generic Adderall XR (=Dextroamphetamine-Amphet XR) 20mg caps, #30 = $27.63 @ KS on RXGo
     She is open to other pharmacies if we see it cheaper elsewhere, but KS is her fav & was cheapest today.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-13 13:24:21', '2022-10-13 13:24:21'),
