  ('zcrm_1579374000105039029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '10-12-22 Kimberly is 55 and meniscus knee issue and she''s willing to be our 1st test case with the MSK company. She would Love nothing more than to avoid meniscus knee surgery and is totally open to alternative therapies, if/when possible. I sent a note to Rod and John T.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-12 15:01:21', '2022-10-12 15:01:21'),
