  ('zcrm_1579374000105076018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060670234', 'William Gage', NULL, '10.12.22 - William called because he stated he called Planstin and was told that he had an inactive account. I explained to William several times that he does have an active account and that perhaps Planstin made a mistake by telling him it was inactive. William and I went around in circles about this and also about the fact that he said the pharmacy told his daughter she no longer has "insurance". I explained to William that they are correct, they do not have insurance and I asked what he was presenting at the pharmacy 3 different times and he wouldn''t tell me. I advised William to have the doctors office give the concierge line a call and we would explain to the offices the type of plan him and his family currently has. 

I did call Planstin personally to verify that William and his family do have an active plan. Karen (Planstin) stated that they are, in fact, active in Planstin''s system and that she does not show that William has called in at all. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-12 14:32:54', '2022-10-12 14:32:54'),
