  ('zcrm_1579374000105062018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082307002', 'Massimo Giammarco', NULL, '10-12-2022:  Max wants a new PCP so he can get his anxiety med refilled.  (He''s been on it 20-yrs (?) &amp; is really struggling because his doc is out.)  We went thru finding HCBB in the post ''Welcome Call'' e-mail &amp; using UberDoc for ''Primary Care'' (those he felt were too expensive).  But, he was glad we talked &amp; will call around.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-12 12:41:15', '2022-10-12 13:04:14'),
