  ('zcrm_1579374000105076013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060475077', 'James Brown', NULL, '10.12.22 - Member called in because he stated that he called Planstin and they told him he no longer has an active plan. The member swore that he did not cancel his plan. I advised this member that I needed some time to look into this so that I could verify that he did not cancel. The member then got upset because I could not just "reinstate" his plan for him. He stated that we are not mandated by the fed government so we can reinstate him at any time. I explained that we do have a process that we need to go through, even if he wanted to reenroll in his plan. The member then stated that he wanted me to tell him why I couldn''t just reenroll him, even though I did explain our process, and got extremely belligerent with me. I advised the member that I was just trying to assist him and that there was no reason for him to be as rude as he was being to me. He told me that he is a very straightforward person and that I needed to take it. I advised the member that I would return his call once I got to the bottom of things and he was very unhappy that I wouldn''t just reenroll him in his plan.

After speaking with Patti Baron, it was found that James did in fact cancel his plan on 8/26/2022. Patti offered to email him the cancelation form that he submitted but I advised Patti that I would call him and if James wanted it I would have her send it to him. I called James to let him know that he did cancel his plan on 8/26/22 and he demanded that I reinstate his plan. I tried to explain to James that he would have to reenroll with Mike Montes. Before I could go any further with James, he told me how horrible and awful I am and hung up on me. Patti informed Mike Montes about how rude James was to me via phone. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-12 12:21:03', '2022-10-12 12:21:03'),
