  ('zcrm_1579374000105002041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105051018', 'Talia Claman', NULL, '10-11-22 Waive the $100 fee since part of Tova Jacober''s family! Talia is 20. She just returned from abroad 1 week ago. She expects to be here for about 1 year at least. She doesn''t have any income yet but family definitely doesn''t want Medicaid. Discussed CARE+ at $1000/$215 and $25 annually. No health issues. Parasites she thinks was more than 2 years ago, so no issue. She will possibly be able to keep her travel insurance according to her dad for the rest of this month. Enrolling tomorrow at 2:00.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-11 19:22:42', '2022-10-11 19:23:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105002033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105093002', 'Elizabeth Koster', NULL, '10-11-22 Elizabeth is 33 and turning 34 soon. She just quit her job and lost her health ins. Husband has health ins through work but adding her and the kids is way too expensive. They have a 7 and 4 year old. They do not do annual wellness visits but asked about labs and kids annual physical for school.  I told her preventative is not included but she can just pay the cash price and still be ahead price wise.  She works for a restaurant and is W2. She quit the construction job that gave her the insurance. No health issues, no meds, no tobacco. She also watched the video and had a good understanding of it when I asked her questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-11 18:00:30', '2022-10-11 18:01:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105002028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026122744', 'Kimberly Payes', NULL, '10-11-22 Kim is calling about a possible surgery she needs to have done on her knee. Had cortisone shots done 2 months ago that she wants to include. I left vm and gave her Concierge # to call them for help and told her about the 6 month time limit from date of service. She can still include the dr. visit from 2 months ago. She really doesn''t want surgery bc she''s active but isn''t sure what else to do at this point. She might be a good candidate for MSK!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-11 17:50:21', '2022-10-11 17:50:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103044012', 'Timothy McCoy', NULL, '10-11-2022:  2nd RX Quote came for Timothy''s Methylphenidate ER (= gen Concerta) 36mg caps, #30.  
     - They req''d ''Patient Care Pharmacy''.  Found a coupon on RXGo for this pharmacy of $52.28, but it doesn''t show a logo, so mentioned to Timothy they may not be contracted w/RXGo & the pharmacy could call the 1-800 RXGo # to get details.  
     - Also sent a Kroger coupon as a backup @ $46.66 in case they need it.  It wasn''t the cheapest, but matched his earlier 2nd coupon.  (Let him know Meijer is cheapest at $41.10.)     -  CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 17:49:13', '2022-10-11 17:49:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105002023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105664002', 'Samuel Fredricksmeyer', NULL, '10-11-22 Beth (Elizabeth) is Sam''s mom. She''s helping get him set up because he''s turning 26 on the 18th of October. He''s living in Louisville and earning $52K. He is offered health ins through work for about $335 through Kaiser with $3K ded and $8700 mop. Earning too much for APTC and doesn''t qualify anyhow bc company offering ins. Works for Untapped Learning. Talked about MCS but then Beth learned that he may need a surgery on his shoulder. It has been injured and eve dislocates in his sleep. He need PT as well. He also had an emergency appendectomy 1 to 1 1/2 years ago. He also takes anxiety meds and sees therapist. Has some OCD as well. No tobacco use. Looked at the Bright Health Bronze $0 Deductible since he will need surgery. Let her know it''s with the Centura Health network. Sending instructions to sign up w C4 and select me as agent and then I will help with final enrollment before deadline. Only problem is she thinks he''ll be kicked off from her ins on his DOB. I''m not sure if they give him until the end of the month or not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-11 17:03:37', '2022-10-11 17:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, '10-11-2022:  Pace submitted an RX Quote for his daughter on her epilepsy medication.  It''s ~$1300 a month because they need brand name.  His daughter is on Medicaid, so he''s looking for a letter stating she does not have prescription benefits on our plan so that Medicaid will pay.  I let him know Patti would need to help w/that.  He was on another call as well, so he''ll call &amp; ask to be trans to her tomorrow.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 16:56:20', '2022-10-11 17:17:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080613002', 'Michael Van Horn', NULL, '10-11-2022:  Michael called &amp; rec''d 2 letters from Zion for his ''med need'', but it looks like they forgot to attach one of the checks.  I made sure he has Zion''s ph # &amp; trans him w/instructions to tt the ''need'' dept.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 16:27:16', '2022-10-11 16:27:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103044012', 'Timothy McCoy', NULL, '10-11-2022:  RX Quote came for Timothy''s Pregabalin (= gen Lyrica) 150mg caps, #90.  
     - They req''d ''Patient Care Pharmacy''.  Found a coupon on RXGo for this pharmacy of $18.46, but it doesn''t show a logo, so mentioned to Timothy they may not be contracted w/RXGo &amp; the pharmacy could call the 1-800 RXGo # to get details.  
     - Also sent a Kroger coupon as a backup @ $14.04 in case they need it.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 16:14:19', '2022-10-11 16:14:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006102293', 'Michael McClaflin', NULL, '10-11-2022:  Michael called.  He knows he''s going to this plan on 11/1/22, but was calling because he rec''d notice his cc didn''t go thru on his Liberty &amp; somehow thought we''d sent it?  I ck''d new &amp; old sides of Admin123 &amp; see the new membership &amp; an old HES plan.  I''m thinking Liberty may need to help him, but trans him to Patti''s VM  since it''s past 5pm.  I let him know she should be able to conf if the Liberty &amp; pymt issue is thru us since I''m uncertain from what I can see.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 16:01:33', '2022-10-11 16:06:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066206016', 'Jacqueline Olivier', NULL, '10-11-2022:  Jacqueline was in an accident in May 2022.  She was unconcious & her friend gave the ER her Zion card as her "ins".  She just rec''d the first bill from the accident & said we said we''d pay it, but now she''s being billed.  I asked if she''d let them know she''s cash pay & she went into how difficult this is.  Since the ER called Zion already, I went into how to sub a ''med need'' & the 6mos deadline, but sugg she tt Zion first since they have supposedly already been connected to the ER.  She''s going to call to make sure a ''need'' hasn''t already been started & will sub the bill immed if not.  She hasn''t pd her 1k IUA either, so she knows that pymt & uploading the receipt are also key.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 15:47:58', '2022-10-11 15:47:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091168002', 'Rebecca Bernard', NULL, '10-11-2022:  Rebecca called.  They are at her husb urology routine visit for labwork review to ck his PSA levels & the doc''s off is saying they do not take ''cash-pay'' pts.  She called to see if we can help.  I let her know we don''t have other options & sugg Zion may be able to advocate for them.  Made sure she had that #.  She''ll try them.  She said a friend also says their PCP has been bought out & is no longer taking ''cash-pay'' either.  She seems relatively calm, but how awful.  They''ve seen both these docs for years!     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 15:39:26', '2022-10-11 15:44:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105002018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103573008', 'Jacob Needham', NULL, '10.11.22 - Sharon called in extremely rude stating that she had a Welcome Call scheduled for today and why didn''t anyone call her. I asked for her to give me a moment while I checked the schedule. When I let Sharon know that I did not see her on the schedule for the next few weeks she got belligerent and stated that this was ridiculous. She insinuated that I was lying to her about the fact that she was not on the schedule. When I assured her that I was not lying and that I am looking at our schedule in real time she stated she was "done talking to me" and hung up. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-11 15:02:35', '2022-10-11 15:02:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, '10-11-2022:  Pace called needing help with the memb chg form.  Made sure he''s all set &amp; let him know since he got the req prior to 10/20/22, his mo cont should reflect the chg for his 10/20 draw.  He says he forgot his kids have other insurance, so he doesn''t need them to be on the plan.  Told him I believe the new mo cont will be $425 for himself &amp; his wife.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 14:54:22', '2022-10-11 14:54:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105051002', 'Harold Skaggs', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-11 14:43:59', '2022-10-11 14:43:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105062003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243295', 'Brooke Spencer', NULL, '10.10.22:  Brooke texted her husband, Tim, was using CirrusMD and found out they still have his old address on his account and he couldn''t change it.  I had Patti update the address in Admin123 which will be sent to CirrusMD and they should see the update and change it.  I texted this to Brooke and told her to give it a few days.  Then, if Tim doesn''t see an update w/CirrusMD, he can email support@cirrusmd.com and ask them to make the address update  and I asked Brooke to let me know if it gets done.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-11 14:21:25', '2022-10-11 14:21:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105002013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, '10.11.22 - Pace called needing a prescription quote form and a member change form link so that he could remove his children from his plan. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-11 14:20:48', '2022-10-11 14:20:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105060003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095919002', 'Pace Ellsworth', NULL, '10-11-2022:  Tried answering an incoming call, but they hung up or couldn''t hear me.  Called right back &amp; LM.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-11 14:17:56', '2022-10-11 14:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105000018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779530', 'Jaelynne Lay', NULL, 'Member called in and said that she had been cancelled out of ASi eff 3/22.  After speaking with John he authorized me to put her on the RCI MEC until the Sedera Transition to the Select + platform at which time we will have her enroll.  I will set a reminder to call Sedera to arrange for her to go on Select + transition.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-11 14:08:09', '2022-10-11 14:08:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000105050003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104534011', 'Yu Deng', NULL, 'Has not had time to go through the process.  Would like more information, webinars.. any info on California (secure) plan. sent an email. moved note to agent prospect.', 'Angela Brocious', 'Angela Brocious', '2022-10-11 13:31:16', '2022-10-12 09:16:35'),
