  ('zcrm_1579374000105039003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104964002', 'Sandra Erickson', NULL, 'Spoke to member regarding her sign up on the Sales Page without an agent and because she signed up in California with a Care+ plan and no MEC.

