  ('zcrm_1579374000105002003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023796008', 'Nancy Micloskey', NULL, '10.11.22 - Nancy called because she was told that the concierge team will negotiate her pricing for her appointment with her gynecologist. I explained that we do not do negotiations and we went over the self-pay process. We also discussed the MAP program because she is currently struggling with grief. I sent her the MAP program info via email. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-11 12:38:49', '2022-10-11 12:38:49'),
