  ('zcrm_1579374000104985008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, '10.11.22 - Kristen called because she had to have a sleeping apparatus due to sleep apnea. I explained that Zion does not share in anything related to sleep apnea and Kristen understood and is thankful that we have helped save her quite a bit of money since her membership start. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-11 11:56:27', '2022-10-11 11:56:27'),
