  ('zcrm_1579374000104990013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000104879002', 'Drew Leder', NULL, '10.07.22:  Cindy emailed &amp; said she is ready to make the change to her membership (remove children) and enroll Drew for a 11/1/22 start date, as he is home today.  I scheduled the enrollment for today at 3:30 pm.  We completed Drew''s enrollment and I told him to make sure he schedules a Welcome Call to learn more about his plan. I also explained general use of the plan as a self-pay patient.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-11 11:44:55', '2022-10-11 11:44:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104990008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '10.11.22:  Called Cindy at 11 a.m. EST.  She and Clay were just finishing up his enrollment.  I explained the basics of his Care Plus plan and strongly urged him to schedule a Welcome Call after Nov. 1, to learn how to use the plan and access the services.  I told him he will be receiving several onboarding emails and a letter with his MPB membership card.  I mentioned that, as a member, he has to participate in managing his health care and to call me with any questions.  I emailed Clay a summary of what I explained to him during our call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-11 11:30:45', '2022-10-11 11:30:45'),
