  ('zcrm_1579374000104944052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, '10-10-2022: Valerie hurt her back &amp; wanted to see how to handle.  She''s going to see a doc &amp;  understands she''s ''cash-pay'' for $500 IUA.  She knows how to sub a ''need'' to Sedera, so she''ll get a ''need'' started as soon as she see''s the doc to req help w/treatment, esp if it''s over the $500.  She''ll call if she needs further assistance.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-10 16:37:37', '2022-10-10 16:38:46'),
