  ('zcrm_1579374000104944034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000069838046', 'Brian Dotson', NULL, '10-10-2022:  Brian called to get details on colonoscopy.  Went over PCHS MultiPlan ntwk search, HCBB, and all things colonoscopy/Planstin.  Knows could move to diagnostic w/$2500 IUA.  Will call us for help sub need if that happens.
