  ('zcrm_1579374000104944026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937066', 'Margaret Tiscornia', NULL, '10-10-2022:  Margaret just added a baby &amp; wanted to get new pricing.  Trans her dir to Patti, she''ll LM if she doesn''t catch her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-10 12:15:45', '2022-10-10 12:15:45'),
