  ('zcrm_1579374000104944016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091076016', 'Mark Caprio', NULL, '10-10-2022:  Mark called.  He is curious about how to proceed on his hernia issues because the pain is becoming an issue (he doesn''t think he can wait to age into Medicare).  His concern is both groins have issues, his stomach has an issue.  We talked due to sep parts of the body, could be considered sep issues w/sep IUAs.  He''s going to choose a doc (we went thru HCBB so he can make sure to choose a high qual, & he''s strug a bit w/fair price due to friend sugg) and find out better what they think he needs to do.  He''s very frustrated that he went w/5k IUA, but knows it was his own choice.  He''ll call after tt doc & get help w/sub a ''med need'' or three...     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-10 12:11:55', '2022-10-10 18:05:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104911028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083717854', 'Teresa Bradford', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to update email address.  I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI &amp; update in FTNI &amp; CRM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-10 11:54:20', '2022-10-10 11:54:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104911023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076937066', 'Margaret Tiscornia', NULL, 'Member called in to ask for pricing when adding a newborn.  Since they have an existing family plan no change in price.  I will send member Change form to fill out.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-10 11:44:07', '2022-10-10 11:44:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104970003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079849335', 'Brian Lorch', NULL, '10-10-22 Brian called bc he''s getting billed twice by Bright Health and for different amounts. One sounds to be correct with $635.17 and APTC $413.97 bringing their cost to $221.20 plus a $7 Peak Health Alliance monthly fee to equal total to them $228.20. But, there''s another account getting billed for a second amount sounding like they didn''t remove Cathy (wife) from the Bright Health billing system and now seems to have two enrollments for one person. This happened during the time when C4 was having duplicate enrollments in their system that they had to clean up. I told Brian to call C4 and ask them to remove the additional enrollment and send over the correct one enrollment and one bill under Brian''s name.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-10 11:40:30', '2022-10-10 11:40:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104911018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086124001', 'Cyndi Freeman', NULL, 'Member submitted Change Form to 1. Remove Spouse aging into Medicare &amp; 2. Change plans from Care + to Direct both eff 11/1/22.  I will notify Planstin &amp; change in A123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-10 11:34:20', '2022-10-10 11:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104968008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079885002', 'Pamela DeVos', NULL, '10.10.22:  Recvd. an email from Brian.  Due to the economy, Brian decided to take a position at Siemans. He is paying less than $200/mo. for him and Pam, so he has to cancel his plan by the end of October. Said he enjoyed his plan and all the support he got.  I sent him the Cancellation form link and thanked him for being a great member - told him I would still give him a referral fee for any prospects he sends that enroll.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-10 11:31:58', '2022-10-10 11:31:58'),
