  ('zcrm_1579374000104944008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103628010', 'Hunter Stirm', NULL, '10-10-2022:  Hunter called basically wanting a ''Welcome Call''.  His advisor told him we''d explain all the portions of his membership.  I finally got him to agree to setting up a ''Welcome Call'' &amp; sent him an invite.  I did answer some questions:  present as ''cash-pay'' IF not ''prev'' &amp; call us asap so we can assist in sub a ''med need''.  IF ''prev'' item, must be in ntwk &amp; lots of details so call us prior to ''prev care'' appt.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-10 10:51:11', '2022-10-10 16:39:20'),
