  ('zcrm_1579374000104943033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, '10.10.22 - Michael called and asked for a list of PCP''s in the following zip codes: 81656 and 92004. I have attached those lists to this note. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-10 10:05:38', '2022-10-10 10:05:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104943028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610497', 'Adam Burstein', NULL, '10.10.22 - Adam called in because he believes his wife should not be charged for labs and wanted to know why the specific labs were so expensive. I explained to Adam that we do not have that information and transferred him to Planstin. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-10 10:01:22', '2022-10-10 10:01:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104911008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066023017', 'Christopher Aird', NULL, 'Member will be aging into the 50 age band.  Since this member''s Share Amount will be going up $150.  I spoke to Jane on how to handle this she wanted me to send out letter after she spoke to member.  Email sent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2022-10-10 09:15:56', '2022-10-10 09:15:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104943023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, '10.10.22 - Sent Jacqui the member change for link to change her address and left her a vm. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-10 09:05:11', '2022-10-10 09:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104943008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083717854', 'Teresa Bradford', NULL, '10.10.22 - John called in asking for a member change form link for Teresa''s email address. I advised John that we should also have both of them sign the form that states he is allowed to discuss her plan so that he does not have any issues in the future. I sent John the following: member change form link, the permission to discuss Teresa''s MPB.Health form, and Teresa''s member portal infor. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-10 08:52:56', '2022-10-10 08:52:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104943003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000095746002', 'Jamie Gambino', NULL, '10.6.22 - Jamie called in distraught because she has found out through 3 different optometrists that she needs to have a corneal transplant. She has a need open for this issue, but she is very nervous about moving forward with this surgery. I spoke with Cece from Zion prior to warm transferring Jamie over to her to let her know that Jamie is quite upset about even having to go through with this surgery. We are treating this member with kid gloves and please be very understanding with her situation. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-10 08:25:18', '2022-10-10 08:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104930003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000102741010', 'James Schrock', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2022-10-10 07:43:11', '2022-10-10 07:43:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104920013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105103002', 'Brian Young', NULL, 'Brian called me from my follow up email.  He still looking for him &amp; his family. Comparing both the SECURE &amp; Care+ plan. Will follow up later this week.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2022-10-10 07:30:43', '2022-10-10 07:30:43'),
