  ('zcrm_1579374000104858023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674051', 'Michelle Searles', NULL, '10-7-2022:  Shelly e-mailed asking about an ultrasound for her dense breasts.  I let her know RCI will be able to tell her if that''ll be part of her ''prev care''.  If not, we can approach Sedera to see if it''ll be something they will share in.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-07 17:58:32', '2022-10-07 17:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104858018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000063775002', 'Daniel Gutierrez', NULL, '10-7-2022:  Martha called to see if we could help w/pricing on her RX:  Imvexxy 10mcg, 8 inserts x 3 = #24.  This is super expensive, so I sent req to Reid.  Martha''s curr using Estradiol Vag Cr 0.1mg, 42.5gms &amp; is getting that at Costco for $26.99.  I''ll let her know what Reid says &amp; the best price we can get on the cream as well once I hear back.  It''s late on a Fri, so I told her prob next week.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-07 16:47:34', '2022-10-07 16:47:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104858013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010543087', 'Tania Dibbs', NULL, '10-7-2022:  Wendy asked if I could reprice the Ajovy.  I ck''d GoodRX &amp; the price had gone up, although KS price was just .19-cents higher than in July.  Since I''d put so much time into this prev &amp; the price doesn''t look to have chg''d, I sugg again that the memb tt their doc to see if there is another option = the exact same thing Wendy is telling her.     - CA', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', '2022-10-07 16:44:37', '2022-10-07 16:44:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104870028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105316001', 'Susan Brady', NULL, '10-7-22 Susan just turned 54 yesterday on Oct. 6th. She just moved here from NJ due to divorce. She''s a licensed professional counselor and therapist. Self-employed. She uses Zymbalta for mildly high blood pressure and trazedone for sleep.  Most of her challenges are on the mental health side which I explained are supported by virtual healthcare/Behavioral Health Specialists and Life Care, mental health counselors. She will pay for her meds on her own and pre-x isn''t relevant when using the app or Life Care. She does her annual wellness visits every year and derm check. I told her derm check is not included and she understands. She also will check when she had a biopsy which was benign for a skin issue. She thinks it was more than 24 months ago. I explained all skin issues may be considered pre-x if they are "watching" something. She understands.  Quoted her SECURE $1000/$325. We have next appt set up for Oct. 19th to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-07 16:29:26', '2022-10-07 16:29:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104870023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601016', 'Meggan Kramer', NULL, '10-7-22 I''ve been in constant communication with Meggan to keep her membership alive. She says she can make the payment by the 11th and then again on the 20th, if we adjust her membership for the Nov. payment. Patti helped me realize that we will need to have her re-enroll if she chooses CARE+ to bring down her cost to $2500/$185. Otherwise, if she changes her IUA, no new enrollment is necessary. But, she must complete the change form ASAP. I called twice today to make sure she completes the form and determine her choice. I''ve let her know many times that her membership will be cancelled if we don''t get the paperwork in. She''s a realtor and she''s waiting to close on a property at the end of the month and then her finances will be back in order. It''s just been a slow period of time which left her financially challenged all of the sudden.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-07 16:21:45', '2022-10-07 16:21:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104883011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207361', 'Janet Ingvaldsen', NULL, '10.7.2022:  Called Rhonda at Zion to discuss Janet''s Need.  Rhonda wasn''t in - l/m to c/b on Monday.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-07 15:26:02', '2022-10-07 15:26:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104870013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881640', 'Meghan Grabow', NULL, 'Meghan wants to cancel and we''ve played phone tag now for me to help her. Just left vm now. She called when I was on our Zoom meeting yesterday with Zion/Planstin. I was thinking it was Meggan Kramer who needs to sort out her payment, but it was Meghan Grabow wanting to cancel. I told her I''d call her back and just did so now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-07 15:14:48', '2022-10-07 15:14:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104883003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079055002', 'Dale Leder', NULL, '10.07.22:  Cindy emailed & said she is ready to make the change to her membership (remove children) and enroll Drew for a 11/1/22 start date, as he is home today.  I scheduled the enrollment for today at 3:30 pm.  We completed Drew''s enrollment and I told him to make sure he schedules a Welcome Call to learn more about his plan. I also explained general use of the plan as a self-pay patient.  I guided Cindy through completion of her change form from M&F to M&S, which she submitted.  I messaged Patti that Cindy had submitted the change form and asked if there is anything else required.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2022-10-07 14:46:33', '2022-10-07 14:47:03'),
