  ('zcrm_1579374000104868008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038037', 'Jeff Bolf', 'Reviewed Medical Bills', 'Reviewed ''medical bills".  There are labs that are on the bills but the rest are products that were purchased at a wellness center.
 
