  ('zcrm_1579374000104870008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000103567009', 'Melissa McDowell', NULL, '10-7-22 Terry called bc he thinks he needs an MRI for his knee which is a new issue. I suggested he call the MPB Concierge Team to price it out for him in his local area and to open a  new Need bc of the 6 month time limit. Also told him the # is on his MPB.Health card. He will look for that but I sent him # via text and he understands what he needs to do now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2022-10-07 12:59:40', '2022-10-07 12:59:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000104808018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086225001', 'John Donovan', NULL, 'John called to find out about his dental plan. I explained that there is no dental included with any of the MPB.Health plans, but perhaps he purchased one separately from his agent, Karen Torsoe. John asked to be transferred to Karen and I also gave him her contact information. ~JTS', 'Jennifer Thorin', 'Jennifer Thorin', '2022-10-07 12:45:48', '2022-10-07 12:45:48'),
